les","como crear un tema wordpress","wordpress pro vs competidores","instalacion de wordpress pro","guia de configuracion de wordpress pro"],"fr":["outils d''ia","wordpress pro","thèmes wordpress personnalisés","figma","textes configurables","comment créer un thème wordpress","wordpress pro vs concurrents","installation de wordpress pro","guide de configuration de wordpress pro"],"de":["ki-tools","wordpress pro","benutzerdefinierte wordpress-themen","figma","konfigurierbare texte","wie man ein wordpress-thema erstellt","wordpress pro vs wettbewerber","installation von wordpress pro","anleitung zur konfiguration von wordpress pro"],"pt":["ferramenta ai wordpress","criar tema wordpress personalizado","como usar ferramenta ai wordpress","wordpress pro vs wordpress gratuito","guia de instalação do wordpress pro","ferramenta ai para desenvolvedores web"],"ru":["ИИ Агент wordpress","создать настраиваемую тему wordpress","как использовать ИИ Агент wordpress","wordpress pro vs бесплатный wordpress","руководство по установке wordpress pro","ИИ инструмент для веб-разработчиков"],"ar":["أداة ووردبريس الذكية","إنشاء تصميم مخصص لوردبريس","كيفية استخدام أداة ووردبريس الذكية","ووردبريس برو مقابل ووردبريس المجاني","دليل تثبيت ووردبريس برو","أداة ذكية لل مطورين الويب"]}},"owner":"ErickAguilar95","repo":"full_wordpress_figma_creator","repoPath":"ErickAguilar95/full_wordpress_figma_creator","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.931Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"wordpress-pro","description":"Use when developing WordPress themes, plugins, customizing Gutenberg blocks, implementing WooCommerce features, or optimizing WordPress performance and security.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# WordPress Pro\n\nExpert WordPress developer specializing in custom themes, plugins, Gutenberg blocks, WooCommerce, and WordPress performance optimization.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior WordPress developer with deep experience building custom themes, plugins, and WordPress solutions. You specialize in modern WordPress development with PHP 8.1+, Gutenberg block development, WooCommerce customization, REST API integration, and performance optimization. You build secure, scalable WordPress s","body":"# WordPress Pro\n\nExpert WordPress developer specializing in custom themes, plugins, Gutenberg blocks, WooCommerce, and WordPress performance optimization.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior WordPress developer with deep experience building custom themes, plugins, and WordPress solutions. You specialize in modern WordPress development with PHP 8.1+, Gutenberg block development, WooCommerce customization, REST API integration, and performance optimization. You build secure, scalable WordPress sites following WordPress coding standards and best practices.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building custom WordPress themes with template hierarchy\n- Developing WordPress plugins with proper architecture\n- Creating custom Gutenberg blocks and block patterns\n- Customizing WooCommerce functionality\n- Implementing WordPress REST API endpoints\n- Optimizing WordPress performance and security\n- Working with Advanced Custom Fields (ACF)\n- Full Site Editing (FSE) and block themes\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n1. **Analyze requirements** - Understand WordPress context, existing setup, goals\n2. **Design architecture** - Plan theme/plugin structure, hooks, data flow\n3. **Implement** - Build using WordPress standards, security best practices\n4. **Optimize** - Cache, query optimization, asset optimization\n5. **Test & secure** - Security audit, performance testing, compatibility checks\n\n## Reference Guide\n\nLoad detailed guidance based on context:\n\n| Topic | Reference | Load When |\n|-------|-----------|-----------|\n| Theme Development | `references/theme-development.md` | Templates, hierarchy, child themes, FSE |\n| Plugin Architecture | `references/plugin-architecture.md` | Structure, activation, settings API, updates |\n| Gutenberg Blocks | `references/gutenberg-blocks.md` | Block dev, patterns, FSE, dynamic blocks |\n| Hooks & Filters | `references/hooks-filters.md` | Actions, filters, custom hooks, priorities |\n| Performance & Security | `references/performance-security.md` | Caching, optimization, hardening, backups |\n\n## Constraints\n\n### MUST DO\n- Follow WordPress Coding Standards (WPCS)\n- Use nonces for form submissions\n- Sanitize all user inputs with appropriate functions\n- Escape all outputs (esc_html, esc_url, esc_attr)\n- Use prepared statements for database queries\n- Implement proper capability checks\n- Enqueue scripts/styles properly (wp_enqueue_*)\n- Use WordPress hooks instead of modifying core\n- Write translatable strings with text domains\n- Test across multiple WordPress versions\n\n### MUST NOT DO\n- Modify WordPress core files\n- Use PHP short tags or deprecated functions\n- Trust user input without sanitization\n- Output data without escaping\n- Hardcode database table names (use $wpdb->prefix)\n- Skip capability checks in admin functions\n- Ignore SQL injection vulnerabilities\n- Bundle unnecessary libraries (use WordPress APIs)\n- Create security vulnerabilities through file uploads\n- Skip internationalization (i18n)\n\n## Output Templates\n\nWhen implementing WordPress features, provide:\n1. Main plugin/theme file with proper headers\n2. Relevant template files or block code\n3. Functions with proper WordPress hooks\n4. Security implementations (nonces, sanitization, escaping)\n5. Brief explanation of WordPress-specific patterns used\n\n## Knowledge Reference\n\nWordPress 6.4+, PHP 8.1+, Gutenberg, WooCommerce, ACF, REST API, WP-CLI, block development, theme customizer, widget API, shortcode API, transients, object caching, query optimization, security hardening, WPCS\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:30:28.212Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Web Development Agents requiring advanced WordPress theme customization and performance optimization capabilities.","zh":"适合需要高级WordPress主题定制和性能优化能力的Web开发代理。","ja":"WordPressテーマの高度なカスタマイズとパフォーマンス最適化機能を必要とするWeb開発エージェントに適しています。","ko":"고급 워드프레스 테마 커스터마이즈와 성능 최적화 기능을 필요로 하는 웹 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo web que requieren personalización avanzada de temas de WordPress y capacidades de optimización de rendimiento.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement web nécessitant une personnalisation avancée de thèmes WordPress et des capacités d''optimisation de performances.","de":"Ideal für Webentwicklungsagenten, die erweiterte Anpassung von WordPress-Themen und Leistungsoptimierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal for Web Development Agents requiring advanced WordPress theme customization and performance optimization capabilities.","ru":"Ideal for Web Development Agents requiring advanced WordPress theme customization and performance optimization capabilities.","ar":"Ideal for Web Development Agents requiring advanced WordPress theme customization and performance optimization capabilities."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create secure, scalable WordPress solutions using PHP 8.1+, Gutenberg block development, and WooCommerce customization, while optimizing performance through REST API integration.","zh":"赋予代理创建安全、可扩展的WordPress解决方案的能力，使用PHP 8.1+、Gutenberg块开发和WooCommerce定制，同时通过REST API集成优化性能。","ja":"エージェントがPHP 8.1+、Gutenbergブロック開発、WooCommerceカスタマイズを使用して、セキュアでスケーラブルなWordPressソリューションを作成できるようにし、REST API統合を通じてパフォーマンスを最適化します。","ko":"에이전트가 PHP 8.1+、Gutenberg 블록 개발, WooCommerce 커스터마이즈를 사용하여 보안이 확보되고 확장 가능한 워드프레스 솔루션을 만들 수 있도록 하며, REST API 통합을 통해 성능을 최적화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear soluciones de WordPress seguras y escalables utilizando PHP 8.1+, desarrollo de bloques de Gutenberg y personalización de WooCommerce, mientras se optimiza el rendimiento a través de la integración de REST API.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des solutions WordPress sécurisées et scalables en utilisant PHP 8.1+, le développement de blocs de Gutenberg et la personnalisation de WooCommerce, tout en optimisant les performances via l''intégration de l''API REST.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, sichere und skalierbare WordPress-Lösungen mit PHP 8.1+, Gutenberg-Blockentwicklung und WooCommerce-Anpassung zu erstellen, während die Leistung durch REST-API-Integration optimiert wird.","pt":"Empowers agents to create secure, scalable WordPress solutions using PHP 8.1+, Gutenberg block development, and WooCommerce customization, while optimizing performance through REST API integration.","ru":"Empowers agents to create secure, scalable WordPress solutions using PHP 8.1+, Gutenberg block development, and WooCommerce customization, while optimizing performance through REST API integration.","ar":"Empowers agents to create secure, scalable WordPress solutions using PHP 8.1+, Gutenberg block development, and WooCommerce customization, while optimizing performance through REST API integration."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating custom WordPress theme development with configurable text boxes","Generating optimized WooCommerce solutions for e-commerce integrations","Debugging WordPress performance issues using REST API and PHP 8.1+"],"zh":["使用可配置的文本框自动化自定义WordPress主题开发","为电子商务集成生成优化的WooCommerce解决方案","使用REST API和PHP 8.1+调试WordPress性能问题"],"ja":["構成可能なテキストボックスを使用してカスタムWordPressテーマ開発を自動化する","電子商取引統合のための最適化されたWooCommerceソリューションを生成する","REST APIとPHP 8.1+を使用してWordPressのパフォーマンス問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["구성 가능한 텍스트 박스를 사용하여 커스텀 워드프레스 테마 개발을 자동화하는 것","전자상거래 통합을 위한 최적화된 WooCommerce 솔루션을 생성하는 것","REST API와 PHP 8.1+를 사용하여 워드프레스 성능 문제를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar el desarrollo de temas personalizados de WordPress con cuadros de texto configurables","Generar soluciones de WooCommerce optimizadas para integraciones de comercio electrónico","Depurar problemas de rendimiento de WordPress utilizando REST API y PHP 8.1+"],"fr":["Automatiser le développement de thèmes personnalisés de WordPress avec des cases de texte configurables","Générer des solutions WooCommerce optimisées pour les intégrations de commerce électronique","Déboguer les problèmes de performances de WordPress en utilisant l''API REST et PHP 8.1+"],"de":["Automatisieren der Entwicklung benutzerdefinierter WordPress-Themen mit konfigurierbaren Textfeldern","Generieren optimierter WooCommerce-Lösungen für E-Commerce-Integrationen","Beheben von WordPress-Leistungsproblemen unter Verwendung von REST-API und PHP 8.1+"],"pt":["Automating custom WordPress theme development with configurable text boxes","Generating optimized WooCommerce solutions for e-commerce integrations","Debugging WordPress performance issues using REST API and PHP 8.1+"],"ru":["Automating custom WordPress theme development with configurable text boxes","Generating optimized WooCommerce solutions for e-commerce integrations","Debugging WordPress performance issues using REST API and PHP 8.1+"],"ar":["Automating custom WordPress theme development with configurable text boxes","Generating optimized WooCommerce solutions for e-commerce integrations","Debugging WordPress performance issues using REST API and PHP 8.1+"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires PHP 8.1+ compatibility","WordPress-specific solutions only","Gutenberg block development and WooCommerce customization required for full functionality"],"zh":["需要PHP 8.1+兼容性","仅限WordPress特定解决方案","需要Gutenberg块开发和WooCommerce定制以实现全功能"],"ja":["PHP 8.1+の互換性が必要","WordPress特有のソリューションのみ","フル機能を実現するにはGutenbergブロック開発とWooCommerceカスタマイズが必要"],"ko":["PHP 8.1+ 호환성이 필요","워드프레스 특정 솔루션만 해당","전체 기능을 구현하려면 구텐베르크 블록 개발 및 우커머스 커스터마이즈가 필요"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con PHP 8.1+","Soluciones específicas de WordPress solo","Desarrollo de bloques de Gutenberg y personalización de WooCommerce requeridos para la funcionalidad completa"],"fr":["Nécessite la compatibilité avec PHP 8.1+","Solutions spécifiques à WordPress uniquement","Développement de blocs de Gutenberg et personnalisation de WooCommerce nécessaires pour la fonctionnalité complète"],"de":["Benö