ectronique","Tooling SDK pour personnaliser","comment utiliser B2C Sandbox","alternatives à B2C Sandbox","B2C Sandbox vs d''autres outils","installation de B2C Sandbox","guide de configuration de B2C Sandbox"],"de":["AI Agent Tools","Salesforce Agentforce Commerce B2C","CLI für Salesforce","MCP für E-Commerce","Tooling SDK für die Anpassung","wie man B2C Sandbox verwendet","Alternativen zu B2C Sandbox","B2C Sandbox vs andere Tools","Installation von B2C Sandbox","Konfigurationsanleitung für B2C Sandbox"],"pt":["ferramentas de IA","Salesforce Agentforce Commerce B2C","CLI","MCP","Tooling SDK","desenvolvimento de comércio eletrônico","soluções de e-commerce","alternativas ao Salesforce","guia de instalação do b2c-sandbox"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","Salesforce Agentforce Commerce B2C","CLI","MCP","Tooling SDK","разработка электронной коммерции","решения для электронной коммерции","альтернативы Salesforce","руководство по установке b2c-sandbox"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","Salesforce Agentforce Commerce B2C","CLI","MCP","Tooling SDK","تطوير التجارة الإلكترونية","حلول التجارة الإلكترونية","بديل لSalesforce","دليل تثبيت ب2c-sandbox"]}},"owner":"SalesforceCommerceCloud","repo":"b2c-developer-tooling","repoPath":"SalesforceCommerceCloud/b2c-developer-tooling","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.976Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"b2c-sandbox","description":"Create and manage (B2C/SFCC/Demandware) on-demand sandboxes (ODS) with the b2c cli. Always reference when using the CLI to create, start, stop, restart, delete, or list on-demand sandboxes (ODS) and development instances.","bodyPreview":"# B2C Sandbox Skill\n\nOnly create or delete sandboxes when explicitly requested. Always confirm destructive actions.\n\nUse the `b2c` CLI plugin to manage Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand sandboxes (ODS). Only create or delete a sandbox if explicitly asked as this may be a billable or destructible action.\n\n> **Tip:** If `b2c` is not installed globally, use `npx @salesforce/b2c-cli` instead (e.g., `npx @salesforce/b2c-cli sandbox list`).\n\n> **Alias:** The `ods` prefix is still supported as a backwa","body":"# B2C Sandbox Skill\n\nOnly create or delete sandboxes when explicitly requested. Always confirm destructive actions.\n\nUse the `b2c` CLI plugin to manage Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand sandboxes (ODS). Only create or delete a sandbox if explicitly asked as this may be a billable or destructible action.\n\n> **Tip:** If `b2c` is not installed globally, use `npx @salesforce/b2c-cli` instead (e.g., `npx @salesforce/b2c-cli sandbox list`).\n\n> **Alias:** The `ods` prefix is still supported as a backward-compatible alias (e.g., `b2c ods list` works the same as `b2c sandbox list`).\n\n## Sandbox ID Formats\n\nCommands that operate on a specific sandbox accept two ID formats:\n\n- **UUID**: The full sandbox UUID (e.g., `abc12345-1234-1234-1234-abc123456789`)\n- **Realm-instance**: The realm-instance format (e.g., `zzzv-123` or `zzzv_123`)\n\nThe realm-instance format uses the 4-character realm code followed by a dash or underscore and the instance number. When using a realm-instance format, the CLI will automatically look up the corresponding UUID.\n\n## Examples\n\n### List Sandboxes\n\n```bash\nb2c sandbox list\n\n# for realm zzpq with JSON output\nb2c sandbox list --realm zzpq --json\n\n# filter by status and those created by a specific user, only print the columns id,state,hostname\nb2c sandbox list --filter-params ''state=started,creating&createdBy=clavery@salesforce.com'' --realm zzpq --columns id,state,hostname\n```\n\n### Create Sandbox\n\nOnly create a sandbox if explicitly asked as this may be a billable action.\n\n```bash\n# create in realm zzpq with 4 hour TTL (0 = infinite); json output and wait for completion (this may take 5-10 minutes; timeout is 10 minutes)\nb2c sandbox create --realm zzpq --ttl 4 --json --wait\n\n# create in realm zzpq with large profile (medium is default)\nb2c sandbox create --realm zzpq --profile large\n\n# create without automatic OCAPI/WebDAV permissions\nb2c sandbox create --realm zzpq --no-set-permissions\n\n# use a different client ID for default permissions\nb2c sandbox create --realm zzpq --permissions-client-id my-other-client\n\n# custom OCAPI settings (replaces defaults)\nb2c sandbox create --realm zzpq --ocapi-settings ''[{\"client_id\":\"my-client\",\"resources\":[{\"resource_id\":\"/code_versions\",\"methods\":[\"get\"]}]}]''\n\n# with start/stop scheduler\nb2c sandbox create --realm zzpq --start-scheduler ''{\"weekdays\":[\"MONDAY\",\"TUESDAY\"],\"time\":\"08:00:00Z\"}'' --stop-scheduler ''{\"weekdays\":[\"MONDAY\",\"TUESDAY\"],\"time\":\"19:00:00Z\"}''\n\n# get full log trace output to debug\nb2c sandbox create --realm zzpq --log-level trace\n```\n\n### Get/Start/Stop/Restart/Delete Sandbox\n\nCommands that operate on a specific sandbox support both UUID and realm-instance formats:\n\n```bash\n# Using UUID\nb2c sandbox get abc12345-1234-1234-1234-abc123456789\nb2c sandbox start abc12345-1234-1234-1234-abc123456789\nb2c sandbox stop abc12345-1234-1234-1234-abc123456789\n\n# Using realm-instance format\nb2c sandbox get zzzv-123\nb2c sandbox start zzzv_123\nb2c sandbox stop zzzv-123\nb2c sandbox restart zzzv-123\nb2c sandbox delete zzzv-123 --force\n```\n\n### More Commands\n\nSee `b2c sandbox --help` for a full list of available commands and options in the `sandbox` topic.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:55:11.806Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for E-commerce Agents needing streamlined Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand sandbox management.","zh":"非常适合需要简化Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand沙盒管理的电子商务代理。","ja":"Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demandサンドボックスの管理をストリームライン化する必要があるECエージェントに適しています。","ko":"Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand 샌드박스 관리를 간소화해야 하는 전자상거래 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de comercio electrónico que necesitan una gestión de sandbox de Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand optimizada.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de commerce électronique ayant besoin d''une gestion de sandbox Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand simplifiée.","de":"Perfekt für E-Commerce-Agents, die eine optimierte Verwaltung von Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand-Sandboxes benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de comércio eletrônico que necessitam de gerenciamento de sandbox On-demand do Salesforce B2C Commerce simplificado.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов электронной коммерции, которым необходим упрощенный менеджмент песочниц On-demand для Salesforce B2C Commerce.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات التجارة الإلكترونية التي تحتاج إلى إدارة ممتازة لبيئة Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand sandboxes (ODS) using the `b2c` CLI plugin, ensuring controlled creation and deletion of sandboxes with explicit confirmation for destructive actions, leveraging MCP and Tooling SDK for seamless integration.","zh":"赋予代理管理Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand沙盒（ODS）的能力，使用`b2c` CLI插件，确保沙盒的受控创建和删除，并对破坏性操作进行明确确认，利用MCP和Tooling SDK实现无缝集成。","ja":"エージェントがSalesforce B2C Commerce On-demandサンドボックス（ODS）を管理できるようにし、`b2c` CLIプラグインを使用して、サンドボックスの制御された作成と削除を確実に実行し、破壊的な操作には明示的な確認を求め、MCPとTooling SDKを利用してシームレスな統合を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand 샌드박스(ODS)를 관리할 수 있도록 하며, `b2c` CLI 플러그인을 사용하여 샌드박스의 제어된 생성 및 삭제를 보장하며, 파괴적인 작업에는 명시적인 확인을 요구하며, MCP 및 Tooling SDK를 활용하여 무결점 통합을 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar sandboxes de Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand (ODS) utilizando el plugin de CLI `b2c`, asegurando la creación y eliminación controlada de sandboxes con confirmación explícita para acciones destructivas, aprovechando MCP y Tooling SDK para una integración perfecta.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les sandboxes Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand (ODS) en utilisant le plugin CLI `b2c`, assurant la création et la suppression contrôlées des sandboxes avec confirmation explicite pour les actions destructrices, en exploitant MCP et Tooling SDK pour une intégration sans faille.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand-Sandboxes (ODS) mithilfe des `b2c`-CLI-Plugins zu verwalten, wodurch die kontrollierte Erstellung und Löschung von Sandboxes mit expliziter Bestätigung für destruktive Aktionen sichergestellt wird, indem MCP und Tooling SDK für eine nahtlose Integration genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar as pesanchas On-demand do Salesforce B2C Commerce (ODS) usando o plugin `b2c` CLI, garantindo criação controlada e exclusão de pesanchas com confirmação explícita para ações destrutivas, aproveitando MCP e Tooling SDK para integração perfeita.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять песочницами On-demand для Salesforce B2C Commerce (ODS) с помощью плагина `b2c` CLI, обеспечивая контролируемое создание и удаление песочниц с явным подтверждением для разрушительных действий, используя MCP и Tooling SDK для бесшовной интеграции.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إدارة بيئات العمل On-demand لـ Salesforce B2C Commerce (ODS) باستخدام إضافة `b2c` CLI، مما يضمن إنشاء وخذف بيئات العمل بإدارة جيدة مع تأكيد صريح للإجراءات التدميرية، واستفادة من MCP و Tooling SDK من أجل التكامل السلس."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating on-demand sandboxes for testing and development environments","Deleting unused sandboxes to optimize resource allocation and reduce costs","Listing available sandboxes for efficient environment management"],"zh":["为测试和开发环境创建按需沙盒","删除未使用的沙盒以优化资源分配和降低成本","列出可用的沙盒以实现高效的环境管理"],"ja":["テストと開発環境用のOn-demandサンドボックスの作成","使用されていないサンドボックスを削除してリソースの割り当てを最適化し、コストを削減する","利用可能なサンドボックスをリストして環境管理を効率化する"],"ko":["테스트 및 개발 환경을 위한 온디맨드 샌드박스의 생성","사용되지 않는 샌드박스를 삭제하여 리소스 할당을 최적화하고 비용을 줄임","사용 가능한 샌드박스를 나열하여 효율적인 환경 관리를 구현"],"es":["Crear sandboxes bajo demanda para entornos de prueba y desarrollo","Eliminar sandboxes no utilizados para optimizar la asignación de recursos y reducir costos","Listar sandboxes disponibles para una gestión eficiente del entorno"],"fr":["Créer des sandboxes sur demande pour les environnements de test et de développement","Supprimer les sandboxes inutilisés pour optimiser l''allocation des ressources et réduire les coûts","Répertorier les sandboxes disponibles pour une gestion efficace de l''environnement"],"de":["Erstellen von Sandboxes auf Abruf für Test- und Entwicklungsumgebungen","Löschen nicht genutzter Sandboxes zur Optimierung der Ressourcenzuweisung und Kostensenkung","Auflisten verfügbarer Sandboxes für eine effiziente Umfeldverwaltung"],"pt":["Criar pesanchas On-demand para ambientes de teste e desenvolvimento","Excluir pesanchas não utilizadas para otimizar alocação de recursos e reduzir custos","Listar pesanchas disponíveis para gerenciamento eficiente de ambientes"],"ru":["Создание песочниц On-demand для тестовых и разработческих сред","Удаление неиспользуемых песочниц для оптимизации распределения ресурсов и снижения затрат","Перечисление доступных песочниц для эффективного управления средами"],"ar":["إنشاء بيئات العمل On-demand للاختبارات والتنمية","حذف البيئات غير المستخدمة لتحسين تخصيص الموارد وتقليل التكاليف","قائمة البيئات المتاحة لإدارة بيئات فعالة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires installation of `b2c` CLI plugin or use of `npx @salesforce/b2c-cli`","Explicit confirmation required for destructive actions like sandbox deletion","Limited to Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand sandboxes"],"zh":["需要安装`b2c` CLI插件或使用`npx @salesforce/b2c-cli`","需要对破坏性操作（如沙盒删除）进行明确确认","仅限于Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand沙盒"],"ja":["`b2c` CLIプラグインのインストールまたは`npx @salesforce/b2c-cli`の使用が必要","破壊的な操作（サンドボックスの削除など）には明示的な確認が必要","Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demandサンドボックスのみ"],"ko":["`b2c` CLI 플러그인의 설치 또는 `npx @salesforce/b2c-cli`의 사용이 필요","파괴적인 작업(샌드박스 삭제 등)에 대한 명시적인 확인이 필요","Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand 샌드박스에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere la instalación del plugin de CLI `b2c` o el uso de `npx @salesforce/b2c-cli`","Se requiere confirmación explícita para acciones destructivas como la eliminación de sandboxes","Limitado a 