CLI","Dynamisches und effizientes Coding"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento nativo de IA","Integração com Gemini CLI","PDCA para melhorar a produtividade","Ferramentas de Vibecoding dinâmicas","Suporte a desenvolvedores"],"ru":["Родное развитие ИИ","Интеграция с Gemini CLI","PDCA для повышения производительности","Динамические инструменты Vibecoding","Поддержка разработчиков"],"ar":["تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي الأصلي","التكامل مع جيميني CLI","PDCA لتحسين الإنتاجية","أدوات Vibecoding الديناميكي","دعم المطورين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI 动态开发工具","bkit Vibecoding Kit","AI 原生开发工具","PDCA 和 CLI 开发支持","Gemini CLI 开发工具","AI开发工具安装","AI开发工具使用"],"ja":["AI エージェント開発ツール","bkit Vibecoding Kit","AI 原生開発ツール","PDCA と CLI 対応","Gemini CLI 開発ツール","AI開発ツールインストール","AI開発ツール使用"],"ko":["AI 개발 도구","bkit Vibecoding Kit","AI 원생 개발 도구","PDCA와 CLI 지원","Gemini CLI 개발 도구","AI 개발 도구 설치","AI 개발 도구 사용"],"es":["herramientas de AI","kit de codificación dinámico","Gemini CLI","desarrollo nativo de IA","PDCA","cómo usar herramientas de AI","alternativas a Gemini CLI","instalación de kit de codificación dinámico"],"fr":["outils IA","kit de codage dynamique","Gemini CLI","développement natif IA","PDCA","comment utiliser les outils IA","alternatives à Gemini CLI","installation du kit de codage dynamique"],"de":["KI-Tools","dynamisches Coding-Kit","Gemini CLI","nativer KI-Entwicklung","PDCA","wie man KI-Tools verwendet","Alternativen zu Gemini CLI","Installation des dynamischen Coding-Kits"],"pt":["como usar kit de Vibecoding dinâmico","o que é kit de Vibecoding dinâmico","kit de Vibecoding dinâmico alternative","kit de Vibecoding dinâmico vs competidores","instalar kit de Vibecoding dinâmico","guia de configuração do kit de Vibecoding dinâmico","desenvolvimento de IA","ferramentas de IA"],"ru":["как использовать динамический набор Vibecoding","что такое динамический набор Vibecoding","динамический набор Vibecoding alternative","динамический набор Vibecoding vs конкуренты","установить динамический набор Vibecoding","руководство по настройке динамического набора Vibecoding","разработка ИИ","инструменты ИИ"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام کیتی Vibecoding الديناميكي","ما هو کیتی Vibecoding الديناميكي","کیتی Vibecoding الديناميكي بديل","کیتی Vibecoding الديناميكي مقابل المنافسين","تثبيت کیتی Vibecoding الديناميكي","دليل إعداد کیتی Vibecoding الديناميكي","تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"popup-studio-ai","repo":"bkit-gemini","repoPath":"popup-studio-ai/bkit-gemini","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.976Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"dynamic","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Dynamic Skill\n\n> Fullstack development with bkend.ai BaaS platform\n\n## Overview\n\nThe Dynamic skill enables fullstack web application development using bkend.ai as the Backend-as-a-Service platform. No server management required.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Web applications with user accounts\n- SaaS products\n- MVPs with backend requirements\n- Apps needing authentication\n- Data-driven applications\n\n## bkend.ai Features\n\n- **Authentication**: Email, OAuth (Google, GitHub), Magic Links\n- **Database**: Mong","body":"# Dynamic Skill\n\n> Fullstack development with bkend.ai BaaS platform\n\n## Overview\n\nThe Dynamic skill enables fullstack web application development using bkend.ai as the Backend-as-a-Service platform. No server management required.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Web applications with user accounts\n- SaaS products\n- MVPs with backend requirements\n- Apps needing authentication\n- Data-driven applications\n\n## bkend.ai Features\n\n- **Authentication**: Email, OAuth (Google, GitHub), Magic Links\n- **Database**: MongoDB Atlas (REST API)\n- **Storage**: S3 Presigned URL file uploads\n- **Real-time**: WebSocket subscriptions (planned)\n- **API**: REST API (`https://api-client.bkend.ai`)\n- **MCP**: 28 tools + 4 resources (`https://api.bkend.ai/mcp`)\n\n## Project Structure\n\n```\nproject/\n├── app/\n│   ├── (auth)/\n│   │   ├── login/\n│   │   └── signup/\n│   ├── (dashboard)/\n│   │   └── ...\n│   └── api/\n├── lib/\n│   └── bkend/\n│       └── client.ts\n├── components/\n├── docs/\n│   ├── 01-plan/\n│   ├── 02-design/\n│   └── 03-analysis/\n└── .mcp.json\n```\n\n## Key Phases (Dynamic Level)\n\n| Phase | Required | Description |\n|-------|----------|-------------|\n| 1. Schema | ✅ | Define data models |\n| 2. Convention | ✅ | Set coding rules |\n| 3. Mockup | ✅ | Design UI/UX |\n| 4. API | ✅ | Design API endpoints |\n| 5. Design System | 🔶 Optional | Component library |\n| 6. UI Integration | ✅ | Connect frontend to API |\n| 7. SEO/Security | 🔶 Optional | Auth hardening |\n| 8. Review | 🔶 Optional | Code review |\n| 9. Deployment | ✅ | Deploy to production |\n\n## Getting Started\n\n```bash\n# Initialize Dynamic project\n/dynamic init\n\n# Start the pipeline\n/development-pipeline start\n```\n\n## Authentication Example\n\n```typescript\n// lib/bkend/client.ts - REST API Direct Call Pattern\nconst BKEND_API_URL = process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_BKEND_API_URL || ''https://api-client.bkend.ai'';\n\nasync function bkendFetch(path: string, options: RequestInit = {}) {\n  const response = await fetch(`${BKEND_API_URL}${path}`, {\n    ...options,\n    headers: {\n      ''Content-Type'': ''application/json'',\n      ''X-Project-Id'': process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_BKEND_PROJECT_ID!,\n      ''X-Environment'': process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_BKEND_ENVIRONMENT || ''dev'',\n      ...options.headers,\n    },\n  });\n  if (!response.ok) throw new Error(`bkend API error: ${response.status}`);\n  return response.json();\n}\n\n// Login\nconst { accessToken, refreshToken, user } = await bkendFetch(''/auth/email/signin'', {\n  method: ''POST'',\n  body: JSON.stringify({ email, password }),\n});\n```\n\n## Available bkend Skills\n\nFor detailed domain knowledge, use these dedicated skills:\n\n| Skill | Command | Domain |\n|-------|---------|--------|\n| bkend-quickstart | `/bkend-quickstart` | Onboarding, core concepts |\n| bkend-auth | `/bkend-auth` | Authentication (21 docs) |\n| bkend-data | `/bkend-data` | Database CRUD (13 docs) |\n| bkend-storage | `/bkend-storage` | File storage (10 docs) |\n| bkend-mcp | `/bkend-mcp` | MCP + AI tools (18 docs) |\n| bkend-security | `/bkend-security` | Security (8 docs) |\n| bkend-cookbook | `/bkend-cookbook` | Project tutorials (4+5) |\n| bkend-guides | `/bkend-guides` | Guides + troubleshooting (16 docs) |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:55:16.968Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Fullstack Development Agents needing seamless Backend-as-a-Service integration with bkend.ai","zh":"非常适合需要与bkend.ai实现无缝 Backend-as-a-Service 集成的全栈开发代理","ja":"bkend.aiとのシームレスなBackend-as-a-Service統合が必要なフルスタック開発エージェントに最適","ko":"bkend.ai와의 무결점 Backend-as-a-Service 통합이 필요한 풀스택 개발 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo Fullstack que necesitan una integración sin problemas con Backend-as-a-Service en bkend.ai","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement Fullstack nécessitant une intégration Backend-as-a-Service transparente avec bkend.ai","de":"Perfekt für Fullstack-Entwicklungsagenten, die eine nahtlose Backend-as-a-Service-Integration mit bkend.ai benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de desenvolvimento Fullstack que precisam de integração sem interrupção do Backend-as-a-Service com bkend.ai","ru":"Идеально для агентов полного стека разработки, которым требуется бесшовная интеграция Backend-as-a-Service с bkend.ai","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الكامل الذي يحتاج إلى تكامل Backend-as-a-Service بدون انقطاع مع bkend.ai"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to rapidly develop web applications with user accounts, leveraging bkend.ai''s features such as Email and OAuth authentication, and MongoDB database management, all without requiring server management","zh":"赋予代理快速开发具有用户账户的Web应用程序的能力，利用bkend.ai的功能，如电子邮件和OAuth身份验证，以及MongoDB数据库管理，而无需服务器管理","ja":"エージェントがbkend.aiの機能を利用して、電子メールやOAuth認証、MongoDBデータベース管理などを使用して、ユーザーアカウントを備えたWebアプリケーションを迅速に開発できるようにする","ko":"에이전트가 bkend.ai의 기능을 활용하여電子メ일 및 OAuth 인증, MongoDB 데이터베이스 관리 등을 사용하여 사용자 계정을 갖춘 웹 애플리케이션을 신속하게 개발할 수 있도록 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a desarrollar rápidamente aplicaciones web con cuentas de usuario, aprovechando las características de bkend.ai como autenticación por correo electrónico y OAuth, y gestión de base de datos MongoDB, todo sin requerir administración de servidor","fr":"Permet aux agents de développer rapidement des applications web avec des comptes utilisateurs, en exploitant les fonctionnalités de bkend.ai telles que l''authentification par e-mail et OAuth, et la gestion de base de données MongoDB, le tout sans nécessiter de gestion de serveur","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Webanwendungen mit Benutzerkonten schnell zu entwickeln, indem sie Funktionen von bkend.ai wie E-Mail- und OAuth-Authentifizierung sowie MongoDB-Datenbankverwaltung nutzen, alles ohne Serververwaltung","pt":"Habilita os agentes a desenvolver rapidamente aplicações web com contas de usuário, aproveitando os recursos do bkend.ai, como autenticação por Email e OAuth, e gerenciamento de banco de dados MongoDB, tudo sem exigir gerenciamento de servidor","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью быстро разрабатывать веб-приложения с учетными записями пользователей, используя функции bkend.ai, такие как аутентификация по электронной почте и OAuth, и управление базой данных MongoDB, все без необходимости управления сервером","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تطوير تطبيقات الويب بسرعة مع حسابات المستخدمين، مستفيدًا من ميزات bkend.ai مثل المصادقة عبر البريد الإلكتروني وOAuth، وإدارة قاعدة بيانات MongoDB، كل ذلك بدون الحاجة إلى إدارة الخادم"},"useCases":{"en":["Building SaaS products with streamlined authentication","Developing MVPs with robust backend requirements","Creating data-driven applications with scalable MongoDB integration"],"zh":["使用流线型身份验证构建SaaS产品","开发具有强大后端要求的MVP","创建具有可扩展的MongoDB集成的数据驱动应用程序"],"ja":["ストリームライン認証を使用したSaaS製品の構築","強力なバックエンド要件を持つMVPの開発","スケーラブルなMongoDB統合を使用したデータ駆動型アプリケーションの作成"],"ko":["스트림 라인 인증을 사용하여 SaaS 제품 구축","강력한 백엔드 요구 사항이 있는 MVP 개발","확장 가능한 MongoDB 통합을 사용하여 데이터 주도형 애플리케이션 생성"],"es":["Creación de productos SaaS con autenticación simplificada","Desarrollo de MVP con requisitos de backend robustos","Creación de aplicaciones impulsadas por datos con integración escalable de MongoDB"],"fr":["Création de produits SaaS avec authentification simplifiée","Développement de MVP avec des exigences de backend robustes","Création d''applications pilotées par des données avec intégration scalable de MongoDB"],"de":["Erstellung von SaaS-Produkten mit gestreamter Authentifizierung","Entwicklung von MVP mit robusten Backend-Anforderungen","Erstellung von datengetriebenen Anwendungen mit skalierbarer MongoDB-Integration"],"pt":["Construir produtos SaaS com autenticação simplificada","Desenvolver MVPs com requisitos de backend robustos","Criar aplicações orientadas a dados com integração escalável do MongoDB"],"ru":["Создание продуктов SaaS с упрощенной аутентификацией","Разработка MVP с надежными требованиями бэкэнда","Создание данных-ориентированных приложений с масштабируемой интеграцией MongoDB"],"ar":["بناء منتجات SaaS مع مصادقة مبسطة","تطوير نماذج أولية مع متطلبات خلفية قوية","إنشاء تطبيقات محددة بالبيانات مع دمج MongoDB قابل للتوسيع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires bkend.ai BaaS platform access","Limited to web applications with supported authentication methods"],"zh":["需要bkend.ai BaaS平台访问","仅限于具有支持的身份验证方法的Web应用程序"],"ja":["bkend.ai BaaSプラットフォームへのアクセスが必要","サポートされている認証方法を持つWebアプリケーションに限定"],"ko":["bkend.ai BaaS 플랫폼 액세스가 필요","지원되는 인증 방법을 갖춘 웹 애플리케이션에 한정"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la plataforma BaaS de bkend.ai","Limitado a aplicaciones web con métodos de autenticación compatibles"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la plateforme BaaS de bkend.ai","Limité aux applications web avec des méthodes d''authentification prises en charge"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die BaaS-Plattform von bkend.ai","Begrenzt auf Webanwendungen mit unterstützten Authentifizierungsmethoden"],"pt":["Exige acesso à plataforma BaaS do bkend.ai","Limitado a aplicações web com métodos de autenticação suportados"],"ru":["Требует доступа к платформе BaaS bkend.ai","Ограничен веб-приложениями с поддерживаемыми методами аутентификации"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى منصة BaaS bkend.ai","محدود بالتطبيقات الويب ذات أساليب المصادقة المعتمدة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"88f02c6b43de3c34bc9e2f2e21e6780040a0feb5a4c022c0d61d6f90415b887e","qualityScore":52}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Vulnetix/vdb-api/commit-feature', 'community', 'Vulnetix', 'vdb-api', 'Vulnetix/vdb-api', 'commit-feature', 0, 0, 52, '2026-03-02T01:56:10.979Z', '2026-03-02T02:57:02.568Z', '7abd5bffd15cdef2c5a3514a435656ffbcecc43f498b2a981584f480b8f02852', '{"id":"Vulnetix/vdb-api/commit-feature","name":"commit-feature","description":{"zh":"commit-feature VDB API是为外部用户提供的AI工具，用于简化开发流程","ja":"commit-feature VDB APIは、外部ユーザー向けのAIエージェントで、開発プロセスを簡素化します","ko":"commit-feature VDB API는 외부 사용자를 위한 AI 에이전트로 개발 프로세스를 단순화합니다","es":"commit-feature es una API de base de datos vectoriales (VDB) diseñada para desarrolladores externos. Permite integrar capacidades de búsqueda semántica y gestión de embeddings en aplicaciones usando Python, Node.js o herramientas CLI.","fr":"commit-feature est une API de base de données vectorielles (VDB) conçue pour les utilisateurs externes. Elle permet d''intégrer la recherche sémantique et la gestion d''embeddings dans des applications avec Python, Node.js ou des outils CLI.","de":"commit-feature ist eine Vector Database (VDB) API für externe Nutzer. Sie ermöglicht die Integration semantischer Suche und Embedding-Verwaltung in Anwendungen mit Python, Node.js oder CLI-Tools.","pt":"O commit-feature é uma ferramenta de IA que utiliza a VDB API para melhorar a colaboração entre desenvolvedores","ru":"ИИ Агент commit-feature использует VDB API для улучшения сотрудничества между разработчиками","ar":"أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي commit-feature تستخدم VDB API لتحسين التعاون بين المطورين","en":"VDB API for external users"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI工具：commit-feature VDB API","ja":"AIエージェント：commit-feature VDB API","ko":"AI 에이전트: commit-feature VDB API","es":"commit-feature: API VDB para desarrolladores | AI Agents","fr":"commit-feature: API VDB pour développeurs | Outils IA","de":"commit-feature: VDB API für Entwickle