ment utiliser des outils d''agents d''intelligence artificielle","qu''est-ce qu''un agent d''intelligence artificielle","AIfred alternative","AIfred vs d''autres agents d''intelligence artificielle","installation d''AIfred","guide de configuration d''AIfred","outils d''intelligence artificielle pour les projets","gestion de projets avec intelligence artificielle"],"de":["wie man KI-Agents-Tools verwendet","was ist ein KI-Agent","AIfred-Alternative","AIfred vs andere KI-Agents","Installation von AIfred","Einrichtungsanleitung für AIfred","KI-Tools für Projekte","Projektverwaltung mit KI"],"pt":["como usar agente de ia","o que é agente de ia","ferramentas de agente de ia","alternativas ao jira","guia de instalação do aifred","configuração do aifred","treinamento de agente de ia","certificação de agente de ia"],"ru":["как использовать ии агент","что такое ии агент","инструменты ии агента","альтернативы jira","руководство по установке aifred","настройка aifred","обучение ии агенту","сертификация ии агента"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هو وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","بديل جيرا","دليل تثبيت أيفريد","إعداد أيفريد","تدريب وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","شهادة وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"davidmoneil","repo":"AIfred","repoPath":"davidmoneil/AIfred","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.983Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"project-lifecycle","description":"End-to-end project management from creation through consolidation and archival","version":"1.0.0","tags":["projects","lifecycle","creation","registration","consolidation"],"bodyPreview":"# Project Lifecycle Skill\n\nComplete project management workflow from creation through consolidation and archival.\n\n---\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill consolidates all project lifecycle operations:\n- **Creation**: New code projects in ~/Code or internal projects in .claude/projects\n- **Registration**: Register existing projects with AIfred tracking\n- **Consolidation**: Sync knowledge, update docs, create commits\n- **Management**: Track priorities, update context files\n\n**Value**: Unified approach to pr","body":"# Project Lifecycle Skill\n\nComplete project management workflow from creation through consolidation and archival.\n\n---\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill consolidates all project lifecycle operations:\n- **Creation**: New code projects in ~/Code or internal projects in .claude/projects\n- **Registration**: Register existing projects with AIfred tracking\n- **Consolidation**: Sync knowledge, update docs, create commits\n- **Management**: Track priorities, update context files\n\n**Value**: Unified approach to project management with consistent patterns and documentation.\n\n---\n\n## Quick Actions\n\n| Need | Action | Reference |\n|------|--------|---------|\n| Create new code project | `/new-code-project <name>` | @.claude/commands/new-code-project.md |\n| Register existing project | `/register-project <path-or-url>` | @.claude/commands/register-project.md |\n| Create internal project | `/create-project <name>` | @.claude/commands/create-project.md |\n| Consolidate project knowledge | `/consolidate-project <name>` | @.claude/commands/consolidate-project.md |\n\n---\n\n## Project Lifecycle Workflow\n\n```\nPROJECT LIFECYCLE\n=================\n\nCREATE (new projects)\n  /new-code-project <name>\n    - Creates in ~/Code/<name>\n    - Initializes git, README, .claude/CLAUDE.md\n    - Registers in paths-registry.yaml\n    - Creates context file at .claude/context/projects/<name>.md\n\n  /create-project <name>\n    - Creates internal project in .claude/projects/<name>\n    - For non-code projects (writing, research, planning)\n    - Creates project structure with config.yaml\n\nREGISTER (existing projects)\n  /register-project <path-or-url>\n    - Clones GitHub URL to ~/Code/ if needed\n    - Auto-detects language/type\n    - Adds to paths-registry.yaml\n    - Creates context file\n\nCONSOLIDATE (ongoing maintenance)\n  /consolidate-project <name>\n    - Updates context file with current state\n    - Syncs documentation with code\n    - Creates git commit with changes\n    - Options: --infrastructure, --analyze, --all\n\nARCHIVE (completed projects)\n  - Move context to .claude/context/archive/\n  - Update paths-registry.yaml status\n  - Optional: Remove from ~/Code/\n```\n\n---\n\n## Project Locations\n\nUnderstanding where projects live:\n\n| Project Type | Location | Registration |\n|--------------|----------|--------------|\n| Code projects | `~/Code/<project>/` | `paths-registry.yaml` → `coding.projects` |\n| Internal projects | `.claude/projects/<project>/` | Direct in AIfred |\n| Context/notes | `.claude/context/projects/<project>.md` | Always in AIfred |\n| External sources | `external-sources/<category>/` | Symlinks to external data |\n\n---\n\n## Context File Template\n\nWhen creating project context files, use this structure:\n\n```markdown\n# Project: <name>\n\n**Type**: web-app | api | cli | library | docker | internal\n**Language**: typescript | python | go | rust | N/A\n**Location**: ~/Code/<name> or .claude/projects/<name>\n**Status**: active | maintenance | archived\n**Created**: YYYY-MM-DD\n\n## Overview\n\nBrief description of project purpose.\n\n## Key Files\n\n- `src/` - Main source code\n- `README.md` - Project documentation\n\n## Current State\n\nWhat''s working, what''s in progress.\n\n## Integration Points\n\nHow this connects to AIfred infrastructure.\n```\n\n---\n\n## Registration Patterns\n\n### GitHub URL Detection\n\nWhen user mentions a GitHub URL:\n1. Check if already registered in `paths-registry.yaml`\n2. If not, clone to `~/Code/<repo-name>`\n3. Auto-detect language from file extensions\n4. Add to registry under `coding.projects`\n5. Create context file\n\n### Existing Local Project\n\nWhen registering an existing local project:\n1. Verify path exists\n2. Detect project type and language\n3. Add to `paths-registry.yaml`\n4. Create context file\n5. Optionally initialize `.claude/CLAUDE.md` in project\n\n---\n\n## Integration Points\n\n### With Session Management\n- New projects can be noted in session-state.md\n- Project work tracked via current-priorities.md\n\n### With Orchestration\n- Complex project setup may trigger orchestration\n- Use `/orchestration:plan \"setup [project]\"` for multi-phase setup\n\n### With Memory MCP\n- Store project metadata as Memory entities\n- Track project relationships and dependencies\n\n### With paths-registry.yaml\n- Source of truth for all project locations\n- Check before assuming any path\n\n---\n\n## Common Workflows\n\n### Starting a New Feature Project\n\n```\n1. /new-code-project my-feature --type api --lang typescript\n2. Review generated structure in ~/Code/my-feature\n3. Update context file with specific requirements\n4. Begin development\n```\n\n### Onboarding Existing Project\n\n```\n1. /register-project https://github.com/user/repo\n2. Review auto-detected settings\n3. Update context file with domain knowledge\n4. Add any custom CLAUDE.md to the project\n```\n\n### Project Knowledge Sync\n\n```\n1. /consolidate-project my-project\n2. Review documentation updates\n3. Commit changes\n4. Update session-state.md if needed\n```\n\n---\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Project not appearing in registry?\n- Check `paths-registry.yaml` directly\n- Verify path exists: `ls ~/Code/<project>`\n- Re-run `/register-project <path>`\n\n### Context file out of date?\n- Run `/consolidate-project <name>`\n- Review changes before committing\n- Update manually if consolidation misses details\n\n### Git clone failing?\n- Check SSH key: `ssh -T git@github.com`\n- Verify URL format\n- Check network connectivity\n\n---\n\n## Related Documentation\n\n### Commands\n- @.claude/commands/new-code-project.md - New code project creation\n- @.claude/commands/register-project.md - Project registration\n- @.claude/commands/create-project.md - Internal project creation\n- @.claude/commands/consolidate-project.md - Project consolidation\n\n### Context Files\n- @paths-registry.yaml - Project registration source of truth\n- @.claude/context/projects/ - All project context files\n- @.claude/templates/project-template/ - Project template structure\n\n### Patterns\n- @.claude/context/patterns/memory-storage-pattern.md - When to store in Memory\n- @.claude/context/standards/documentation-location.md - Where to document\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:58:34.700Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT needing comprehensive project management capabilities from creation to archival.","zh":"适用于 Claude Code 和 AutoGPT 等 AI Agent，需要从创建到存档的全面项目管理功能。","ja":"Claude Code や AutoGPT などの AI エージェントに適しています。プロジェクトの作成からアーカイブまでの包括的なプロジェクト管理機能が必要です。","ko":"Claude Code 및 AutoGPT와 같은 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다. 생성에서 보관까지 종합적인 프로젝트 관리 기능이 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude Code y AutoGPT que necesitan capacidades de gestión de proyectos integrales desde la creación hasta el archivo.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Claude Code et AutoGPT nécessitant des capacités de gestion de projets complètes de la création à l''archivage.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Claude Code und AutoGPT, die umfassende Projektmanagementfunktionen von der Erstellung bis zum Archiv benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA como Claude Code e AutoGPT que necessitam de capacidades de gerenciamento de projetos abrangentes desde a criação até o arquivamento.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code и AutoGPT, которым необходимы комплексные возможности управления проектами от создания до архивации.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude Code و AutoGPT الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات إدارة مشاريع شاملة من الإنشاء إلى الأرشفة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage project lifecycles by consolidating creation, registration, consolidation, and management tasks, utilizing runbooks and tracking project priorities, all while updating context files and syncing knowledge.","zh":"使代理能够通过整合创建、注册、整合和管理任务来管理项目生命周期，利用 runbooks 跟踪项目优先级，同时更新上下文文件和同步知识。","ja":"エージェントは、runbooks を使用してプロジェクトの優先順位を追跡し、同時にコンテキストファイルを更新し、知識を同期することで、作成、登録、統合、管理タスクを統合してプロジェクトのライフサイクルを管理できます。","ko":"에이전트가 런북을 사용하여 프로젝트의 우선순위를 추적하고,同時に 컨텍스트 파일을 업데이트하고 지식을 동기화함으로써 생성, 등록, 통합, 관리 작업을 통합하여 프로젝트 생명주기를 관리할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar los ciclos de vida de los proyectos consolidando la creación, el registro, la consolidación y las tareas de gestión, utilizando libros de ejecución y seguimiento de prioridades de proyectos, todo mientras actualiza archivos de contexto y sincroniza conocimientos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les cycles de vie des projets en consolidant la création, l''enregistrement, la consolidation et les tâches de gestion, en utilisant des livres de suivi et en suivant les priorités des projets, le tout en mettant à jour les fichiers de contexte et en synchronisant les connaissances.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, Projektlebenszyklen zu verwalten, indem sie die Erstellung, Registrierung, Konsolidierung und Verwaltungsaufgaben konsolidieren, Runbooks verwenden und Projekt Prioritäten verfolgen, während sie Kontextdateien aktualisieren und Wissen synchronisieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar ciclos de vida de projetos consolidando criação, registro, consolidação e tarefas de gerenciamento, utilizando runbooks e acompanhando prioridades de projeto, atualizando arquivos de contexto e sincronizando conhecimento.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять жизненным циклом проектов, консолидируя создание, регистрацию, консолидацию и задачи управления, используя runbooks и отслеживая приоритеты проекта, обновляя контекстные файлы и синхронизируя знания.","ar":"يتمكّن الوكلاء من إدارة دورة حياة المشروع عن طريق توحيد إنشاء التسجيل وتوحيد والمهام الإدارية، واستخدام الكتب التشغيلية وتتبع أولويات المشروع، مع تحديث ملفات السياق وتزامن المعرفة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating project onboarding by registering existing projects with AIfred tracking","Consolidating project knowledge by syncing documentation and creating commits","Managing project priorities by tracking and updating context files"],"zh":["通过 AIfred 跟踪注册现有项目来自动化项目入门","通过同步文档和创建提交来整合项目知识","通过跟踪和更新上下文文件来管理项目优先级"],"ja":["AIfred のトラッキングで既存のプロジェクトを登録してプロジェクトのオンボーディングを自動化する","ドキュメントを同期しコミットを作成することでプロジェクトの知識を統合する","コンテキストファイルを追跡して更新することでプロジェクトの優先順位を管理する"],"ko":["AIfred 추적을 통해 기존 프로젝트를 등록하여 프로젝트 온보딩을 자동화합니다.","문서를 동기화하고 커밋을 생성하여 프로젝트 지식을 통합합니다.","컨텍스트 파일을 추적하고 업데이트하여 프로젝트 우선순위를 관리합니다."],"es":["Automatizar la integración de proyectos mediante el registro de proyectos existentes con el seguimiento de AIfred","Consolidar el conocimiento del proyecto sincronizando la documentación y creando confirmaciones","Gestionar las prioridades del proyecto mediante el seguimiento y la actualización de archivos de contexto"],"fr":["Automatiser l''intégration de projets en enregistrant les projets existants avec le suivi AIfred","Consolider les connaissances du projet en synchronisant la documentation et en créant des validations","Gérer les priorités des projets en suivant et en mettant à jour les fichiers de contexte"],"de":["Automatisieren der Projektintegration durch Registrierung bestehender Projekte mit AIfred-Verfolgung","Konsolidieren des Projektwissens durch Synchronisierung der Dokumentation und Erstellung von Commits","Verwalten der Projekt Prioritäten durch Verfolgen und Aktualisieren von Kontextdateien"],"pt":["Automatizar o processo de integração de projetos registrando projetos existentes com o acompanhamento do AIfred","Consolidar o conhecimento do projeto sincronizando a documentação e criando commits","Gerenciar prioridades de projeto acompanhando e atualizando arquivos de contexto"],"ru":["Автоматизировать процесс интеграции проектов, регистрируя существующие проекты с отслеживанием AIfred","Консолидировать знания проекта, синхронизируя документацию и создавая коммиты","Управлять приоритетами проекта, отслеживая и обновляя контекстные файлы"],"ar":["تأتمتة عملية إدراج المشروع عن طريق تسجيل المشاريع الحالية مع تتبع AIfred","توحيد معرفة المشروع بمزامنة الوثائق وإبداء التعديلات","إدارة أولويات المشروع من خلال تتبع ملفات السياق و تحديثها"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires AIfred command deck integration","Limited to projects in ~/Code or .claude/projects directories"],"zh":["需要 AIfred 命令集成","仅限于 ~/Code 或 .claude/projects 目录中的项目"],"ja":["AIfred コマンドデッキの統合が必要"," ~/Code または .claude/projects ディレクトリ内のプロジェクトのみに限定"],"ko":["AIfred 명령 덱 통합이 필요합니다.","~/Code 또는 .claude/projects 디렉토리 내의 프로젝트만 허용"],"es":["Requiere integración con la cubierta de comandos de AIfred","Limitado a proyectos en los directorios ~/Code o .claude/projects"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec le pont de commandes AIfred","Limité aux projets dans les répertoires ~/Code ou .claude/projects"],"de":["Benötigt Integration mit dem Befehlsdeck von AIfred","Begrenzt auf Projekte in den Verzeichnissen ~/Code oder .claude/projects"],"pt":["Requer integração com o convés de comando do AIfred","Limitado a projetos nos diretórios ~/Code ou .claude/projects"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с командным деком AIfred","Ограничен проектами в директориях ~/Code или .claude/projects"],"ar":["يتطلب تكاملًا مع سطح التحكم في الأوامر AIfred","محدود بمشاريع في الدلائل ~/Code أو .claude/projects"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"86e16d8047d9a29478b0c588228d5fae3dfaab2a67aefceedc8d21c104009fde","qualityScore":52}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('deadlock-mod-manager/deadlock-mod-manager/opensrc', 'community', 'deadlock-mod-manager', 'deadlock-mod-manager', 'deadlock-mod-manager/deadlock-mod-manager', 'opensrc', 0, 0, 52, '2026-03-02T01:56:11.053Z', '2026-03-02T03:26:22.291Z', 'ceb02950c4a30434297d257c8bb9ab6bb3322ca9461b5020988fcb6b43dfbd65', '{"id":"deadlock-mod-manager/deadlock-mod-manager/opensrc","name":"opensrc","description":{"zh":"opensrc - AI","ja":"opensrc - AI","ko":"opensrc - AI","es":"opensrc es un gestor de mods para el juego Deadlock de Valve, diseñado para mejorar la experiencia de juego con herramientas de AI","fr":"opensrc est un gestionnaire de mods pour le jeu Deadlock de Valve, conçu pour améliorer l''expérience de jeu avec des outils d''IA","de":"opensrc ist ein Mod-Manager für das Spiel Deadlock von Valve, entwickelt um die Spiel-Erfahrung mit KI-Tools zu verbessern","pt":"opensrc é um gerenciador de mods para o jogo Deadlock da Valve. Ele permite que os jogadores gerenciem e instalem mods facilmente.","ru":"opensrc — менеджер модов для игры Deadlock от Valve. Он позволяет игрокам легко управлять и устанавливать моды.","ar":"opensrc هو مدير تعديلات لألعاب Deadlock من Valve. يسمح للاعبين بإدارة وتثبيت التعديلات بسهولة.","en":"A mod manager for the Valve game Deadlock."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"opensrc - AI","ja":"opensrc - AI","ko":"opensrc - AI","es":"Herramientas de AI: opensrc, gestor de mods para Deadlock","fr":"Outils d''IA: opensrc, gestionnaire de mods pour Deadlock","de":"KI-Tools: opensrc, Mod-Manager für Deadlock","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: opensrc, Gerenciador de Mods para Dead...","ru":"ИИ Агенты: opensrc, Менеджер Модов для Deadlock","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: opensrc، مدير تعديلات Deadlock","en":"opensrc"},"description":{"zh":"opensrc - AI","ja":"opensrc - AI","ko":"opensrc - AI","es":"opensrc es un gestor de mods para el juego Deadlock de Valve, diseñado para mejorar la experiencia de juego con herramientas de AI","fr":"opensrc est un gestionnaire de mods pour le jeu Deadlock de Valve, conçu pour améliorer l''expérience de jeu avec des outils d''IA","de":"opensrc ist ein Mod-Manager für das Spiel Deadlock von Valve, entwickelt um die Spiel-Erfahrung mit KI-Tools zu verbessern","pt":"opensrc é um gerenciador de mods para o jogo Deadlock da Valve. Ele permite que os jogadores gerenciem e instalem mods facilmente.","ru":"opensrc — менеджер модов для игры Deadlock от Valve. Он позволяет игрокам легко управлять и устанавливать моды.","ar":"opensrc هو مدير تعديلات لألعاب Deadlock من Valve. يسمح للاعبين بإدارة وتثبيت التعديلات بسهولة.","en":"A mod manager for the Valve game Deadlock."},"definition":{"en":"A mod manager for the Valve game Deadlock."},"features":{"zh":["opensrc - AI","opensrc - AI","opensrc - AI"],"ja":["opensrc - AI","opensrc - AI","opensrc - AI"],"ko":["opensrc - AI","opensrc - AI","opensrc - AI"],"es":["Gestión de mods para Deadlock","Herramientas de AI para mejorar la experiencia de juego","Instalación y configuración sencilla","Compatibilidad con diferentes versiones de Deadlock","Soporte para mods personalizados"],"fr":["Gestion de mods pour Deadlock","Outils d''IA pour améliorer l''expérience de jeu","Installation et configuration simples","Compatibilité avec différentes versions de Deadlock","Prise en charge de mods personnalisés"],"de":["Mod-Verwaltung für Deadlock","KI-Tools zur Verbesserung der Spiel-Erfahrung","Einfache Installation und Konfiguration","Kompatibilität mit verschiedenen Deadlock-Versionen","Unterstützung für benutzerdefinierte Mods"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de mods fácil","Instalação de mods simplificada","Compatibilidade com mods personalizados","Interface de usuário intuitiva","Suporte a mods de terceiros"],"ru":["Легкое управление модами","Упрощенная установка модов","Совместимость с пользовательскими модами","Интуитивно понятный интерфейс","Поддержка модов третьих лиц"],"ar":["إدارة تعديلات سهلة","تثبيت تعديلات مبسط","توافق مع التعديلات المخصصة","واجهة مستخدم سهلة الاستخدام","دعم التعديلات من جهات خارجية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["opensrc - AI","opensrc - AI","opensrc - AI"],"ja":["opensrc - AI","opensrc - AI","opensrc - AI"],"ko":["opensrc - AI","opensrc - AI","opensrc - AI"],"es":["herramientas de AI","gestor de mods","Deadlock","cómo instalar opensrc","guias de configuración de opensrc","alternativas a opensrc","opensrc vs otros gestores de mods","instalación de opensrc","configuración de opensrc"],"fr":["outils d''IA","gestionnaire de mods","Deadlock","comment installer opensrc","guides de configuration d''opensrc","alternatives à opensrc","opensrc vs autres gestionnaires de mods","installation d''opensrc","configuration d''opensrc"],"de":["KI-Tools","Mod-Manager","Deadlock","wie man opensrc installiert","Konfigurationsanleitungen für opensrc","Alternativen zu opensrc","opensrc vs andere Mod-Manager","Installation von opensrc","Konfiguration von opensrc"],"pt":["como usar opensrc","o que é opensrc","opensrc vs mod manager","instalar opensrc","guias de configuração opensrc","alternativas para opensrc","opensrc para deadlock","ferramentas de ia para jogos"],"ru":["как использовать opensrc","что такое opensrc","opensrc vs менеджер модов","установить opensrc","руководства по настройке opensrc","альтернативы opensrc","opensrc для deadlock","инструменты ии для игр"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام opensrc","ما هو opensrc","opensrc مقابل مدير التعديلات","تثبيت opensrc","دليل إعداد opensrc","بديل ل opensrc","opensrc ل deadlock","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للألعاب"]}},"owner":"deadlock-mod-manager","repo":"deadlock-mod-manager","repoPath":"deadlock-mod-manager/deadlock-mod-manager","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.053Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"opensrc","description":"Fetch source code for npm, PyPI, or crates.io packages and GitHub/GitLab repos to provide AI agents with implementation context beyond types and docs. Use when needing to understand how a library works internally, debug dependency issues, or explore package implementations.","bodyPreview":"# opensrc\n\nCLI tool to fetch source code for packages/repos, giving AI coding agents deeper implementation context.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Need to understand how a library/package works internally (not just its interface)\n- Debugging issues where types alone are insufficient\n- Exploring implementation patterns in dependencies\n- Agent needs to reference actual source code of a package\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\n# Install globally or use npx\nnpm install -g opensrc\n\n# Fetch npm package (auto-detects inst","body":"# opensrc\n\nCLI tool to fetch source code for packages/repos, giving AI coding agents deeper implementation context.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Need to understand how a library/package works internally (not just its interface)\n- Debugging issues where types alone are insufficient\n- Exploring implementation patterns in dependencies\n- Agent needs to reference actual source code of a package\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\n# Install globally or use npx\nnpm install -g opensrc\n\n# Fetch npm package (auto-detects installed version from lockfile)\nnpx opensrc zod\n\n# Fetch from other registries\nnpx opensrc pypi:requests       # Python/PyPI\nnpx opensrc crates:serde        # Rust/crates.io\n\n# Fetch GitHub repo directly\nnpx opensrc vercel/ai           # owner/repo shorthand\nnpx opensrc github:owner/repo   # explicit prefix\nnpx opensrc https://github.com/colinhacks/zod  # full URL\n\n# Fetch specific version/ref\nnpx opensrc zod@3.22.0\nnpx opensrc owner/repo@v1.0.0\n```\n\n## Commands\n\n| Command                 | Description                     |\n| ----------------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| `opensrc <packages...>` | Fetch source for packages/repos |\n| `opensrc list`          | List all fetched sources        |\n| `opensrc remove <name>` | Remove specific source          |\n| `opensrc clean`         | Remove all sources              |\n\n## Output Structure\n\nAfter fetching, sources stored in `opensrc/` directory:\n\n```\nopensrc/\n├── settings.json           # User preferences\n├── sources.json            # Index of fetched packages/repos\n└── repos/\n    └── github.com/\n        └── owner/\n            └── repo/       # Cloned source code\n```\n\n## File Modifications\n\nOn first run, opensrc prompts to modify:\n\n- `.gitignore` - adds `opensrc/` to ignore list\n- `tsconfig.json` - excludes `opensrc/` from compilation\n- `AGENTS.md` - adds section pointing agents to source code\n\nUse `--modify` or `--modify=false` to skip prompt.\n\n## Key Behaviors\n\n1. **Version Detection** - For npm, auto-detects installed version from `node_modules`, `package-lock.json`, `pnpm-lock.yaml`, or `yarn.lock`\n2. **Repository Resolution** - Resolves package to its git repo via registry API, clones at matching tag\n3. **Monorepo Support** - Handles packages in monorepos via `repository.directory` field\n4. **Shallow Clone** - Uses `--depth 1` for efficient cloning, removes `.git` after clone\n5. **Tag Fallback** - Tries `v{version}`, `{version}`, then default branch if tag not found\n\n## Common Workflows\n\n### Fetching a Package\n\n```bash\n# Agent needs to understand zod''s implementation\nnpx opensrc zod\n# → Detects version from lockfile\n# → Finds repo URL from npm registry\n# → Clones at matching git tag\n# → Source available at opensrc/repos/github.com/colinhacks/zod/\n```\n\n### Updating Sources\n\n```bash\n# Re-run same command to update to currently installed version\nnpx opensrc zod\n# → Checks if version changed\n# → Re-clones if needed\n```\n\n### Multiple Sources\n\n```bash\n# Fetch multiple at once\nnpx opensrc react react-dom next\nnpx opensrc zod pypi:pydantic vercel/ai\n```\n\n## References\n\nFor detailed information:\n\n- [CLI Usage & Options](references/cli-usage.md) - Full command reference\n- [Architecture](references/architecture.md) - Code structure and extension\n- [Registry Support](references/registry-support.md) - npm, PyPI, crates.io details\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:26:22.291Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Coding Agents needing deeper implementation context of libraries and packages.","zh":"适合需要对库和包有更深入实现上下文的编码代理。","ja":"ライブラリやパッケージの実装に関するより深いコンテキストが必要なコーディングエージェントに適しています。","ko":"라이브러리 및 패키지에 대한 더 깊은 구현 컨텍스트가 필요한 코딩 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Codificación que necesitan un contexto de implementación más profundo de bibliotecas y paquetes.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Codage qui ont besoin d''un contexte d''implémentation plus approfondi de bibliothèques et de packages.","de":"Perfekt für Coding-Agenten, die einen tieferen Implementierungskontext von Bibliotheken und Paketen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Codificação que necessitam de um contexto de implementação mais profundo de bibliotecas e pacotes.","ru":"Идеально для Агентов Кодирования, которым требуется более глубокий контекст реализации библиотек и пакетов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التشفير الذي يحتاج إلى سياق تنفيذ أعمق للمكتبات والحزم."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to fetch source code for packages and repositories, providing a deeper understanding of internal implementations, debugging capabilities, and exploration of implementation patterns using npm packages and CLI tools.","zh":"赋予代理获取包和仓库的源代码的能力，提供对内部实现、调试能力和使用npm包和CLI工具的实现模式的更深入的理解。","ja":"エージェントにパッケージやリポジトリのソースコードを取得する能力を与え、内部実装、デバッグ機能、およびnpmパッケージやCLIツールを使用した実装パターンの調査に関するより深い理解を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 패키지 및 저장소의 소스 코드를 가져오는 기능을 부여하여 내부 구현, 디버깅 기능 및 npm 패키지 및 CLI 도구를 사용한 구현 패턴에 대한 더 깊은 이해를 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a recuperar el código fuente de paquetes y repositorios, proporcionando una comprensión más profunda de las implementaciones internas, capacidades de depuración y exploración de patrones de implementación utilizando paquetes npm y herramientas CLI.","fr":"Permet aux agents de récupérer le code source des packages et des référentiels, fournissant une compréhension plus approfondie des implémentations internes, des capacités de débogage et de l''exploration des modèles d''implémentation en utilisant des packages npm et des outils CLI.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, den Quellcode für Pakete und Repositories abzurufen, und bietet so ein tieferes Verständnis von internen Implementierungen, Debugging-Funktionen und der Erkundung von Implementierungsmustern unter Verwendung von npm-Paketen und CLI-Tools.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a buscar o código-fonte de pacotes e repositórios, fornecendo uma compreensão mais profunda das implementações internas, capacidades de depuração e exploração de padrões de implementação usando pacotes npm e ferramentas CLI.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью получать исходный код пакетов и репозиториев, обеспечивая более глубокое понимание внутренних реализаций, возможностей отладки и изучения шаблонов реализации с помощью пакетов npm и инструментов CLI.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على استرجاع код المصدر للحزم والمستودعات، مما يوفر فهمًا أعمق للتنفيذات الداخلية وقدرات التصحيح واكتشاف أنماط التنفيذ باستخدام حزم npm وأدوات CLI."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging issues where types alone are insufficient","Exploring implementation patterns in dependencies","Fetching source code for npm packages"],"zh":["调试仅使用类型不足的问题","探索依赖项中的实现模式","获取npm包的源代码"],"ja":["タイプだけでは不十分な問題のデバッグ","依存関係内の実装パターンの探索","npmパッケージのソースコードの取得"],"ko":["유형만으로는 불충분한 문제의 디버깅","의존성 내의 구현 패턴 탐색","npm 패키지의 소스 코드 가져오기"],"es":["Depuración de problemas donde los tipos solos son insuficientes","Exploración de patrones de implementación en dependencias","Recuperación del código fuente para paquetes npm"],"fr":["Débogage de problèmes où les types seuls sont insuffisants","Exploration de modèles d''implémentation dans les dépendances","Récupération du code source pour les packages npm"],"de":["Fehlerbehebung bei Problemen, bei denen Typen allein unzureichend sind","Erkundung von Implementierungsmustern in Abhängigkeiten","Abruf des Quellcodes für npm-Pakete"],"pt":["Depuração de problemas onde os tipos sozinhos são insuficientes","Exploração de padrões de implementação em dependências","Obtenção do código-fonte para pacotes npm"],"ru":["Отладка проблем, где типы alone являются недостаточными","Изучение шаблонов реализации в зависимостях","Получение исходного кода для пакетов npm"],"ar":["تصحيح المشكلات حيث النوع وحده غير كاف","استكشاف أنماط التنفيذ في الاعتماديات","استرجاع код المصدر للحزم npm"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires npm installation or npx usage","Limited to npm packages and repositories"],"zh":["需要npm安装或npx使用","仅限npm包和仓库"],"ja":["npmのインストールまたはnpxの使用が必要","npmパッケージやリポジトリに限定"],"ko":["npm 설치 또는 npx 사용이 필요","npm 패키지 및 저장소에 제한"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de npm o el uso de npx","Limitado a paquetes y repositorios npm"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de npm ou l''utilisation de npx","Limité aux packages et référentiels npm"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation von npm oder die Verwendung von npx","Eingeschränkt auf npm-Pakete und -Repositories"],"pt":["Requer instalação do npm ou uso do npx","Limitado a pacotes e repositórios npm"],"ru":["Требует установки npm или использования npx","Ограничен пакетами и репозиториями npm"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت npm أو استخدام npx","محدود بالحزم والمستودعات npm"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"ceb02950c4a30434297d257c8bb9ab6bb3322ca9461b5020988fcb6b43dfbd65","qualityScore":52}');
