ntas de IA: project-memory, Recomendador de Livros","ru":"ИИ Агенты: project-memory, Система Рекомендации Книг","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: project-memory، نظام توصية الكتب","en":"project-memory"},"description":{"zh":"project-memory是一个基于AI的智能书籍推荐系统，使用React和Python等技术","ja":"project-memoryは、AIエージェントを使用した本のレコメンドシステムで、ReactとPythonなどの技術を使用しています","ko":"project-memory는 AI 에이전트를 활용한 도서 추천 시스템으로, React와 Python 등의 기술을 사용합니다","es":"Project-memory es un sistema de recomendación de libros agente que utiliza inteligencia artificial para sugerir lecturas personalizadas a los usuarios","fr":"Project-memory est un système de recommandation de livres basé sur l''intelligence artificielle qui suggère des lectures personnalisées aux utilisateurs","de":"Project-memory ist ein empfehlungssystem für bücher, das künstliche intelligenz nutzt, um personalisierte leseempfehlungen an die benutzer zu geben","pt":"O project-memory é um sistema de recomendação de livros baseado em IA, projetado para ajudar os desenvolvedores a encontrar novos títulos.","ru":"Project-memory - это система рекомендации книг на основе ИИ, предназначенная для помощи разработчикам в поиске новых названий.","ar":"project-memory هو نظام توصية الكتب بالذكاء الاصطناعي، مصمم لمساعدة المطورين على العثور على عناوين جديدة.","en":"An agentic book recommender system"},"definition":{"en":"An agentic book recommender system"},"features":{"zh":["使用AI算法进行个性化推荐","支持React和Python等开发技术","提供CLI工具进行快速部署","可集成多种数据源","支持实时更新和推荐"],"ja":["AIアルゴリズムを使用した個性化されたレコメンド","ReactとPythonなどの開発技術をサポート","CLIツールを使用した迅速なデプロイ","複数のデータソースを統合する","リアルタイム更新とレコメンドをサポート"],"ko":["AI 알고리즘을 사용한 개인화된 추천","React와 Python 등의 개발 기술을 지원","CLI 도구를 사용한 빠른 배포","다중 데이터 소스를 통합","실시간 업데이트 및 추천을 지원"],"es":["Sistema de recomendación de libros personalizados","Utiliza inteligencia artificial para analizar las preferencias del usuario","Ofrece sugerencias de lecturas basadas en la historia de lectura del usuario","Permite a los usuarios descubrir nuevos autores y géneros","Es compatible con diferentes plataformas y dispositivos"],"fr":["Système de recommandation de livres personnalisés","Utilise l''intelligence artificielle pour analyser les préférences de l''utilisateur","Offre des suggestions de lectures basées sur l''historique de lecture de l''utilisateur","Permet aux utilisateurs de découvrir de nouveaux auteurs et genres","Est compatible avec différentes plateformes et appareils"],"de":["Empfehlungssystem für bücher mit personalisierten vorschlägen","Nutzt künstliche intelligenz, um die vorlieben des benutzers zu analysieren","Bietet leseempfehlungen basierend auf der lesegeschichte des benutzers","Ermöglicht es den benutzern, neue autoren und genres zu entdecken","Ist kompatibel mit verschiedenen plattformen und geräten"],"pt":["Recomendação de livros personalizada","Integração com plataformas de leitura","Análise de preferências do usuário","Sugestões de livros baseadas em IA","Interface de usuário intuitiva"],"ru":["Персональные рекомендации книг","Интеграция с платформами чтения","Анализ предпочтений пользователя","Предложения книг на основе ИИ","Интуитивный интерфейс пользователя"],"ar":["توصية الكتب الشخصية","التكامل مع منصات القراءة","تحليل تفضيلات المستخدم","اقتراحات الكتب بالذكاء الاصطناعي","واجهة مستخدم直觉ية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用project-memory","什么是AI智能书籍推荐系统","project-memory替代品","project-memory vs 其他推荐系统","project-memory安装指南","project-memory设置教程"],"ja":["project-memoryの使い方","AIエージェントによる本のレコメンドシステムとは","project-memoryの代替品","project-memoryと他のレコメンドシステムの比較","project-memoryのインストールガイド","project-memoryの設定方法"],"ko":["project-memory 사용법","AI 에이전트를 활용한 도서 추천 시스템이란","project-memory 대체품","project-memory와 다른 추천 시스템 비교","project-memory 설치 가이드","project-memory 설정 방법"],"es":["cómo utilizar project-memory","qué es un sistema de recomendación de libros agente","project-memory alternativa","project-memory vs otros sistemas de recomendación","instalación de project-memory","guía de configuración de project-memory","desarrollo de sistemas de recomendación de libros","inteligencia artificial en la recomendación de libros"],"fr":["comment utiliser project-memory","qu''est-ce qu''un système de recommandation de livres basé sur l''intelligence artificielle","project-memory alternative","project-memory vs autres systèmes de recommandation","installation de project-memory","guide de configuration de project-memory","développement de systèmes de recommandation de livres","intelligence artificielle dans la recommandation de livres"],"de":["wie man project-memory verwendet","was ist ein empfehlungssystem für bücher","project-memory alternative","project-memory vs andere empfehlungssysteme","installation von project-memory","einrichtungsanleitung für project-memory","entwicklung von empfehlungssystemen für bücher","künstliche intelligenz in der buchempfehlung"],"pt":["como usar project-memory","o que é project-memory","ferramentas de ia para desenvolvedores","sistemas de recomendação de livros","project-memory vs outros sistemas de recomendação","instalar project-memory","guia de configuração do project-memory"],"ru":["как использовать project-memory","что такое project-memory","инструменты ИИ для разработчиков","системы рекомендации книг","project-memory vs другие системы рекомендации","установить project-memory","руководство по настройке project-memory"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام project-memory","ما هو project-memory","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","نظم توصية الكتب","project-memory مقابل أنظمة توصية أخرى","تثبيت project-memory","دليل إعداد project-memory"]}},"owner":"jaydee829","repo":"agentic_librarian","repoPath":"jaydee829/agentic_librarian","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.107Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"project-memory","description":"Set up and maintain a structured project memory system in docs/project_notes/ that tracks bugs with solutions, architectural decisions, key project facts, and work history. Use this skill when asked to set up project memory, track our decisions, log a bug fix, update project memory, or initialize memory system. Configures both GEMINI.md and AGENTS.md to maintain memory awareness across different AI coding tools.","bodyPreview":"# Project Memory\n\n## Table of Contents\n\n- [Overview](#overview)\n- [When to Use This Skill](#when-to-use-this-skill)\n- [Core Capabilities](#core-capabilities)\n  - [1. Initial Setup - Create Memory Infrastructure](#1-initial-setup---create-memory-infrastructure)\n  - [2. Configure GEMINI.md - Memory-Aware Behavior](#2-configure-gemini.md---memory-aware-behavior)\n  - [3. Configure AGENTS.md - Multi-Tool Support](#3-configure-agentsmd---multi-tool-support)\n  - [4. Searching Memory Files](#4-searching","body":"# Project Memory\n\n## Table of Contents\n\n- [Overview](#overview)\n- [When to Use This Skill](#when-to-use-this-skill)\n- [Core Capabilities](#core-capabilities)\n  - [1. Initial Setup - Create Memory Infrastructure](#1-initial-setup---create-memory-infrastructure)\n  - [2. Configure GEMINI.md - Memory-Aware Behavior](#2-configure-gemini.md---memory-aware-behavior)\n  - [3. Configure AGENTS.md - Multi-Tool Support](#3-configure-agentsmd---multi-tool-support)\n  - [4. Searching Memory Files](#4-searching-memory-files)\n  - [5. Updating Memory Files](#5-updating-memory-files)\n  - [6. Memory File Maintenance](#6-memory-file-maintenance)\n- [Templates and References](#templates-and-references)\n- [Example Workflows](#example-workflows)\n- [Integration with Other Skills](#integration-with-other-skills)\n- [Success Criteria](#success-criteria)\n\n## Overview\n\nMaintain institutional knowledge for projects by establishing a structured memory system in `docs/project_notes/`. This skill sets up four key memory files (bugs, decisions, key facts, issues) and configures GEMINI.md and AGENTS.md to automatically reference and maintain them. The result is a project that remembers past decisions, solutions to problems, and important configuration details across coding sessions and across different AI tools.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nInvoke this skill when:\n\n- Starting a new project that will accumulate knowledge over time\n- The project already has recurring bugs or decisions that should be documented\n- The user asks to \"set up project memory\" or \"track our decisions\"\n- The user wants to log a bug fix, architectural decision, or completed work\n- Encountering a problem that feels familiar (\"didn''t we solve this before?\")\n- Before proposing an architectural change (check existing decisions first)\n- Working on projects with multiple developers or AI tools (Claude Code, Cursor, Antigravity, etc.)\n\n## Core Capabilities\n\n### 1. Initial Setup - Create Memory Infrastructure\n\nWhen invoked for the first time in a project, create the following structure:\n\n```\ndocs/\n└── project_notes/\n    ├── bugs.md         # Bug log with solutions\n    ├── decisions.md    # Architectural Decision Records\n    ├── key_facts.md    # Project configuration and constants\n    └── issues.md       # Work log with ticket references\n```\n\n**Directory naming rationale:** Using `docs/project_notes/` instead of `memory/` makes it look like standard engineering organization, not AI-specific tooling. This increases adoption and maintenance by human developers.\n\n**Initial file content:** Copy templates from the `references/` directory in this skill:\n- Use `references/bugs_template.md` for initial `bugs.md`\n- Use `references/decisions_template.md` for initial `decisions.md`\n- Use `references/key_facts_template.md` for initial `key_facts.md`\n- Use `references/issues_template.md` for initial `issues.md`\n\nEach template includes format examples and usage tips.\n\n### 2. Configure GEMINI.md - Memory-Aware Behavior\n\nAdd or update the following section in the project''s `GEMINI.md` file:\n\n```markdown\n## Project Memory System\n\nThis project maintains institutional knowledge in `docs/project_notes/` for consistency across sessions.\n\n### Memory Files\n\n- **bugs.md** - Bug log with dates, solutions, and prevention notes\n- **decisions.md** - Architectural Decision Records (ADRs) with context and trade-offs\n- **key_facts.md** - Project configuration, credentials, ports, important URLs\n- **issues.md** - Work log with ticket IDs, descriptions, and URLs\n\n### Memory-Aware Protocols\n\n**Before proposing architectural changes:**\n- Check `docs/project_notes/decisions.md` for existing decisions\n- Verify the proposed approach doesn''t conflict with past choices\n- If it does conflict, acknowledge the existing decision and explain why a change is warranted\n\n**When encountering errors or bugs:**\n- Search `docs/project_notes/bugs.md` for similar issues\n- Apply known solutions if found\n- Document new bugs and solutions when resolved\n\n**When looking up project configuration:**\n- Check `docs/project_notes/key_facts.md` for credentials, ports, URLs, service accounts\n- Prefer documented facts over assumptions\n\n**When completing work on tickets:**\n- Log completed work in `docs/project_notes/issues.md`\n- Include ticket ID, date, brief description, and URL\n\n**When user requests memory updates:**\n- Update the appropriate memory file (bugs, decisions, key_facts, or issues)\n- Follow the established format and style (bullet lists, dates, concise entries)\n\n### Style Guidelines for Memory Files\n\n- **Prefer bullet lists over tables** for simplicity and ease of editing\n- **Keep entries concise** (1-3 lines for descriptions)\n- **Always include dates** for temporal context\n- **Include URLs** for tickets, documentation, monitoring dashboards\n- **Manual cleanup** of old entries is expected (not automated)\n```\n\n### 3. Configure AGENTS.md - Multi-Tool Support\n\nIf the project has an `AGENTS.md` file (used for agent workflows or multi-tool projects), add the same memory protocols. This ensures consistency whether using Claude Code, Cursor, Antigravity, or other AI tools.\n\n**If AGENTS.md exists:** Add the same \"Project Memory System\" section as above.\n\n**If AGENTS.md doesn''t exist:** Ask the user if they want to create it. Many projects use multiple AI tools and benefit from shared memory protocols.\n\n### 4. Searching Memory Files\n\nWhen encountering problems or making decisions, proactively search memory files:\n\n**Search bugs.md:**\n```bash\n# Look for similar errors\ngrep -i \"connection refused\" docs/project_notes/bugs.md\n\n# Find bugs by date range\ngrep \"2025-01\" docs/project_notes/bugs.md\n```\n\n**Search decisions.md:**\n```bash\n# Check for decisions about a technology\ngrep -i \"database\" docs/project_notes/decisions.md\n\n# Find all ADRs\ngrep \"^### ADR-\" docs/project_notes/decisions.md\n```\n\n**Search key_facts.md:**\n```bash\n# Find database connection info\ngrep -A 5 \"Database\" docs/project_notes/key_facts.md\n\n# Look up service accounts\ngrep -i \"service account\" docs/project_notes/key_facts.md\n```\n\n**Use Grep tool for more complex searches:**\n- Search across all memory files: `Grep(pattern=\"oauth\", path=\"docs/project_notes/\")`\n- Context-aware search: `Grep(pattern=\"bug\", path=\"docs/project_notes/bugs.md\", -A=3, -B=3)`\n\n### 5. Updating Memory Files\n\nWhen the user requests updates or when documenting resolved issues, update the appropriate memory file:\n\n**Adding a bug entry:**\n```markdown\n### YYYY-MM-DD - Brief Bug Description\n- **Issue**: What went wrong\n- **Root Cause**: Why it happened\n- **Solution**: How it was fixed\n- **Prevention**: How to avoid it in the future\n```\n\n**Adding a decision:**\n```markdown\n### ADR-XXX: Decision Title (YYYY-MM-DD)\n\n**Context:**\n- Why the decision was needed\n- What problem it solves\n\n**Decision:**\n- What was chosen\n\n**Alternatives Considered:**\n- Option 1 -> Why rejected\n- Option 2 -> Why rejected\n\n**Consequences:**\n- Benefits\n- Trade-offs\n```\n\n**Adding key facts:**\n- Organize by category (GCP Project, Database, API, Local Development, etc.)\n- Use bullet lists for clarity\n- Include both production and development details\n- Add URLs for easy navigation\n- See `references/key_facts_template.md` for security guidelines on what NOT to store\n\n**Adding work log entry:**\n```markdown\n### YYYY-MM-DD - TICKET-ID: Brief Description\n- **Status**: Completed / In Progress / Blocked\n- **Description**: 1-2 line summary\n- **URL**: https://jira.company.com/browse/TICKET-ID\n- **Notes**: Any important context\n```\n\n### 6. Memory File Maintenance\n\n**Periodically clean old entries:**\n- User is responsible for manual cleanup (no automation)\n- Remove very old bug entries (6+ months) that are no longer relevant\n- Archive completed work from issues.md (3+ months old)\n- Keep all decisions (they''re lightweight and provide historical context)\n- Update key_facts.md when project configuration changes\n\n**Conflict resolution:**\n- If proposing something that conflicts with decisions.md, explain why revisiting the decision is warranted\n- Update the decision entry if the choice changes\n- Add date of revision to show evolution\n\n## Templates and References\n\nThis skill includes template files in `references/` that demonstrate proper formatting:\n\n- **references/bugs_template.md** - Bug entry format with examples\n- **references/decisions_template.md** - ADR format with examples\n- **references/key_facts_template.md** - Key facts organization with examples (includes security guidelines)\n- **references/issues_template.md** - Work log format with examples\n\nWhen creating initial memory files, copy these templates to `docs/project_notes/` and customize them for the project.\n\n## Example Workflows\n\n### Scenario 1: Encountering a Familiar Bug\n\n```\nUser: \"I''m getting a ''connection refused'' error from the database\"\n-> Search docs/project_notes/bugs.md for \"connection\"\n-> Find previous solution: \"Use AlloyDB Auth Proxy on port 5432\"\n-> Apply known fix\n```\n\n### Scenario 2: Proposing an Architectural Change\n\n```\nInternal: \"User might benefit from using SQLAlchemy for migrations\"\n-> Check docs/project_notes/decisions.md\n-> Find ADR-002: Already decided to use Alembic\n-> Use Alembic instead, maintaining consistency\n```\n\n### Scenario 3: User Requests Memory Update\n\n```\nUser: \"Add that CORS fix to our bug log\"\n-> Read docs/project_notes/bugs.md\n-> Add new entry with date, issue, solution, prevention\n-> Confirm addition to user\n```\n\n### Scenario 4: Looking Up Project Configuration\n\n```\nInternal: \"Need to connect to database\"\n-> Check docs/project_notes/key_facts.md\n-> Find Database Configuration section\n-> Use documented connection string and credentials\n```\n\n## Tips for Effective Memory Management\n\n1. **Be proactive**: Check memory files before proposing solutions\n2. **Be concise**: Keep entries brief (1-3 lines for descriptions)\n3. **Be dated**: Always include dates for temporal context\n4. **Be linked**: Include URLs to tickets, docs, monitoring dashboards\n5. **Be selective**: Focus on recurring or instructive issues, not every bug\n\n## Integration with Other Skills\n\nThe project-memory skill complements other skills:\n\n- **requirements-documenter**: Requirements -> Decisions (ADRs reference requirements)\n- **root-cause-debugger**: Bug diagnosis -> Bug log (document solutions after fixes)\n- **code-quality-reviewer**: Quality issues -> Decisions (document quality standards)\n- **docs-sync-editor**: Code changes -> Key facts (update when config changes)\n\nWhen using these skills together, consider updating memory files as a follow-up action.\n\n## Success Criteria\n\nThis skill is successfully deployed when:\n\n- `docs/project_notes/` directory exists with all four memory files\n- GEMINI.md includes \"Project Memory System\" section with protocols\n- AGENTS.md includes the same protocols (if file exists or user requested)\n- Memory files follow template format and style guidelines\n- AI assistant checks memory files before proposing changes\n- User can easily request memory updates (\"add this to bugs.md\")\n- Memory files look like standard engineering documentation, not AI artifacts\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:36:17.740Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Knowledge Retrieval Agents seeking to enhance their memory infrastructure for efficient content analysis and book recommendations.","zh":"非常适合寻求增强其记忆基础设施以进行高效内容分析和书籍推荐的 Knowledge Retrieval Agent。","ja":"効率的なコンテンツ分析と書籍推薦のためにメモリインフラを強化しようとしている Knowledge Retrieval Agent に理想的です。","ko":"효율적인 콘텐츠 분석 및 도서 추천을 위해 메모리 인프라를 강화하려는 Knowledge Retrieval Agent에 이상적입니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Recuperación de Conocimiento que buscan mejorar su infraestructura de memoria para un análisis de contenido eficiente y recomendaciones de libros.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Recherche de Connaissances souhaitant améliorer leur infrastructure de mémoire pour une analyse de contenu efficace et des recommandations de livres.","de":"Ideal für Wissensabrufagenten, die ihre Speicherinfrastruktur für eine effiziente Inhaltsanalyse und Buchempfehlungen verbessern möchten.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Recuperação de Conhecimento que buscam melhorar sua infraestrutura de memória para análise de conteúdo eficiente e recomendações de livros.","ru":"Идеально для агентов поиска знаний, стремящихся улучшить свою инфраструктуру памяти для эффективного анализа контента и рекомендаций книг.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء استرجاع المعرفة الذين يسعون لتعزيز بنية تحتية الذاكرة لفهرسة المحتوى بكفاءة وتوصيات الكتب."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create a memory-aware behavior by configuring GEMINI.md, leveraging multi-tool support through AGENTS.md, and searching memory files for comprehensive content analysis, utilizing markdown files like GEMINI.md and AGENTS.md for customized memory setup.","zh":"通过配置 GEMINI.md 来赋能 Agent 创建具备记忆感知能力的行为，利用 AGENTS.md 实现多工具支持，并搜索内存文件以进行全面的内容分析，利用 GEMINI.md 和 AGENTS.md 等 Markdown 文件实现自定义的记忆设置。","ja":"GEMINI.md を設定してメモリ認識動作を作成し、AGENTS.md を通じてマルチツールサポートを活用し、包括的なコンテンツ分析のためにメモリファイルを検索することで、Agent に力を与えます。GEMINI.md や AGENTS.md などの Markdown ファイルを利用してカスタマイズされたメモリ設定を実現します。","ko":"GEMINI.md 구성을 통해 메모리 인식 동작을 생성하고, AGENTS.md를 통해 다중 도구 지원을 활용하며, 포괄적인 콘텐츠 분석을 위해 메모리 파일을 검색함으로써 Agent에 권한을 부여합니다. 사용자 정의 메모리 설정을 위해 GEMINI.md 및 AGENTS.md와 같은 Markdown 파일을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear un comportamiento consciente de la memoria configurando GEMINI.md, aprovechando el soporte multi-herramienta a través de AGENTS.md, y buscando archivos de memoria para un análisis de contenido integral, utilizando archivos markdown como GEMINI.md y AGENTS.md para una configuración de memoria personalizada.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer un comportement conscient de la mémoire en configurant GEMINI.md, en exploitant le support multi-outil via AGENTS.md, et en recherchant des fichiers de mémoire pour une analyse de contenu complète, en utilisant des fichiers markdown comme GEMINI.md et AGENTS.md pour une configuration de mémoire personnalisée.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, ein speicherbewusstes Verhalten zu erstellen, indem sie GEMINI.md konfigurieren, die Multi-Tool-Unterstützung über AGENTS.md nutzen und Speicherdateien für eine umfassende Inhaltsanalyse durchsuchen, wobei sie Markdown-Dateien wie GEMINI.md und AGENTS.md für eine benutzerdefinierte Speicherkonfiguration verwenden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar um comportamento consciente da memória configurando o GEMINI.md, aproveitando o suporte a várias ferramentas por meio do AGENTS.md e procurando arquivos de memória para análise de conteúdo abrangente, utilizando arquivos de markdown como GEMINI.md e AGENTS.md para configuração de memória personalizada.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создать поведение, осознающее память, конфигурируя GEMINI.md, используя поддержку нескольких инструментов через AGENTS.md и поиск файлов памяти для всестороннего анализа контента, используя файлы markdown, такие как GEMINI.md и AGENTS.md, для настройки памяти.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء سلوك متجاوب مع الذاكرة عن طريق تكوين GEMINI.md ، و الاستفادة من دعم أدوات متعددة من خلال AGENTS.md ، و البحث عن ملفات الذاكرة للتحليل الشامل للمحتوى ، و استخدام ملفات تنسيق مثل GEMINI.md و AGENTS.md لإعداد الذاكرة المخصص."},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring memory infrastructure for agentic book recommender systems","Searching memory files for specific content and book recommendations","Implementing memory-aware behavior through GEMINI.md configuration"],"zh":["为 Agentic book recommender systems 配置记忆基础设施","搜索内存文件以查找特定内容和书籍推荐","通过 GEMINI.md 配置实现记忆感知行为"],"ja":["Agentic book recommender systems のためのメモリインフラの設定","特定のコンテンツと書籍推薦のためにメモリファイルを検索する","GEMINI.md 設定を通じたメモリ認識動作の実装"],"ko":["Agentic book recommender systems를 위한 메모리 인프라 구성","특정 콘텐츠 및 도서 추천을 위한 메모리 파일 검색","GEMINI.md 구성을 통한 메모리 인식 동작 구현"],"es":["Configuración de la infraestructura de memoria para sistemas de recomendación de libros de agente","Búsqueda de archivos de memoria para contenido y recomendaciones de libros específicos","Implementación de un comportamiento consciente de la memoria a través de la configuración de GEMINI.md"],"fr":["Configuration de l''infrastructure de mémoire pour les systèmes de recommandation de livres d''agent","Recherche de fichiers de mémoire pour un contenu et des recommandations de livres spécifiques","Mise en œuvre d''un comportement conscient de la mémoire via la configuration de GEMINI.md"],"de":["Konfiguration der Speicherinfrastruktur für Agenten-Buchempfehlungssysteme","Suchen von Speicherdateien für bestimmten Inhalt und Buchempfehlungen","Implementierung eines speicherbewussten Verhaltens durch die Konfiguration von GEMINI.md"],"pt":["Configurando a infraestrutura de memória para sistemas de recomendação de livros baseados em agentes","Procurando arquivos de memória por conteúdo específico e recomendações de livros","Implementando comportamento consciente da memória por meio da configuração do GEMINI.md"],"ru":["Настройка инфраструктуры памяти для систем рекомендации книг на основе агентов","Поиск файлов памяти для конкретного контента и рекомендаций книг","Реализация поведения, осознающего память, посредством конфигурирования GEMINI.md"],"ar":["تكوين بنية تحتية للذاكرة لأنظمة توصية الكتب القائمة على الوكلاء","البحث عن ملفات الذاكرة لمحتوى معين وتوصيات الكتب","تنفيذ سلوك متجاوب مع الذاكرة من خلال تكوين GEMINI.md"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires initial setup of memory infrastructure","Needs configuration of GEMINI.md and AGENTS.md for customized behavior","Limited to markdown file formats like GEMINI.md and AGENTS.md"],"zh":["需要初始设置记忆基础设施","需要配置 GEMINI.md 和 AGENTS.md 以实现自定义行为","仅限于 GEMINI.md 和 AGENTS.md 等 Markdown 文件格式"],"ja":["メモリインフラの初期設定が必要","カスタマイズされた動作のために GEMINI.md と AGENTS.md の設定が必要","GEMINI.md や AGENTS.md などの Markdown ファイル形式に限定される"],"ko":["메모리 인프라의 초기 설정이 필요함","사용자 정의 동작을 위해 GEMINI.md 및 AGENTS.md 구성이 필요함","GEMINI.md 및 AGENTS.md와 같은 Markdown 파일 형식으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere una configuración inicial de la infraestructura de memoria","Necesita la configuración de GEMINI.md y AGENTS.md para un comportamiento personalizado","Limitado a formatos de archivo markdown como GEMINI.md y AGENTS.md"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration initiale de l''infrastructure de mémoire","Nécessite la configuration de GEMINI.md et AGENTS.md pour un comportement personnalisé","Limité aux formats de fichiers markdown comme GEMINI.md et AGENTS.md"],"de":["Benötigt eine anfängliche Konfiguration der Speicherinfrastruktur","Benötigt die Konfiguration von GEMINI.md und AGENTS.md für ein benutzerdefiniertes Verhalten","Begrenzt auf Markdown-Dateiformate wie GEMINI.md und AGENTS.md"],"pt":["Exige configuração inicial da infraestrutura de memória","Necessita de configuração do GEMINI.md e AGENTS.md para comportamento personalizado","Limitado a formatos de arquivo markdown como GEMINI.md e AGENTS.md"],"ru":["Требует первоначальной настройки инфраструктуры памяти","Требует конфигурирования GEMINI.md и AGENTS.md для настройки поведения","Ограничен форматами файлов markdown, такими как GEMINI.md и AGENTS.md"],"ar":["يتطلب إعدادًا أوليًا لبنية تحتية للذاكرة","يحتاج إلى تكوين GEMINI.md و AGENTS.md لسلوك مخصص","محدود بتنسيقات ملفات مثل GEMINI.md و AGENTS.md"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"8e57092a9ba4fb581864fe5b4644eb42806660783baa8c278cc95941494e7d9e","qualityScore":52}');
