o usar research-topic","qué es research-topic","alternativas a research-topic","research-topic vs otros herramientas de IA","instalación de research-topic","guía de configuración de research-topic"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour les blogs techniques","comment utiliser research-topic","qu''est-ce que research-topic","alternatives à research-topic","research-topic vs autres outils d''IA","installation de research-topic","guide de configuration de research-topic"],"de":["KI-Tools für technische Blogs","wie man research-topic verwendet","was ist research-topic","alternativen zu research-topic","research-topic vs andere KI-Tools","installation von research-topic","konfigurationsanleitung für research-topic"],"pt":["como usar research-topic","o que é research-topic","ferramentas de IA para artigos técnicos","research-topic vs ferramentas de escrita","instalar research-topic","guia de configuração do research-topic"],"ru":["как использовать research-topic","что такое research-topic","ИИ Агенты для технических статей","research-topic vs инструменты написания","установить research-topic","руководство по настройке research-topic"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام research-topic","ما هو research-topic","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لمقالات تقنية","research-topic مقابل أدوات الكتابة","تثبيت research-topic","دليل إعداد research-topic"]}},"owner":"OmuNaman","repo":"blog-automation","repoPath":"OmuNaman/blog-automation","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-22T15:25:34Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"research-topic","description":"Deep research on a technical topic for blog writing. Use when user says research, look into, explore, or provides a blog topic to investigate. Searches the web extensively and creates structured research notes with visual opportunity identification.","bodyPreview":"# Deep Research Skill\n\n## Input\n$ARGUMENTS = the topic to research\n\n## Process\n\n### Step 1: Broad Search (5 to 8 searches)\nSearch the web for high-quality sources on the topic:\n- Original research papers (arXiv, conference proceedings)\n- Official documentation and blog posts from the creators\n- Well-written technical blog posts (Lilian Weng, Jay Alammar, etc.)\n- Video transcripts or lecture notes if available\n- GitHub implementations for reference\n\n### Step 2: Deep Read\nFor each promising source","body":"# Deep Research Skill\n\n## Input\n$ARGUMENTS = the topic to research\n\n## Process\n\n### Step 1: Broad Search (5 to 8 searches)\nSearch the web for high-quality sources on the topic:\n- Original research papers (arXiv, conference proceedings)\n- Official documentation and blog posts from the creators\n- Well-written technical blog posts (Lilian Weng, Jay Alammar, etc.)\n- Video transcripts or lecture notes if available\n- GitHub implementations for reference\n\n### Step 2: Deep Read\nFor each promising source, use WebFetch to read the full content.\nExtract and organize:\n\n**Core Concepts**\n- What is this? (one-paragraph definition)\n- Why does it exist? What problem does it solve?\n- What did it replace or improve upon?\n\n**How It Works (Technical Depth)**\n- Step-by-step mechanism\n- Key equations and their intuition\n- Concrete numerical examples (shapes, dimensions, values)\n- Implementation details\n\n**Comparisons and Alternatives**\n- How does this compare to previous approaches?\n- What are the trade-offs?\n- Quantitative comparisons (benchmarks, memory savings, speedups)\n\n**Historical Context**\n- When was it introduced? By whom?\n- What papers are most relevant?\n- How has it evolved since introduction?\n\n### Step 3: Identify Visual Opportunities\nThis is critical. For EVERY concept, ask: \"Would a diagram help here?\"\nList 6 to 10 concepts that NEED visual diagrams:\n- Architecture overviews\n- Data flow through components\n- Step-by-step process walkthroughs\n- Before/after comparisons\n- Matrix operations with concrete shapes\n- Mathematical derivation steps\n\nFor each, write:\n- Diagram name (e.g., \"fig_mla_architecture\")\n- What it should show\n- Type: architecture / flowchart / comparison / step-by-step / matrix-operation\n\n### Step 4: Save Research Notes\nSave to: `research/<topic-slug>.md`\n\nStructure:\n```\n# Research: <Topic Name>\n\n## Quick Summary\n(2-3 sentence overview)\n\n## Core Concepts\n(detailed notes)\n\n## How It Works\n(step-by-step technical breakdown)\n\n## Mathematical Foundation\n(key equations with explanations)\n\n## Comparisons and Alternatives\n(vs previous approaches, with numbers)\n\n## Visual Opportunities\n(list of 6-10 diagrams needed with descriptions)\n\n## Running Example\n(define the simple example we will use throughout:\n e.g., 4 tokens, specific dimensions, concrete values)\n\n## Key Sources\n- [Paper Name](url) - what we extracted from it\n- [Blog Post](url) - what we extracted from it\n```\n\n## Output\nSave to research/<topic-slug>.md and summarize key findings to user.\nTell the user how many diagram opportunities were identified.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T13:10:51.048Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Technical Writing Agents needing in-depth research capabilities with PaperBanana diagrams.","zh":"适合需要使用PaperBanana图表进行深入研究的技术写作代理.","ja":"PaperBanana図を使用して深い研究を行う必要がある技術文書化エージェントに適しています。","ko":"PaperBanana 도표를 사용하여 심층적인 연구가 필요한 기술 문서 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Escritura Técnica que necesitan capacidades de investigación en profundidad con diagramas de PaperBanana.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de rédaction technique ayant besoin de capacités de recherche approfondies avec des diagrammes PaperBanana.","de":"Perfekt für technische Schreibagenten, die umfassende Forschungsfähigkeiten mit PaperBanana-Diagrammen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Redação Técnica que necessitam de capacidades de pesquisa aprofundada com diagramas PaperBanana.","ru":"Идеально для Технических Агентов по написанию, требующих глубоких исследовательских возможностей с диаграммами PaperBanana.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء النصيين الفنيين الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات بحث متقدمة مع رسومات PaperBanana."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate deeply pedagogical technical blog posts with 25-35 PaperBanana diagrams per article, leveraging Claude Code skills and web searches across arXiv, conference proceedings, and official documentation.","zh":"赋予代理生成具有25-35个PaperBanana图表的技术博客文章的能力，利用Claude Code技能和arXiv、会议论文集、官方文档的网络搜索。","ja":"Claude CodeスキルとarXiv、会議論文集、公式ドキュメントのウェブ検索を利用して、25-35個のPaperBanana図を含む技術ブログ記事を生成するエージェントの能力を提供します。","ko":"Claude Code 스킬과 arXiv, 학술대회 논문, 공식 문서의 웹 검색을 활용하여 25-35개의 PaperBanana 도표를 포함하는 기술 블로그 게시물 생성 에이전트의 능력을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar publicaciones de blog técnicos profundamente pedagógicos con 25-35 diagramas de PaperBanana por artículo, aprovechando las habilidades de Claude Code y las búsquedas web en arXiv, actas de conferencias y documentación oficial.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des billets de blog techniques profondément pédagogiques avec 25-35 diagrammes PaperBanana par article, en exploitant les compétences de Claude Code et les recherches web sur arXiv, les actes de conférence et la documentation officielle.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, tiefgreifend pädagogische technische Blog-Beiträge mit 25-35 PaperBanana-Diagrammen pro Artikel zu generieren, indem sie die Fähigkeiten von Claude Code und Web-Suchen über arXiv, Konferenzveröffentlichungen und offizielle Dokumentation nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar posts de blog técnicos profundamente pedagógicos com 25-35 diagramas PaperBanana por artigo, utilizando habilidades Claude Code e pesquisas na web em arXiv, anais de conferências e documentação oficial.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать глубоко педагогические технические блог-посты с 25-35 диаграммами PaperBanana на статью, используя навыки Claude Code и веб-поиск по arXiv, материалам конференций и официальной документации.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء منشورات مدونة تقنية تعليمية متعمقة مع 25-35 رسومات PaperBanana لكل مقال، مستخدمين مهارات Claude Code والبحث عبر الويب في arXiv وملفات المؤتمر والوثائق الرسمية."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating technical blog post creation","Generating research summaries with diagrams","Creating educational content with PaperBanana visuals"],"zh":["自动化技术博客文章的创建","使用图表生成研究摘要","创建带有PaperBanana视觉效果的教育内容"],"ja":["技術ブログ記事の自動生成","図を使用して研究のまとめを生成する","PaperBananaの視覚効果を使用した教育コンテンツの作成"],"ko":["기술 블로그 게시물 자동 생성","도표를 사용하여 연구 요약 생성","PaperBanana 시각 효과를 사용한 교육 콘텐츠 생성"],"es":["Automatización de la creación de publicaciones de blog técnicos","Generación de resúmenes de investigación con diagramas","Creación de contenido educativo con visuales de PaperBanana"],"fr":["Automatisation de la création de billets de blog techniques","Génération de résumés de recherche avec des diagrammes","Création de contenu éducatif avec des visuels PaperBanana"],"de":["Automatisierung der Erstellung von technischen Blog-Beiträgen","Generierung von Forschungszusammenfassungen mit Diagrammen","Erstellung von Bildungsinhalten mit PaperBanana-Visualisierungen"],"pt":["Automatização da criação de posts de blog técnicos","Geração de resumos de pesquisa com diagramas","Criação de conteúdo educacional com visuais PaperBanana"],"ru":["Автоматизация создания технических блог-постов","Генерация исследовательских обзоров с диаграммами","Создание образовательного контента с визуальными элементами PaperBanana"],"ar":["أتمتة إنشاء منشورات المدونة الفنية","توليد ملخصات البحث مع الرسومات","إنشاء المحتوى التعليمي مع الرسومات PaperBanana"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Claude Code skills integration","Limited to web-accessible sources","Dependent on quality of search results"],"zh":["需要集成Claude Code技能","仅限于可访问的网络来源","依赖于搜索结果的质量"],"ja":["Claude Codeスキルの統合が必要","ウェブにアクセスできるソースに限定される","検索結果の品質に依存する"],"ko":["Claude Code 스킬 통합이 필요","웹에 접근할 수 있는 출처로 제한","검색 결과의 품질에 의존"],"es":["Requiere la integración de habilidades de Claude Code","Limitado a fuentes accesibles en la web","Dependiente de la calidad de los resultados de búsqueda"],"fr":["Nécessite l''intégration des compétences de Claude Code","Limité aux sources accessibles sur le web","Dépendant de la qualité des résultats de recherche"],"de":["Benötigt die Integration von Claude Code-Fähigkeiten","Begrenzt auf webzugängliche Quellen","Abhängig von der Qualität der Suchergebnisse"],"pt":["Requer integração de habilidades Claude Code","Limitado a fontes acessíveis pela web","Dependente da qualidade dos resultados da pesquisa"],"ru":["Требует интеграции навыков Claude Code","Ограничен доступными через веб-источниками","Зависит от качества результатов поиска"],"ar":["يتطلب دمج مهارات Claude Code","محدود بالمصادر القابلة للوصول عبر الويب","يعتمد على جودة نتائج البحث"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"aaa4dc3f0d2e022c6ec72ec2e41eea70d62b6960f49cc28ee6fff5e3a9f19be7","qualityScore":51}');
