eprocess-debug im Vergleich zu anderen KI-Tools","Installation von preprocess-debug","Konfigurationsanleitung für preprocess-debug"],"pt":["ferramenta de IA para prever crescimento de tumores","como usar preprocess-debug","preprocess-debug vs outros agentes de IA","guias de instalação do preprocess-debug","configuração do preprocess-debug","preprocess-debug para análise de imagens médicas","desenvolvimento de aplicativos com preprocess-debug","preprocess-debug para pesquisas médicas"],"ru":["ИИ Агент для прогнозирования роста менингиомы","как использовать preprocess-debug","preprocess-debug vs другие ИИ Агенты","руководство по установке preprocess-debug","настройка preprocess-debug","preprocess-debug для анализа медицинских изображений","разработка приложений с preprocess-debug","preprocess-debug для медицинских исследований"],"ar":["أداة ذكاء اصطناعي لتوقع نمو الأورام","كيفية استخدام preprocess-debug","preprocess-debug مقابل أدوات ذكاء اصطناعي أخرى","دليل تثبيت preprocess-debug","إعداد preprocess-debug","preprocess-debug لتحليل الصور الطبية","تطوير تطبيقات مع preprocess-debug","preprocess-debug لأبحاث طبية"]}},"owner":"MarioPasc","repo":"MenGrowth","repoPath":"MarioPasc/MenGrowth","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T08:04:43Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"preprocess-debug","description":"Debug preprocessing pipeline failures. Guides through reading checkpoint files, checking step artifacts, interpreting QC metrics, examining visualization PNGs, and identifying which step failed and why. Use when a preprocessing run produces unexpected results, crashes, or generates poor-quality outputs.","bodyPreview":"# Preprocess Debug — Preprocessing Failure Diagnosis\n\n## When to Use\n\n- \"Why did preprocessing fail for patient X?\"\n- \"The registration output looks wrong\"\n- \"Skull stripping removed too much / too little\"\n- \"Intensity normalization produced weird values\"\n- \"Which step is causing the problem?\"\n- Any preprocessing quality issue or crash investigation\n\n## Diagnostic Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Identify the failing step\n\nCheck the visualization directory for which step produced the last PNG:\n\n```bash\nls","body":"# Preprocess Debug — Preprocessing Failure Diagnosis\n\n## When to Use\n\n- \"Why did preprocessing fail for patient X?\"\n- \"The registration output looks wrong\"\n- \"Skull stripping removed too much / too little\"\n- \"Intensity normalization produced weird values\"\n- \"Which step is causing the problem?\"\n- Any preprocessing quality issue or crash investigation\n\n## Diagnostic Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Identify the failing step\n\nCheck the visualization directory for which step produced the last PNG:\n\n```bash\nls -la {viz_root}/MenGrowth-XXXX/MenGrowth-XXXX-YYY/\n# step1_data_harmonization_t1c.png  ← exists\n# step2_bias_field_correction_t1c.png  ← exists\n# step3_resampling_t1c.png  ← MISSING → Step 3 failed\n```\n\nCheck logs for error messages (look for `ERROR` or `RuntimeError`).\n\n### Step 2: Check step artifacts\n\nEach step may produce artifacts in `{artifacts}/MenGrowth-XXXX/MenGrowth-XXXX-YYY/`:\n\n| Artifact | Produced by | What to check |\n|----------|-------------|---------------|\n| `t1c_bias_field.nii.gz` | Bias field correction | Should be smooth, low-frequency field |\n| `t1c_brain_mask.nii.gz` | Skull stripping | Load in viewer — verify mask covers brain + tumor |\n| `*.h5`, `*.mat` transforms | Registration | Verify transforms exist and are non-zero |\n\n### Step 3: Examine visualization PNGs\n\nEach step''s PNG shows before/after comparison. Look for:\n\n| Step | What to check in visualization |\n|------|-------------------------------|\n| Data harmonization | Orientation correct? Background removed? |\n| Bias field correction | Intensity gradients reduced? |\n| Resampling | Resolution changed? No aliasing artifacts? |\n| Cubic padding | Volume centered? Correct padding extent? |\n| Registration | Modalities aligned? Atlas overlay reasonable? |\n| Skull stripping | Mask boundary at brain surface? Tumor included? |\n| Intensity normalization | Histogram shifted to expected range? |\n| Longitudinal registration | Timepoints aligned? No excessive deformation? |\n\n### Step 4: Check specific failure patterns\n\n#### Registration failures\n- **\"No reference modality found\"**: Check that `reference_modality_priority` matches available modalities\n- **Poor alignment**: Try `engine: \"antspyx\"` instead of `\"nipype\"` (or vice versa)\n- **Divergence**: Check if `use_center_of_mass_init: true` is set\n- **ANTs crash**: Look for `ITK ERROR` in logs; check if input volumes have valid affine matrices\n- **Quality warning**: If correlation dissimilarity > `quality_warning_threshold`, registration may have failed\n\n#### Skull stripping failures\n- **Over-stripping (tumor removed)**: HD-BET is more robust to pathology than SynthStrip; try `method: \"hdbet\"` with `hdbet_mode: \"accurate\"`\n- **Under-stripping (skull remaining)**: Increase SynthStrip `border` parameter or switch methods\n- **GPU OOM**: Set `hdbet_device: \"cpu\"` or `synthstrip_device: \"cpu\"`\n\n#### Intensity normalization failures\n- **All zeros output**: Check that brain mask exists and covers tissue\n- **Extreme values**: Use `clip_range: [-5.0, 5.0]` for z-score\n- **NaN values**: Input may contain NaN — check with `nib.load(path).get_fdata()` for NaN/Inf\n- **Wrong mask source**: Check logs for \"Using brain mask from:\" vs \"using nonzero voxels as fallback\"\n\n#### Data harmonization failures\n- **Wrong orientation**: Check `reorient_to` matches expected convention (RAS vs LPS)\n- **Background not removed**: Try `method: \"otsu_foreground\"` instead of default\n- **NRRD parse error**: Check if input file is valid NRRD with `nrrd.read(path)`\n\n#### Resampling failures\n- **ECLARE environment not found**: Verify `conda_environment_eclare` matches installed env\n- **GPU OOM with ECLARE**: Reduce `batch_size` or switch to `method: \"bspline\"`\n- **Extreme anisotropy**: Use `method: \"composite\"` for volumes with > 5mm slice thickness\n\n### Step 5: Check the temp-file mechanism\n\nIf a step crashes mid-write, a `.tmp.nii.gz` file may be left behind:\n\n```bash\nfind {output_root} -name \"*.tmp*\"\n```\n\nThese should be deleted before re-running.\n\n## Key Debugging Code Locations\n\n| Issue | File to read |\n|-------|-------------|\n| Step handler logic | `mengrowth/preprocessing/src/steps/{step_name}.py` |\n| Brain mask resolution | Search for `brain_mask` in the step handler |\n| Registration quality metrics | `mengrowth/preprocessing/src/registration/diagnostic_parser.py` |\n| Checkpoint state | `mengrowth/preprocessing/src/checkpoint.py` |\n| QC metrics interpretation | `mengrowth/preprocessing/src/config.py` → `QCMetricsConfig` |\n| Step execution order | YAML config `steps:` list |\n| Config validation errors | `mengrowth/preprocessing/src/config.py` → `__post_init__()` methods |\n\n## Quick Config Fixes\n\n| Problem | Config change |\n|---------|--------------|\n| Step taking too long | Increase `shrink_factor`, reduce iterations |\n| Registration not converging | Switch `engine`, adjust `sampling_percentage`, add transform stages |\n| Mask too aggressive | Adjust `fill_value`, `border`, or switch skull stripping method |\n| Step crashing on GPU | Set device to `\"cpu\"` in step config |\n| Want to skip a step | Remove from `steps:` list or set `method: null` in step config |\n| Need to re-run from step N | Remove all outputs from step N onward, or use checkpoint resume |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-01T14:53:56.912Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Medical Imaging Agents needing advanced preprocessing failure diagnosis capabilities for meningioma intracraneal tumour analysis","zh":"非常适合需要高级预处理故障诊断功能的医学影像代理，特别是在脑膜瘤颅内肿瘤分析中","ja":"医療用画像エージェントが高度な前処理の故障診断機能を必要とする場合に最適です。特に、脳膜瘤の頭内腫瘍分析に適しています","ko":"의료 영상 에이전트가 고급의 전처리 오류 진단 기능을 필요로 할 때 적합합니다. 특히 경막종 뇌내 종양 분석에 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes de imágenes médicas que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de diagnóstico de fallos de preprocesamiento para análisis de tumores intracraneales de meningioma","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''imagerie médicale nécessitant des capacités de diagnostic de défaillance de prétraitement avancées pour l''analyse des tumeurs intracraniennes de méningiome","de":"Perfekt für medizinische Bildagenten, die erweiterte Fähigkeiten zur Fehlervorbehandlung bei der Analyse von intrakraniellen Meningeom-Tumoren benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Imagem Médica que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de diagnóstico de falhas de pré-processamento para análise de tumores intracranianos meningioma","ru":"Идеально подходит для Медицинских Визуализирующих Агентов, требующих расширенных возможностей диагностики сбоев предварительной обработки для анализа внутричерепных опухолей менингиомы","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء التصوير الطبي الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لتشخيص فشل المعالجة المسبقة لتحليل أورام السحايا داخل الجمجمة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to diagnose preprocessing quality issues using visualization directories and PNG analysis, facilitating intensity normalization and skull stripping debugging through protocols like registration output verification","zh":"使得代理能够使用可视化目录和PNG分析来诊断前处理质量问题，通过注册输出验证等协议来促进强度归一化和颅骨剥离调试","ja":"エージェントが視覚化ディレクトリとPNG分析を使用して前処理の品質の問題を診断できるようにし、登録出力の検証などのプロトコルを介して強度の正規化と頭骨の剥離のデバッグを促進します","ko":"에이전트가 시각화 디렉토리와 PNG 분석을 사용하여 전처리의 품질 문제를 진단할 수 있도록 하며, 등록 출력 검증 등의 프로토콜을 통해 강度 정규화와 두개골剥離 디버깅을 촉진합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diagnosticar problemas de calidad de preprocesamiento utilizando directorios de visualización y análisis PNG, facilitando la normalización de intensidad y la depuración de eliminación de cráneo a través de protocolos como la verificación de la salida de registro","fr":"Permet aux agents de diagnostiquer les problèmes de qualité de prétraitement en utilisant des répertoires de visualisation et d''analyse PNG, facilitant la normalisation d''intensité et le débogage de l''élimination du crâne via des protocoles tels que la vérification de la sortie d''enregistrement","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Vorbehandlungsqualitätsprobleme mithilfe von Visualisierungsverzeichnissen und PNG-Analyse zu diagnostizieren, wodurch die Intensitätsnormalisierung und die Fehlersuche bei der Entfernung des Schädels durch Protokolle wie die Überprüfung der Registrierungsausgabe erleichtert werden","pt":"Capacita os agentes a diagnosticar problemas de qualidade de pré-processamento usando diretórios de visualização e análise PNG, facilitando a normalização de intensidade e a depuração de skull stripping através de protocolos como verificação de saída de registro","ru":"Позволяет агентам диагностировать проблемы качества предварительной обработки с использованием каталогов визуализации и анализа PNG, способствуя нормализации интенсивности и отладке skull stripping с помощью таких протоколов, как проверка выходных данных регистрации","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من تشخيص مشكلات جودة المعالجة المسبقة باستخدام أدلة التصور وتحليل PNG، مما يسهل تسوية الشدة وتصحيح تجريد الجمجمة من خلال بروتوكولات مثل التحقق من ناتج التسجيل"},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging skull stripping errors","Investigating intensity normalization issues","Identifying failing steps in preprocessing pipelines","Analyzing registration output quality"],"zh":["调试头骨剥离错误","调查强度归一化问题","确定前处理管道中的失败步骤","分析注册输出质量"],"ja":["頭骨の剥離エラーのデバッグ","強度の正規化の問題の調査","前処理パイプラインの故障ステップの特定","登録出力の品質の分析"],"ko":["두개골剥離 오류 디버깅","강도 정규화 문제 조사","전처리 파이프라인의 실패 단계 식별","등록 출력 품질 분석"],"es":["Depuración de errores de eliminación de cráneo","Investigación de problemas de normalización de intensidad","Identificación de pasos fallidos en las tuberías de preprocesamiento","Análisis de la calidad de la salida de registro"],"fr":["Débogage des erreurs d''élimination du crâne","Investigation des problèmes de normalisation d''intensité","Identification des étapes défaillantes dans les pipelines de prétraitement","Analyse de la qualité de la sortie d''enregistrement"],"de":["Fehlersuche bei der Entfernung des Schädels","Untersuchung von Intensitätsnormalisierungsproblemen","Identifizierung fehlgeschlagener Schritte in der Vorbehandlungspipeline","Analyse der Registrierungsausgabqualität"],"pt":["Depuração de erros de skull stripping","Investigação de problemas de normalização de intensidade","Identificação de etapas com falha em pipelines de pré-processamento","Análise da qualidade da saída de registro"],"ru":["Отладка ошибок skull stripping","Исследование проблем нормализации интенсивности","Выявление неудачных шагов в конвейерах предварительной обработки","Анализ качества выходных данных регистрации"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء تجريد الجمجمة","التحقيق في مشكلات تسوية الشدة","تحديد الخطوات الفاشلة في خطوط أنابيب المعالجة المسبقة","تحليل جودة ناتج التسجيل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to visualization directories","Specific to meningioma intracraneal tumour analysis","Dependent on PNG output for diagnostic workflow"],"zh":["需要访问可视化目录","仅适用于脑膜瘤颅内肿瘤分析","依赖于PNG输出的诊断工作流"],"ja":["視覚化ディレクトリへのアクセスが必要","脳膜瘤の頭内腫瘍分析に特有","PNG出力に依存した診断ワークフロー"],"ko":["시각화 디렉토리에 대한 액세스가 필요","경막종 뇌내 종양 분석에 특정","PNG 출력에 의존하는 진단 워크플로"],"es":["Requiere acceso a directorios de visualización","Específico para el análisis de tumores intracraneales de meningioma","Dependiente de la salida PNG para el flujo de trabajo de diagnóstico"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux répertoires de visualisation","Spécifique à l''analyse des tumeurs intracraniennes de méningiome","Dépendant de la sortie PNG pour le flux de travail de diagnostic"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf Visualisierungsverzeichnisse","Spezifisch für die Analyse von intrakraniellen Meningeom-Tumoren","Abhängig von der PNG-Ausgabe für den Diagnose-Arbeitsablauf"],"pt":["Requer acesso a diretórios de visualização","Específico para análise de tumores intracranianos meningioma","Dependente de saída PNG para o fluxo de trabalho de diagnóstico"],"ru":["Требует доступ к каталогам визуализации","Специфично для анализа внутричерепных опухолей менингиомы","Зависит от вывода PNG для диагностического workflow"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى أدلة التصور","مخصص لتحليل أورام السحايا داخل الجمجمة","يعتمد على ناتج PNG لسير عمل التشخيص"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"d75a5720c3679d33a6edd06689e84165c39ec4e7397dce2f43236718ec9c742a","qualityScore":51}');
