s para avanzar semillas mediante operaciones en cadena","fr":"La compétence Cat met en œuvre des chaînes de tuyaux dérivationnels pour faire progresser les graines via des opérations en chaîne","de":"Das Cat Skill implementiert Ableitungs-Pipe-Chainings, um Sämlinge durch Kettenoperationen voranzutreiben","pt":"O skill Cat implementa a operação de pipe usando encadeamento derivacional, permitindo a chaining de operações","ru":"Навык Cat реализует операцию конвейера с помощью деривационной цепочки, позволяя объединять операции","ar":"تمتلك مهارة القط خاصية تشغيل الانابيب باستخدام السلسلة اشتقاقية، مما يسمح بالتركيب العملياتي","en":"everything is topological chemputer!"},"definition":{"en":"everything is topological chemputer!"},"features":{"zh":["使用 `|>` 管道运算符","实现操作链","基于派生的管道链","替代时间顺序","提高代码可读性","增强开发效率"],"ja":[" `|>` パイプ演算子を使用","操作を連結","導出によるパイプチェーンを使用","時間順序に代わる","コードの可読性を高める","開発効率を向上させる"],"ko":[" `|>` 파이프 연산자를 사용","연산을 연결","파생된 파이프 체인을 사용","시간 순서를 대신","코드의 가독성을 높임","개발 효율성을 향상"],"es":["Implementación del operador de tubería |>","Cadenas de tuberías derivacionales","Avance de semillas mediante operaciones en cadena","Fórmula central: pipe_chain: A |> f |> g |> h","Uso de trits para avanzar semillas"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre de l''opérateur de tuyau |>","Chaînes de tuyaux dérivationnels","Progression des graines via des opérations en chaîne","Formule centrale : pipe_chain: A |> f |> g |> h","Utilisation de trits pour faire progresser les graines"],"de":["Implementierung des Pipe-Operators |>","Ableitungs-Pipe-Chainings","Vorantreiben von Sämlingen durch Kettenoperationen","Zentrale Formel: pipe_chain: A |> f |> g |> h","Verwendung von Trits zum Vorantreiben von Sämlingen"],"pt":["Encadeamento derivacional","Operação de pipe","Chaining de operações","Seed avançado","Trits personalizados"],"ru":["Деривационная цепочка","Операция конвейера","Объединение операций","Расширенный сид","Пользовательские триты"],"ar":["سلسلة اشتقاقية","عملية الانابيب","تركيب العمليات","بذرة متقدمة","تروتات مخصصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Cat 技能","派生的管道链","管道运算符","操作链","时间顺序","代码可读性","开发效率"],"ja":["Cat スキル","導出によるパイプチェーン","パイプ演算子","操作連結","時間順序","コード可読性","開発効率"],"ko":["Cat 스킬","파생된 파이프 체인","파이프 연산자","연산 연결","시간 순서","코드 가독성","개발 효율성"],"es":["cat skill","cadenas de tuberías derivacionales","operador de tubería","semillas","trits","programación funcional","derivación"],"fr":["compétence cat","chaînes de tuyaux dérivationnels","opérateur de tuyau","graines","trits","programmation fonctionnelle","dérivation"],"de":["cat skill","ableitungs-pipe-chainings","pipe-operator","sämlinge","trits","funktionale programmierung","ableitung"],"pt":["skill cat","encadeamento derivacional","operação de pipe","chaining de operações","desenvolvimento de software","programação funcional"],"ru":["навык cat","деривационная цепочка","операция конвейера","объединение операций","разработка программного обеспечения","функциональное программирование"],"ar":["مهارة القط","سلسلة اشتقاقية","عملية الانابيب","تركيب العمليات","تطوير البرمجيات","برمجة وظيفية"]}},"owner":"plurigrid","repo":"asi","repoPath":"plurigrid/asi","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.878Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"cat","description":"cat Skill: Derivational Pipe Chaining","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# cat Skill: Derivational Pipe Chaining\n\n**Trit**: 0 (ERGODIC - coordinator)\n**Color**: #26D826 (Green)\n**Principle**: Chain operations via derivational succession, not temporal\n\n---\n\n## Overview\n\nThe `cat` skill implements the `|>` pipe operator using **derivational chaining** instead of temporal succession. Each pipe stage advances a seed: `seed_{n+1} = f(seed_n, trit_n)`.\n\n## Core Formula\n\n```\npipe_chain: A |> f |> g |> h\n  seed₀ → f(seed₀, trit_f) → seed₁\n  seed₁ → g(seed₁, trit_g) → seed₂","body":"# cat Skill: Derivational Pipe Chaining\n\n**Trit**: 0 (ERGODIC - coordinator)\n**Color**: #26D826 (Green)\n**Principle**: Chain operations via derivational succession, not temporal\n\n---\n\n## Overview\n\nThe `cat` skill implements the `|>` pipe operator using **derivational chaining** instead of temporal succession. Each pipe stage advances a seed: `seed_{n+1} = f(seed_n, trit_n)`.\n\n## Core Formula\n\n```\npipe_chain: A |> f |> g |> h\n  seed₀ → f(seed₀, trit_f) → seed₁\n  seed₁ → g(seed₁, trit_g) → seed₂  \n  seed₂ → h(seed₂, trit_h) → seed₃\n\nGF(3) conservation: Σ(trit_f + trit_g + trit_h) ≡ 0 (mod 3)\n```\n\n## Babashka Implementation\n\n```clojure\n(ns cat.pipe\n  (:require [clojure.string :as str]))\n\n(def GAMMA 0x9E3779B97F4A7C15)\n(def MIX 0xBF58476D1CE4E5B9)\n(def MASK64 0xFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF)\n\n(defn chain-seed [seed trit]\n  (bit-and (unchecked-multiply \n             (bit-xor seed (* trit GAMMA)) \n             MIX) \n           MASK64))\n\n(defmacro |> \n  \"Derivational pipe with GF(3) tracking\"\n  [seed & forms]\n  (reduce (fn [acc [f trit]]\n            `(let [result# (~f ~acc)\n                   new-seed# (chain-seed (:seed ~acc) ~trit)]\n               (assoc result# :seed new-seed# :trit ~trit)))\n          `{:value ~seed :seed 0x42D :trit 0}\n          (partition 2 forms)))\n```\n\n## Usage\n\n```bash\n# Pipe with GF(3) conservation\nbb -e \"(require ''[cat.pipe :refer [|>]])\n       (|> ''input'' \n           [read-fn -1]      ; MINUS: validate\n           [transform-fn 0]  ; ERGODIC: coordinate\n           [write-fn +1])    ; PLUS: generate\n       ; => GF(3) sum = 0 ✓\"\n```\n\n## Commands\n\n```bash\n# Run pipe chain\njust cat-pipe ''input'' -1 0 +1\n\n# Verify GF(3) conservation\njust cat-verify-gf3 chain.edn\n```\n\n## Integration\n\nForms triads with temporal-coalgebra (-1) and synthetic-adjunctions (+1):\n```\ntemporal-coalgebra (-1) ⊗ cat (0) ⊗ synthetic-adjunctions (+1) = 0 ✓\n```\n\n---\n\n**Skill Name**: cat\n**Type**: Pipe Coordinator  \n**Trit**: 0 (ERGODIC)\n**Replaces**: dypler-mcp (not found in npm)\n\n\n\n## Scientific Skill Interleaving\n\nThis skill connects to the K-Dense-AI/claude-scientific-skills ecosystem:\n\n### Graph Theory\n- **networkx** [○] via bicomodule\n  - Universal graph hub\n\n### Bibliography References\n\n- `category-theory`: 139 citations in bib.duckdb\n\n\n\n## SDF Interleaving\n\nThis skill connects to **Software Design for Flexibility** (Hanson & Sussman, 2021):\n\n### Primary Chapter: 3. Variations on an Arithmetic Theme\n\n**Concepts**: generic arithmetic, coercion, symbolic, numeric\n\n### GF(3) Balanced Triad\n\n```\ncat (−) + SDF.Ch3 (○) + [balancer] (+) = 0\n```\n\n**Skill Trit**: -1 (MINUS - verification)\n\n### Secondary Chapters\n\n- Ch2: Domain-Specific Languages\n\n### Connection Pattern\n\nGeneric arithmetic crosses type boundaries. This skill handles heterogeneous data.\n## Cat# Integration\n\nThis skill maps to **Cat# = Comod(P)** as a bicomodule in the equipment structure:\n\n```\nTrit: 0 (ERGODIC)\nHome: Prof\nPoly Op: ⊗\nKan Role: Adj\nColor: #26D826\n```\n\n### GF(3) Naturality\n\nThe skill participates in triads satisfying:\n```\n(-1) + (0) + (+1) ≡ 0 (mod 3)\n```\n\nThis ensures compositional coherence in the Cat# equipment structure."},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:07:19.218Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Advanced Math Agents requiring derivational pipe chaining and topological chemputer operations.","zh":"适用于需要派生管道链和拓扑化学计算机操作的高级数学代理。","ja":"導出パイプ チェーンおよびトポロジー ケムコンピューター操作を必要とする高度な数学エージェントに適しています。","ko":"도출 파이프 체인 및 위상학적 เค무퓨터 작동이 필요한 고급 수학 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de matemáticas avanzadas que requieren encadenamiento de tuberías derivacionales y operaciones de química computacional topológica.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de mathématiques avancées nécessitant une chaîne de tuyauterie dérivée et des opérations de chimie informatique topologique.","de":"Ideal für erweiterte Mathematik-Agenten, die eine Ableitungspipeline-Kettenverbindung und topologische Chemputer-Operationen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Matemática Avançada que exigem encadeamento de pipe derivacional e operações de chemputer topológico.","ru":"Идеально для продвинутых математических агентов, требующих цепной деривационной трубы и топологических операций хемкомпьютера.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الرياضيات المتقدم الذي يتطلب تشaining الderivation труб وتشغيل الكيميائي الطوبولوجي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform complex derivational succession using the `|>` pipe operator, enabling the creation of advanced chemputer models with precise control over seed advancement via `seed_{n+1} = f(seed_n, trit_n)`","zh":"赋予代理执行复杂的導出继承，使用 `|>` 管道运算符，使得可以创建具有对种子进展进行精确控制的高级ケムコンピューター模型，通过 `seed_{n+1} = f(seed_n, trit_n)`","ja":"エージェントが `|>` パイプ オペレーターを使用して複雑な導出継承を実行できるようにし、シードの進歩を `seed_{n+1} = f(seed_n, trit_n)` 経由で正確に制御できる高级ケムコンピューター モデルを作成できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 `|>` 파이프 연산자를 사용하여 복잡한 도출 승계를 수행할 수 있도록 하여, 시드의 진행을 `seed_{n+1} = f(seed_n, trit_n)`를 통해 정확하게 제어할 수 있는 고급 켐퓨터 모델을 만들 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar sucesiones derivadas complejas utilizando el operador de tubería `|>`, lo que permite la creación de modelos de química computacional avanzados con un control preciso sobre el avance de la semilla a través de `seed_{n+1} = f(seed_n, trit_n)`","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer des successions dérivées complexes en utilisant l''opérateur de tuyauterie `|>`, ce qui permet la création de modèles de chimie informatique avancés avec un contrôle précis sur la progression de la graine via `seed_{n+1} = f(seed_n, trit_n)`","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, komplexe Ableitungssukzessionen unter Verwendung des `|>`-Pipe-Operators durchzuführen, wodurch die Erstellung von erweiterten Chemputer-Modellen mit präziser Kontrolle über den Samenfortschritt via `seed_{n+1} = f(seed_n, trit_n)` ermöglicht wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar sucessões derivacionais complexas usando o operador de pipe `|>`, permitindo a criação de modelos de chemputer avançados com controle preciso sobre o avanço da semente via `seed_{n+1} = f(seed_n, trit_n)`","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять сложные деривационные успехи с помощью оператора трубы `|>`, что позволяет создавать продвинутые модели хемкомпьютера с точным контролем над продвижением семени через `seed_{n+1} = f(seed_n, trit_n)`","ar":"يُمكّن الوكيل من إجراء سلسلة من الاستchedulers المشتقة باستخدام مشغل الpipe `|>`, مما يسمح بإنشاء نماذج متقدمة من الكيميائي مع التحكم الدقيق في تقدم البذور عبر `seed_{n+1} = f(seed_n, trit_n)`"},"useCases":{"en":["Chaining operations for complex chemputer simulations","Deriving successive seeds for advanced mathematical modeling","Implementing topological chemputer principles in AI workflows"],"zh":["复杂ケムコンピューター 시뮬레이션의 연산 체인","高级 수학적 모델링을 위한 연속적인 시드의 도출","AI 워크플로에서 トポロジー ケムコンピューター 원리를 구현"],"ja":["複雑なケムコンピューター シミュレーションの操作 チェーン","高度な数学的 モデリングのための連続的なシードの導出","AI ワークフローでトポロジー ケムコンピューター 原理を実装"],"ko":["複雑한 켐퓨터 시뮬레이션을 위한 연산 체인","고급 수학적 모델링을 위한 연속적인 시드의 도출","AI 워크플로에서 위상학적 켐퓨터 원리를 구현"],"es":["Encadenamiento de operaciones para simulaciones de química computacional complejas","Derivación de semillas sucesivas para modelado matemático avanzado","Implementación de principios de química computacional topológica en flujos de trabajo de IA"],"fr":["Chaînage d''opérations pour des simulations de chimie informatique complexes","Déduction de graines successives pour la modélisation mathématique avancée","Mise en œuvre de principes de chimie informatique topologique dans les flux de travail de l''IA"],"de":["Verkettung von Operationen für komplexe Chemputer-Simulationen","Ableitung von aufeinanderfolgenden Samen für erweitertes mathematisches Modellieren","Implementierung von topologischen Chemputer-Prinzipien in AI-Workflows"],"pt":["Encadeamento de operações para simulações de chemputer complexas","Derivação de sementes sucessivas para modelagem matemática avançada","Implementação de princípios de chemputer topológico em fluxos de trabalho de IA"],"ru":["Цепной операций для сложных симуляций хемкомпьютера","Получение последовательных семян для продвинутого математического моделирования","Реализация топологических принципов хемкомпьютера в потоках работы ИИ"],"ar":["سلسلة من العمليات لل симуляции الكيميائي المعقدة","استخلاص البذور المتتالية للنمذجة الرياضية المتقدمة","تنفيذ مبادئ الكيميائي الطوبولوجي في تدفقات عمل الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of derivational succession and topological chemputer principles","Limited to pipe chaining via the `|>` operator"],"zh":["需要了解導出继承和トポロジー ケムコンピューター 原理","仅限于通过 `|>` 运算符的管道链"],"ja":["導出継承とトポロジー ケムコンピューター 原理の理解が必要"," `|>` オペレーター経由のパイプ チェーンに限定"],"ko":["도출 승계와 トポロジー 켐퓨터 원리의 이해가 필요"," `|>` 연산자를 통해 파이프 체인에 한정"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de la sucesión derivada y los principios de química computacional topológica","Limitado al encadenamiento de tuberías a través del operador `|>`"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension de la succession dérivée et des principes de chimie informatique topologique","Limité au chaînage de tuyauterie via l''opérateur `|>`"],"de":["Erfordert das Verständnis der Ableitungssukzession und der topologischen Chemputer-Prinzipien","Begrenzt auf die Verkettung von Pipelines über den `|>`-Operator"],"pt":["Exige compreensão da sucessão derivacional e dos princípios de chemputer topológico","Limitado ao encadeamento de pipe via o operador `|>`"],"ru":["Требует понимания деривационной успехи и принципов топологического хемкомпьютера","Ограничен цепным оператором `|>`"],"ar":["يتطلب فهماً للاستchedulers المشتقة ومبادئ الكيميائي الطوبولوجي","محدود بالسلسلة من خلال مشغل الpipe `|>`"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"0b15379ed2d0fceecbb2d2ea5ba3a7582b0f9d2db2dc7fa67cfef02aeabfc93c","qualityScore":51}');
