rello","Installationsanleitung für Claude Code","wie man KI-Fähigkeiten verwendet","was ist Lebensplanung mit KI","Steigerung der Produktivität mit KI"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","gerenciamento de vida","produtividade pessoal","desenvolvimento de skills","como usar plano","plano vs trello","plano install","plano setup guide"],"ru":["ИИ агенты","управление жизнью","личная производительность","разработка навыков","как использовать план","план vs тrello","план установка","план руководство по настройке"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","إدارة الحياة","الإنتاجية الشخصية","تطوير المهارات","كيفية استخدام خطة","خطة vs تrello","خطة تثبيت","خطة دليل الإعداد"]}},"owner":"TaylorHuston","repo":"local-life-manager","repoPath":"TaylorHuston/local-life-manager","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.895Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"plan","description":"Create PLAN.md file with phase-based breakdown for issues. Use after creating an issue with /issue to break down work into phases.","bodyPreview":"# /plan\n\nCreate PLAN.md with phase-based breakdown for tasks, spikes, and bugs.\n\n## Usage\n\n```bash\n/plan 001                    # Create plan for issue 001 (auto-detect project)\n/plan 001 --project coordinatr  # Explicit project\n/plan SPIKE-003              # Plan for a spike (creates exploration plans)\n/plan 003 --second-opinion   # Get peer review from Gemini CLI before finalizing\n```\n\n## Issue Type Detection\n\n| Issue Type | Plan Structure | File Created |\n|------------|---------------|-------","body":"# /plan\n\nCreate PLAN.md with phase-based breakdown for tasks, spikes, and bugs.\n\n## Usage\n\n```bash\n/plan 001                    # Create plan for issue 001 (auto-detect project)\n/plan 001 --project coordinatr  # Explicit project\n/plan SPIKE-003              # Plan for a spike (creates exploration plans)\n/plan 003 --second-opinion   # Get peer review from Gemini CLI before finalizing\n```\n\n## Issue Type Detection\n\n| Issue Type | Plan Structure | File Created |\n|------------|---------------|--------------|\n| Task (TASK.md) | Sequential phases with checkpoints | PLAN.md |\n| Bug (BUG.md) | Investigation → Fix phases | PLAN.md |\n| Spike (SPIKE.md) | Exploration phases per approach | PLAN-1.md, PLAN-2.md, ... |\n\n## Execution Flow\n\n### For Task/Bug\n\n1. **Load Context**:\n   ```bash\n   Read: ideas/[project]/issues/###-*/TASK.md (or BUG.md)\n   Read: spaces/[project]/docs/specs/*.md (if implements: field exists)\n   Glob: spaces/[project]/docs/adrs/ADR-*.md\n   Glob: resources/research/*.md\n   ```\n\n   If the issue has an `implements:` field, load that specific spec section:\n   ```bash\n   Read: spaces/[project]/docs/specs/required-features.md  # Extract relevant section\n   ```\n\n2. **Cross-Project Pattern Search**:\n   ```bash\n   # Search other projects for similar implementations\n   Grep: spaces/*/src/ for relevant patterns\n   ```\n\n   Include relevant references in plan:\n   ```markdown\n   ## Related Implementations\n\n   Found similar patterns in other projects:\n   - `spaces/yourbench/src/auth/clerk.ts` - Clerk auth setup\n   - `spaces/coordinatr/src/lib/session.ts` - Session handling\n   ```\n\n3. **Library Documentation** (automatic for integrations):\n\n   **MANDATORY when task involves:**\n   - Installing/configuring external libraries or SDKs\n   - Framework integrations (auth providers, databases, APIs)\n   - Third-party services (Clerk, Stripe, AWS services, etc.)\n\n   **Process:**\n   ```bash\n   # 1. Resolve library ID\n   mcp__context7__resolve-library-id: {libraryName}\n\n   # 2. Fetch current documentation\n   mcp__context7__query-docs: {context7CompatibleLibraryID}\n\n   # 3. Search for recent patterns/best practices\n   WebSearch: \"{library} {framework} integration 2026\"\n   ```\n\n   **Document findings:**\n   ```markdown\n   ## Library Documentation Validation\n\n   **{Library Name}** (validated YYYY-MM-DD):\n   - Current version: X.Y.Z\n   - Key integration patterns: [summary]\n   - Recommended approach: [based on current docs]\n   ```\n\n4. **Generate Plan**:\n   - Break work into logical phases\n   - Each phase has clear deliverables\n   - Include checkpoints between phases\n   - Add \"Done When\" criteria\n\n5. **Write PLAN.md**:\n   - Present phases, estimated effort, dependencies\n   - Include \"Library Documentation Validation\" section (if applicable)\n   - Include \"Second Opinion Analysis\" section (if requested)\n\n6. **Commit Suggestion**:\n   - Ask: \"Commit PLAN.md to ideas repo? (yes/no)\"\n\n### For Spike (Exploration)\n\n1. **Load Context**: Read SPIKE.md (questions, success criteria, time box)\n\n2. **Gather Approaches**:\n   - Ask: \"How many approaches to explore?\" → N\n   - For each: \"Describe approach N?\"\n\n3. **Generate**: Create PLAN-N.md for each approach\n\n4. **Commit Suggestion**: Ask to commit all plan files\n\n## Task Plan Example\n\n```markdown\n# Implementation Plan: 001 Research Auth Patterns\n\n## Overview\nResearch authentication patterns for Coordinatr''s multi-tenant architecture.\n\n## Phase 1: Survey Existing Solutions\n\n### 1.1 - Research Auth Libraries\n- [ ] Review Better Auth documentation\n- [ ] Compare with Auth.js and Lucia\n- [ ] Document trade-offs\n\n### 1.2 - Multi-Tenant Patterns\n- [ ] Research team-based auth patterns\n- [ ] Review how Slack, Linear handle it\n- [ ] [CHECKPOINT] Summary document complete\n\n## Phase 2: Architecture Proposal\n\n### 2.1 - Draft Architecture\n- [ ] Create architecture diagram\n- [ ] Document token strategy\n- [ ] Define permission model\n\n### 2.2 - Review\n- [ ] Self-critique against requirements\n- [ ] [CHECKPOINT] Architecture doc complete\n\n## Done When\n- [ ] Auth library recommendation documented\n- [ ] Architecture proposal in ideas/coordinatr/docs/\n- [ ] Trade-offs and risks identified\n```\n\n## Second Opinion Feature\n\n**What**: Optional peer review from Gemini CLI before finalizing plans.\n\n**Usage**: Pass `--second-opinion` flag to trigger Gemini review with Context7 validation.\n\n**Process**:\n1. Send plan to Gemini CLI for review\n2. Validate each recommendation against Context7 docs\n3. Claude makes final decision on each:\n   - ✅ **ACCEPT**: Recommendation validated AND improves plan\n   - ⚠️ **MODIFY**: Good idea but needs adjustment\n   - ❌ **REJECT**: Invalid or not applicable\n4. Document all decisions in \"Second Opinion Analysis\" section\n\n**Requirements**:\n- Gemini CLI installed and functional\n- `--second-opinion` flag explicitly passed\n\n**Graceful degradation**: If Gemini unavailable, proceeds with Claude-only plan.\n\n## Workflow\n\n```\n/spec → /issue → /plan {ID} → (work phases) → /complete {ID}\n                    ↓\n          Load spec section from implements: field\n```\n\n**Creates:**\n- Task/Bug: `ideas/{project}/issues/###-*/PLAN.md`\n- Spike: `ideas/{project}/issues/###-*/PLAN-1.md`, `PLAN-2.md`, etc.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:10:33.807Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Task Management Agents needing structured project planning and issue tracking capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要结构化项目规划和问题跟踪功能的任务管理代理。","ja":"タスク管理エージェントが構造化されたプロジェクト計画と問題追跡機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"구조화된 프로젝트 계획 및 문제 추적 기능이 필요한 태스크 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de gestión de tareas que necesitan una planificación de proyectos estructurada y capacidades de seguimiento de problemas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de gestion de tâches nécessitant une planification de projet structurée et des capacités de suivi de problèmes.","de":"Perfekt für Task-Management-Agents, die eine strukturierte Projektplanung und Problemmelde-Funktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Tarefas que precisam de planejamento de projeto estruturado e capacidades de rastreamento de problemas.","ru":"Идеально для Агентов Управления Задачами, которым необходим структурированный планирование проекта и возможности отслеживания проблем.","ar":"مثالية لعمليات إدارة المهام التي تحتاج إلى تخطيط مشروع منظم وقدرات تتبع الأخطاء."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create phase-based breakdowns for tasks, spikes, and bugs, utilizing Markdown files like PLAN.md, and integrates with command-line interfaces like Gemini CLI for peer review and second opinions.","zh":"赋予代理创建基于阶段的任务、Spikes和Bug分解，利用Markdown文件如PLAN.md，并集成命令行接口如Gemini CLI进行同行评审和第二意见。","ja":"エージェントがタスク、スパイク、バグのフェーズベースのブレークダウンを作成できるようにし、PLAN.mdのようなMarkdownファイルを利用し、Gemini CLIのようなコマンドラインインターフェイスと統合してピアレビューと第二意見を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 태스크, 스파이크, 버그의 페이즈 기반 분해를 생성할 수 있도록 하며, PLAN.md와 같은 Markdown 파일을 사용하며, Gemini CLI와 같은 명령줄 인터페이스와 통합하여 동료 리뷰 및 제2의 의견을 구현합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear desgloses basados en fases para tareas, spikes y errores, utilizando archivos Markdown como PLAN.md, e integra con interfaces de línea de comandos como Gemini CLI para la revisión por pares y segundas opiniones.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des desgloses basés sur les phases pour les tâches, les spikes et les bogues, en utilisant des fichiers Markdown comme PLAN.md, et intègre avec des interfaces de ligne de commande comme Gemini CLI pour la revue par les pairs et les secondes opinions.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, phasenbasierte Aufteilungen für Aufgaben, Spikes und Fehler zu erstellen, indem Markdown-Dateien wie PLAN.md verwendet werden, und integriert mit Kommandozeilen-Schnittstellen wie Gemini CLI für Peer-Review und zweite Meinungen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar quebras baseadas em fases para tarefas, spikes e bugs, utilizando arquivos Markdown como PLAN.md, e integra-se com interfaces de linha de comando como Gemini CLI para revisão por pares e opiniões secundárias.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать фазово-ориентированное разбиение задач, спайков и багов, используя файлы Markdown, такие как PLAN.md, и интегрируется с командными интерфейсами, такими как Gemini CLI, для обзора коллегами и второго мнения.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء هيكل مكون من مراحل لعمليات المهام والتحسينات والأخطاء، باستخدام ملفات تعليمات Markdown مثل PLAN.md، وتكاملها مع واجهات سطر الأوامر مثل Gemini CLI لمراجعة الأقران والآراء الثانوية."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating project planning with phase-based breakdowns","Generating exploration plans for spikes","Creating issue-specific plans with auto-detection of project and issue type"],"zh":["使用基于阶段的分解来自动化项目规划","为Spikes生成探索计划","创建特定于问题的计划，自动检测项目和问题类型"],"ja":["フェーズベースのブレークダウンを使用してプロジェクト計画を自動化する","スパイクのための探索計画を生成する","問題ごとの計画を生成し、プロジェクトと問題のタイプを自動で検出する"],"ko":["페이즈 기반 분해를 사용하여 프로젝트 계획을 자동화하는 것","스파이크를 위한 탐색 계획을 생성하는 것","문제별 계획을 생성하고 프로젝트 및 문제 유형을 자동으로 감지하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar la planificación de proyectos con desgloses basados en fases","Generar planes de exploración para spikes","Crear planes específicos de problemas con autodetección de tipo de proyecto y problema"],"fr":["Automatiser la planification de projet avec des desgloses basés sur les phases","Générer des plans d''exploration pour les spikes","Créer des plans spécifiques aux problèmes avec une autodétection du type de projet et de problème"],"de":["Automatisierung der Projektplanung mit phasenbasierten Aufteilungen","Erstellung von Explorationsplänen für Spikes","Erstellen von problematischen Plänen mit automatischer Erkennung von Projekt- und Problemtyp"],"pt":["Automatizar o planejamento de projetos com quebras baseadas em fases","Gerar planos de exploração para spikes","Criar planos específicos de problemas com detecção automática do tipo de projeto e problema"],"ru":["Автоматизировать планирование проектов с фазово-ориентированным разбиением","Генерировать планы исследования для спайков","Создавать планы, специфичные для проблем, с автоматическим определением типа проекта и проблемы"],"ar":["تحسين تخطيط المشاريع مع تحليلات المراحل","إنتاج خطط استكشافية للتحسينات","إنشاء خطط محددة للأخطاء مع الكشف التلقائي عن نوع المشروع والخطأ"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires command-line interface access","Specific to issue tracking and project management workflows"],"zh":["需要命令行接口访问","仅适用于问题跟踪和项目管理工作流"],"ja":["コマンドラインインターフェイスへのアクセスが必要","問題追跡とプロジェクト管理のワークフローに特化している"],"ko":["명령줄 인터페이스 액세스가 필요함","문제 추적 및 프로젝트 관리 워크플로에 특정됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la interfaz de línea de comandos","Específico para flujos de trabajo de seguimiento de problemas y gestión de proyectos"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''interface de ligne de commande","Spécifique aux flux de travail de suivi de problèmes et de gestion de projet"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Kommandozeilen-Schnittstelle","Spezifisch für Arbeitsabläufe zur Problemmeldung und Projektmanagement"],"pt":["Requer acesso à interface de linha de comando","Específico para fluxos de trabalho de rastreamento de problemas e gerenciamento de projetos"],"ru":["Требует доступа к командному интерфейсу","Специфичен для рабочих процессов отслеживания проблем и управления проектами"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى واجهة سطر الأوامر","محدد لعمليات العمل لتتبع الأخطاء وإدارة المشاريع"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"70c1bcc8a06d5a35101f6229d4de4910b3e31f414053ff8e6169c518470b5309","qualityScore":51}');
