jora la depuración y el análisis de errores","Facilita la identificación de problemas en la aplicación","Permite la personalización de la configuración de registro"],"fr":["Journalisation structurée d''appels de fonctions Python","Compatibilité avec les applications conteneurisées et Docker Compose","Améliore le débogage et l''analyse des erreurs","Facilite l''identification des problèmes dans l''application","Permet la personnalisation de la configuration de journalisation"],"de":["Strukturierte Protokollierung von Python-Funktionenaufrufen","Kompatibilität mit containerisierten Anwendungen und Docker Compose","Verbessert die Fehlersuche und die Analyse von Fehlern","Ermöglicht die Identifizierung von Problemen in der Anwendung","Ermöglicht die Anpassung der Protokollkonfiguration"],"pt":["Registros estruturados de chamadas de funções Python","Integração com aplicações containerizadas","Suporte a Docker Compose","Melhoria da depuração e monitoramento","Registros personalizáveis"],"ru":["Структурированное логирование вызовов функций Python","Интеграция с контейнеризованными приложениями","Поддержка Docker Compose","Улучшение отладки и мониторинга","Настраиваемые логи"],"ar":["التسجيلات المنسقة لدعوات وظائف بايثون","التكامل مع التطبيقات المُحتوية","دعم Docker Compose","تحسين التصحيح والمراقبة","سجلات قابلة для التخصيص"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用logfire-read","什么是结构化日志","logfire-read替代品","logfire-read vs ELK","logfire-read安装","logfire-read设置指南","Python日志记录","容器化应用日志"],"ja":["logfire-readの使い方","構造化ログとは","logfire-readの代替","logfire-read vs ELK","logfire-readのインストール","logfire-readの設定ガイド","Pythonのログ記録","コンテナ化アプリケーションのログ"],"ko":["logfire-read 사용법","구조화 로그란","logfire-read 대체품","logfire-read vs ELK","logfire-read 설치","logfire-read 설정 가이드","Python 로그 기록","컨테이너화된 애플리케이션 로그"],"es":["herramientas de registro de AI","logfire-read","aplicaciones contenerizadas","Docker Compose","depuración de errores","análisis de errores","registro estructurado","llamadas a funciones de Python","cómo usar logfire-read"],"fr":["outils d''agent IA","logfire-read","applications conteneurisées","Docker Compose","débogage d''erreurs","analyse d''erreurs","journalisation structurée","appels de fonctions Python","comment utiliser logfire-read"],"de":["KI-Tools","logfire-read","containerisierte Anwendungen","Docker Compose","Fehlersuche","Fehleranalyse","strukturierte Protokollierung","Python-Funktionenaufrufe","wie man logfire-read verwendet"],"pt":["logfire-read","registros estruturados","chamadas de funções Python","aplicações containerizadas","Docker Compose","ferramentas de IA","como usar logfire-read","o que é logfire-read","alternativas ao logfire-read"],"ru":["logfire-read","структурированное логирование","вызовы функций Python","контейнеризованные приложения","Docker Compose","инструменты ИИ Агентов","как использовать logfire-read","что такое logfire-read","альтернативы logfire-read"],"ar":["logfire-read","التسجيلات المنسقة","دعوات وظائف بايثون","التطبيقات المُحتوية","Docker Compose","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","كيفية استخدام logfire-read","ما هو logfire-read","بديلات logfire-read"]}},"owner":"michaeltschreiber","repo":"logger","repoPath":"michaeltschreiber/logger","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.954Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"logfire-read","description":"Query Logfire logs via the Logfire query API using read tokens and JSONL output. Use when you need to fetch or filter Logfire records, build log queries, or provide agent-ready log retrieval from this repo. Triggers: Logfire read, query API, JSONL logs, read token, log retrieval, log queries.","bodyPreview":"# Logfire Read Skill\n\nUse this skill to read Logfire records with JSONL output using the repo’s reader utilities.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n1. Load `.env` from the repo root:\n\n```sh\nset -a\n. ./.env\nset +a\n```\n\n2. Run the JSONL reader:\n\n```sh\npython scripts/logfire-fetch.py\n```\n\nOr use the bundled script:\n\n```sh\n./.codex/skills/logfire-read/scripts/read_logs.sh --message-like \"Processing failed\" --limit 10\n```\n\n## Agent-Friendly CLI\n\nUse the agent helper for targeted queries:\n\n```sh\npython scripts/logfire","body":"# Logfire Read Skill\n\nUse this skill to read Logfire records with JSONL output using the repo’s reader utilities.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n1. Load `.env` from the repo root:\n\n```sh\nset -a\n. ./.env\nset +a\n```\n\n2. Run the JSONL reader:\n\n```sh\npython scripts/logfire-fetch.py\n```\n\nOr use the bundled script:\n\n```sh\n./.codex/skills/logfire-read/scripts/read_logs.sh --message-like \"Processing failed\" --limit 10\n```\n\n## Agent-Friendly CLI\n\nUse the agent helper for targeted queries:\n\n```sh\npython scripts/logfire-read-agent.py --since 2026-01-11T00:00:00Z --message-like \"Processing failed\" --limit 10\n```\n\n## Module API\n\nUse `query_logfire()` for programmatic access:\n\n```python\nfrom logger import query_logfire\n\nrows = query_logfire(jsonl=True, level=21, message_like=\"Processing failed\", limit=10)\nfor row in rows:\n    print(row)\n```\n\n## Environment Variables\n\nRequired:\n- `LOGFIRE_READ_URL` (e.g., `https://logfire-us.pydantic.dev/v1/query`)\n- `LOGFIRE_READ_TOKEN`\n\nOptional filters:\n- `LOGFIRE_READ_COLUMNS`\n- `LOGFIRE_READ_LIMIT`\n- `LOGFIRE_READ_SINCE`\n- `LOGFIRE_READ_LEVEL`\n- `LOGFIRE_READ_MESSAGE_LIKE`\n- `LOGFIRE_READ_TRACE_ID`\n- `LOGFIRE_READ_SPAN_ID`\n- `LOGFIRE_READ_JSONL=true`\n\n## Output Format\n\n- JSONL output returns one JSON object per record.\n- `level` is converted to severity strings (`trace`, `debug`, `info`, `warn`, `error`, `fatal`).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:45:48.010Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Logging Analysis Agents needing structured logging of Python function calls for containerized applications and Docker Compose","zh":"非常适合需要对容器化应用程序中的Python函数调用进行结构化日志记录的日志分析代理，特别适用于Docker Compose","ja":"Python関数呼び出しの構造化ログ記録が必要なコンテナ化アプリケーションとDocker Composeのログ分析エージェントに最適","ko":"Python 함수 호출에 대한 구조화된 로깅이 필요한 컨테이너화된 애플리케이션 및 Docker Compose를 위한 로그 분석 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Registro que necesitan registro estructurado de llamadas a funciones de Python para aplicaciones contenerizadas y Docker Compose","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse de Journal nécessitant un journal structuré des appels de fonctions Python pour des applications conteneurisées et Docker Compose","de":"Perfekt für Logging-Analyse-Agents, die strukturiertes Logging von Python-Funktionenaufrufen für containerisierte Anwendungen und Docker Compose benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Registros que necessitam de registros estruturados de chamadas de funções Python para aplicativos containerizados e Docker Compose","ru":"Идеально для агентов анализа журналов, которым необходимы структурированные журналы вызовов функций Python для контейнеризированных приложений и Docker Compose","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل السجلات الذي يحتاج إلى سجلات بنية لاستدعاءات دالة Python لتطبيقات الحاويات و Docker Compose"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to read Logfire records with JSONL output using Python scripts and the repo''s reader utilities, enabling targeted queries with the agent helper for advanced logging analysis and debugging with Docker Compose","zh":"赋予代理读取Logfire记录的能力，使用Python脚本和仓库的读取工具，以JSONL输出格式，实现有针对性的查询和高级日志分析与Docker Compose的调试","ja":"Pythonスクリプトとリポジトリのリーダーutilityを使用して、JSONL出力でLogfireレコードを読み取るエージェントを可能にし、エージェントヘルパーを使用したターゲットクエリとDocker Composeの高度なログ分析およびデバッグを可能にする","ko":"Python 스크립트와 저장소의 리더 유틸리티를 사용하여 JSONL 출력 형식으로 Logfire 레코드를 읽는 에이전트를 가능하게 하며, 에이전트 헬퍼를 사용한 타겟 쿼리와 Docker Compose의 고급 로깅 분석 및 디버깅을 가능하게 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a leer registros de Logfire con salida JSONL utilizando scripts de Python y las utilidades de lectura del repositorio, lo que permite consultas dirigidas con el ayudante del agente para un análisis de registro avanzado y depuración con Docker Compose","fr":"Permet aux agents de lire des enregistrements Logfire avec une sortie JSONL en utilisant des scripts Python et les utilitaires de lecteur du référentiel, ce qui permet des requêtes ciblées avec l''assistant de l''agent pour une analyse de journal avancée et un débogage avec Docker Compose","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Logfire-Protokolle mit JSONL-Ausgabe mithilfe von Python-Skripten und den Leseverzeichnissen des Repositorys zu lesen, wodurch gezielte Abfragen mit dem Agenten-Helfer für erweiterte Protokollanalyse und Fehlerbehebung mit Docker Compose ermöglicht werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a lerem registros do Logfire com saída JSONL usando scripts Python e utilitários de leitura do repositório, permitindo consultas direcionadas com o auxiliar do agente para análise de registro avançada e depuração com Docker Compose","ru":"Позволяет агентам читать записи Logfire с выводом JSONL, используя скрипты Python и утилиты чтения репозитория, что позволяет выполнять целевые запросы с помощью помощника агента для продвинутого анализа журналов и отладки с Docker Compose","ar":"يُمكن العميل من قراءة سجلات Logfire مع إخراج JSONL باستخدام نصوص Python وأدوات قراءة المستودع، مما يتيح استفسارات محددة مع مساعد العميل لتحليل سجل متقدم وتصحيح الأخطاء مع Docker Compose"},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging containerized application issues","Analyzing Logfire records for error patterns","Automating logging data extraction with Python scripts"],"zh":["调试容器化应用程序的问题","分析Logfire记录以查找错误模式","使用Python脚本自动提取日志数据"],"ja":["コンテナ化アプリケーションの問題をデバッグする","エラーパターンを検出するためにLogfireレコードを分析する","Pythonスクリプトを使用してログデータを自動抽出する"],"ko":["컨테이너화된 애플리케이션의 문제를 디버깅하는 것","오류 패턴을 검색하기 위해 Logfire 레코드를 분석하는 것","Python 스크립트를 사용하여 로그 데이터를 자동으로 추출하는 것"],"es":["Depuración de problemas de aplicaciones contenerizadas","Análisis de registros de Logfire para patrones de errores","Automatización de la extracción de datos de registro con scripts de Python"],"fr":["Débogage des problèmes d''applications conteneurisées","Analyse des enregistrements Logfire pour les modèles d''erreurs","Automatisation de l''extraction de données de journal avec des scripts Python"],"de":["Fehlerbehebung bei containerisierten Anwendungsproblemen","Analyse von Logfire-Protokollen für Fehlermuster","Automatisierung der Extraktion von Protokolldaten mit Python-Skripten"],"pt":["Depuração de problemas de aplicativos containerizados","Análise de registros do Logfire para padrões de erros","Automação da extração de dados de registro com scripts Python"],"ru":["Отладка проблем контейнеризированных приложений","Анализ записей Logfire для поиска моделей ошибок","Автоматизация извлечения данных журнала с помощью скриптов Python"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء تطبيقات الحاويات","تحليل سجلات Logfire لعرض أنماط الأخطاء","تأطير استخراج بيانات السجل باستخدام نصوص Python"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python environment","Docker Compose setup needed","JSONL output format"],"zh":["需要Python环境","需要Docker Compose设置","JSONL输出格式"],"ja":["Python環境が必要","Docker Composeの設定が必要","JSONL出力形式"],"ko":["Python 환경이 필요","Docker Compose 설정이 필요","JSONL 출력 형식"],"es":["Requiere entorno de Python","Configuración de Docker Compose necesaria","Formato de salida JSONL"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python","Configuration de Docker Compose nécessaire","Format de sortie JSONL"],"de":["Benötigt Python-Umgebung","Docker Compose-Setup erforderlich","JSONL-Ausgabeformat"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Python","Configuração do Docker Compose necessária","Formato de saída JSONL"],"ru":["Требуется среда Python","Необходима настройка Docker Compose","Формат вывода JSONL"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Python","إعداد Docker Compose مطلوب","تنسيق إخراج JSONL"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"cfb10ead6df30e9c1c07ba8d934b23698b015dfa001ea4be9094f450c4100d08","qualityScore":51}');
