lligence artificielle"],"de":["Forschungsnachrichten zur künstlichen Intelligenz","Erkundung von bahnbrechender Forschung","KI-Tool für Entwickler","Echtzeit-Updates","Zugang zu KI-Forschung"],"pt":["Suporte a pesquisa de artigos","Integração com Idea Explorer","Recursos de desenvolvimento de Inteligência Artificial","Compatibilidade com React, Python e Node.js","Interface de linha de comando (CLI)"],"ru":["Поддержка поиска статей","Интеграция с Idea Explorer","Возможности разработки ИИ","Совместимость с React, Python и Node.js","Интерфейс командной строки (CLI)"],"ar":["دعم البحث عن المقالات","التكامل مع Idea Explorer","ميزات تطوير ذكاء اصطناعي","التوافق مع React، Python و Node.js","واجهة سطر الأوامر (CLI)"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用paper-finder","什么是AI研究论文","paper-finder替代工具","paper-finder安装指南","paper-finder设置教程","AI研究论文下载","AI技术论文查找","paper-finder-vs-其他工具"],"ja":["paper-finderの使い方","AI研究論文とは","paper-finderの代替ツール","paper-finderのインストール方法","paper-finderの設定ガイド","AI研究論文のダウンロード","AI技術論文の検索","paper-finderと他のツールの比較"],"ko":["paper-finder 사용법","AI 연구 논문이란","paper-finder 대체 도구","paper-finder 설치 가이드","paper-finder 설정 튜토리얼","AI 연구 논문의 다운로드","AI 기술 논문의 검색","paper-finder와 다른 도구의 비교"],"es":["herramientas de ia","paper-finder","inteligencia artificial","investigación de ia","desarrollo de ia","ia para desarrolladores","cómo usar paper-finder","alternativas a paper-finder","paper-finder vs otros herramientas de ia"],"fr":["outils d''ia","paper-finder","intelligence artificielle","recherche d''ia","développement d''ia","ia pour les développeurs","comment utiliser paper-finder","alternatives à paper-finder","paper-finder vs autres outils d''ia"],"de":["ki-tools","paper-finder","künstliche intelligenz","ki-forschung","ki-entwicklung","ki für entwickler","wie man paper-finder verwendet","alternativen zu paper-finder","paper-finder vs andere ki-tools"],"pt":["como usar paper-finder","o que é Inteligência Artificial","paper-finder alternativa","paper-finder vs outros agentes","instalar paper-finder","guia de configuração do paper-finder"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агент paper-finder","что такое ИИ","ИИ Агент paper-finder альтернатива","ИИ Агент paper-finder vs другие агенты","установить ИИ Агент paper-finder","руководство по настройке ИИ Агента paper-finder"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أداة paper-finder","ما هو ذكاء اصطناعي","أداة paper-finder بديلة","أداة paper-finder مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت أداة paper-finder","دليل إعداد أداة paper-finder"]}},"owner":"Hypogenic-AI","repo":"news-from-future-ai-aed4-claude","repoPath":"Hypogenic-AI/news-from-future-ai-aed4-claude","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.970Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"paper-finder","description":"Find and search for academic papers using the paper-finder service. Use when conducting literature review, searching for related work, finding baseline papers, or looking for methodology references.","bodyPreview":"# Paper Finder\n\nSystematic paper discovery and prioritization for research projects.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Starting a literature review\n- Looking for related work on a topic\n- Finding baseline papers for experiments\n- Searching for methodology references\n- Building a citation list for a research paper\n\n## How to Use\n\nRun the helper script from your workspace:\n\n```bash\npython .claude/skills/paper-finder/scripts/find_papers.py \"your research topic\"\n```\n\nOptions:\n- `--mode fast` (default): Quick searc","body":"# Paper Finder\n\nSystematic paper discovery and prioritization for research projects.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Starting a literature review\n- Looking for related work on a topic\n- Finding baseline papers for experiments\n- Searching for methodology references\n- Building a citation list for a research paper\n\n## How to Use\n\nRun the helper script from your workspace:\n\n```bash\npython .claude/skills/paper-finder/scripts/find_papers.py \"your research topic\"\n```\n\nOptions:\n- `--mode fast` (default): Quick search\n- `--mode diligent`: Thorough search (recommended for comprehensive review)\n- `--format json`: Output as JSON instead of text\n\nExample:\n```bash\npython .claude/skills/paper-finder/scripts/find_papers.py \"hypothesis generation with large language models\" --mode fast\n```\n\n## Search Strategy\n\n### Query Formulation\n\nUse structured queries for better results:\n\n1. **Core concept + Method**: \"transformer attention mechanism\"\n2. **Problem + Domain**: \"few-shot learning natural language processing\"\n3. **Technique + Application**: \"graph neural networks drug discovery\"\n\n### Multi-Stage Search\n\n1. **Broad scan**: Start with general topic terms\n2. **Focused dive**: Use specific method/technique names from initial results\n3. **Citation chase**: Search for highly-cited papers referenced in relevant work\n\n## Citation Prioritization\n\n### Relevance Tiers\n\n| Relevance Score | Priority | Action |\n|-----------------|----------|--------|\n| 3 (High) | Must read | Download PDF, read fully, cite |\n| 2 (Medium) | Should read | Read abstract + intro, cite if relevant |\n| 1 (Low) | Optional | Skim abstract, cite only if needed |\n| 0 (Not relevant) | Skip | Do not include |\n\n### Citation Count Thresholds\n\n| Category | Citation Count | Interpretation |\n|----------|----------------|----------------|\n| Seminal | 1000+ | Foundational work, must cite |\n| Well-established | 100-999 | Widely accepted, cite if relevant |\n| Recent/Emerging | 10-99 | Current research, cite for novelty |\n| New | <10 | Very recent, check publication venue |\n\n### Venue Tiers (ML/AI Focus)\n\n**Tier 1** (Top venues, high credibility):\n- NeurIPS, ICML, ICLR, ACL, EMNLP, CVPR, ICCV\n\n**Tier 2** (Strong venues):\n- AAAI, IJCAI, NAACL, COLING, ECCV, WACV\n\n**Tier 3** (Good venues):\n- *ACL workshops, COLM, EACL, CoNLL\n\n**Preprints** (arXiv):\n- Check for peer-reviewed version first\n- Cite arXiv only if no published version exists\n\n## Screening Workflow\n\n### Phase 1: Title Screening\n- Review titles from search results\n- Mark papers as \"include\", \"exclude\", or \"maybe\"\n- Goal: ~50% reduction\n\n### Phase 2: Abstract Screening\n- Read abstracts for included/maybe papers\n- Evaluate: relevance, methodology, findings\n- Goal: Identify key papers for deeper reading\n\n### Phase 3: Full-Text Review\n- Download and read full PDFs for key papers\n- Extract: methods, results, limitations, citations\n- Use the PDF chunker for detailed reading (see below)\n\n## Output Structure\n\nReturns relevance-ranked papers with:\n- Title, authors, year\n- Abstract (already extracted)\n- URL for download\n- Relevance score (0-3, focus on papers with score >= 2)\n- Citation count\n\n## After Finding Papers\n\n1. Download PDFs for papers with relevance >= 2\n2. Read abstracts first (already provided in output)\n3. Only read full PDFs for most relevant papers\n4. Write notes to literature_review.md immediately\n5. Track citations for references.bib\n\n## Reading Large PDFs\n\nUse the PDF chunker to split papers into smaller PDF files that can be read directly.\nThis preserves all formatting perfectly (unlike text extraction which loses formatting).\n\n**Dependencies:**\n```bash\n# Using uv (recommended):\nuv add pypdf\n\n# Or with pip:\npip install pypdf\n```\n\n**How to run:**\n\n```bash\npython .claude/skills/paper-finder/scripts/pdf_chunker.py <pdf_path>\n```\n\nOptions:\n- `--pages-per-chunk N`: Number of pages per chunk (default: 1)\n- `--output-dir DIR`: Output directory (default: `<pdf_dir>/pages`)\n\n**Output:**\n- Creates PDF chunk files: `<pdf_name>_chunk_001.pdf`, `<pdf_name>_chunk_002.pdf`, etc.\n- Creates a manifest: `<pdf_name>_manifest.txt` listing all chunks with page ranges\n\n**Integration with screening workflow:**\n1. Run the chunker on papers before detailed reading\n2. For abstract skimming: read only chunk 1 (page 1 or pages 1-3)\n3. For deep reading: read ALL chunk PDFs sequentially, writing notes after each\n4. Check the manifest to see how many chunks exist\n5. IMPORTANT: Do not skip chunks - methodology and results are in later chunks\n\n## If Paper-Finder Service Not Running\n\nThe script will show a fallback message. Use manual search instead:\n- arXiv: https://arxiv.org\n- Semantic Scholar: https://www.semanticscholar.org\n- Papers with Code: https://paperswithcode.com\n- Google Scholar: https://scholar.google.com\n\nManual search works well - paper-finder is just a convenience for faster, more targeted results.\n\n## References\n\nSee `references/` folder for:\n- `search_strategies.md`: Detailed search query formulation\n- `prioritization_guide.md`: Extended prioritization criteria\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:53:21.333Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Research Agents needing systematic paper discovery and prioritization for literature reviews and research projects.","zh":"非常适合需要系统化论文发现和优先级排序的研究代理，用于文献综述和研究项目。","ja":"研究エージェントが文献レビューと研究プロジェクトのための体系的な論文発見と優先順位付けを必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"문서 발견과 우선 순위를 시스템적으로 처리해야 하는 연구 에이전트에게 적합하며, 문헌 리뷰 및 연구 프로젝트에 사용됩니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Investigación que necesitan un descubrimiento y priorización sistemáticos de artículos para revisiones de literatura y proyectos de investigación.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Recherche ayant besoin d''une découverte et d''une priorisation systématiques de documents pour les revues de littérature et les projets de recherche.","de":"Perfekt für Forschungsagenten, die ein systematisches Auffinden und Priorisieren von Artikeln für Literaturübersichten und Forschungsprojekte benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Pesquisa que necessitam de descoberta e priorização sistemáticas de artigos para revisões de literatura e projetos de pesquisa.","ru":"Идеально подходит для исследовательских агентов, которым необходима систематическая обнаружение и приоритезация статей для обзоров литературы и исследовательских проектов.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء البحثيين الذين يحتاجون إلى اكتشاف منهجي وتحديد الأولوية للأوراق البحثية لمراجعات الأدب والمشاريع البحثية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to systematically discover and prioritize research papers using Python scripts, facilitating quick searches and citation list building with options like ''--mode fast'' for efficient research topic exploration.","zh":"赋予代理使用Python脚本系统地发现和优先级排序研究论文的能力，方便快速搜索和引用列表构建，例如使用''--mode fast''选项进行高效的研究主题探索。","ja":"Pythonスクリプトを使用して、エージェントが研究論文を体系的に発見し、優先順位を付けることができるようにします。 ''--mode fast''などのオプションを使用すると、効率的な研究トピックの探索が可能になり、クイックサーチや引用リストの構築が容易になります。","ko":"에이전트가 Python 스크립트를 사용하여 연구 논문을 체계적으로 발견하고 우선 순위를 지정할 수 있도록 합니다. 빠른 검색과 인용 목록 구성을 위한 옵션으로 ''--mode fast''와 같은 기능을 제공하여 효율적인 연구 주제 탐색을 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a descubrir y priorizar sistemáticamente los artículos de investigación utilizando scripts de Python, facilitando búsquedas rápidas y la creación de listas de citas con opciones como ''--mode fast'' para una exploración eficiente de temas de investigación.","fr":"Permet aux agents de découvrir et de prioriser systématiquement les articles de recherche en utilisant des scripts Python, facilitant les recherches rapides et la construction de listes de citations avec des options comme ''--mode fast'' pour une exploration efficace des sujets de recherche.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Forschungsartikel systematisch zu entdecken und zu priorisieren, indem sie Python-Skripte verwenden, wodurch schnelle Suchen und das Erstellen von Zitationslisten mit Optionen wie ''--mode fast'' für eine effiziente Erforschung von Forschungsthemen erleichtert werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a descobrirem e priorizarem systematicamente artigos de pesquisa usando scripts Python, facilitando buscas rápidas e construção de listas de citações com opções como ''--mode fast'' para exploração eficiente de tópicos de pesquisa.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью систематически обнаруживать и приоритезировать исследовательские статьи с помощью скриптов Python, облегчая быстрый поиск и построение списков цитат с опциями, такими как ''--mode fast'' для эффективного исследования тем.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على اكتشاف وتصنيف الأوراق البحثية بشكل منهجي باستخدام سكريبتات Python، مما يسهل عمليات البحث السريعة وبناء قوائم الإشارات المرجعية مع خيارات مثل ''--mode fast'' لاستكشاف مواضيع البحث بفعالية."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating literature reviews","Finding baseline papers for experiments","Building comprehensive citation lists","Searching for methodology references"],"zh":["自动化文献综述","找到实验的基线论文","构建全面的引用列表","搜索方法参考"],"ja":["文献レビューの自動化","実験のベースライン論文の検索","包括的な引用リストの構築","方法に関する参考資料の検索"],"ko":["문헌 리뷰 자동화","실험을 위한 기준 논문의 tìm kiếm","포괄적인 인용 목록 구축","방법론 참조 검색"],"es":["Automatización de revisiones de literatura","Encontrar artículos base para experimentos","Crear listas de citas comprehensivas","Buscar referencias de metodología"],"fr":["Automation des revues de littérature","Trouver des articles de base pour les expériences","Construire des listes de citations complètes","Rechercher des références de méthodologie"],"de":["Automatisierung von Literaturübersichten","Finden von Basisartikeln für Experimente","Erstellen von umfassenden Zitationslisten","Suchen nach Methodenreferenzen"],"pt":["Automatizar revisões de literatura","Encontrar artigos de base para experimentos","Construir listas de citações abrangentes","Pesquisar referências de metodologia"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обзоры литературы","Найти базовые статьи для экспериментов","Построить всесторонние списки цитат","Поиск ссылок на методологию"],"ar":["أتمتة مراجعات الأدب","ايجاد أوراق أساسية لل تجارب","بناء قوائم إشارات مرجعية شاملة","البحث عن مراجع منهجية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python environment","Dependent on script execution from workspace"],"zh":["需要Python环境","依赖于工作空间中的脚本执行"],"ja":["Python環境が必要","ワークスペースからのスクリプト実行に依存"],"ko":["Python 환경이 필요함","작업 공간에서 스크립트 실행에 의존"],"es":["Requiere entorno de Python","Dependiente de la ejecución de scripts desde el espacio de trabajo"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python","Dépend de l''exécution de scripts depuis l''espace de travail"],"de":["Benötigt Python-Umgebung","Abhängig von der Skriptausführung aus dem Arbeitsbereich"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Python","Dependente da execução do script a partir do espaço de trabalho"],"ru":["Требуется среда Python","Зависит от выполнения скрипта из рабочего пространства"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Python","يعتمد على تشغيل السكريبت من مساحة العمل"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"2c652be8b402a40b7ede85116e20c60323e3ea98ca2f10393d3b94e0fa3fd59b","qualityScore":51}');
