s","Análise de investimento com capacidades do mundo real","Integração com Jazz CLI","Desenvolvimento de soluções personalizadas","Suporte a múltiplas linguagens de programação"],"ru":["Создание автономных ИИ агентов","Анализ инвестиций с реальными возможностями","Интеграция с Jazz CLI","Разработка индивидуальных решений","Поддержка нескольких языков программирования"],"ar":["إنشاء وكلاء ذكاء اصطناعي مستقلين","تحليل الاستثمار بقدرات العالم الحقيقي","التكامل مع Jazz CLI","تطوير حلول مخصصة","دعم لغات برمجة متعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用Jazz CLI","什么是投资分析AI代理","Jazz CLI替代品","Jazz CLI与其他工具的比较","Jazz CLI安装","Jazz CLI设置指南","投资分析工具","AI代理开发","机器学习在投资分析中的应用"],"ja":["Jazz CLIの使い方","投資分析AIエージェントとは","Jazz CLIの代替品","Jazz CLIと他のツールの比較","Jazz CLIのインストール","Jazz CLIの設定ガイド","投資分析ツール","AIエージェント開発","機械学習を投資分析に適用"],"ko":["Jazz CLI 사용 방법","투자 분석 AI 에이전트란","Jazz CLI 대체품","Jazz CLI와 다른 도구 비교","Jazz CLI 설치","Jazz CLI 설정 가이드","투자 분석 도구","AI 에이전트 개발","기계 학습을 투자 분석에 적용"],"es":["cómo usar Jazz para análisis de inversión","qué es un agente de IA","Jazz alternativa","Jazz vs otros agentes de IA","instalación de Jazz","guía de configuración de Jazz","análisis de inversión con IA","desarrollo de aplicaciones de IA"],"fr":["comment utiliser Jazz pour analyse d''investissement","qu''est-ce qu''un outil d''IA","Jazz alternative","Jazz vs autres outils d''IA","installation de Jazz","guide de configuration de Jazz","analyse d''investissement avec IA","développement d''applications d''IA"],"de":["wie man Jazz für Investitionsanalyse verwendet","was ist ein KI-Agent","Jazz Alternative","Jazz vs andere KI-Agenten","Installation von Jazz","Einrichtungsanleitung für Jazz","Investitionsanalyse mit KI","Entwicklung von KI-Anwendungen"],"pt":["como usar agentes de IA","o que é análise de investimento","Jazz CLI alternative","Jazz vs outros agentes de IA","instalar Jazz CLI","guia de configuração do Jazz"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ агентов","что такое анализ инвестиций","Jazz CLI альтернатива","Jazz vs другие ИИ агенты","установить Jazz CLI","руководство по настройке Jazz"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هو تحليل الاستثمار","بديل Jazz CLI","Jazz مقابل وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الآخرون","تثبيت Jazz CLI","دليل إعداد Jazz"]}},"owner":"lvndry","repo":"jazz","repoPath":"lvndry/jazz","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.976Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"investment-analysis","description":"In-depth analysis of investment assets (gold, silver, bitcoin, equities, etc.) to support investment decisions. Use when the user wants to understand an assets current state, market analysis, patterns, forecasts, or whether it fits their situation. Triggers on investment analysis, analyze gold/bitcoin/silver, should I invest in X, current state of X, market analysis, is X a good investment.","bodyPreview":"# Investment Analysis\n\nInvestment decisions affect real wealth and real lives. This skill provides in-depth analysis—grounded in investor frameworks (value, macro, growth, risk)—to support your decisions. When the analysis supports a view, give a **clear, sourced, nuanced conclusion** tailored to the user''s profile. Avoid vague hedging; substance and conviction (when justified) build trust.\n\nFor mindset and frameworks, see [references/investment-mindset.md](references/investment-mindset.md).\n\n##","body":"# Investment Analysis\n\nInvestment decisions affect real wealth and real lives. This skill provides in-depth analysis—grounded in investor frameworks (value, macro, growth, risk)—to support your decisions. When the analysis supports a view, give a **clear, sourced, nuanced conclusion** tailored to the user''s profile. Avoid vague hedging; substance and conviction (when justified) build trust.\n\nFor mindset and frameworks, see [references/investment-mindset.md](references/investment-mindset.md).\n\n## When to Use\n\n- User wants to analyze an asset (gold, silver, bitcoin, a stock, ETF, or commodity)\n- User asks \"should I invest in X?\" or \"is X a good investment?\"\n- User wants current market state, patterns, or forecasts for an asset\n- User wants to know if an asset fits their goals, risk, or time horizon\n- User asks for \"investment analysis\", \"market analysis\", or \"pattern recognition\" for an asset\n\n## Disclaimer & Scope\n\n**This is not licensed investment, tax, or legal advice.** No guarantee of returns. For major decisions (large sums, complex situations, tax/estate), recommend consulting a qualified professional.\n\n**Do give actionable conclusions** when analysis supports them: sourced, justified, tied to the user''s goals, risk, and horizon. The user deserves a clear view, not a hand-off. State confidence level and caveats.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. **Clarify asset and user situation**: Which asset? User''s goals (growth, income, hedge), risk tolerance, time horizon, and (if shared) existing exposure.\n2. **Gather current state**: Price, volume, recent trend, key levels. Use recent data; cite source and date.\n3. **Apply investment mindset**: Use frameworks from [references/investment-mindset.md](references/investment-mindset.md)—Buffett/Munger (value, margin of safety), Dalio (macro), Lynch (story), Marks (risk/cycles), Graham (intrinsic value)—to deepen analysis. Avoid shallow takes.\n4. **Analyze patterns and context**: Technical patterns, sentiment, on-chain (for crypto), macro context (rates, inflation, geopolitics) where relevant.\n5. **Consider forecasts and previsions**: What analysts or models say (bull/bear cases). Label as outlook, not fact.\n6. **Assess fit for situation**: Does the asset align with the user''s goals, risk, and horizon? Pros and cons in that context.\n7. **Present analysis**: Structured report with current state, patterns, outlook, fit, risks, and caveats. When analysis supports a view, state it clearly—e.g. \"For your profile, a small allocation (X–Y%) could fit because [sourced reasons]\" or \"Given your horizon and risk tolerance, this asset is likely misaligned—[reasons].\"\n\n## What to Analyze\n\n### Current State\n\n- **Price**: Current level, recent range (e.g. 30/90 days), key support/resistance if useful\n- **Volume / liquidity**: Where relevant (e.g. crypto, equities)\n- **Trend**: Short- and medium-term direction; cite time frame\n- **Context**: Rates, inflation, dollar, geopolitics—only what''s relevant to the asset\n\nCite source and date for every number (e.g. \"BTC price as of [date] per [source]\").\n\n### Pattern Recognition\n\n- **Technical**: Trends, ranges, common patterns (e.g. breakout, consolidation). Describe, don''t guarantee.\n- **Sentiment**: Fear/greed, positioning, flows—when data is available and relevant\n- **On-chain (crypto)**: Active addresses, supply in profit/loss, exchange flows—when available\n- **Seasonal / cyclical**: Historical patterns (e.g. gold in certain periods); state that past ≠ future\n\nLabel clearly: \"pattern observed\" vs \"forecast or interpretation.\"\n\n### Forecasts and Previsions\n\n- **Analyst views**: Summarize bull/bear cases; name source and date\n- **Model-based**: E.g. valuation bands, trend extrapolation—state assumptions\n- **Scenarios**: Best / base / worst case with clear \"if X then Y\" and caveats\n\nNo single \"this will happen\" claim; present range of views and uncertainty.\n\n### Fit for User Situation\n\n- **Goals**: Growth vs income vs hedge vs diversification\n- **Risk tolerance**: Volatility, drawdowns, loss capacity\n- **Time horizon**: Short vs long term; liquidity needs\n- **Existing exposure**: Already heavy in the asset? Diversification benefit?\n\nOutput: A clear conclusion with reasoning. E.g. \"Given [situation], I''d lean [for/against/neutral] because [sourced reasons]. Consider [suggested allocation or action] if [conditions].\" Tie every view to sources and profile.\n\n## Output Format\n\n```markdown\n# Investment Analysis: [Asset] — [Date]\n\n## Summary\n\n[2–4 sentences: current state, main pattern/outlook, and fit with user situation. Include a clear conclusion when analysis supports it—e.g. \"For a long-term, risk-tolerant profile, a small allocation could fit; for short horizons, likely misaligned.\"]\n\n## Your Situation (as shared)\n\n- Goals: [e.g. long-term growth, hedge inflation]\n- Risk: [e.g. moderate, can tolerate 20% drawdown]\n- Horizon: [e.g. 5+ years]\n- [Optional] Current exposure: [e.g. none, 5% in gold]\n\n## Current Market State\n\n- **Price / level**: [value] as of [date] ([source])\n- **Recent trend**: [e.g. up/down/sideways over 30/90 days]\n- **Context**: [rates, inflation, or other relevant factor in 1–2 lines]\n\n## Patterns & Indicators\n\n- [Pattern 1]: [What you see and time frame]\n- [Pattern 2]: [What you see and time frame]\n- [Sentiment / on-chain if relevant]: [1–2 lines]\n\n## Outlook & Previsions\n\n- **Bull case**: [Short summary + source/date if applicable]\n- **Bear case**: [Short summary]\n- **Base case / range**: [If useful, with assumptions stated]\n\n## Fit for Your Situation\n\n- **Pros**: [How it could align with goals/risk/horizon]\n- **Cons**: [Risks or misalignment with situation]\n- **Conclusion**: [Clear view with reasoning. E.g. \"For your profile (long-term, moderate risk), a 2–5% allocation could fit as a diversification/hedge—because [sourced reasons]. I''d avoid or minimize if [conditions].\" Or \"Given your short horizon, I''d lean against—[reasons].\" State confidence and caveats.]\n\n## Risks & Caveats\n\n- [Risk 1]\n- [Risk 2]\n- Past performance does not guarantee future results. For large or complex decisions, consult a qualified professional.\n```\n\n## Asset Coverage\n\n- **Precious metals**: Gold, silver—price, trend, macro context (real rates, dollar, geopolitics), common use as hedge.\n- **Crypto**: Bitcoin (and optionally major altcoins)—price, volume, on-chain metrics, sentiment, regulatory/macro tailwinds/risks.\n- **Equities / ETFs**: Single names or broad indices—valuation, trend, sector context; same \"current state + patterns + outlook + fit\" structure.\n\nFor asset-specific metrics and data sources, see [references/assets.md](references/assets.md).\n\n## Time Awareness\n\n- **User specifies a period** (e.g. \"last 6 months\", \"2024\") → Use that period for trends and data.\n- **No period given** → Use **most recent** data (e.g. current price, last 30/90 days for trend).\n- Always state the date and source for prices and metrics (e.g. \"as of [date] per [source]\").\n\n## Sources\n\n- **Prices / market data**: Exchange or index provider, reputable aggregator (e.g. CoinGecko for crypto). Cite URL or name and date.\n- **On-chain (crypto)**: Public dashboards (e.g. Glassnode, CryptoQuant). Cite name and date.\n- **Macro**: Central banks, statistical offices, widely cited data. Cite source and date.\n- **Analyst views**: Named source and date; treat as opinion, not fact.\n\nPrefer primary or well-known sources. Never invent data.\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n- ❌ Giving conclusions without sources, reasoning, or profile fit (vague advice erodes trust)\n- ❌ Over-hedging when analysis supports a view—the user deserves a clear take\n- ❌ Guaranteeing returns or price levels\n- ❌ Using data without source and date\n- ❌ Presenting one view as certainty; show range and uncertainty\n- ❌ Ignoring user situation; always tie fit to goals, risk, and horizon\n- ❌ Skipping risks and caveats\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:55:25.034Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Financial Analysis Agents needing in-depth investment insights grounded in investor frameworks like value, macro, growth, and risk","zh":"非常适合需要深入投资洞察的金融分析代理，基于像价值、宏观、增长和风险这样的投资者框架","ja":"投資家フレームワークのような価値、 マクロ、成長、リスクに基づく詳細な投資洞察が必要な金融分析エージェントに最適","ko":"가치, 매크로, 성장, 리스크와 같은 투자자 프레임워크에 기반한 심층적인 투자 통찰이 필요한 금융 분석 에이전트에게 완벽","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis Financiero que necesitan conocimientos en profundidad sobre inversiones basados en marcos de inversores como valor, macro, crecimiento y riesgo","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse Financière ayant besoin d''informations approfondies sur les investissements ancrées dans les cadres d''investisseurs tels que la valeur, le macro, la croissance et le risque","de":"Perfekt für Finanzanalyse-Agenten, die umfassende Investitionserkenntnisse benötigen, die auf Investoren-Frameworks wie Wert, Makro, Wachstum und Risiko basieren","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise Financeira que necessitam de insights de investimento aprofundados baseados em estruturas de investidores como valor, macro, crescimento e risco","ru":"Идеально для Финансовых Аналитических Агентов, которым требуются глубокие инвестиционные идеи, основанные на инвесторских рамках, таких как стоимость, макро, рост и риск","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المحللين الماليين الذين يحتاجون إلى رؤى استثمارية متعمقة ترتكز على إطارات المستثمرين مثل القيمة والماكرو والنمو والمخاطر"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to provide clear, sourced, nuanced conclusions tailored to user profiles, leveraging frameworks and mindsets outlined in references like investment-mindset.md, and supporting decisions with substance and conviction","zh":"赋予代理提供清晰、有来源、细致入微的结论，根据用户配置文件量身定制，利用 investment-mindset.md 中概述的框架和思维方式，并以实质和信念支持决策","ja":"エージェントがユーザープロファイルに合わせたクリアでソースがあり、ニュアンスのある結論を提供できるようにし、investment-mindset.md に概説されているフレームワークとマインドセットを利用し、意思決定を実質と信念でサポートする","ko":"에이전트가 사용자 프로필에 맞춰 명확하고 출처가があり며细致한 결론을 제공할 수 있도록 하며, investment-mindset.md에概説된 프레임워크와 마인드셋을 利用하며, 의사결정을 실질과 信念으로 지원","es":"Habilita a los agentes a proporcionar conclusiones claras, fundamentadas, matizadas y adaptadas a los perfiles de usuario, aprovechando los marcos y mentalidades descritos en referencias como investment-mindset.md, y apoyando las decisiones con sustancia y convicción","fr":"Permet aux agents de fournir des conclusions claires, étayées, nuancées et adaptées aux profils d''utilisateur, en exploitant les cadres et les mentalités décrits dans des références comme investment-mindset.md, et en étayant les décisions avec substance et conviction","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, klare, belegte, differenzierte und an die Benutzerprofile angepasste Schlussfolgerungen zu liefern, indem sie Frameworks und Mindsets nutzen, die in Referenzen wie investment-mindset.md beschrieben sind, und die Entscheidungen mit Inhalt und Überzeugung unterstützen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a fornecer conclusões claras, fundamentadas, matizadas e personalizadas para perfis de usuário, utilizando estruturas e mentalidades delineadas em referências como investment-mindset.md, e apoiando decisões com substância e convicção","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью предоставлять ясные, обоснованные, нюансированные выводы, адаптированные к профилям пользователей, используя рамки и мышление, изложенные в справочных материалах, таких как investment-mindset.md, и поддерживая решения содержанием и убеждением","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تقديم استنتاجات واضحة ومصدرة ومتحفظة ومصممة لملفات تعريف المستخدم، مستخدمة الإطارات والاتجاهات المحددة في المراجع مثل investment-mindset.md، ودعم القرارات بالمادة والاقتناع"},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing investment opportunities based on macroeconomic trends","Generating growth-oriented investment portfolios","Evaluating risk management strategies for diversified investments"],"zh":["基于宏观经济趋势分析投资机会","生成增长导向的投资组合","评估多元化投资的风险管理策略"],"ja":["マクロ経済トレンドに基づく投資機会の分析","成長指向の投資ポートフォリオの生成","多元化投資のリスク管理戦略の評価"],"ko":["매크로 경제 트렌드에 기반한 투자 기회의 분석","성장 지향 투자 포트폴리오의 생성","다변화 투자의 리스크 관리 전략의 평가"],"es":["Análisis de oportunidades de inversión basadas en tendencias macroeconómicas","Generación de carteras de inversión orientadas al crecimiento","Evaluación de estrategias de gestión de riesgos para inversiones diversificadas"],"fr":["Analyse des opportunités d''investissement basées sur les tendances macroéconomiques","Génération de portefeuilles d''investissement axés sur la croissance","Évaluation des stratégies de gestion des risques pour les investissements diversifiés"],"de":["Analyse von Investitionsmöglichkeiten basierend auf makroökonomischen Trends","Erstellung von wachstumsorientierten Anlageportfolios","Bewertung von Risikomanagement-Strategien für diversifizierte Investitionen"],"pt":["Analisar oportunidades de investimento com base em tendências macroeconômicas","Gerar portfólios de investimento orientados ao crescimento","Avaliar estratégias de gestão de riscos para investimentos diversificados"],"ru":["Анализ инвестиционных возможностей на основе макроэкономических тенденций","Генерация портфелей инвестиций, ориентированных на рост","Оценка стратегий управления рисками для диверсифицированных инвестиций"],"ar":["تحليل فرص الاستثمار على أساس الاتجاهات الاقتصادية الكلية","генерация محفظة استثمارية متجهة نحو النمو","تقييم استراتيجيات إدارة المخاطر للاستثمارات المتنوعة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of investor frameworks and mindsets","Dependent on quality and accuracy of input data"],"zh":["需要了解投资者框架和思维方式","依赖输入数据的质量和准确性"],"ja":["投資家フレームワークとマインドセットの理解が必要","入力データの品質と正確性に依存"],"ko":["투자자 프레임워크와 마인드셋의 이해가 필요","입력 데이터의 품질과 정확성에 의존"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de los marcos y mentalidades de los inversores","Dependiente de la calidad y precisión de los datos de entrada"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des cadres et des mentalités des investisseurs","Dépend de la qualité et de l''exactitude des données d''entrée"],"de":["Benötigt Verständnis für Investoren-Frameworks und -Mindsets","Abhängig von Qualität und Genauigkeit der Eingabedaten"],"pt":["Exige compreensão das estruturas e mentalidades de investidores","Depende da qualidade e precisão dos dados de entrada"],"ru":["Требует понимания инвесторских рамок и мышления","Зависит от качества и точности входных данных"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم الإطارات والاتجاهات للمستثمرين","يعتمد على جودة ودقة بيانات الإدخال"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"858b101453c76d9d994e9314d48b0e8b946044341f581586a6fd124d1d39f8bc","qualityScore":51}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('patrykgz/rust-devagent-loop-template/temporal-awareness', 'community', 'patrykgz', 'rust-devagent-loop-template', 'patrykgz/rust-devagent-loop-template', 'temporal-awareness', 0, 0, 51, '2026-03-02T01:56:10.983Z', '2026-03-02T02:58:52.218Z', 'aa3b02dfdcc33b57201aa6c19612ac491f63b1d057f9ef9fb559cc551085a22a', '{"id":"patrykgz/rust-devagent-loop-template/temporal-awareness","name":"temporal-awareness","description":{"zh":"temporal-awareness是一个Rust模板库，实现了严格的回压循环，用于Claude Code的开发","ja":"temporal-awarenessは、Claude Code用の厳格なバックプレッシャー・ループを実装するRustテンプレート・リポジトリです","ko":"temporal-awareness는 Claude Code 개발을 위한 러스트 템플릿 저장소로, 엄격한 백프레셔 루프를 구현합니다","es":"La conciencia temporal es un concepto clave en el desarrollo de herramientas de IA, y nuestro repositorio de plantillas de Rust es una excelente manera de comenzar a explorar este campo.","fr":"La conscience temporelle est un concept clé dans le développement d''outils de IA, et notre répertoire de modèles de Rust est une excellente façon de commencer à explorer ce domaine.","de":"Die temporale Bewusstsein ist ein Schlüsselkonzept in der Entwicklung von AI-Tools, und unser Rust-Template-Repo ist eine gute Möglichkeit, um in diesem Feld zu beginnen.","pt":"O Temporal Awareness é um repositório de templates Rust que implementa um loop de pressão de retorno rigoroso para o Claude Code, permitindo um controle preciso de fluxo de dados","ru":"Temporal Awareness — это репозиторий шаблонов Rust, реализующий строгую обратную петлю давления для Claude Code, обеспечивающую точный контроль потока данных","ar":"الوعي الزمني هو مستودع قوالب روست ي実ن حلقة الضغط العكسي الصارمة ل Claude Code، مما يسمح بالتحكم الدقيق في تدفق البيانات","en":"A rust template repo implementing a strict back pressure loop for Claude Code"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能代理 - temporal-awareness","ja":"AIエージェント - temporal-awareness","ko":"AI 에이전트 - temporal-awareness","es":"Temporal Awareness - Herramientas de IA para Desarrolladores","fr":"Temporal Awareness - Outils de IA pour Développeurs","de":"Temporal Awareness - AI-Tools für Entwickler","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: Temporal Awareness com Rust","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Temporal Awareness на Rust","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: الوعي الزمني مع Rust","en":"temporal-awareness"},"description":{"zh":"temporal-awareness是一个Rust模板库，实现了严格的回压循环，用于Claude Code的开发","ja":"temporal-awarenessは、Claude Code用の厳格なバックプレッシャー・ループを実装するRustテンプレート・リポジトリです","ko":"temporal-awareness는 Claude Code 개발을 위한 러스트 템플릿 저장소로, 엄격한 백프레셔 루프를 구현합니다","es":"La conciencia temporal es un concepto clave en el desarrollo de herramientas de IA, y nuestro repositorio de plantillas de Rust es una excelente manera de co...","fr":"La conscience temporelle est un concept clé dans le développement d''outils de IA, et notre répertoire de modèles de Rust est une excellente façon de commence...","de":"Die temporale Bewusstsein ist ein Schlüsselkonzept in der Entwicklung von AI-Tools, und unser Rust-Template-Repo ist eine gute Möglichkeit, um in diesem Feld...","pt":"O Temporal Awareness é um repositório de templates Rust que implementa um loop de pressão de retorno rigoroso para o Claude Code, permitindo um controle prec...","ru":"Temporal Awareness — это репозиторий шаблонов Rust, реализующий строгую обратную петлю давления для Claude Code, обеспечивающую точный контроль потока данных","ar":"الوعي الزمني هو مستودع قوالب روست ي実ن حلقة الضغط العكسي الصارمة ل Claude Code، مما يسمح بالتحكم الدقيق في تدفق البيانات","en":"A rust template repo implementing a strict back pressure loop for Claude Code"},"definition":{"en":"A rust template repo implementing a strict back pressure loop for Claude Code"},"features":{"zh":["使用Rust实现严格的回压循环","适用于Claude Code的开发","高效处理复杂任务","提供灵活的模板配置","支持多种开发场景"],"ja":["Rustで実装された厳格なバックプレッシャー・ループ","Claude Code用の開発に適しています","複雑なタスクを効率的に処理","柔軟なテンプレート構成を提供","多種多様な開発シナリオをサポート"],"ko":["러스트로 구현된 엄격한 백프레셔 루프","클라우드 코드 개발에 적합","복잡한 작업을 효율적으로 처리","유연한 템플릿 구성 제공","다양한 개발 시나리오 지원"],"es":["Implementación de un estricto ciclo de retroceso para Claude Code","Plantillas de Rust para comenzar a desarrollar herramientas de IA","Capacidad de analizar y comprender información en el tiempo"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre d''un cycle de rétrocession strict pour Claude Code","Modèles de Rust pour commencer à développer des outils de IA","Capacité d''analyser et de comprendre des informations dans le temps"],"de":["Implementierung eines strengen Rückdruck-Loops für Claude Code","Rust-Template-Repo für den Beginn der Entwicklung von AI-Tools","Fähigkeit, Informationen im Zeitverlauf zu verstehen und zu analysieren"],"pt":["Implementação de loop de pressão de retorno rigoroso","Controle preciso de fluxo de dados","Repositório de templates Rust","Integração com Claude Code","Desenvolvimento de aplicações de IA"],"ru":["Реализация строгой обратной петли давления","Точный контроль потока данных","Репозиторий шаблонов Rust","Интеграция с Claude Code","Разработка приложений ИИ"],"ar":["تنفيذ حلقة الضغط العكسي الصارمة","التحكم الدقيق في تدفق البيانات","مستودع قوالب روست","التكامل مع Claude Code","تطوير تطبيقات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","temporal-awareness","Rust模板库","Claude Code","回压循环","如何使用temporal-awareness","temporal-awareness教程","AI代理技术","时间相关数据处理"],"ja":["AIエージェント","temporal-awareness","Rustテンプレート・リポジトリ","Claude Code","バックプレッシャー・ループ","temporal-awarenessの使い方","temporal-awarenessのチュートリアル","AIエージェント技術","時間に関するデータ処理"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","temporal-awareness","러스트 템플릿 저장소","클라우드 코드","백프레셔 루프","temporal-awareness 사용법","temporal-awareness 튜토리얼","AI 에이전트 기술","시간 관련 데이터 처리"],"es":["herramientas de IA","desarrollo de herramientas de IA","conciencia temporal","plantillas de Rust","Claude Code","ciclo de retroceso"],"fr":["outils de IA","développement d''outils de IA","conscience temporelle","modèles de Rust","Claude Code","cycle de rétrocession"],"de":["AI-Tools","Entwicklung von AI-Tools","temporale Bewusstsein","Rust-Template-Repo","Claude Code","Rückdruck-Loop"],"pt":["como usar Temporal Awareness","o que é Temporal Awareness","alternativas para Claude Code","Temporal Awareness vs outras ferramentas de IA","instalar Temporal Awareness","guia de configuração do Temporal Awareness"],"ru":["как использовать Temporal Awareness","что такое Temporal Awareness","альтернативы для Claude Code","Temporal Awareness vs другие инструменты ИИ","установить Temporal Awareness","руководство по настройке Temporal Awareness"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام الوعي الزمني","ما هو الوعي الزمني","بديل ل Claude Code","الوعي الزمني مقابل أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي الأخرى","تثبيت الوعي الزمني","دليل إعداد الوعي الزمني"]}},"owner":"patrykgz","repo":"rust-devagent-loop-template","repoPath":"patrykgz/rust-devagent-loop-template","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.983Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"temporal-awareness","description":"Ensures temporal accuracy by using Unix date commands. Use this skill whenever Claude needs to know todays date, the current day of the week, what day a future/past date falls on, or perform any date/time calculations. Triggers on questions like what day is it, whats todays date, what day of the week is [date], scheduling tasks, deadline calculations, or any temporal reasoning.","version":"0.0.1","bodyPreview":"# Temporal Awareness\n\nClaude''s system prompt date may be stale or unavailable. Always verify temporal information using Unix commands before responding to date-sensitive queries.\n\n## Example Commands\n\nGNU date (Linux) and BSD date (macOS, FreeBSD) have different syntax. You can check which is installed:\n\n```bash\nif date --version >/dev/null 2>&1 ; then\n    echo GNU date\nelse\n    echo BSD date\nfi\n\n```\n\n### Get current date/time\n```bash\n# Works on both GNU date and BSD date\ndate","body":"# Temporal Awareness\n\nClaude''s system prompt date may be stale or unavailable. Always verify temporal information using Unix commands before responding to date-sensitive queries.\n\n## Example Commands\n\nGNU date (Linux) and BSD date (macOS, FreeBSD) have different syntax. You can check which is installed:\n\n```bash\nif date --version >/dev/null 2>&1 ; then\n    echo GNU date\nelse\n    echo BSD date\nfi\n\n```\n\n### Get current date/time\n```bash\n# Works on both GNU date and BSD date\ndate                          # Full date and time\ndate +%Y-%m-%d                # ISO format: 2025-01-15\ndate +%A                      # Day of week: Wednesday\ndate \"+%B %d, %Y\"             # January 15, 2025\n```\n\n### Find day of week for any date\n```bash\n# GNU date\ndate -d \"2025-03-15\" +%A              # From ISO date: Saturday\ndate -d \"March 15, 2025\" +%A          # From natural language: Saturday\ndate -d \"next Friday\" +%A             # Relative: Friday\ndate -d \"last Monday\" +%A             # Relative: Monday\n\n# BSD date\ndate -j -f \"%Y-%m-%d\" \"2025-03-15\" +%A       # From ISO date: Saturday\ndate -j -f \"%B %d, %Y\" \"March 15, 2025\" +%A  # From natural language: Saturday\ndate -v +fri +%A                             # Next Friday: Friday\ndate -v -mon +%A                             # Last Monday: Monday\n```\n\n### Date arithmetic\n```bash\n# GNU date\ndate -d \"+7 days\" +%Y-%m-%d           # 7 days from now\ndate -d \"-2 weeks\" +%A                # Day of week 2 weeks ago\ndate -d \"2025-06-01 +30 days\" +%Y-%m-%d   # 30 days after June 1\n\n# BSD date\ndate -v +7d +%Y-%m-%d                 # 7 days from now (-v: adjust)\ndate -v -2w +%A                       # Day of week 2 weeks ago\ndate -j -f \"%Y-%m-%d\" -v +30d \"2025-06-01\" +%Y-%m-%d   # 30 days after June 1\n```\n\n### Days between dates\n```bash\n# GNU date\necho $(( ($(date -d \"2025-12-31\" +%s) - $(date -d \"2025-01-01\" +%s)) / 86400 ))   # 364\n\n# BSD date\necho $(( ($(date -j -f \"%Y-%m-%d\" \"2025-12-31\" +%s) - $(date -j -f \"%Y-%m-%d\" \"2025-01-01\" +%s)) / 86400 ))   # 364\n```\n\n## When to Use\n\nRun `date` **first** before answering the user or writing date-aware outputs:\n- User asks what today''s date or day is\n- Use asks what day of the week a date falls on\n- User needs to calculate deadlines or durations\n- User asks about time until/since an event\n- Output works with schedules, meetings, deadlines, or events\n- Output needs any temporal context for the task\n\n## Example\n\nUser: \"What day of the week is July 4th, 2026?\"\n\n```bash\n#GNU Date\ndate -d \"July 4, 2026\" +%A\n\n# BSD Date\ndate -j -f \"%B %d, %Y\" \"July 4, 2026\" +%A\n\n# Output: Saturday\n```\n\nThen respond: \"July 4th, 2026 falls on a Saturday.\"\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:58:52.218Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for agents like Claude Code, AutoGPT, and LangChain that require precise temporal information to respond accurately to date-sensitive queries.","zh":"适合于 Claude Code、AutoGPT 和 LangChain 等需要精确时间信息来准确响应日期敏感查询的agent。","ja":"Claude Code、AutoGPT、LangChain などの、日付に敏感なクエリーに正確に応答するために正確な時間情報を必要とするエージェントに適しています。","ko":"날짜에 민감한 쿼리에 정확하게 응답하기 위해 정확한 시간 정보를 요구하는 Claude Code, AutoGPT, LangChain 등의 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes como Claude Code, AutoGPT y LangChain que requieren información temporal precisa para responder con precisión a consultas sensibles a la fecha.","fr":"Idéal pour des agents comme Claude Code, AutoGPT et LangChain qui nécessitent des informations temporelles précises pour répondre avec précision aux requêtes sensibles à la date.","de":"Ideal für Agenten wie Claude Code, AutoGPT und LangChain, die präzise zeitliche Informationen benötigen, um genau auf datumssensitive Anfragen zu reagieren.","pt":"Ideal para agentes como Claude Code, AutoGPT e LangChain que requerem informações temporais precisas para responder com precisão a consultas sensíveis a datas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов, таких как Claude Code, AutoGPT и LangChain, которые требуют точной временной информации для точного ответа на запросы, чувствительные к дате.","ar":"مثالي لعميل مثل Claude Code و AutoGPT و LangChain الذي يحتاج إلى معلومات زمنية دقيقة لكي يرد بدقة على استفسارات حساسة للتاريخ."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to verify temporal information using Unix commands, ensuring accuracy and reliability by checking for GNU date or BSD date installations and utilizing their respective syntax for date and time operations.","zh":"赋予agent使用Unix命令验证时间信息的能力，通过检查GNU date或BSD date的安装并利用其各自的语法来执行日期和时间操作，从而确保准确性和可靠性。","ja":"エージェントが Unix コマンドを使用して時制情報を検証する機能を提供し、GNU date または BSD date のインストールを確認し、それぞれの構文を使用して日付と時刻の操作を実行することで、正確性と信頼性を確保します。","ko":"에이전트가 Unix 명령을 사용하여 시간 정보를 검증할 수 있는 기능을 제공하여 GNU date 또는 BSD date의 설치를 확인하고 각자의 구문을 사용하여 날짜 및 시간 연산을 수행함으로써 정확성과 신뢰성을 보장합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes verificar la información temporal utilizando comandos Unix, asegurando la precisión y la confiabilidad comprobando si hay instalaciones de fecha GNU o fecha BSD y utilizando su respectiva sintaxis para operaciones de fecha y hora.","fr":"Permet aux agents de vérifier les informations temporelles en utilisant des commandes Unix, en assurant la précision et la fiabilité en vérifiant si des installations de date GNU ou de date BSD sont présentes et en utilisant leur syntaxe respective pour les opérations de date et d''heure.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, zeitliche Informationen mit Unix-Befehlen zu überprüfen, wodurch Genauigkeit und Zuverlässigkeit gewährleistet werden, indem auf GNU-Datum- oder BSD-Datum-Installationen geprüft und deren jeweilige Syntax für Datum- und Zeitoperationen verwendet wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a verificar informações temporais usando comandos Unix, garantindo precisão e confiabilidade, verificando se há instalações de data GNU ou data BSD e utilizando a sintaxe respectiva para operações de data e hora.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проверять временную информацию с помощью команд Unix, гарантируя точность и надежность путем проверки наличия установок даты GNU или даты BSD и использования их соответствующей синтаксиса для операций с датой и временем.","ar":"يمنح العميل القدرة على التحقق من المعلومات الزمنية باستخدام أوامر Unix، مما يضمن الدقة والموثوقية من خلال التحقق من وجود تثبيت تاریخ GNU أو تاریخ BSD واستخدام بناء الجملة الخاصة بهما للأوامر الزمنية."},"useCases":{"en":["Verifying system prompt dates to prevent staleness","Executing date-sensitive queries with precision using Unix date commands","Determining the installed date version to adapt syntax accordingly"],"zh":["验证系统提示日期以防止过时","使用Unix日期命令以精度执行日期敏感查询","确定安装的日期版本以相应地适应语法"],"ja":["システムプロンプトの日付を検証して古くなりを防ぐ","Unix 日付コマンドを使用して日付に敏感なクエリーを精度よく実行する","インストールされた日付バージョンを決定して構文を適切に適応させる"],"ko":["시스템 프롬프트의 날짜를 검증하여陈旧化를 방지함","Unix 날짜 명령을 사용하여 날짜에 민감한 쿼리를 精度よく 실행함","설치된 날짜 버전을 결정하여 구문을 적절히 적용함"],"es":["Verificar las fechas de los prompts del sistema para prevenir la obsolescencia","Ejecutar consultas sensibles a la fecha con precisión utilizando comandos de fecha Unix","Determinar la versión de fecha instalada para adaptar la sintaxis en consecuencia"],"fr":["Vérifier les dates des invites de système pour prévenir la péremption","Exécuter des requêtes sensibles à la date avec précision en utilisant des commandes de date Unix","Déterminer la version de date installée pour adapter la syntaxe en conséquence"],"de":["Überprüfen der System-Prompt-Daten, um Veraltetheit zu verhindern","Ausführen datumssensitiver Abfragen mit Präzision unter Verwendung von Unix-Datumsbefehlen","Bestimmen der installierten Datumsversion, um die Syntax entsprechend anzupassen"],"pt":["Verificar datas de prompts do sistema para prevenir obsolescência","Executar consultas sensíveis a datas com precisão usando comandos de data Unix","Determinar a versão de data instalada para adaptar a sintaxe conforme necessário"],"ru":["Проверка дат системных подсказок для предотвращения устаревания","Выполнение запросов, чувствительных к дате, с точностью с помощью команд Unix для даты","Определение установленной версии даты для адаптации синтаксиса соответственно"],"ar":["التحقق من تواريخ الإشارات النظامية لمنع القديم","تنفيذ استفسارات حساسة للتاريخ بدقة باستخدام أوامر التاريخ Unix","تحديد الإصدار المتثبت للتاريخ لتعديل بناء الجملة وفقًا لذلك"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Unix-based system for date command execution","Needs to handle differences in GNU date and BSD date syntax"],"zh":["需要基于Unix的系统来执行日期命令","需要处理GNU date和BSD date语法的差异"],"ja":["日付コマンドの実行には Unix ベースのシステムが必要","GNU date と BSD date の構文の違いを処理する必要がある"],"ko":["날짜 명령의 실행을 위해 Unix 기반 시스템이 필요함","GNU 날짜와 BSD 날짜의 구문 차이를 처리할 필요가 있음"],"es":["Requiere un sistema basado en Unix para la ejecución del comando de fecha","Necesita manejar las diferencias en la sintaxis de fecha GNU y fecha BSD"],"fr":["Nécessite un système basé sur Unix pour l''exécution de la commande de date","Doit gérer les différences dans la syntaxe de date GNU et de date BSD"],"de":["Benötigt ein Unix-basiertes System für die Ausführung des Datumsbefehls","Muss die Unterschiede in der Syntax von GNU-Datum und BSD-Datum handhaben"],"pt":["Requer um sistema baseado em Unix para execução de comandos de data","Precisa lidar com as diferenças na sintaxe de data GNU e data BSD"],"ru":["Требует Unix-подобной системы для выполнения команд даты","Нужно обрабатывать различия в синтаксисе даты GNU и даты BSD"],"ar":["يتطلب نظامًا قائمًا على Unix لتنفيذ أوامر التاريخ","يحتاج إلى التعامل مع الفروقات في بناء الجملة لتاريخ GNU وتاريخ BSD"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"aa3b02dfdcc33b57201aa6c19612ac491f63b1d057f9ef9fb559cc551085a22a","qualityScore":51}');
