트 비교"],"es":["herramientas de AI","datos estáticos","TILDA","OpenStreetMap","infraestructura de bicicletas","aparcamiento","cómo usar TILDA","guía de instalación de TILDA","alternativas a TILDA"],"fr":["outils d''IA","données statiques","TILDA","OpenStreetMap","infrastructure de bicyclette","stationnement","comment utiliser TILDA","guide d''installation de TILDA","alternatives à TILDA"],"de":["KI-Tools","statische Daten","TILDA","OpenStreetMap","Fahrradinfrastruktur","Parkinfrastruktur","wie man TILDA verwendet","TILDA-Installationsanleitung","Alternativen zu TILDA"],"pt":["como usar TILDA","o que é TILDA","ferramentas de IA para dados estáticos","TILDA vs outras ferramentas","instalar TILDA","guia de configuração do TILDA","TILDA para staff administrativo","acesso a dados de infraestrutura"],"ru":["как использовать TILDA","что такое TILDA","ИИ Агенты для статических данных","TILDA vs другие инструменты","установить TILDA","руководство по настройке TILDA","TILDA для административного персонала","доступ к данным о инфраструктуре"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام TILDA","ما هي TILDA","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للبيانات الثابتة","TILDA مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت TILDA","دليل إعداد TILDA","TILDA لأفراد الموظفين الإداريين","الوصول إلى بيانات البنية التحتية"]}},"owner":"FixMyBerlin","repo":"tilda-geo","repoPath":"FixMyBerlin/tilda-geo","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.002Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"add-static-dataset","description":"Add a new static dataset to app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson. Infers config from prompt, asks for missing data, uses types to guide required fields.","bodyPreview":"# Add Static Dataset\n\nAdds a new static dataset folder to `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson`. The `/geojson` folder is a symlink.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- User wants to add a new GeoJSON dataset\n- User mentions adding static data, geojson files, \"uploads\", or datasets\n- User provides a geojson file path and wants it integrated\n\n## Required Information\n\nExtract from user prompt or ask if missing:\n\n1. **Group folder** (e.g., `region-berlin`, `region-bb`) - parent folder name\n2. **Sub-folder name** (e.","body":"# Add Static Dataset\n\nAdds a new static dataset folder to `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson`. The `/geojson` folder is a symlink.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- User wants to add a new GeoJSON dataset\n- User mentions adding static data, geojson files, \"uploads\", or datasets\n- User provides a geojson file path and wants it integrated\n\n## Required Information\n\nExtract from user prompt or ask if missing:\n\n1. **Group folder** (e.g., `region-berlin`, `region-bb`) - parent folder name\n2. **Sub-folder name** (e.g., `berlin-bezirke`) - dataset folder name (must be valid slug). **Must include region/group prefix**: for `region-berlin` use `berlin-<name>`, not just `<name>`\n3. **GeoJSON file path** - absolute path to source file on disk\n4. **Regions** - array of region slugs (e.g., `[''infravelo'']`, `[''berlin'']`)\n5. **Optional**: transformation needs, style preferences, category, attribution, license\n\n## Process\n\n### 1. Create Folder Structure\n\n```bash\napp/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson/<GROUP_FOLDER>/<SUB_FOLDER>/\n```\n\n**Important**: `/geojson` is a symlink. Create folders in `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson/` path.\n\nCreate directory if group folder doesn''t exist. Ensure sub-folder name follows naming convention (see Required Information above).\n\n### 2. Move GeoJSON File\n\n- Move source file to `<SUB_FOLDER>/<FILENAME>.geojson`\n- Run prettier from `app/` directory (prettier config is in app/): `cd app && bunx prettier --write scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson/<GROUP_FOLDER>/<SUB_FOLDER>/<FILENAME>.geojson`\n\n### 3. Create transform.ts (if needed)\n\nOnly if transformation required. Use helpers from `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson/_utils`:\n\n- `transformUtils.ts` - property transformations\n- `defaultLayerStyles.ts` - default styling helpers\n- `translateUtils.ts` - translation helpers\n\nExample:\n\n```typescript\nimport { FeatureCollection } from \"geojson\";\n\nexport const transform = (data: FeatureCollection) => {\n  // Use helper functions from _utils when possible\n  return data;\n};\n```\n\n### 4. Create meta.ts\n\n**Critical**: Research similar datasets in same group folder first.\n\n**Before writing meta.ts**:\n\n1. List all datasets in `<GROUP_FOLDER>/` directory\n2. Read 2-3 similar `meta.ts` files (similar geometry type, similar purpose)\n3. Infer patterns:\n   - Category from similar datasets\n   - Attribution patterns\n   - License conventions\n   - Style patterns\n   - Inspector settings\n4. If unclear, ask user to confirm or provide missing data\n\n**Required fields** (from `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/types.ts`):\n\n- `regions`: RegionSlug[] (required)\n- `public`: boolean (required)\n- `dataSourceType`: ''local'' (required)\n- `configs`: Array with at least one config (required)\n\n**Config required fields**:\n\n- `name`: string\n- `attributionHtml`: string\n- `inspector`: { enabled: boolean, ... } or { enabled: false }\n- `layers`: Layer[] (required)\n\n**Config optional fields**:\n\n- `category`: StaticDatasetCategoryKey | null\n- `updatedAt`: string\n- `description`: string\n- `dataSourceMarkdown`: string\n- `licence`: License type (see types.ts)\n- `licenceOsmCompatible`: ''licence'' | ''waiver'' | ''no''\n- `legends`: Legend[]\n\n**Style/Legend**: If not specified, make best guess:\n\n- Use `defaultLayerStyles()` from `_utils/defaultLayerStyles.ts` for simple cases\n- For polygons: fill + outline\n- For lines: colored line with width\n- For points: circle markers\n- Create appropriate legend entries\n\n**Example structure**:\n\n```typescript\nimport { MetaData } from \"../../../types\";\nimport { defaultLayerStyles } from \"../../_utils/defaultLayerStyles\";\n\nexport const data: MetaData = {\n  regions: [\"infravelo\"], // From user or infer from group folder\n  public: true,\n  dataSourceType: \"local\",\n  configs: [\n    {\n      name: \"Dataset Name\",\n      category: \"berlin/misc\", // Infer from similar datasets\n      attributionHtml: \"Source Name\", // Ask if unclear\n      licence: \"DL-DE/ZERO-2.0\", // Infer from similar datasets\n      inspector: { enabled: false }, // Default unless specified\n      layers: defaultLayerStyles(), // Or custom layers\n    },\n  ],\n};\n```\n\n### 5. Verify Command\n\nCheck `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/updateStaticDatasets.ts` for correct params:\n\n- `--folder-filter=<SUB_FOLDER_NAME>` (matches full path, so sub-folder name works)\n- `--env=dev` (or staging/production, required)\n\n**One-click command** (replace `<SUB_FOLDER_NAME>` with actual folder name):\n\n```bash\nbun --env-file=.env ./scripts/StaticDatasets/updateStaticDatasets.ts --folder-filter=<SUB_FOLDER_NAME> --env=dev\n```\n\nNote: `updateDownloadSources.ts` is for WFS downloads (requires downloadConfig.ts). Use `updateStaticDatasets.ts` for local GeoJSON files.\n\n### 6. Verify TypeScript Compilation\n\n**Always run this after creating or modifying TypeScript files** (meta.ts, transform.ts, or any imports):\n\n```bash\nnpm run type-check:deploy\n```\n\nThis temporarily removes the `geojson` symlink, runs TypeScript type-checking, and restores the symlink. It simulates the Docker build environment where symlinks aren''t available, ensuring your code will compile correctly during builds.\n\n## Validation\n\nBefore completing:\n\n1. ✅ Folder structure created\n2. ✅ GeoJSON file moved and prettier run\n3. ✅ transform.ts created only if needed\n4. ✅ meta.ts follows type structure (check with TypeScript)\n5. ✅ Similar datasets in group folder reviewed for patterns\n6. ✅ Command verified and provided as one-click action\n7. ✅ `npm run type-check:deploy` run successfully (see Step 6)\n\n## References\n\n- Types: `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/types.ts`\n- Examples: `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson/region-berlin/*/meta.ts`\n- Utils: `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson/_utils/`\n- Docs: `docs/Features-Parameter-Deeplinks.md`, `docs/Regional-Masks.md`\n- Update script: `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/updateStaticDatasets.ts`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:05:58.295Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Geographic Information System (GIS) Agents requiring seamless integration of static GeoJSON datasets.","zh":"适用于需要无缝集成静态 GeoJSON 数据集的 Geographic Information System (GIS) Agents。","ja":"Geographic Information System (GIS) エージェントが静的 GeoJSON データセットを無制限に統合する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"정적 GeoJSON 데이터셋을 무제한으로 통합해야 하는 Geographic Information System (GIS) 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de Sistemas de Información Geográfica (GIS) que requieren una integración perfecta de conjuntos de datos GeoJSON estáticos.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de Système d''Information Géographique (GIS) nécessitant une intégration transparente des jeux de données GeoJSON statiques.","de":"Ideal für Geographic Information System (GIS) Agents, die eine nahtlose Integration statischer GeoJSON-Datensätze erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Sistema de Informação Geográfica (GIS) que exigem integração perfeita de conjuntos de dados GeoJSON estáticos.","ru":"Идеально для Географических Информационных Систем (GIS) агентов, требующих бесшовной интеграции статических наборов данных GeoJSON.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل لنظام المعلومات الجغرافية (GIS) التي تتطلب تكاملًا بدون فواصل لمجموعات بيانات GeoJSON الثابتة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to efficiently manage and add new static dataset folders to the `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson` directory, utilizing GeoJSON file formats and symlinks for streamlined data access and analysis.","zh":"使得代理能够高效地管理和添加新的静态数据集文件夹到 `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson` 目录中，利用 GeoJSON 文件格式和符号链接实现流畅的数据访问和分析。","ja":"エージェントが `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson` ディレクトリに新しい静的データセットフォルダーを効率的に管理および追加できるようにし、GeoJSON ファイル形式とシンボリックリンクを使用してスムーズなデータアクセスと分析を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson` 디렉토리에 새로운 정적 데이터셋 폴더를 효율적으로 관리하고 추가할 수 있도록 하며, GeoJSON 파일 형식과 심볼릭 링크를 사용하여 데이터 액세스와 분석을 원활하게 수행합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes gestionar y agregar eficientemente nuevas carpetas de conjuntos de datos estáticos al directorio `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson`, utilizando formatos de archivo GeoJSON y enlaces simbólicos para un acceso y análisis de datos optimizado.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer et d''ajouter efficacement de nouveaux dossiers de jeux de données statiques au répertoire `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson`, en utilisant les formats de fichiers GeoJSON et les liens symboliques pour un accès et une analyse des données rationalisés.","de":"Ermöglicht Agents, neue statische Datensatzordner effizient im Verzeichnis `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson` zu verwalten und hinzuzufügen, unter Verwendung von GeoJSON-Dateiformaten und Symlinks für einen optimierten Datenzugriff und -analyse.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerenciem e adicionem novas pastas de conjuntos de dados estáticos ao diretório `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson` de forma eficiente, utilizando formatos de arquivo GeoJSON e symlinks para acesso e análise de dados otimizados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью эффективно управлять и добавлять новые папки статических наборов данных в директорию `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson`, используя форматы файлов GeoJSON и symlinks для оптимизированного доступа и анализа данных.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من إدارة وأضافة مجلدات جديدة لمجموعات البيانات الثابتة إلى الدليل `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson` بطريقة فعالة، مستخدماً تنسيقات الملفات GeoJSON والروابط الرمزية لتحقيق وصول وتحليل البيانات المُتَстраَع."},"useCases":{"en":["Adding new administrative region datasets","Integrating custom GeoJSON files for data visualization","Uploading static datasets for urban planning analysis"],"zh":["添加新的行政区域数据集","集成自定义 GeoJSON 文件以进行数据可视化","上传静态数据集以进行城市规划分析"],"ja":["新しい行政区域データセットを追加する","データ可視化のためにカスタム GeoJSON ファイルを統合する","都市計画分析のための静的データセットをアップロードする"],"ko":["新的 행정 구역 데이터셋을 추가하는 것","데이터 시각화를 위한 사용자 지정 GeoJSON 파일을 통합하는 것","도시 계획 분석을 위한 정적 데이터셋을 업로드하는 것"],"es":["Adición de nuevos conjuntos de datos de regiones administrativas","Integración de archivos GeoJSON personalizados para la visualización de datos","Carga de conjuntos de datos estáticos para análisis de planificación urbana"],"fr":["Ajout de nouveaux jeux de données de régions administratives","Intégration de fichiers GeoJSON personnalisés pour la visualisation des données","Téléchargement de jeux de données statiques pour l''analyse de la planification urbaine"],"de":["Hinzufügen neuer administrativer Regionsdatensätze","Integrieren benutzerdefinierter GeoJSON-Dateien für die Datenvisualisierung","Hochladen statischer Datensätze für die Analyse der Stadtplanung"],"pt":["Adicionar novos conjuntos de dados de regiões administrativas","Integrar arquivos GeoJSON personalizados para visualização de dados","Fazer upload de conjuntos de dados estáticos para análise de planejamento urbano"],"ru":["Добавление новых наборов данных административных регионов","Интеграция пользовательских файлов GeoJSON для визуализации данных","Загрузка статических наборов данных для анализа городского планирования"],"ar":["إضافة مجموعات بيانات جديدة لمناطق إدارية","دمج ملفات GeoJSON مخصصة لتصور البيانات","تحميل مجموعات البيانات الثابتة لتحليل تخطيط المدن"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires user-provided group folder and sub-folder names","Limited to GeoJSON file format","Dependent on access to the `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson` directory"],"zh":["需要用户提供的组文件夹和子文件夹名称","仅限于 GeoJSON 文件格式","依赖于对 `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson` 目录的访问"],"ja":["ユーザー提供のグループフォルダーとサブフォルダーの名前が必要","GeoJSON ファイル形式のみ","`app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson` ディレクトリへのアクセスに依存"],"ko":["사용자 제공 그룹 폴더 및 하위 폴더 이름이 필요","GeoJSON 파일 형식만","`app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson` 디렉토리への 액세스에 의존"],"es":["Requiere nombres de carpetas de grupo y subcarpetas proporcionados por el usuario","Limitado al formato de archivo GeoJSON","Depende del acceso al directorio `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson`"],"fr":["Nécessite des noms de dossiers de groupe et de sous-dossiers fournis par l''utilisateur","Limité au format de fichier GeoJSON","Dépend de l''accès au répertoire `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson`"],"de":["Erfordert vom Benutzer bereitgestellte Gruppenordner- und Unterordnernamen","Beschränkt auf das GeoJSON-Dateiformat","Abhängig vom Zugriff auf das Verzeichnis `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson`"],"pt":["Exige nomes de pastas e subpastas de grupo fornecidos pelo usuário","Limitado ao formato de arquivo GeoJSON","Dependente do acesso ao diretório `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson`"],"ru":["Требует предоставления пользователем имен групповых папок и подпапок","Ограничен форматом файла GeoJSON","Зависит от доступа к директорию `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson`"],"ar":["يتطلب اسماء مجلدات فرعية ومجلدات مجموعة مقدمة من قبل المستخدم","محدود بتنسيق الملف GeoJSON","يعتمد على الوصول إلى الدليل `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson`"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"dcae1b227597c1a96b7c1135632a3253ba3535a4923294dccc51f128f9ccbe06","qualityScore":51}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('heiko-braun/draft/refine', 'community', 'heiko-braun', 'draft', 'heiko-braun/draft', 'refine', 0, 0, 51, '2026-03-02T01:56:11.003Z', '2026-03-02T03:06:02.918Z', 'a465c272f8953ae45cdd237db0de329b3422998f3c7885de9bf0c62c219c7ae2', '{"id":"heiko-braun/draft/refine","name":"refine","description":{"zh":"refine 是一个轻量级框架，用于特定驱动开发，支持 Claude Code 和其他 AI 编码助手","ja":"refine は AI エージェントを使用した特定駆動開発のための軽量フレームワークです","ko":"refine는 Claude Code 및 다른 AI 코딩 도구를 사용한 구체적驱动 개발을 위한 경량 프레임워크입니다","es":"refine es un framework ligero para desarrollo de código basado en especificaciones con Claude Code y otros asistentes de codificación de IA","fr":"refine est un framework léger pour le développement de code basé sur des spécifications avec Claude Code et d''autres assistants de codage d''IA","de":"refine ist ein leichtes Framework für die Code-Entwicklung basierend auf Spezifikationen mit Claude Code und anderen KI-Coding-Assistenten","pt":"Refine é um framework leve para desenvolvimento orientado a especificações com Claude Code e outros assistentes de codificação de IA","ru":"Refine - легкий фреймворк для разработки на основе спецификаций с Claude Code и другими ИИ-ассистентами кодирования","ar":"Refine هو إطار عمل خفيف للتنمية الموجهة للمواصفات مع Claude Code ومساعدين آخرين للتعليم بالذكاء الاصطناعي","en":"A lightweight framework for spec-driven development with Claude Code and other AI coding assistants."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI开发工具 - refine","ja":"AIエージェント - refine","ko":"AI 도구 - refine","es":"Herramientas de AI: refine para desarrollo de código","fr":"Outils d''IA: refine pour le développement de code","de":"KI-Tools: refine für Code-Entwicklung","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: Refine, um framework leve para desenvo...","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Refine, легкий фреймворк для разработки","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: Refine، إطار عمل خفيف للتنمية","en":"refine"},"description":{"zh":"refine 是一个轻量级框架，用于特定驱动开发，支持 Claude Code 和其他 AI 编码助手","ja":"refine は AI エージェントを使用した特定駆動開発のための軽量フレームワークです","ko":"refine는 Claude Code 및 다른 AI 코딩 도구를 사용한 구체적驱动 개발을 위한 경량 프레임워크입니다","es":"refine es un framework ligero para desarrollo de código basado en especificaciones con Claude Code y otros asistentes de codificación de IA","fr":"refine est un framework léger pour le développement de code basé sur des spécifications avec Claude Code et d''autres assistants de codage d''IA","de":"refine ist ein leichtes Framework für die Code-Entwicklung basierend auf Spezifikationen mit Claude Code und anderen KI-Coding-Assistenten","pt":"Refine é um framework leve para desenvolvimento orientado a especificações com Claude Code e outros assistentes de codificação de IA","ru":"Refine - легкий фреймворк для разработки на основе спецификаций с Claude Code и другими ИИ-ассистентами кодирования","ar":"Refine هو إطار عمل خفيف للتنمية الموجهة للمواصفات مع Claude Code ومساعدين آخرين للتعليم بالذكاء الاصطناعي","en":"A lightweight framework for spec-driven development with Claude Code and other AI coding assistants."},"definition":{"en":"A lightweight framework for spec-driven development with Claude Code and other AI coding assistants."},"features":{"zh":["轻量级框架","支持 Claude Code 和其他 AI 编码助手","特定驱动开发","快速开发","高效开发"],"ja":["軽量フレームワーク","AI エージェントを使用した特定駆動開発","Claude Code と他の AI コーディング アシスタントをサポート","迅速な開発","効率的な開発"],"ko":["경량 프레임워크","Claude Code 및 다른 AI 코딩 도구를 사용한 구체적驱동 개발","AI 코딩 도구를 지원","迅速한 개발","효율적인 개발"],"es":["Desarrollo de código basado en especificaciones","Integración con asistentes de codificación de IA como Claude Code","Framework ligero y flexible","Soporte para múltiples lenguajes de programación","Desarrollo ágil y eficiente"],"fr":["Développement de code basé sur des spécifications","Intégration avec des assistants de codage d''IA comme Claude Code","Framework léger et flexible","Prise en charge de plusieurs langages de programmation","Développement agile et efficace"],"de":["Code-Entwicklung basierend auf Spezifikationen","Integration mit KI-Coding-Assistenten wie Claude Code","Leichtes und flexibles Framework","Unterstützung für mehrere Programmiersprachen","Agiles und effizientes Entwickeln"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento orientado a especificações","Integração com assistentes de codificação de IA","Framework leve e flexível","Suporte a Claude Code e outros assistentes de codificação","Desenvolvimento rápido e eficiente"],"ru":["Разработка на основе спецификаций","Интеграция с ИИ-ассистентами кодирования","Легкий и гибкий фреймворк","Поддержка Claude Code и других ИИ-ассистентов кодирования","Быстрая и эффективная разработка"],"ar":["التنمية الموجهة للمواصفات","التكامل مع مساعدين للتعليم بالذكاء الاصطناعي","إطار عمل خفيف وممكن","دعم Claude Code ومساعدين آخرين للتعليم","التنمية السريعة والفعالة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["how to use refine","what is refine","refine alternative","refine vs other AI tools","refine install","refine setup guide"],"ja":["how to use refine","what is refine","refine alternative","refine vs other AI tools","refine install","refine setup guide"],"ko":["how to use refine","what is refine","refine alternative","refine vs other AI tools","refine install","refine setup guide"],"es":["herramientas de AI para desarrollo","cómo usar refine","qué es refine","refine vs otros frameworks","instalación de refine","guía de configuración de refine","desarrollo de código con IA"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour le développement","comment utiliser refine","qu''est-ce que refine","refine vs autres frameworks","installation de refine","guide de configuration de refine","développement de code avec IA"],"de":["KI-Tools für die Entwicklung","wie man refine verwendet","was ist refine","refine vs andere Frameworks","Installation von refine","Konfigurationsanleitung für refine","Code-Entwicklung mit KI"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","desenvolvimento orientado a especificações","assistente de codificação de ia","claude code","refine framework","como usar refine","o que é refine","refine vs outros frameworks","instalar refine","guia de configuração do refine"],"ru":["ии агенты","разработка на основе спецификаций","ии ассистент кодирования","claude code","refine фреймворк","как использовать refine","что такое refine","refine vs другие фреймворки","установить refine","руководство по настройке refine"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","التنمية الموجهة للمواصفات","مساعد للتعليم بالذكاء الاصطناعي","claude code","إطار عمل refine","كيفية استخدام refine","ما هو refine","refine مقابل إطارات عمل أخرى","تثبيت refine","دليل إعداد refine"]}},"owner":"heiko-braun","repo":"draft","repoPath":"heiko-braun/draft","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.003Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"refine","description":"Refines existing specs","bodyPreview":"# Refine Existing Spec\n\nRefine an existing specification based on new insights, feedback, or changing requirements.\n\n**Feature to refine:** $ARGUMENTS\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. **Load the existing spec** from `/specs/{feature}.md`\n   - If no spec exists for this feature, suggest using `/spec` instead\n   - If multiple specs match, ask the user which one to refine\n\n2. **Ask 2-3 focused refinement questions** (one at a time):\n   - What aspect needs refinement? (goals, criteria, approach, scope)\n   - Wha","body":"# Refine Existing Spec\n\nRefine an existing specification based on new insights, feedback, or changing requirements.\n\n**Feature to refine:** $ARGUMENTS\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. **Load the existing spec** from `/specs/{feature}.md`\n   - If no spec exists for this feature, suggest using `/spec` instead\n   - If multiple specs match, ask the user which one to refine\n\n2. **Ask 2-3 focused refinement questions** (one at a time):\n   - What aspect needs refinement? (goals, criteria, approach, scope)\n   - What new information or feedback has emerged?\n   - Are there specific pain points with the current spec?\n\n3. **Check scope and modularity:**\n   - Does the refinement keep the spec small enough for a single vertical slice?\n   - If criteria are being added, does the total still stay at ~5 or fewer?\n   - Does the refinement change which modules are affected? Update the \"Affected Modules\" section.\n   - If the refinement significantly expands scope or blast radius, suggest a separate spec instead.\n\n4. **Update the spec in place**:\n   - **Preserve front-matter**: Keep all existing front-matter fields (title, description, author). Keep `status: proposed` (refinements don''t change status)\n   - Preserve completed acceptance criteria checkboxes\n   - Update goals, criteria, or approach as needed\n   - Update \"Affected Modules\" and \"Test Strategy\" if the changes alter them\n   - Add to \"Out of Scope\" if removing features\n   - Add refinement notes to the \"Notes\" section with timestamp\n\n5. **Show a diff summary**:\n   - Highlight what changed (goals, new criteria, removed items, affected modules, etc.)\n   - Ask for confirmation before saving\n\n6. **Get user confirmation** before proceeding to implementation\n   - If confirmed, use the **implement** skill with the refined spec\n   - If not, ask if they want to refine further\n\n## Refinement Guidelines\n\n- **Preserve progress**: Don''t uncheck completed criteria unless they''re no longer valid\n- **Be additive when possible**: Add new criteria rather than rewriting existing ones\n- **Document changes**: Always add a timestamped note explaining what was refined and why\n- **Validate scope**: Check if refinements are expanding scope significantly - if so, suggest a new spec\n- **Validate modularity**: If the refinement introduces new module dependencies or widens the blast radius, flag it explicitly\n\n## Example Refinement Note\n\n```markdown\n## Notes\n\n**Refinement 2026-01-25**: Updated approach to use WebSocket instead of polling based on performance testing results. Added new acceptance criterion for connection handling. Blast radius unchanged — change is contained within the `transport` module.\n```\n\nRemember:\n- Keep refinements focused and minimal\n- Preserve the spec''s history through notes\n- Suggest new specs for major scope changes\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:06:02.918Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Assistant Agents like Claude Code needing advanced specification refinement capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要高级规格细化功能的代码助手代理，如 Claude Code。","ja":"Claude Code のような高度な仕様の精査機能を必要とするコードアシスタントエージェントに適しています。","ko":"클로드 코드와 같은 고급 사양 세부 정보 기능이 필요한 코드 조수 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes asistentes de código como Claude Code que necesitan capacidades de refinamiento de especificaciones avanzadas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''assistance de code comme Claude Code nécessitant des capacités de raffinement de spécifications avancées.","de":"Ideal für Code-Assistenten-Agenten wie Claude Code, die erweiterte Spezifikationsverfeinerungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Assistente de Código, como Claude Code, que precisam de capacidades de refinamento de especificações avançadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов-помощников кода, таких как Claude Code, которым требуются продвинутые возможности уточнения спецификаций.","ar":"مثالي لعميل مساعد الشفرة مثل Claude Code الذي يحتاج إلى تعريف مواصفات متقدم"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to refine existing specifications using focused refinement questions, supporting spec-driven development with features like loading specs from `/specs/{feature}.md` and handling multiple spec matches, all while integrating with AI coding assistants through protocols like Markdown file analysis.","zh":"赋予代理通过专注的精化问题来完善现有的规格，支持通过特性如从 `/specs/{feature}.md` 加载规格和处理多个规格匹配来驱动开发，并通过协议如 Markdown 文件分析与 AI 编码助手集成。","ja":"エージェントに、焦点を当てた精査の質問を使用して既存の仕様を精査する機能を提供し、`/specs/{feature}.md` から仕様を読み込み、複数の仕様の一致を処理するなど、仕様駆動開発をサポートし、Markdown ファイル分析などのプロトコルを介して AI コーディング アシスタントと統合します。","ko":"대리人が焦점을 맞춘 세부 사항 질문을 사용하여 기존 사양을 세부적으로 분석할 수 있도록 하여 사양 구동 개발을 지원하고, `/specs/{feature}.md`에서 사양을 로드하고 여러 사양 일치를 처리하는 등의 기능을 제공하며, Markdown 파일 분석과 같은 프로토콜을 통해 AI 코딩 조수로 통합합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a refinar las especificaciones existentes utilizando preguntas de refinamiento enfocadas, lo que admite el desarrollo impulsado por especificaciones con características como la carga de especificaciones desde `/specs/{feature}.md` y el manejo de varias coincidencias de especificaciones, todo mientras se integra con asistentes de codificación de IA a través de protocolos como el análisis de archivos Markdown.","fr":"Permet aux agents de raffiner les spécifications existantes en utilisant des questions de raffinement ciblées, ce qui prend en charge le développement piloté par les spécifications avec des fonctionnalités comme le chargement des spécifications à partir de `/specs/{feature}.md` et la gestion de plusieurs correspondances de spécifications, le tout tout en s''intégrant avec les assistants de codage IA via des protocoles tels que l''analyse de fichiers Markdown.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, bestehende Spezifikationen mithilfe fokussierter Verfeinerungsfragen zu verfeinern, wodurch die spezifikationsgetriebene Entwicklung mit Funktionen wie dem Laden von Spezifikationen aus `/specs/{feature}.md` und dem Umgang mit mehreren Spezifikationsübereinstimmungen unterstützt wird, während gleichzeitig die Integration mit AI-Coding-Assistenten über Protokolle wie die Analyse von Markdown-Dateien erfolgt.","pt":"Permite que os agentes refine as especificações existentes usando perguntas de refinamento focadas, apoiando o desenvolvimento orientado por especificações com recursos como carregar especificações de `/specs/{feature}.md` e lidar com várias correspondências de especificações, tudo isso integrando-se com assistentes de codificação de IA por meio de protocolos como análise de arquivos Markdown.","ru":"Позволяет агентам уточнять существующие спецификации с помощью сфокусированных вопросов уточнения, поддерживая разработку, ориентированную на спецификации, с функциями, такими как загрузка спецификаций из `/specs/{feature}.md` и обработка нескольких совпадений спецификаций, все это интегрируется с помощниками кодирования ИИ через протоколы, такие как анализ файлов Markdown.","ar":"يمكن للعميل تعريف المواصفات الحالية باستخدام أسئلة دقيقة، ودعم تطوير مواصفات التوجيه باستخدام ميزات مثل تحميل المواصفات من `/specs/{feature}.md` ومعالجة مطابقات المواصفات المتعددة، كل ذلك من خلال بروتوكولات مثل تحليل ملفات Markdown."},"useCases":{"en":["Refining existing specifications based on user feedback","Loading and analyzing specs from designated directories","Asking targeted questions to clarify spec requirements"],"zh":["根据用户反馈完善现有的规格","从指定目录加载和分析规格","提出有针对性的问题以阐明规格要求"],"ja":["ユーザーのフィードバックに基づいて既存の仕様を精査する","指定されたディレクトリから仕様を読み込み分析する","仕様の要件を明確にするためにターゲットを絞った質問をする"],"ko":["사용자 피드백을 기반으로 기존 사양을 분석하는 것","지정된 디렉토리에서 사양을 로드하고 분석하는 것","사양 요구 사항을 명확히하기 위해 대상 질문을 하는 것"],"es":["Refinar las especificaciones existentes en función de la retroalimentación del usuario","Cargar y analizar las especificaciones desde directorios designados","Hacer preguntas dirigidas para aclarar los requisitos de las especificaciones"],"fr":["Raffiner les spécifications existantes en fonction des commentaires des utilisateurs","Charger et analyser les spécifications à partir de répertoires désignés","Poser des questions ciblées pour clarifier les exigences de spécification"],"de":["Bestehende Spezifikationen auf der Grundlage von Benutzerfeedback verfeinern","Spezifikationen aus bestimmten Verzeichnissen laden und analysieren","Gezielte Fragen stellen, um die Spezifikationsanforderungen zu klären"],"pt":["Refinamento de especificações existentes com base no feedback do usuário","Carregar e analisar especificações de diretórios designados","Fazer perguntas direcionadas para esclarecer requisitos de especificações"],"ru":["Уточнение существующих спецификаций на основе обратной связи пользователя","Загрузка и анализ спецификаций из назначенных каталогов","Задавание целевых вопросов для уточнения требований спецификаций"],"ar":["تعريف المواصفات الحالية بناءً على ملاحظات المستخدم","تحميل وتحليل المواصفات من الدلائل المحددة","الأسئلة المستهدفة لتوضيح متطلبات المواصفات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires existing specification files in Markdown format","Limited to refining specs within the `/specs/` directory hierarchy"],"zh":["需要现有的 Markdown 格式的规格文件","仅限于 `/specs/` 目录层次结构内的规格精化"],"ja":["既存の Markdown 形式の仕様ファイルが必要"," `/specs/` ディレクトリ階層内でのみ仕様の精査が可能"],"ko":["기존의 Markdown 형식의 사양 파일이 필요함"," `/specs/` 디렉토리 계층 구조 내에서만 사양 세부 사항 분석이 가능"],"es":["Requiere archivos de especificaciones existentes en formato Markdown","Limitado a la refinación de especificaciones dentro de la jerarquía del directorio `/specs/`"],"fr":["Nécessite des fichiers de spécification existants au format Markdown","Limité au raffinement des spécifications dans la hiérarchie du répertoire `/specs/`"],"de":["Benötigt bestehende Spezifikationsdateien im Markdown-Format","Begrenzt auf die Verfeinerung von Spezifikationen innerhalb der Verzeichnishierarchie `/specs/`"],"pt":["Exige arquivos de especificações existentes no formato Markdown","Limitado a refinar especificações dentro da hierarquia de diretórios `/specs/`"],"ru":["Требует существующих файлов спецификаций в формате Markdown","Ограничен уточнением спецификаций внутри иерархии каталогов `/specs/`"],"ar":["يتطلب ملفات مواصفات موجودة بالفعل بالتنسيق Markdown","محدود بتحسين المواصفات داخل هيكل الدلائل `/specs/`"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"a465c272f8953ae45cdd237db0de329b3422998f3c7885de9bf0c62c219c7ae2","qualityScore":51}');
