che"],"pt":["Ferramenta de AI simples para Mac","Escrita em Swift","Suportada em macOS 14+ Sonoma","Solução nativa para entrada de texto em vietnamita","Fácil de usar e instalar"],"ru":["Простой инструмент ИИ для macOS","Написанный на Swift","Поддерживаемый в macOS 14+ Sonoma","Родное решение для ввода текста на вьетнамском языке","Легко использовать и устанавливать"],"ar":["أداة ذكاء اصطناعي بسيطة للماك","مكتوبة بلغة Swift","مدعومة في macOS 14+ Sonoma","حل أصلي لإدخال النص باللغة الفيتنامية","سهل الاستخدام والتركيب"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI工具","release-app","中文输入法","Swift","macOS 14+ Sonoma","如何使用release-app","release-app安装","release-app设置指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント","release-app","ベトナム語入力法","Swift","macOS 14+ Sonoma","release-appの使い方","release-appのインストール","release-appの設定ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","release-app","베트남어 입력기","Swift","macOS 14+ Sonoma","release-app 사용법","release-app 설치","release-app 설정 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de AI para macOS","release-app alternative","cómo usar release-app","release-app vs otras herramientas","instalación de release-app","guía de configuración de release-app","desarrollo de aplicaciones para macOS","herramientas de código abierto para macOS"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour macOS","release-app alternative","comment utiliser release-app","release-app vs d''autres outils","installation de release-app","guide de configuration de release-app","développement d''applications pour macOS","outils open source pour macOS"],"de":["KI-Tools für macOS","release-app Alternative","wie man release-app verwendet","release-app vs andere Tools","Installation von release-app","Konfigurationsanleitung für release-app","Entwicklung von Anwendungen für macOS","Open-Source-Tools für macOS"],"pt":["ferramentas de AI para Mac","release-app alternative","como usar release-app","o que é release-app","instalar release-app","guias de setup para release-app"],"ru":["инструменты ИИ для macOS","release-app альтернатива","как использовать release-app","что такое release-app","установить release-app","руководства по настройке release-app"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للماك","release-app بديل","كيفية استخدام release-app","ما هو release-app","تركيب release-app","دليل إعداد release-app"]}},"owner":"khanhicetea","repo":"Caffee","repoPath":"khanhicetea/Caffee","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.110Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"release-app","description":"Automate the release process for Caffee app.","bodyPreview":"## Instructions\n\nWhen the user invokes this skill with an app path:\n\n1. **Extract version from filename**\n   - The app filename format is `Caffee-v{VERSION}.app` (e.g., `Caffee-v1.18.0.app`)\n   - Extract the version string including the ''v'' prefix (e.g., `v1.18.0`)\n   - Also extract just the number part for display (e.g., `1.18.0`)\n\n2. **Verify the app exists**\n   - Check if the provided app path exists\n   - If not, report error and stop\n\n3. **Rename app to Caffee.app**\n   - Copy/rename the app","body":"## Instructions\n\nWhen the user invokes this skill with an app path:\n\n1. **Extract version from filename**\n   - The app filename format is `Caffee-v{VERSION}.app` (e.g., `Caffee-v1.18.0.app`)\n   - Extract the version string including the ''v'' prefix (e.g., `v1.18.0`)\n   - Also extract just the number part for display (e.g., `1.18.0`)\n\n2. **Verify the app exists**\n   - Check if the provided app path exists\n   - If not, report error and stop\n\n3. **Rename app to Caffee.app**\n   - Copy/rename the app to `Caffee.app` in the same directory\n   - This ensures consistent naming when users install the app\n   - Example: `cp -R ~/Documents/Caffee-v1.18.0 ~/Documents/Caffee.app`\n\n4. **Create DMG**\n   - Run: `create-dmg Caffee.app .` (use the renamed Caffee.app)  (use which for get path)\n   - This creates a DMG in the current directory\n   - Rename the output to `Caffee-{VERSION}.dmg` (e.g., `Caffee-v1.18.0.dmg`)\n   - Clean up: remove the temporary Caffee.app copy\n\n5. **Sign the DMG**\n   - Run: `sign_update Caffee-{VERSION}.dmg` (use which for get path)\n   - Capture the output which contains:\n     - `sparkle:edSignature=\"...\"`\n     - `length=\"...\"`\n   - Parse and extract the signature and file size\n\n6. **Get file size and checksum**\n   - Get file size: `stat -f%z Caffee-{VERSION}.dmg`\n   - Get SHA256 checksum: `shasum -a 256 Caffee-{VERSION}.dmg`\n\n7. **Update web/appcast.xml**\n   - Add a new `<item>` element at the top of the channel (before existing items)\n   - Use current date in RFC 2822 format for pubDate\n   - The download URL format: `https://github.com/khanhicetea/Caffee/releases/download/{VERSION}/Caffee-{VERSION}.dmg`\n   - Include the signature and length from sign_update output\n   - If release notes provided, use them; otherwise generate from git log since previous version\n   - the <sparkle:version> should be integer, e.g., 11901 (1.19.1 => 1*10000 + 19*100 + 1)\n\n8. **Update web/index.html**\n   - Update the download button version text and link\n   - Add new release notes entry in the Release Notes section with checksum\n   - Release notes (changelogs) translate into Vietnamese\n\n9. **Update web/download.html**\n   - Update the meta refresh URL to point to the new DMG release\n   - Update the direct download link in the body\n   - URL format: `https://github.com/khanhicetea/Caffee/releases/download/{VERSION}/Caffee-{VERSION}.dmg`\n\n10. **Summary**\n   - Show summary of what was done\n   - Show the DMG path for upload to GitHub\n   - Remind user to:\n     - Upload DMG to GitHub releases at the tag `{VERSION}`\n     - Deploy updated web files\n\n## Example appcast.xml item format\n\n```xml\n<item>\n  <title>Version 1.18.0</title>\n  <sparkle:version>1</sparkle:version>\n  <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.18.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>\n  <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 30 Jan 2026 12:00:00 +0700</pubDate>\n  <enclosure\n    url=\"https://github.com/khanhicetea/Caffee/releases/download/v1.18.0/Caffee-v1.18.0.dmg\"\n    sparkle:edSignature=\"SIGNATURE_HERE\"\n    length=\"12345678\"\n    type=\"application/octet-stream\"\n  />\n  <description><![CDATA[\n    <h2>What''s New</h2>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Release notes here</li>\n    </ul>\n  ]]></description>\n</item>\n```\n\n## Example index.html updates\n\nDownload button (around line 64):\n```html\n<button class=\"secondary\" onclick=\"location.href=''/download.html?v=1.18.0''\">\n    Tải app tại đây (v1.18.0)\n</button>\n```\n\nRelease notes section (after line 240):\n```html\n<div>\n    <h5>v1.18.0</h5>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Checksum sha256 (Caffee-v1.18.0.dmg) :\n            <code>CHECKSUM_HERE</code>\n        </li>\n        <li>Release notes here</li>\n    </ul>\n    <hr />\n</div>\n```\n\n## Example download.html updates\n\nMeta refresh tag (line 9):\n```html\n<meta\n    http-equiv=\"refresh\"\n    content=\"2; URL=https://github.com/khanhicetea/Caffee/releases/download/v1.18.0/Caffee-v1.18.0.dmg\"\n/>\n```\n\nDirect download link (line 24):\n```html\n<a\n    href=\"https://github.com/khanhicetea/Caffee/releases/download/v1.18.0/Caffee-v1.18.0.dmg\"\n    >bấm vào đây để tải ngay</a\n>\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:36:50.347Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for macOS-focused Agents needing automated app release management with Swift compatibility.","zh":"非常适合需要自动应用程序发布管理并兼容Swift的macOS专用Agent。","ja":"Swiftとの互換性を備えた自動アプリのリリース管理が必要なmacOS専用のエージェントに最適です。","ko":"스위프트와 호환되는 자동 앱 릴리즈 관리가 필요한 macOS 전용 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes centrados en macOS que necesitan una gestión automática de lanzamiento de aplicaciones con compatibilidad con Swift.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents axés sur macOS nécessitant une gestion automatisée de publication d''applications avec une compatibilité Swift.","de":"Perfekt für macOS-fokussierte Agenten, die eine automatisierte App-Release-Verwaltung mit Swift-Kompatibilität benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agents focados em macOS que necessitam de gerenciamento de lançamento de aplicativos automatizado com compatibilidade com Swift.","ru":"Идеально для агентов, ориентированных на macOS, которым требуется автоматизированное управление выпуском приложений с совместимостью Swift.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يركزون على macOS والذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة إصدار تطبيقات آلية مع توافق Swift."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to extract version information from filenames, verify app existence, and rename apps to a standardized format, leveraging macOS 14+ Sonoma support and Swift programming.","zh":"赋予代理从文件名中提取版本信息、验证应用程序存在性以及使用macOS 14+ Sonoma支持和Swift编程将应用程序重命名为标准化格式的能力。","ja":"macOS 14+ SonomaのサポートとSwiftプログラミングを利用して、ファイル名からバージョン情報を抽出する、アプリの存在を確認する、アプリを標準化された形式に名前を変更するエージェントの能力を可能にします。","ko":"macOS 14+ Sonoma 지원과 스위프트 프로그래밍을 활용하여 파일 이름에서 버전 정보를 추출하고, 앱 존재를 확인하며, 앱을 표준화된 형식으로 이름을 변경하는 에이전트의 능력을 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a extraer información de versión de nombres de archivos, verificar la existencia de aplicaciones y renombrar aplicaciones a un formato estandarizado, aprovechando el soporte de macOS 14+ Sonoma y la programación Swift.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''extraire des informations de version à partir de noms de fichiers, de vérifier l''existence d''applications et de renommer des applications dans un format standardisé, en exploitant le support de macOS 14+ Sonoma et la programmation Swift.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Versionsinformationen aus Dateinamen zu extrahieren, die Existenz von Apps zu überprüfen und Apps in ein standardisiertes Format umzubenennen, indem es die Unterstützung von macOS 14+ Sonoma und die Swift-Programmierung nutzt.","pt":"Permite que os agentes extraiam informações de versão de nomes de arquivos, verifiquem a existência de aplicativos e renomeiem aplicativos para um formato padronizado, aproveitando o suporte do macOS 14+ Sonoma e a programação Swift.","ru":"Позволяет агентам извлекать информацию о версии из имен файлов, проверять существование приложений и переименовывать приложения в стандартный формат, используя поддержку macOS 14+ Sonoma и программирование на Swift.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء استخراج معلومات الإصدار من أسماء الملفات والتحقق من وجود التطبيقات وإعادة تسمية التطبيقات إلى تنسيق معياري ، مستفيدة من دعم macOS 14+ Sonoma وبرمجة Swift."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating app version extraction for release notes","Verifying app existence before deployment","Renaming apps to a consistent format for easier management"],"zh":["自动为发布说明提取应用程序版本信息","部署前验证应用程序存在性","将应用程序重命名为一致的格式以便于管理"],"ja":["リリースノートの自動アプリバージョン抽出","デプロイ前のアプリ存在確認","一貫した形式にアプリを名前変更して管理を容易にする"],"ko":["릴리즈 노트를 위한 자동 앱 버전 추출","배포 전 앱 존재 확인","관리하기 쉽도록 일관된 형식으로 앱 이름 변경"],"es":["Automatizar la extracción de versión de aplicaciones para notas de lanzamiento","Verificar la existencia de aplicaciones antes de la implementación","Renombrar aplicaciones a un formato coherente para una gestión más sencilla"],"fr":["Automatiser l''extraction de version d''applications pour les notes de publication","Vérifier l''existence d''applications avant le déploiement","Renommer des applications dans un format cohérent pour une gestion plus facile"],"de":["Automatisieren der Versionsextraktion von Apps für Versionshinweise","Überprüfen der Existenz von Apps vor der Bereitstellung","Umbenennen von Apps in ein konsistentes Format für eine einfachere Verwaltung"],"pt":["Automatizar a extração da versão do aplicativo para notas de lançamento","Verificar a existência do aplicativo antes da implantação","Renomear aplicativos para um formato consistente para facilitar a gestão"],"ru":["Автоматизировать извлечение версии приложения для заметок о выпуске","Проверить существование приложения перед развертыванием","Переименовать приложения в последовательный формат для легкого управления"],"ar":["تأتمتة استخراج إصدار التطبيق لملاحظات الإصدار","التحقق من وجود التطبيق قبل النشر","إعادة تسمية التطبيقات إلى تنسيق متسق لتسهيل الإدارة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires macOS 14+ Sonoma or later","Limited to apps with filenames in the ''Caffee-v{VERSION}.app'' format"],"zh":["需要macOS 14+ Sonoma或更高版本","仅限文件名为''Caffee-v{VERSION}.app''格式的应用程序"],"ja":["macOS 14+ Sonoma以降が必要","ファイル名が''Caffee-v{VERSION}.app''形式のアプリのみ"],"ko":["macOS 14+ Sonoma 이상이 필요","파일 이름이 ''Caffee-v{VERSION}.app'' 형식인 앱만 해당"],"es":["Requiere macOS 14+ Sonoma o posterior","Limitado a aplicaciones con nombres de archivos en el formato ''Caffee-v{VERSION}.app''"],"fr":["Nécessite macOS 14+ Sonoma ou ultérieur","Limité aux applications avec des noms de fichiers au format ''Caffee-v{VERSION}.app''"],"de":["Erfordert macOS 14+ Sonoma oder neuer","Begrenzt auf Apps mit Dateinamen im Format ''Caffee-v{VERSION}.app''"],"pt":["Requer macOS 14+ Sonoma ou posterior","Limitado a aplicativos com nomes de arquivos no formato ''Caffee-v{VERSION}.app''"],"ru":["Требуется macOS 14+ Sonoma или позже","Ограничен для приложений с именами файлов в формате ''Caffee-v{VERSION}.app''"],"ar":["يتطلب macOS 14+ Sonoma أو لاحقًا","محدود للتطبيقات بأسماء الملفات بتنسيق ''Caffee-v{VERSION}.app''"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"da33f480e83f445743b747f591fa0ae23bbbc90f0144a7f6fe0295429c1bb4ac","qualityScore":51}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('bodangren/git-workflow/doc-indexer', 'community', 'bodangren', 'git-workflow', 'bodangren/git-workflow', 'doc-indexer', 0, 0, 51, '2026-03-02T01:56:11.120Z', '2026-03-02T03:39:09.384Z', 'c644f16429f24e3e1e180220fd4eb9fa0703c69d4884b344185d342bb923b753', '{"id":"bodangren/git-workflow/doc-indexer","name":"doc-indexer","description":{"zh":"doc-indexer 是一个 Spec-Driven Git 工作流插件，提供综合的开发工作流和 GitHub 集成，支持冲刺管理和遗留系统迁移","ja":"doc-indexer は Spec-Driven Git ワークフロー プラグインであり、包括的な開発ワークフローと GitHub 統合を提供し、スプリント管理とレガシーシステム移行をサポート","ko":"doc-indexer는 Spec-Driven Git 워크플로우 플러그인으로, 포괄적인 개발 워크플로우와 GitHub 통합을 제공하며, 스프린트 관리와 레거시 시스템 마이그레이션을 지원","es":"Doc-Indexer es un plugin de workflow de Git que ofrece una solución integral para el desarrollo, con integración de GitHub y soporte de migración","fr":"Doc-Indexer est un plugin de workflow Git qui offre une solution complète pour le développement, avec intégration GitHub et support de migration","de":"Doc-Indexer ist ein Git-Workflow-Plugin, das eine umfassende Lösung für die Entwicklung bietet, mit GitHub-Integration und Migrationsunterstützung","pt":"O Doc-Indexer é um plugin de fluxo de trabalho Git para Claude Code, oferecendo integração GitHub, gerenciamento de sprint e suporte à migração brownfield","ru":"Doc-Indexer - это плагин для Git-работы для Claude Code, предоставляющий интеграцию GitHub, управление спринтами и поддержку миграции brownfield","ar":"Doc-Indexer هو إضافة لتدفق العمل Git ل Claude Code، يقدم دمج GitHub وإدارة الركض ودعم هجرة Brownfield","en":"Spec-Driven Git Workflow plugin for Claude Code - Comprehensive development workflow with GitHub integration, sprint management, and brownfield migration support"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI工具 - doc-indexer Spec-Driven Git 工作流插件","ja":"AIエージェント - doc-indexer Spec-Driven Git ワークフロー プラグイン","ko":"AI 에이전트 - doc-indexer Spec-Driven Git 워크플로우 플러그인","es":"Herramientas de AI: Doc-Indexer para flujo de trabajo de Git","fr":"Outils d''IA : Doc-Indexer pour workflow Git","de":"KI-Tools: Doc-Indexer für Git-Workflow","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: Doc-Indexer para Desenvolvedores","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Doc-Indexer для Разработчиков","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: Doc-Indexer للמطورين","en":"doc-indexer"},"description":{"zh":"doc-indexer 是一个 Spec-Driven Git 工作流插件，提供综合的开发工作流和 GitHub 集成，支持冲刺管理和遗留系统迁移","ja":"doc-indexer は Spec-Driven Git ワークフロー プラグインであり、包括的な開発ワークフローと GitHub 統合を提供し、スプリント管理とレガシーシステム移行をサポート","ko":"doc-indexer는 Spec-Driven Git 워크플로우 플러그인으로, 포괄적인 개발 워크플로우와 GitHub 통합을 제공하며, 스프린트 관리와 레거시 시스템 마이그레이션을 지원","es":"Doc-Indexer es un plugin de workflow de Git que ofrece una solución integral para el desarrollo, con integración de GitHub y soporte de migración","fr":"Doc-Indexer est un plugin de workflow Git qui offre une solution complète pour le développement, avec intégration GitHub et support de migration","de":"Doc-Indexer ist ein Git-Workflow-Plugin, das eine umfassende Lösung für die Entwicklung bietet, mit GitHub-Integration und Migrationsunterstützung","pt":"O Doc-Indexer é um plugin de fluxo de trabalho Git para Claude Code, oferecendo integração GitHub, gerenciamento de sprint e suporte à migração brownfield","ru":"Doc-Indexer - это плагин для Git-работы для Claude Code, предоставляющий интеграцию GitHub, управление спринтами и поддержку миграции brownfield","ar":"Doc-Indexer هو إضافة لتدفق العمل Git ل Claude Code، يقدم دمج GitHub وإدارة الركض ودعم هجرة Brownfield","en":"Spec-Driven Git Workflow plugin for Claude Code - Comprehensive development workflow with GitHub integration, sprint management, and brownfield migration sup..."},"definition":{"en":"Spec-Driven Git Workflow plugin for Claude Code - Comprehensive development workflow with GitHub integration, sprint management, and brownfield migration support"},"features":{"zh":["Spec-Driven Git 工作流","GitHub 集成","冲刺管理","遗留系统迁移支持","综合开发工作流"],"ja":["Spec-Driven Git ワークフロー","GitHub 統合","スプリント管理","レガシーシステム移行サポート","包括的な開発ワークフロー"],"ko":["Spec-Driven Git 워크플로우","GitHub 통합","스프린트 관리","레거시 시스템 마이그레이션 지원","포괄적인 개발 워크플로우"],"es":["Integración con GitHub","Gestión de sprints","Soporte de migración","Flujo de trabajo de desarrollo integral","Indexación y gestión de documentos"],"fr":["Intégration avec GitHub","Gestion de sprints","Support de migration","Flux de travail de développement complet","Indexation et gestion de documents"],"de":["Integration mit GitHub","Sprint-Management","Migrationsunterstützung","Umfassender Entwicklungsworkflow","Dokumentenindexierung und -verwaltung"],"pt":["Integração GitHub","Gerenciamento de sprint","Suporte à migração brownfield","Fluxo de trabalho Git","Desenvolvimento de software","Ferramentas de IA"],"ru":["Интеграция GitHub","Управление спринтами","Поддержка миграции brownfield","Git-работа","Разработка программного обеспечения","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["دمج GitHub","إدارة الركض","دعم هجرة Brownfield","تدفق العمل Git","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用 doc-indexer","什么是 Spec-Driven Git 工作流","doc-indexer 替代品","doc-indexer 与竞争对手比较","doc-indexer 安装","doc-indexer 设置指南","AI 工具开发","Git 工作流优化"],"ja":["doc-indexer の使用方法","Spec-Driven Git ワークフローの概要","doc-indexer の代替","doc-indexer と競合他社の比較","doc-indexer のインストール","doc-indexer の設定ガイド","AI エージェント開発","Git ワークフローの最適化"],"ko":["doc-indexer 사용 방법","Spec-Driven Git 워크플로우 개요","doc-indexer 대체","doc-indexer와 경쟁사 비교","doc-indexer 설치","doc-indexer 설정 가이드","AI 에이전트 개발","Git 워크플로우 최적화"],"es":["cómo usar Doc-Indexer","qué es el flujo de trabajo de Git","alternativas a Doc-Indexer","Doc-Indexer vs GitHub","instalación de Doc-Indexer","guía de configuración de Doc-Indexer","herramientas de AI para desarrollo"],"fr":["comment utiliser Doc-Indexer","qu''est-ce que le flux de travail Git","alternatives à Doc-Indexer","Doc-Indexer vs GitHub","installation de Doc-Indexer","guide de configuration de Doc-Indexer","outils d''IA pour le développement"],"de":["wie man Doc-Indexer verwendet","was ist der Git-Workflow","Alternativen zu Doc-Indexer","Doc-Indexer vs GitHub","Installation von Doc-Indexer","Konfigurationsanleitung für Doc-Indexer","KI-Tools für die Entwicklung"],"pt":["como usar Doc-Indexer","o que é Doc-Indexer","alternativa ao Doc-Indexer","Doc-Indexer vs Claude Code","instalar Doc-Indexer","guia de configuração do Doc-Indexer","desenvolvimento de software com Doc-Indexer","ferramentas de IA para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["как использовать Doc-Indexer","что такое Doc-Indexer","альтернатива Doc-Indexer","Doc-Indexer vs Claude Code","установить Doc-Indexer","руководство по настройке Doc-Indexer","разработка программного обеспечения с Doc-Indexer","ИИ Агенты для разработчиков"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Doc-Indexer","ما هو Doc-Indexer","بديل Doc-Indexer","Doc-Indexer مقابل Claude Code","تثبيت Doc-Indexer","دليل إعداد Doc-Indexer","تطوير البرمجيات مع Doc-Indexer","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين"]}},"owner":"bodangren","repo":"git-workflow","repoPath":"bodangren/git-workflow","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.120Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"doc-indexer","description":"Use this skill at the beginning of any session or when needing to understand available project documentation. Provides just-in-time context by scanning YAML frontmatter from all markdown files in the docs/ directory without loading full content.","bodyPreview":"# Document Indexer Skill\n\n## Purpose\n\nProvide just-in-time context about available project documentation without loading full file content into the context window. The doc-indexer scans all markdown files in the `docs/` directory, extracts their YAML frontmatter metadata, and returns a structured map of available documentation. This enables efficient discovery of specs, plans, retrospectives, and other documentation while minimizing token usage.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill in the following s","body":"# Document Indexer Skill\n\n## Purpose\n\nProvide just-in-time context about available project documentation without loading full file content into the context window. The doc-indexer scans all markdown files in the `docs/` directory, extracts their YAML frontmatter metadata, and returns a structured map of available documentation. This enables efficient discovery of specs, plans, retrospectives, and other documentation while minimizing token usage.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill in the following situations:\n\n- At the beginning of any work session to understand the current state of documentation\n- When starting work on a new issue to identify relevant specs and context\n- Before proposing changes to understand existing specifications\n- When planning a sprint to review available approved specs\n- Anytime you need an overview of project documentation without reading full files\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- The project must have a `docs/` directory\n- Documentation files should follow the convention of including YAML frontmatter\n- The `jq` tool is NOT required (script works without it)\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Run the Documentation Scanner\n\nExecute the helper script to scan all markdown files in the docs/ directory:\n\n```bash\nbash scripts/scan-docs.sh\n```\n\nThis will output a human-readable summary showing each document''s frontmatter metadata.\n\nFor machine-readable JSON output (useful for programmatic processing):\n\n```bash\nbash scripts/scan-docs.sh -j\n```\n\n### Step 2: Review the Documentation Map\n\nThe scanner returns information about all markdown files found in `docs/`, including:\n\n- **File path**: Location of the documentation file\n- **Frontmatter metadata**: Key-value pairs from YAML frontmatter (title, status, type, etc.)\n- **Compliance warnings**: Files missing YAML frontmatter are flagged\n\n**Example human-readable output**:\n```\n---\nfile: docs/specs/001-synthesis-flow.md\ntitle: AgenticDev Methodology\nstatus: approved\ntype: spec\n---\nfile: docs/changes/my-feature/proposal.md\ntitle: My Feature Proposal\nstatus: in-review\ntype: proposal\n[WARNING] Non-compliant file (no frontmatter): docs/README.md\n```\n\n**Example JSON output**:\n```json\n[\n  {\n    \"file\": \"docs/specs/001-synthesis-flow.md\",\n    \"compliant\": true,\n    \"frontmatter\": {\n      \"title\": \"AgenticDev Methodology\",\n      \"status\": \"approved\",\n      \"type\": \"spec\"\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"file\": \"docs/README.md\",\n    \"compliant\": false,\n    \"frontmatter\": null\n  }\n]\n```\n\n### Step 3: Use the Map to Identify Relevant Documentation\n\nBased on the documentation map, identify which specific files to read for your current task:\n\n- **For implementation work**: Look for approved specs related to your issue\n- **For spec proposals**: Review existing specs to understand the current state\n- **For sprint planning**: Identify approved specs ready for implementation\n- **For learning context**: Find retrospectives and design docs\n\n### Step 4: Read Specific Documentation Files\n\nOnce you''ve identified relevant files from the map, use the Read tool to load their full content:\n\n```bash\n# Example: Read a specific spec identified from the map\nRead docs/specs/001-synthesis-flow.md\n```\n\nThis two-step approach (scan first, then read selectively) minimizes token usage while ensuring you have access to all necessary context.\n\n## Error Handling\n\n### No docs/ Directory\n\n**Symptom**: Script reports \"No such file or directory\"\n\n**Solution**:\n- Verify you''re in the project root directory\n- Check if the project has been initialized with `project-init` skill\n- Create `docs/` directory structure if needed\n\n### Files Missing Frontmatter\n\n**Symptom**: Script outputs \"[WARNING] Non-compliant file (no frontmatter): ...\"\n\n**Impact**: These files won''t have structured metadata in the output\n\n**Solution**:\n- Add YAML frontmatter to documentation files for better discoverability\n- Frontmatter should be at the top of the file between `---` markers\n- Example format:\n  ```markdown\n  ---\n  title: My Document\n  status: draft\n  type: design\n  ---\n\n  # Document content starts here\n  ```\n\n### Script Permission Errors\n\n**Symptom**: \"Permission denied\" when running the script\n\n**Solution**:\n```bash\nchmod +x scripts/scan-docs.sh\n```\n\n## Output Interpretation Guide\n\n### Frontmatter Fields\n\nCommon frontmatter fields you''ll encounter:\n\n- **title**: Human-readable document title\n- **status**: Document state (draft, in-review, approved, archived)\n- **type**: Document category (spec, proposal, design, retrospective, plan)\n- **epic**: Associated epic issue number\n- **sprint**: Sprint identifier\n- **author**: Document author\n- **created**: Creation date\n- **updated**: Last update date\n\n### Using JSON Output Programmatically\n\nThe JSON output mode is particularly useful when:\n\n- Filtering documents by specific criteria (e.g., only approved specs)\n- Counting documents by type or status\n- Building automated workflows\n- Integrating with other tools\n\nExample using `jq` to filter approved specs:\n```bash\nbash scripts/scan-docs.sh -j | jq ''.[] | select(.frontmatter.status == \"approved\")''\n```\n\n## Notes\n\n- The scanner is non-invasive and read-only - it never modifies files\n- Large projects with many docs benefit most from this just-in-time approach\n- The script scans recursively through all subdirectories in `docs/`\n- Empty frontmatter sections are treated as non-compliant\n- The scan is fast and can be run frequently without performance concerns\n- Consider running this at the start of each work session to stay current with documentation changes\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:39:09.384Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents like Claude Code needing efficient project documentation discovery and metadata extraction from markdown files","zh":"非常适合像 Claude Code 这样的 AI Agents，它需要从 markdown 文件中高效地发现项目文档和提取元数据","ja":"Claude Code のような AI エージェントに最適で、Markdown ファイルからのプロジェクト文書の効率的な発見とメタデータの抽出が必要","ko":"Claude Code 와 같은 AI 에이전트에 적합하며, 마크다운 파일에서 프로젝트 문서를 효율적으로 발견하고 메타데이터를 추출하는 데 필요","es":"Perfect for AI Agents like Claude Code needing efficient project documentation discovery and metadata extraction from markdown files","fr":"Perfect for AI Agents like Claude Code needing efficient project documentation discovery and metadata extraction from markdown files","de":"Perfect for AI Agents like Claude Code needing efficient project documentation discovery and metadata extraction from markdown files","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA como Claude Code que necessitam de descoberta eficiente de documentação de projetos e extração de metadados de arquivos markdown","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code, которым требуется эффективное обнаружение документации проекта и извлечение метаданных из файлов markdown","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude Code الذي يحتاج إلى اكتشاف كفء للوثائق المشروع و استخراج البيانات الوصفية من الملفات markdown"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to scan markdown files in the `docs/` directory, extract YAML frontmatter metadata, and return a structured map of available documentation, minimizing token usage and enabling efficient discovery of specs, plans, and retrospectives using GitHub integration and sprint management","zh":"赋予代理扫描 `docs/` 目录中的 markdown 文件、提取 YAML 前置元数据，并返回可用文档的结构化映射，尽量减少令牌使用并启用使用 GitHub 集成和 sprint 管理的规格、计划和回顾的高效发现","ja":"エージェントに `docs/` ディレクトリ内の Markdown ファイルをスキャンし、YAML フロントマター メタデータを抽出し、GitHub 統合とスプリント管理を使用して仕様、プラン、レトロスペクティブの効率的な発見を可能にするために、利用可能なドキュメントの構造化マップを返す機能を提供し、トークンの使用を最小限に抑える","ko":"에이전트가 `docs/` 디렉토리의 마크다운 파일을 스캔하고 YAML 전면 메타데이터를 추출하여 구조화된 맵으로 사용 가능한 문서를 반환하고 GitHub 통합 및 스프린트 관리를 사용하여 사양, 계획 및 회고의 효율적인 발견을 가능하게 하며 토큰 사용을 최소화","es":"Empowers agents to scan markdown files in the `docs/` directory, extract YAML frontmatter metadata, and return a structured map of available documentation, minimizing token usage and enabling efficient discovery of specs, plans, and retrospectives using GitHub integration and sprint management","fr":"Empowers agents to scan markdown files in the `docs/` directory, extract YAML frontmatter metadata, and return a structured map of available documentation, minimizing token usage and enabling efficient discovery of specs, plans, and retrospectives using GitHub integration and sprint management","de":"Empowers agents to scan markdown files in the `docs/` directory, extract YAML frontmatter metadata, and return a structured map of available documentation, minimizing token usage and enabling efficient discovery of specs, plans, and retrospectives using GitHub integration and sprint management","pt":"Habilita os agentes a digitalizar arquivos markdown no diretório `docs/`, extrair metadados de frontmatter YAML, e retornar um mapa estruturado da documentação disponível, minimizando o uso de tokens e habilitando a descoberta eficiente de especificações, planos e retrospectivas usando integração com o GitHub e gerenciamento de sprint","ru":"Позволяет агентам сканировать файлы markdown в директории `docs/`, извлекать метаданные YAML frontmatter и возвращать структурированную карту доступной документации, минимизируя использование токенов и ermöglicht эффективное обнаружение спецификаций, планов и ретроспектив с помощью интеграции с GitHub и управления спринтами","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على مسح الملفات markdown في الدليل `docs/` ، واستخراج البيانات الوصفية من YAML frontmatter ، وإرجاع خريطة منظمة للتوثيق المتاح ، وتقليل استخدام الرموز ، وتمكين اكتشاف كفء للمواصفات والخطط والاسترجاعات باستخدام التكامل مع GitHub وإدارة سبورت"},"useCases":{"en":["Indexing project documentation for just-in-time context","Extracting YAML frontmatter metadata from markdown files","Enabling efficient discovery of specs, plans, and retrospectives"],"zh":["为即时上下文索引项目文档","从 markdown 文件中提取 YAML 前置元数据","启用使用 GitHub 集成和 sprint 管理的规格、计划和回顾的高效发现"],"ja":["仕様、プラン、レトロスペクティブの効率的な発見のための即時コンテキストのためのプロジェクト ドキュメントのインデックス作成","Markdown ファイルからの YAML フロントマター メタデータの抽出","GitHub 統合とスプリント管理を使用した仕様、プラン、レトロスペクティブの効率的な発見の有効化"],"ko":["즉시 컨텍스트를 위한 프로젝트 문서의 색인 생성","마크다운 파일에서 YAML 전면 메타데이터 추출","GitHub 통합 및 스프린트 관리를 사용하여 사양, 계획 및 회고의 효율적인 발견 활성화"],"es":["Indexing project documentation for just-in-time context","Extracting YAML frontmatter metadata from markdown files","Enabling efficient discovery of specs, plans, and retrospectives"],"fr":["Indexing project documentation for just-in-time context","Extracting YAML frontmatter metadata from markdown files","Enabling efficient discovery of specs, plans, and retrospectives"],"de":["Indexing project documentation for just-in-time context","Extracting YAML frontmatter metadata from markdown files","Enabling efficient discovery of specs, plans, and retrospectives"],"pt":["Indexação da documentação do projeto para contexto em tempo real","Extração de metadados de frontmatter YAML de arquivos markdown","Habilitação da descoberta eficiente de especificações, planos e retrospectivas"],"ru":["Индексация документации проекта для контекста в режиме реального времени","Извлечение метаданных YAML frontmatter из файлов markdown","Возможность эффективного обнаружения спецификаций, планов и ретроспектив"],"ar":["فهرسة توثيق المشروع للسياق في الوقت الفعلي","استخراج البيانات الوصفية من YAML frontmatter من الملفات markdown","تمكين اكتشاف كفء للمواصفات والخطط والاسترجاعات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to the `docs/` directory","Limited to markdown files with YAML frontmatter metadata","Integration with GitHub and sprint management required for full functionality"],"zh":["需要访问 `docs/` 目录","仅限于具有 YAML 前置元数据的 markdown 文件","需要 GitHub 和 sprint 管理集成以实现全部功能"],"ja":["`docs/` ディレクトリへのアクセスが必要","YAML フロントマター メタデータを持つ Markdown ファイルのみ","すべての機能を実現するには GitHub とスプリント管理の統合が必要"],"ko":["`docs/` 디렉토리에 대한 액세스가 필요","YAML 전면 메타데이터가 있는 마크다운 파일만","전체 기능을 구현하려면 GitHub 및 스프린트 관리 통합이 필요"],"es":["Requires access to the `docs/` directory","Limited to markdown files with YAML frontmatter metadata","Integration with GitHub and sprint management required for full functionality"],"fr":["Requires access to the `docs/` directory","Limited to markdown files with YAML frontmatter metadata","Integration with GitHub and sprint management required for full functionality"],"de":["Requires access to the `docs/` directory","Limited to markdown files with YAML frontmatter metadata","Integration with GitHub and sprint management required for full functionality"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao diretório `docs/`","Limitado a arquivos markdown com metadados de frontmatter YAML","Integração com o GitHub e gerenciamento de sprint é necessária para a funcionalidade completa"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к директории `docs/`","Ограничен файлами markdown с метаданными YAML frontmatter","Интеграция с GitHub и управление спринтами необходима для полной функциональности"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى الدليل `docs/`","محدود بالملفات markdown التي تحتوي على بيانات وصفية YAML frontmatter","التكامل مع GitHub وإدارة سبورت مطلوب للوظيفة الكاملة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"c644f16429f24e3e1e180220fd4eb9fa0703c69d4884b344185d342bb923b753","qualityScore":51}');
