 Tableau","aget-check-evolutionのインストール","aget-check-evolutionの設定ガイド","データ分析ツール","AIエージェント","データ可視化"],"ko":["aget-check-evolution 사용법","aget-check-evolution이란","aget-check-evolution 대안","aget-check-evolution vs Tableau","aget-check-evolution 설치","aget-check-evolution 설정 가이드","데이터 분석 툴","AI 에이전트","데이터 시각화"],"es":["aget-check-evolution tutorial","cómo usar aget-check-evolution","plantilla análisis datos IA Agents","Advisor archetype extensión","automated data insights Python","aget-check-evolution vs alternatives","instalar aget-check-evolution","setup guide aget-check-evolution","data analysis template Node.js","herramientas IA para desarrolladores"],"fr":["aget-check-evolution tutoriel","comment utiliser aget-check-evolution","modèle analyse données outils d''IA","extension archétype Advisor","insights données automatisés Python","aget-check-evolution alternatives","installer aget-check-evolution","guide setup aget-check-evolution","template analyse données Node.js","outils IA pour développeurs"],"de":["aget-check-evolution Tutorial","wie verwendet man aget-check-evolution","Datenanalyse Vorlage KI-Agenten","Advisor Archetyp Erweiterung","automatisierte Daten Insights Python","aget-check-evolution Alternativen","aget-check-evolution installieren","Setup Guide aget-check-evolution","Datenanalyse Template Node.js","KI-Tools für Entwickler"],"pt":["como usar aget-check-evolution","o que é aget-check-evolution","aget-check-evolution vs Tableau","instalar aget-check-evolution","guia de configuração do aget-check-evolution","ferramentas de ia para análise de dados","análise de dados em tempo real","template analítico para análise de dados"],"ru":["как использовать aget-check-evolution","что такое aget-check-evolution","aget-check-evolution vs Tableau","установить aget-check-evolution","руководство по настройке aget-check-evolution","инструменты ИИ для анализа данных","анализ данных в реальном времени","аналитический шаблон для анализа данных"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام aget-check-evolution","ما هي أداة aget-check-evolution","aget-check-evolution مقابل Tableau","تثبيت aget-check-evolution","دليل إعداد aget-check-evolution","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للتحليل البياني","تحليل البيانات في الوقت الفعلي","قالب تحليلي للتحليل البياني"]}},"owner":"aget-framework","repo":"template-analyst-aget","repoPath":"aget-framework/template-analyst-aget","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-26T08:25:24.796Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"aget-check-evolution","description":"Monitor .aget/evolution/ directory health. Validates file counts, naming conventions, disk usage, and returns health status with alerts on anomalies.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# /aget-check-evolution\n\nMonitor the health of the `.aget/evolution/` directory by checking file counts, types, naming conventions, and disk usage.\n\n## Purpose\n\nProvide self-diagnostic capability for AGET agents to assess their evolution directory health without supervisor intervention.\n\n## Execution\n\nWhen invoked, perform these checks:\n\n### 1. File Inventory\n\n```bash\n# Count total files\nfind .aget/evolution -type f | wc -l\n\n# Count by extension\nfind .aget/evolution -type f -name \"*.md\" | wc -l","body":"# /aget-check-evolution\n\nMonitor the health of the `.aget/evolution/` directory by checking file counts, types, naming conventions, and disk usage.\n\n## Purpose\n\nProvide self-diagnostic capability for AGET agents to assess their evolution directory health without supervisor intervention.\n\n## Execution\n\nWhen invoked, perform these checks:\n\n### 1. File Inventory\n\n```bash\n# Count total files\nfind .aget/evolution -type f | wc -l\n\n# Count by extension\nfind .aget/evolution -type f -name \"*.md\" | wc -l\nfind .aget/evolution -type f -name \"*.json\" | wc -l\nfind .aget/evolution -type f ! -name \"*.md\" ! -name \"*.json\" | wc -l\n```\n\n### 2. Naming Convention Check\n\nValid L-doc pattern: `L###_*.md` (e.g., `L588_skill_invocation_control_semantics.md`)\n\n```bash\n# Count valid L-doc names\nfind .aget/evolution -type f -name \"L[0-9][0-9][0-9]_*.md\" | wc -l\n\n# Find non-conforming files (excluding index.json)\nfind .aget/evolution -type f ! -name \"L[0-9][0-9][0-9]_*.md\" ! -name \"index.json\" ! -name \"README.md\"\n```\n\n### 3. Disk Usage\n\n```bash\ndu -sh .aget/evolution\n```\n\n### 4. Index Integrity\n\nCheck that `index.json` exists and is valid JSON:\n\n```bash\ntest -f .aget/evolution/index.json && jq empty .aget/evolution/index.json 2>/dev/null && echo \"valid\" || echo \"invalid\"\n```\n\n## Thresholds\n\n| Metric | OK | WARN | CRITICAL |\n|--------|-----|------|----------|\n| Total files | <500 | 500-750 | >750 |\n| Non-standard files | 0-10 | 11-50 | >50 |\n| Disk size | <10MB | 10-25MB | >25MB |\n| Index integrity | valid | - | invalid |\n\n**Note**: Thresholds inherited from supervisor defaults. Research AGET baseline (2026-02-08): 94 files, 800K - well within OK range.\n\n## Output Format\n\nReport the following:\n\n```\n=== /aget-check-evolution ===\n\nDirectory: .aget/evolution/\n\nFile Counts:\n  Total:     [count]\n  L-docs:    [count] (.md matching L###_*.md)\n  Index:     [1 if exists, 0 otherwise]\n  Other:     [count] (non-conforming)\n\nDisk Usage: [size]\n\nIndex Status: [valid/invalid/missing]\n\nNon-Conforming Files:\n  [list any files not matching expected patterns]\n\nHealth Status: [OK | WARN | CRITICAL]\nAlerts:\n  [list any threshold violations]\n```\n\n## Health Status Logic\n\n```\nIF index invalid OR index missing:\n  CRITICAL\nELIF total_files > 750 OR disk > 25MB OR non_standard > 50:\n  CRITICAL\nELIF total_files > 500 OR disk > 10MB OR non_standard > 10:\n  WARN\nELSE:\n  OK\n```\n\n## Constraints\n\n- **C1**: Read-only operation. Never modify files.\n- **C2**: Report ALL findings, even if status is OK.\n- **C3**: List non-conforming files by name for actionability.\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- `/aget-check-sessions` - Sessions directory health\n- `/aget-check-kb` - Knowledge base health\n- `/aget-record-lesson` - Capture findings as L-docs\n\n## Traceability\n\n| Link | Reference |\n|------|-----------|\n| POC | POC-017 |\n| Project | PROJECT_PLAN_AGET_UNIVERSAL_SKILLS.md |\n| Source | Fleet Skill Deployment Report (supervisor) |\n| Baseline | 94 files, 800K (2026-02-08) |\n\n---\n\n*aget-check-evolution v1.0.0*\n*Category: Monitoring*\n*POC-017 Phase 1*\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T12:45:19.188Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Autonomous Agents needing self-diagnostic capabilities for directory health assessment.","zh":"适合需要自诊断功能以评估目录健康状况的自主代理。","ja":"ディレクトリの健全性評価のための自己診断機能を必要とする自律エージェントに最適です。","ko":"디렉토리 건강 상태 평가를 위한 자가 진단 기능이 필요한 자율 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Autónomos que necesitan capacidades de autodiagnóstico para la evaluación de la salud del directorio.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents Autonomes ayant besoin de capacités d''auto-diagnostic pour l''évaluation de la santé du répertoire.","de":"Perfekt für autonome Agenten, die Selbstdiagnosefunktionen für die Bewertung der Verzeichnisgesundheit benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Autônomos que necessitam de capacidades de autodiagnóstico para avaliação da saúde do diretório.","ru":"Идеально для автономных агентов, которым требуются возможности самодиагностики для оценки здоровья директории.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المستقلين الذين يحتاجون إلى قابليات التشخيص الذاتي لتقييم صحة الدليل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to monitor their evolution directory health by checking file counts, types, naming conventions, and disk usage, utilizing Unix commands like ''find'' and ''wc'' for file inventory and analysis.","zh":"使代理能够通过检查文件数量、类型、命名约定和磁盘使用情况来监控其演化目录的健康状况，利用Unix命令，如''find''和''wc''进行文件清单和分析。","ja":"エージェントがファイル数、タイプ、命名規則、ディスク使用状況をチェックすることで、エボリューション・ディレクトリのヘルスを監視できるようにし、ファイルのインベントリと分析のために''find''や''wc''などのUnixコマンドを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 파일 수, 유형, 명명 규칙, 디스크 사용량을 확인하여 에볼루션 디렉토리의 건강 상태를 모니터링할 수 있도록 하며, 파일 인벤토리 및 분석을 위해 ''find'' 및 ''wc''와 같은 Unix 명령을 사용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes monitorear la salud de su directorio de evolución comprobando los recuentos de archivos, los tipos, las convenciones de nomenclatura y el uso del disco, utilizando comandos de Unix como ''find'' y ''wc'' para el inventario y el análisis de archivos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de surveiller la santé de leur répertoire d''évolution en vérifiant les comptes de fichiers, les types, les conventions de dénomination et l''utilisation du disque, en utilisant des commandes Unix comme ''find'' et ''wc'' pour l''inventaire et l''analyse des fichiers.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, die Gesundheit ihres Evolution-Verzeichnisses zu überwachen, indem sie Dateizählungen, -typen, Benennungskonventionen und Festplattennutzung überprüfen, wobei Unix-Kommandos wie ''find'' und ''wc'' für die Dateiinventarisierung und -analyse verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a monitorar a saúde do diretório de evolução, verificando contagem de arquivos, tipos, convenções de nomenclatura e uso do disco, utilizando comandos Unix como ''find'' e ''wc'' para inventário e análise de arquivos.","ru":"Позволяет агентам отслеживать здоровье директории эволюции, проверяя количество файлов, типы, соглашения об именовании и использование диска, используя команды Unix, такие как ''find'' и ''wc'', для инвентаризации и анализа файлов.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من مراقبة صحة دليل التطور من خلال التحقق من عدد الملفات وأنوعها وأساليب التسمية واستخدام القرص، باستخدام أوامر Unix مثل ''find'' و ''wc'' لمخزون الملفات والتحليل."},"useCases":{"en":["Monitoring file system health","Debugging evolution directory issues","Automating disk usage checks"],"zh":["文件系统健康状况监测","演化目录问题调试","自动磁盘使用情况检查"],"ja":["ファイルシステムのヘルス状態の監視","エボリューション・ディレクトリの問題のデバッグ","ディスク使用状況の自動チェック"],"ko":["파일 시스템 건강 상태 모니터링","에볼루션 디렉토리 문제 디버깅","自動 디스크 사용량 체크"],"es":["Supervisión de la salud del sistema de archivos","Depuración de problemas del directorio de evolución","Automatización de comprobaciones de uso de disco"],"fr":["Supervision de la santé du système de fichiers","Débogage des problèmes de répertoire d''évolution","Automatisation des vérifications d''utilisation du disque"],"de":["Überwachung der Dateisystemgesundheit","Fehlerbehebung bei Problemen im Evolution-Verzeichnis","Automatisierung von Festplattennutzungsprüfungen"],"pt":["Monitoramento da saúde do sistema de arquivos","Depuração de problemas do diretório de evolução","Automatização de verificações de uso do disco"],"ru":["Мониторинг здоровья файловой системы","Отладка проблем директории эволюции","Автоматизация проверок использования диска"],"ar":["مراقبة صحة نظام الملفات","تصحيح أخطاء دليل التطور","تأتمة فحص استخدام القرص"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires filesystem access","Limited to Unix-based systems","Dependent on ''.aget/evolution/'' directory structure"],"zh":["需要文件系统访问权限","仅限于Unix 기반系统","依赖于''.aget/evolution/''目录结构"],"ja":["ファイルシステムへのアクセスが必要","Unixベースのシステムのみ","''.aget/evolution/''ディレクトリ構造に依存"],"ko":["파일 시스템 접근 권한이 필요합니다","Unix 기반 시스템에만 한정됩니다","''.aget/evolution/'' 디렉토리 구조에 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso al sistema de archivos","Limitado a sistemas basados en Unix","Dependiente de la estructura del directorio ''.aget/evolution/''"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au système de fichiers","Limité aux systèmes basés sur Unix","Dépendant de la structure du répertoire ''.aget/evolution/''"],"de":["Benötigt Dateisystemzugriff","Begrenzt auf Unix-basierte Systeme","Abhängig von der Verzeichnisstruktur ''.aget/evolution/''"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao sistema de arquivos","Limitado a sistemas baseados em Unix","Dependente da estrutura do diretório ''.aget/evolution/''"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файловой системе","Ограничен системами на основе Unix","Зависит от структуры директории ''.aget/evolution/''"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى نظام الملفات","محدود بالنظم المبنية على Unix","يعتمد على هيكل دليل ''.aget/evolution/''"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"62225f596bebfa5e6aa19d9cc2fdf738236aaf21bb057aece1bfe1c5b54b6cb3","qualityScore":51}');
