s de trabajo de agentes","Desarrollo asistido por AI Agent"],"fr":["Packages réutilisables","TypeScript strict","Vérifications CI","Flux de travail d''agent","Développement assisté par Agent IA"],"de":["Wiederverwendbare Pakete","Strenger TypeScript","CI-Checks","Agent-Workflows","Agentenunterstützte Entwicklung"],"pt":["Pacotes reutilizáveis","Fluxos de trabalho de agentes","Verificação de código com TypeScript","Integração contínua com CI"],"ru":["Многократно используемые пакеты","Рабочие процессы агентов","Проверка кода с помощью TypeScript","Непрерывная интеграция с CI"],"ar":["حزم قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام","عمليات عمل للوكلاء","فحص الكود باستخدام TypeScript","التكامل المستمر مع CI"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能体","前端UI模板","可重用包","TypeScript","CI检查","智能工作流","Monorepo","AI工具","前端开发"],"ja":["AIエージェント","フロントエンドUIテンプレート","再利用可能なパッケージ","TypeScript","CIチェック","エージェントワークフロー","Monorepo","AIツール","フロントエンド開発"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","프론트엔드 UI 템플릿","재사용 가능한 패키지","TypeScript","CI 확인","에이전트 워크플로우","Monorepo","AI 도구","프론트엔드 개발"],"es":["herramientas de AI Agent","desarrollo asistido por AI Agent","monorepo template","TypeScript estricto","flujos de trabajo de agentes","cómo usar AI Agent","qué es AI Agent","AI Agent vs herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["outils d''Agent IA","développement assisté par Agent IA","modèle de monorepo","TypeScript strict","flux de travail d''agent","comment utiliser Agent IA","qu''est-ce que Agent IA","Agent IA vs outils de développement"],"de":["AI Agent Tools","agentenunterstützte Entwicklung","Monorepo-Template","strenger TypeScript","Agent-Workflows","wie man AI Agent verwendet","was ist AI Agent","AI Agent vs Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["ferramentas de IA","desenvolvimento de frontend UI","monorepo","pacotes reutilizáveis","fluxos de trabalho de agentes","TypeScript","CI","como usar frontend-ui","o que é frontend-ui"],"ru":["ИИ агенты","разработка приложений frontend UI","монорепозиторий","многократно используемые пакеты","рабочие процессы агентов","TypeScript","CI","как использовать frontend-ui","что такое frontend-ui"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير تطبيقات الواجهة الأمامية","مونوريبوزиторي","حزم قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام","عمليات عمل للوكلاء","TypeScript","CI","كيفية استخدام frontend-ui","ما هو frontend-ui"]}},"owner":"valuecodes","repo":"agentic-monorepo-starter","repoPath":"valuecodes/agentic-monorepo-starter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-26T08:25:24.755Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"frontend-ui","description":"UI/UX guidelines for app development in this Turborepo (apps/web and future apps). Use when designing or implementing app pages, layouts, navigation, or interactions with Tailwind and @repo/ui components.","bodyPreview":"# Frontend UI (Apps)\n\n## Overview\n\nDesign and implement app UI/UX with consistent patterns, accessibility, and performance. Reuse shared components from `@repo/ui`, keep the landing page lightweight, and follow App Router conventions.\n\n## Scope and Boundaries\n\n- Apps may import packages; packages must not import apps.\n- Prefer shared UI in `packages/ui` to avoid duplication across apps.\n- App-specific UI belongs under the app (for web: `apps/web/src/components`).\n- Import UI components via subpa","body":"# Frontend UI (Apps)\n\n## Overview\n\nDesign and implement app UI/UX with consistent patterns, accessibility, and performance. Reuse shared components from `@repo/ui`, keep the landing page lightweight, and follow App Router conventions.\n\n## Scope and Boundaries\n\n- Apps may import packages; packages must not import apps.\n- Prefer shared UI in `packages/ui` to avoid duplication across apps.\n- App-specific UI belongs under the app (for web: `apps/web/src/components`).\n- Import UI components via subpath exports (no barrel imports).\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Scan existing app layouts/components to preserve established patterns.\n2. Decide whether the UI should be shared (packages/ui) or app-specific.\n3. Build the UI using `@repo/ui` components and Tailwind utilities.\n4. Add or update local app components using the `~/` path alias.\n5. Validate UX details: hierarchy, spacing, responsive behavior, states, and a11y.\n6. Keep changes minimal and avoid new dependencies unless required; ask first.\n\n## UI/UX Guidelines\n\n- Layout: establish clear hierarchy with headings and section spacing; keep pages lightweight.\n- Typography: use the existing Geist Sans/Mono setup unless explicitly asked to change.\n- Color: rely on the UI theme tokens and CSS variables; avoid ad-hoc palettes.\n- States: include hover/focus/active/disabled plus empty, loading, and error states.\n- Responsiveness: design mobile-first and avoid horizontal scroll.\n- Motion: use subtle, purposeful motion only when it improves clarity.\n\n## Implementation Rules\n\n- App Router only: routes live in `apps/web/src/app` (use `page.tsx` and `layout.tsx`).\n- Use `~/` for local imports (e.g., `~/components/...`).\n- Do not duplicate global CSS imports already defined in `apps/web/src/app/globals.css`.\n\n## Accessibility and Semantics\n\n- Use semantic elements (`header`, `nav`, `main`, `footer`) and proper heading order.\n- Ensure keyboard access and visible focus states.\n- Use buttons for actions and links for navigation.\n- Provide labels or ARIA attributes where needed.\n\n## Client Component Guidance\n\n- Default to Server Components in apps.\n- Add `\"use client\"` only when needed (hooks, browser APIs, event handlers).\n- Isolate client components to the smallest subtree.\n\n## Output Format (PR-ready)\n\n- Follow the repo response format: Plan, Edits, Review Notes, Validation.\n- In Review Notes, include a PR summary (what/why), risks, and follow-ups.\n\n## Validation Commands\n\n- `pnpm --filter web lint`\n- `pnpm --filter web typecheck`\n- `pnpm --filter web build`\n- `pnpm --filter web format`\n- Use repo-wide `pnpm lint` / `pnpm typecheck` when required.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T11:14:22.200Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents focusing on web development, needing streamlined frontend UI implementation with TypeScript and reusable components.","zh":"非常适合专注于Web开发、需要使用TypeScript和可重用组件简化前端UI实现的AI Agent。","ja":"Web開発に焦点を当て、TypeScriptと再利用可能なコンポーネントを使用してフロントエンドUIの実効的な実装を必要とするAI Agentに最適です。","ko":"웹 개발에 중점을 두고 TypeScript와 재사용 가능한 컴포넌트를 사용하여 간소화된 프론트엔드 UI 구현이 필요한 AI 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA enfocados en desarrollo web, que necesitan una implementación optimizada de la interfaz de usuario frontend con TypeScript y componentes reutilizables.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents IA axés sur le développement web, ayant besoin d''une implémentation rationalisée de l''interface utilisateur frontend avec TypeScript et des composants réutilisables.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die sich auf Webentwicklung konzentrieren und eine optimierte Implementierung der Frontend-UI mit TypeScript und wiederverwendbaren Komponenten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA focados em desenvolvimento web, necessitando de implementação simplificada de UI frontend com TypeScript e componentes reutilizáveis.","ru":"Идеально подходит для ИИ-агентов, ориентированных на веб-разработку, которым требуется упрощенная реализация пользовательского интерфейса фронтенда с TypeScript и повторно используемыми компонентами.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يركزون على تطوير الويب، ويحتاجون إلى تنفيذ مبسط لواجهة المستخدم الأمامية باستخدام TypeScript ومكونات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design and implement app UI/UX with consistent patterns, accessibility, and performance, utilizing shared components from @repo/ui and following App Router conventions, while ensuring strict TypeScript and CI checks.","zh":"使Agent能够利用来自@repo/ui的共享组件并遵循App Router约定，设计和实现具有一致模式、可访问性和性能的应用UI/UX，同时确保严格的TypeScript和CI检查。","ja":"@repo/uiからの共有コンポーネントを利用し、App Routerの規則に従いながら、一貫したパターン、アクセシビリティ、パフォーマンスを備えたアプリのUI/UXを設計および実装する能力をAgentに付与し、厳格なTypeScriptとCIチェックを保証します。","ko":"@repo/ui의 공유 컴포넌트를 활용하고 App Router 규칙을 따르면서, 일관된 패턴, 접근성 및 성능을 갖춘 앱 UI/UX를 설계 및 구현할 수 있도록 에이전트에 권한을 부여하며, 엄격한 TypeScript 및 CI 검사를 보장합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes diseñar e implementar la UI/UX de aplicaciones con patrones consistentes, accesibilidad y rendimiento, utilizando componentes compartidos de @repo/ui y siguiendo las convenciones de App Router, mientras garantiza estrictas comprobaciones de TypeScript y CI.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir et de mettre en œuvre l''UI/UX d''applications avec des modèles cohérents, l''accessibilité et les performances, en utilisant des composants partagés de @repo/ui et en suivant les conventions App Router, tout en assurant des vérifications strictes de TypeScript et d''IC.","de":"Ermöglicht Agents das Entwerfen und Implementieren von App-UI/UX mit konsistenten Mustern, Barrierefreiheit und Leistung unter Verwendung gemeinsamer Komponenten aus @repo/ui und unter Einhaltung der App Router-Konventionen, während strenge TypeScript- und CI-Prüfungen sichergestellt werden.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a projetar e implementar a UI/UX de aplicativos com padrões consistentes, acessibilidade e desempenho, utilizando componentes compartilhados do @repo/ui e seguindo as convenções do App Router, enquanto garante verificações rigorosas de TypeScript e CI.","ru":"Позволяет агентам проектировать и реализовывать пользовательский интерфейс/опыт взаимодействия (UI/UX) приложений с использованием единообразных шаблонов, доступности и производительности, используя общие компоненты из @repo/ui и следуя соглашениям App Router, обеспечивая при этом строгие проверки TypeScript и CI.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من تصميم وتنفيذ واجهة المستخدم / تجربة المستخدم (UI/UX) للتطبيقات بأنماط متسقة وإمكانية الوصول والأداء، باستخدام المكونات المشتركة من @repo/ui واتباع اصطلاحات App Router، مع ضمان فحوصات صارمة لنظام TypeScript و CI."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing consistent UI patterns across web applications","Optimizing app performance through lightweight landing pages","Developing accessible and reusable UI components with @repo/ui"],"zh":["跨Web应用程序实施一致的UI模式","通过轻量级着陆页优化应用性能","使用@repo/ui开发可访问且可重用的UI组件"],"ja":["Webアプリケーション全体で一貫したUIパターンを実装する","軽量なランディングページを通じてアプリのパフォーマンスを最適化する","@repo/uiを使用してアクセシブルで再利用可能なUIコンポーネントを開発する"],"ko":["웹 애플리케이션 전반에 걸쳐 일관된 UI 패턴 구현","가벼운 랜딩 페이지를 통해 앱 성능 최적화","@repo/ui를 사용하여 접근 가능하고 재사용 가능한 UI 컴포넌트 개발"],"es":["Implementación de patrones de UI consistentes en aplicaciones web","Optimización del rendimiento de aplicaciones mediante páginas de destino ligeras","Desarrollo de componentes de UI accesibles y reutilizables con @repo/ui"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre de modèles d''interface utilisateur cohérents dans les applications web","Optimisation des performances des applications grâce à des pages de destination légères","Développement de composants d''interface utilisateur accessibles et réutilisables avec @repo/ui"],"de":["Implementierung konsistenter UI-Muster in Webanwendungen","Optimierung der App-Leistung durch schlanke Landing Pages","Entwicklung von barrierefreien und wiederverwendbaren UI-Komponenten mit @repo/ui"],"pt":["Implementação de padrões de UI consistentes em aplicações web","Otimização do desempenho do aplicativo por meio de páginas de destino leves","Desenvolvimento de componentes de UI acessíveis e reutilizáveis com @repo/ui"],"ru":["Реализация единообразных шаблонов пользовательского интерфейса в веб-приложениях","Оптимизация производительности приложения за счет облегченных целевых страниц","Разработка доступных и повторно используемых компонентов пользовательского интерфейса с @repo/ui"],"ar":["تنفيذ أنماط واجهة مستخدم متسقة عبر تطبيقات الويب","تحسين أداء التطبيق من خلال صفحات هبوط خفيفة الوزن","تطوير مكونات واجهة مستخدم قابلة للوصول وإعادة الاستخدام مع @repo/ui"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires monorepo template setup","Apps may not import packages directly, only via subpaths","Strict adherence to TypeScript and CI checks is mandatory"],"zh":["需要monorepo模板设置","应用程序可能无法直接导入包，只能通过子路径导入","必须严格遵守TypeScript和CI检查"],"ja":["monorepoテンプレートのセットアップが必要","アプリはパッケージを直接インポートできず、サブパスのみを介してインポート可能","TypeScriptとCIチェックの厳格な遵守が必須"],"ko":["monorepo 템플릿 설정 필요","앱이 패키지를 직접 임포트할 수 없고 서브패스만을 통해서만 가능","TypeScript 및 CI 검사의 엄격한 준수 필수"],"es":["Requiere la configuración de una plantilla de monorepo","Las aplicaciones no pueden importar paquetes directamente, solo a través de subrutas","La adherencia estricta a las comprobaciones de TypeScript y CI es obligatoria"],"fr":["Nécessite la configuration d''un modèle de monorepo","Les applications ne peuvent pas importer de packages directement, uniquement via des sous-chemins","Le respect strict des vérifications TypeScript et CI est obligatoire"],"de":["Erfordert die Einrichtung einer Monorepo-Vorlage","Apps dürfen Pakete nicht direkt importieren, sondern nur über Subpfade","Strikte Einhaltung der TypeScript- und CI-Prüfungen ist zwingend erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer configuração de modelo de monorepo","Os aplicativos não podem importar pacotes diretamente, apenas através de subcaminhos","A adesão estrita às verificações de TypeScript e CI é obrigatória"],"ru":["Требует настройки шаблона монoreпозитория","Приложения могут импортировать пакеты не напрямую, а только через подпути","Строгое соблюдение проверок TypeScript и CI является обязательным"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد قالب monorepo","قد لا تستورد التطبيقات الحزم مباشرة، فقط عبر المسارات الفرعية","الالتزام الصارم بفحوصات TypeScript و CI إلزامي"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"61d90d0dafed9f0ff6a300ead885ed187734f730122f29fa3128b0f51f3525e0","qualityScore":50}');
