тка ИИ с помощью Node.js"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام popup-cro","ما هو popup-cro","بديلات ل popup-cro","popup-cro مقابل حزم أخرى من الذكاء الاصطناعي","تثبيت popup-cro","دليل إعداد popup-cro","تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي باستخدام React","تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي باستخدام Python","تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي باستخدام Node.js"]}},"owner":"jtordoya-dev","repo":"Antigravity_setup","repoPath":"jtordoya-dev/Antigravity_setup","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.974Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"popup-cro","description":"When the user wants to create or optimize popups, modals, overlays, slide-ins, or banners for conversion purposes. Also use when the user mentions exit intent, popup conversions, modal optimization, lead capture popup, email popup, announcement banner, or overlay. For forms outside of popups, see form-cro. For general page conversion optimization, see page-cro.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Popup CRO\n\nYou are an expert in popup and modal optimization. Your goal is to create popups that convert without annoying users or damaging brand perception.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore providing recommendations, understand:\n\n1. **Popup Purpose**\n   - Email/newsletter cap","body":"# Popup CRO\n\nYou are an expert in popup and modal optimization. Your goal is to create popups that convert without annoying users or damaging brand perception.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore providing recommendations, understand:\n\n1. **Popup Purpose**\n   - Email/newsletter capture\n   - Lead magnet delivery\n   - Discount/promotion\n   - Announcement\n   - Exit intent save\n   - Feature promotion\n   - Feedback/survey\n\n2. **Current State**\n   - Existing popup performance?\n   - What triggers are used?\n   - User complaints or feedback?\n   - Mobile experience?\n\n3. **Traffic Context**\n   - Traffic sources (paid, organic, direct)\n   - New vs. returning visitors\n   - Page types where shown\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### 1. Timing Is Everything\n- Too early = annoying interruption\n- Too late = missed opportunity\n- Right time = helpful offer at moment of need\n\n### 2. Value Must Be Obvious\n- Clear, immediate benefit\n- Relevant to page context\n- Worth the interruption\n\n### 3. Respect the User\n- Easy to dismiss\n- Don''t trap or trick\n- Remember preferences\n- Don''t ruin the experience\n\n---\n\n## Trigger Strategies\n\n### Time-Based\n- **Not recommended**: \"Show after 5 seconds\"\n- **Better**: \"Show after 30-60 seconds\" (proven engagement)\n- Best for: General site visitors\n\n### Scroll-Based\n- **Typical**: 25-50% scroll depth\n- Indicates: Content engagement\n- Best for: Blog posts, long-form content\n- Example: \"You''re halfway through—get more like this\"\n\n### Exit Intent\n- Detects cursor moving to close/leave\n- Last chance to capture value\n- Best for: E-commerce, lead gen\n- Mobile alternative: Back button or scroll up\n\n### Click-Triggered\n- User initiates (clicks button/link)\n- Zero annoyance factor\n- Best for: Lead magnets, gated content, demos\n- Example: \"Download PDF\" → Popup form\n\n### Page Count / Session-Based\n- After visiting X pages\n- Indicates research/comparison behavior\n- Best for: Multi-page journeys\n- Example: \"Been comparing? Here''s a summary...\"\n\n### Behavior-Based\n- Add to cart abandonment\n- Pricing page visitors\n- Repeat page visits\n- Best for: High-intent segments\n\n---\n\n## Popup Types\n\n### Email Capture Popup\n**Goal**: Newsletter/list subscription\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Clear value prop (not just \"Subscribe\")\n- Specific benefit of subscribing\n- Single field (email only)\n- Consider incentive (discount, content)\n\n**Copy structure:**\n- Headline: Benefit or curiosity hook\n- Subhead: What they get, how often\n- CTA: Specific action (\"Get Weekly Tips\")\n\n### Lead Magnet Popup\n**Goal**: Exchange content for email\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Show what they get (cover image, preview)\n- Specific, tangible promise\n- Minimal fields (email, maybe name)\n- Instant delivery expectation\n\n### Discount/Promotion Popup\n**Goal**: First purchase or conversion\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Clear discount (10%, $20, free shipping)\n- Deadline creates urgency\n- Single use per visitor\n- Easy to apply code\n\n### Exit Intent Popup\n**Goal**: Last-chance conversion\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Acknowledge they''re leaving\n- Different offer than entry popup\n- Address common objections\n- Final compelling reason to stay\n\n**Formats:**\n- \"Wait! Before you go...\"\n- \"Forget something?\"\n- \"Get 10% off your first order\"\n- \"Questions? Chat with us\"\n\n### Announcement Banner\n**Goal**: Site-wide communication\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Top of page (sticky or static)\n- Single, clear message\n- Dismissable\n- Links to more info\n- Time-limited (don''t leave forever)\n\n### Slide-In\n**Goal**: Less intrusive engagement\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Enters from corner/bottom\n- Doesn''t block content\n- Easy to dismiss or minimize\n- Good for chat, support, secondary CTAs\n\n---\n\n## Design Best Practices\n\n### Visual Hierarchy\n1. Headline (largest, first seen)\n2. Value prop/offer (clear benefit)\n3. Form/CTA (obvious action)\n4. Close option (easy to find)\n\n### Sizing\n- Desktop: 400-600px wide typical\n- Don''t cover entire screen\n- Mobile: Full-width bottom or center, not full-screen\n- Leave space to close (visible X, click outside)\n\n### Close Button\n- Always visible (top right is convention)\n- Large enough to tap on mobile\n- \"No thanks\" text link as alternative\n- Click outside to close\n\n### Mobile Considerations\n- Can''t detect exit intent (use alternatives)\n- Full-screen overlays feel aggressive\n- Bottom slide-ups work well\n- Larger touch targets\n- Easy dismiss gestures\n\n### Imagery\n- Product image or preview\n- Face if relevant (increases trust)\n- Minimal for speed\n- Optional—copy can work alone\n\n---\n\n## Copy Formulas\n\n### Headlines\n- Benefit-driven: \"Get [result] in [timeframe]\"\n- Question: \"Want [desired outcome]?\"\n- Command: \"Don''t miss [thing]\"\n- Social proof: \"Join [X] people who...\"\n- Curiosity: \"The one thing [audience] always get wrong about [topic]\"\n\n### Subheadlines\n- Expand on the promise\n- Address objection (\"No spam, ever\")\n- Set expectations (\"Weekly tips in 5 min\")\n\n### CTA Buttons\n- First person works: \"Get My Discount\" vs \"Get Your Discount\"\n- Specific over generic: \"Send Me the Guide\" vs \"Submit\"\n- Value-focused: \"Claim My 10% Off\" vs \"Subscribe\"\n\n### Decline Options\n- Polite, not guilt-trippy\n- \"No thanks\" / \"Maybe later\" / \"I''m not interested\"\n- Avoid manipulative: \"No, I don''t want to save money\"\n\n---\n\n## Frequency and Rules\n\n### Frequency Capping\n- Show maximum once per session\n- Remember dismissals (cookie/localStorage)\n- 7-30 days before showing again\n- Respect user choice\n\n### Audience Targeting\n- New vs. returning visitors (different needs)\n- By traffic source (match ad message)\n- By page type (context-relevant)\n- Exclude converted users\n- Exclude recently dismissed\n\n### Page Rules\n- Exclude checkout/conversion flows\n- Consider blog vs. product pages\n- Match offer to page context\n\n---\n\n## Compliance and Accessibility\n\n### GDPR/Privacy\n- Clear consent language\n- Link to privacy policy\n- Don''t pre-check opt-ins\n- Honor unsubscribe/preferences\n\n### Accessibility\n- Keyboard navigable (Tab, Enter, Esc)\n- Focus trap while open\n- Screen reader compatible\n- Sufficient color contrast\n- Don''t rely on color alone\n\n### Google Guidelines\n- Intrusive interstitials hurt SEO\n- Mobile especially sensitive\n- Allow: Cookie notices, age verification, reasonable banners\n- Avoid: Full-screen before content on mobile\n\n---\n\n## Measurement\n\n### Key Metrics\n- **Impression rate**: Visitors who see popup\n- **Conversion rate**: Impressions → Submissions\n- **Close rate**: How many dismiss immediately\n- **Engagement rate**: Interaction before close\n- **Time to close**: How long before dismissing\n\n### What to Track\n- Popup views\n- Form focus\n- Submission attempts\n- Successful submissions\n- Close button clicks\n- Outside clicks\n- Escape key\n\n### Benchmarks\n- Email popup: 2-5% conversion typical\n- Exit intent: 3-10% conversion\n- Click-triggered: Higher (10%+, self-selected)\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Popup Design\n- **Type**: Email capture, lead magnet, etc.\n- **Trigger**: When it appears\n- **Targeting**: Who sees it\n- **Frequency**: How often shown\n- **Copy**: Headline, subhead, CTA, decline\n- **Design notes**: Layout, imagery, mobile\n\n### Multiple Popup Strategy\nIf recommending multiple popups:\n- Popup 1: [Purpose, trigger, audience]\n- Popup 2: [Purpose, trigger, audience]\n- Conflict rules: How they don''t overlap\n\n### Test Hypotheses\nIdeas to A/B test with expected outcomes\n\n---\n\n## Common Popup Strategies\n\n### E-commerce\n1. Entry/scroll: First-purchase discount\n2. Exit intent: Bigger discount or reminder\n3. Cart abandonment: Complete your order\n\n### B2B SaaS\n1. Click-triggered: Demo request, lead magnets\n2. Scroll: Newsletter/blog subscription\n3. Exit intent: Trial reminder or content offer\n\n### Content/Media\n1. Scroll-based: Newsletter after engagement\n2. Page count: Subscribe after multiple visits\n3. Exit intent: Don''t miss future content\n\n### Lead Generation\n1. Time-delayed: General list building\n2. Click-triggered: Specific lead magnets\n3. Exit intent: Final capture attempt\n\n---\n\n## Experiment Ideas\n\n### Placement & Format Experiments\n\n**Banner Variations**\n- Top bar vs. banner below header\n- Sticky banner vs. static banner\n- Full-width vs. contained banner\n- Banner with countdown timer vs. without\n\n**Popup Formats**\n- Center modal vs. slide-in from corner\n- Full-screen overlay vs. smaller modal\n- Bottom bar vs. corner popup\n- Top announcements vs. bottom slideouts\n\n**Position Testing**\n- Test popup sizes on desktop and mobile\n- Left corner vs. right corner for slide-ins\n- Test visibility without blocking content\n\n---\n\n### Trigger Experiments\n\n**Timing Triggers**\n- Exit intent vs. 30-second delay vs. 50% scroll depth\n- Test optimal time delay (10s vs. 30s vs. 60s)\n- Test scroll depth percentage (25% vs. 50% vs. 75%)\n- Page count trigger (show after X pages viewed)\n\n**Behavior Triggers**\n- Show based on user intent prediction\n- Trigger based on specific page visits\n- Return visitor vs. new visitor targeting\n- Show based on referral source\n\n**Click Triggers**\n- Click-triggered popups for lead magnets\n- Button-triggered vs. link-triggered modals\n- Test in-content triggers vs. sidebar triggers\n\n---\n\n### Messaging & Content Experiments\n\n**Headlines & Copy**\n- Test attention-grabbing vs. informational headlines\n- \"Limited-time offer\" vs. \"New feature alert\" messaging\n- Urgency-focused copy vs. value-focused copy\n- Test headline length and specificity\n\n**CTAs**\n- CTA button text variations\n- Button color testing for contrast\n- Primary + secondary CTA vs. single CTA\n- Test decline text (friendly vs. neutral)\n\n**Visual Content**\n- Add countdown timers to create urgency\n- Test with/without images\n- Product preview vs. generic imagery\n- Include social proof in popup\n\n---\n\n### Personalization Experiments\n\n**Dynamic Content**\n- Personalize popup based on visitor data\n- Show industry-specific content\n- Tailor content based on pages visited\n- Use progressive profiling (ask more over time)\n\n**Audience Targeting**\n- New vs. returning visitor messaging\n- Segment by traffic source\n- Target based on engagement level\n- Exclude already-converted visitors\n\n---\n\n### Frequency & Rules Experiments\n\n- Test frequency capping (once per session vs. once per week)\n- Cool-down period after dismissal\n- Test different dismiss behaviors\n- Show escalating offers over multiple visits\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What''s the primary goal for this popup?\n2. What''s your current popup performance (if any)?\n3. What traffic sources are you optimizing for?\n4. What incentive can you offer?\n5. Are there compliance requirements (GDPR, etc.)?\n6. Mobile vs. desktop traffic split?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **form-cro**: For optimizing the form inside the popup\n- **page-cro**: For the page context around popups\n- **email-sequence**: For what happens after popup conversion\n- **ab-test-setup**: For testing popup variations\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:54:59.722Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Conversion Rate Optimization Agents focusing on user experience and modal windows.","zh":"非常适合专注于用户体验和模态窗口的转化率优化（CRO）Agent。","ja":"ユーザーエクスペリエンスとモーダルウィンドウに焦点を当てたコンバージョン率最適化（CRO）エージェントに最適です。","ko":"사용자 경험과 모달 창에 초점을 맞춘 전환율 최적화(CRO) 에이전트에 이상적입니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de optimización de la tasa de conversión que se centran en la experiencia del usuario y las ventanas modales.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''optimisation du taux de conversion se concentrant sur l''expérience utilisateur et les fenêtres modales.","de":"Ideal für Agenten zur Optimierung der Konvertierungsrate, die sich auf die Benutzererfahrung und Modal-Fenster konzentrieren.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Otimização de Taxa de Conversão que se concentram em experiência do usuário e janelas modais.","ru":"Идеально для агентов оптимизации коэффициента конверсии, которые фокусируются на пользовательском опыте и модальных окнах.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحسين معدل التحويل الذين يركزون على تجربة المستخدم ونوافذ الطريقة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create optimized popups for email and newsletter capture, enhancing user engagement without compromising brand perception, utilizing context from product marketing files like `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` and focusing on modal optimization techniques.","zh":"赋能Agent利用来自产品营销文件（如`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`）的上下文，专注于模态优化技术，创建用于电子邮件和新闻通讯捕获的优化弹窗，从而在不影响品牌感知的情况下增强用户参与度。","ja":"製品マーケティングファイル（例：`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`）からのコンテキストを利用し、モーダル最適化技術に焦点を当てることで、エージェントがメールやニュースレター獲得のための最適化されたポップアップを作成し、ブランド認知を損なうことなくユーザーエンゲージメントを高めることを可能にします。","ko":"제품 마케팅 파일(예: `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`)의 컨텍스트를 활용하고 모달 최적화 기술에 집중하여, 에이전트가 이메일 및 뉴스레터 캡처를 위한 최적화된 팝업을 생성하여 브랜드 인식을 저해하지 않으면서 사용자 참여를 향상시킬 수 있도록 지원합니다.","es":"Empodera a los agentes para crear ventanas emergentes optimizadas para la captura de correos electrónicos y boletines, mejorando la participación del usuario sin comprometer la percepción de la marca, utilizando el contexto de los archivos de marketing de productos como `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` y centrándose en técnicas de optimización de ventanas modales.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des fenêtres contextuelles optimisées pour la capture d''e-mails et de newsletters, améliorant l''engagement de l''utilisateur sans compromettre la perception de la marque, en utilisant le contexte des fichiers de marketing de produits comme `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` et en se concentrant sur les techniques d''optimisation des fenêtres modales.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, optimierte Popups für die Erfassung von E-Mails und Newslettern zu erstellen, die die Benutzerverbindung verbessern, ohne die Markenwahrnehmung zu beeinträchtigen, indem sie den Kontext von Produktmarketingdateien wie `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` nutzen und sich auf Modal-Optimierungstechniken konzentrieren.","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem popups otimizados para captura de e-mail e boletim informativo, melhorando o engajamento do usuário sem comprometer a percepção da marca, utilizando o contexto de arquivos de marketing de produtos como `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` e se concentrando em técnicas de otimização de modais.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать оптимизированные всплывающие окна для захвата электронной почты и рассылки новостей, повышая вовлеченность пользователя без ущерба для восприятия бренда, используя контекст файлов маркетинга продукта, таких как `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`, и фокусируясь на техниках оптимизации модальных окон.","ar":"يسمح للعميلين بإنشاء نوافذ منبثقة مُحسنة لالتقاط البريد الإلكتروني والنشرة الإخبارية، وتحسين المشاركة من قبل المستخدم دون المساس بإدراك العلامة التجارية، باستخدام السياق من ملفات تسويق المنتج مثل `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` وتركيز على تقنيات تحسين الطريقة."},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing popup placement for maximum conversion","Designing modal windows that enhance user experience","Analyzing popup purpose for targeted marketing campaigns"],"zh":["优化弹窗布局以实现最大转化率","设计能够增强用户体验的模态窗口","分析用于定向营销活动的弹窗目的"],"ja":["最大のコンバージョン率のためのポップアップ配置の最適化","ユーザーエクスペリエンスを向上させるモーダルウィンドウの設計","ターゲットを絞ったマーケティングキャンペーンのためのポップアップ目的の分析"],"ko":["최대 전환율을 위한 팝업 배치 최적화","사용자 경험을 향상시키는 모달 창 설계","타겟 마케팅 캠페인을 위한 팝업 목적 분석"],"es":["Optimización de la colocación de ventanas emergentes para una mayor conversión","Diseño de ventanas modales que mejoran la experiencia del usuario","Análisis del propósito de las ventanas emergentes para campañas de marketing dirigidas"],"fr":["Optimisation du positionnement des fenêtres contextuelles pour une conversion maximale","Conception de fenêtres modales qui améliorent l''expérience utilisateur","Analyse de l''objectif des fenêtres contextuelles pour des campagnes marketing ciblées"],"de":["Optimierung der Platzierung von Popups für eine maximale Konvertierung","Entwurf von Modal-Fenstern, die die Benutzererfahrung verbessern","Analyse des Zwecks von Popups für gezielte Marketing-Kampagnen"],"pt":["Otimização da posição do popup para máxima conversão","Desenvolvimento de janelas modais que melhoram a experiência do usuário","Análise do propósito do popup para campanhas de marketing direcionadas"],"ru":["Оптимизация размещения всплывающих окон для максимальной конверсии","Разработка модальных окон, которые улучшают пользовательский опыт","Анализ цели всплывающего окна для целевых маркетинговых кампаний"],"ar":["تحسين وضع النوافذ المنبثقة للحصول على أقصى تحويل","تصميم نوافذ الطريقة التي تحسن تجربة المستخدم","تحليل غرض النافذة المنبثقة للحملات التسويقية المستهدفة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of product marketing context","Dependent on specific task requirements for popup optimization"],"zh":["需要理解产品营销背景","依赖于弹窗优化的具体任务要求"],"ja":["製品マーケティングのコンテキストの理解が必要","ポップアップ最適化のための特定のタスク要件に依存"],"ko":["제품 마케팅 컨텍스트에 대한 이해가 필요함","팝업 최적화를 위한 특정 작업 요구사항에 의존함"],"es":["Requiere una comprensión del contexto de marketing de productos","Dependiente de requisitos de tareas específicas para la optimización de ventanas emergentes"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension du contexte de marketing de produits","Dépendante d''exigences de tâches spécifiques pour l''optimisation des fenêtres contextuelles"],"de":["Erfordert ein Verständnis des Produktmarketing-Kontexts","Abhängig von bestimmten Aufgabenanforderungen für die Popup-Optimierung"],"pt":["Exige compreensão do contexto de marketing de produtos","Depende de requisitos específicos de tarefas para otimização de popups"],"ru":["Требует понимания контекста маркетинга продукта","Зависит от конкретных требований задач для оптимизации всплывающих окон"],"ar":["يتطلب فهمًا للسياق تسويق المنتج","يعتمد على متطلبات مهمة محددة لتحسين النوافذ المنبثقة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"0d37211c60d0ef1a67deef75f2f31feb79788cf33a0a7ed573a6c119c83219ae","qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('sayeedjoy/seucampusmate-web/core-web-vitals', 'community', 'sayeedjoy', 'seucampusmate-web', 'sayeedjoy/seucampusmate-web', 'core-web-vitals', 0, 0, 50, '2026-03-02T01:56:10.984Z', '2026-03-02T02:59:25.810Z', 'b03396c9bd7a41950bbaf5964bc8f1cf60a3c81830a6171614d6413c8bff308c', '{"id":"sayeedjoy/seucampusmate-web/core-web-vitals","name":"core-web-vitals","description":{"zh":"核心网页生命体征AI工具，是一个用于提升网页性能的Web companion，提供学术工具、校园信息和学生资源","ja":"Core Web Vitals AIエージェントは、Webパフォーマンスを向上させるためのWeb companionです。学術ツール、キャンパス情報、学生リソースを一つに提供","ko":"코어 웹 비탈스 AI 에이전트는 웹 페이지 성능을 향상시키는 Web companion입니다. 학술 도구, 캠퍼스 정보, 학생 리소스를 하나로 제공","es":"Core-web-vitals es un conjunto de métricas para evaluar la calidad de la experiencia del usuario en el web. Mejora la velocidad y la eficiencia de tus sitios web","fr":"Core-web-vitals est un ensemble de métricas pour évaluer la qualité de l''expérience utilisateur sur le web. Améliorez la vitesse et l''efficacité de vos sites web","de":"Core-Web-Vitals ist ein Satz von Metriken, um die Qualität der Benutzererfahrung im Web zu bewerten. Verbessern Sie die Geschwindigkeit und Effizienz Ihrer Websites","pt":"O Core Web Vitals é uma ferramenta de inteligência artificial que ajuda os desenvolvedores a otimizar o desempenho da web","ru":"Core Web Vitals - это ИИ Агент, который помогает веб-разработчикам оптимизировать производительность веб-приложений","ar":"Core Web Vitals هو أداة ذكاء اصطناعي تساعد المطورين على تحسين أداء الويب","en":"Web companion for Southeast University students. Academic tools, campus info, and student resources in one place."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"核心网页生命体征AI工具","ja":"Core Web Vitals AIエージェント","ko":"코어 웹 비탈스 AI 에이전트","es":"Herramientas de core-web-vitals para desarrolladores","fr":"Outils de core-web-vitals pour les développeurs","de":"Core-Web-Vitals-Tools für Entwickler","pt