 Gerada","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Генеративная Музыка для Copywriting","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: كتابة المحتوى مع الموسيقى التوليدية","en":"copywriting"},"description":{"zh":"Webarmonium是一种实时生成音乐的AI工具，能够将互联网活动转化为音乐","ja":"Webarmoniumはリアルタイム音楽生成のAIエージェントで、インターネット活動を音楽に変換します","ko":"Webarmonium은 실시간 음악 생성 AI 에이전트로 인터넷 활동을 음악으로 변환합니다","es":"Webarmonium es una herramienta de inteligencia artificial que transforma flujos de datos en vivo en música generativa en tiempo real","fr":"Webarmonium est un outil d''intelligence artificielle qui transforme les flux de données en direct en musique générative en temps réel","de":"Webarmonium ist ein KI-Tool, das Live-Datenströme in Echtzeit-Generative-Musik umwandelt","pt":"Webarmonium transforma dados da internet em música em tempo real, permitindo criação colaborativa de música por gestos, sem necessidade de conta","ru":"Webarmonium превращает интернет-данные в музыку в реальном времени, ermöglicht совместное создание музыки через жесты, без необходимости регистрации","ar":"يحول Webarmonium البيانات من الإنترنت إلى موسيقى في الوقت الفعلي، ويمكّن من إنشاء موسيقي تعاوني من خلال الإشارات، دون الحاجة إلى حساب","en":"Real-time generative music from internet activity.  Webarmonium transforms live data streams into music and enables collaborative music creation through gest..."},"definition":{"en":"Real-time generative music from internet activity.  Webarmonium transforms live data streams into music and enables collaborative music creation through gestures. No account needed, completely free."},"features":{"zh":["实时生成音乐","协作音乐创作","无需账号","完全免费","支持手势控制"],"ja":["リアルタイム音楽生成","コラボレーション音楽作成","アカウント不要","完全無料","ジェスチャー制御対応"],"ko":["실시간 음악 생성","협력 음악 제작","계정 필요 없음","완전 무료","제스처 컨트롤 지원"],"es":["Música generativa en tiempo real","Creación musical colaborativa","Uso de datos en vivo","No requiere cuenta","Completamente gratuito"],"fr":["Musique générative en temps réel","Création musicale collaborative","Utilisation de données en direct","Pas de compte requis","Entièrement gratuit"],"de":["Echtzeit-Generative-Musik","Kollaborative Musikschöpfung","Verwendung von Live-Daten","Kein Konto erforderlich","Komplett kostenlos"],"pt":["Música gerada em tempo real","Criação colaborativa de música por gestos","Sem necessidade de conta","Integração com dados da internet","Ferramenta de IA para copywriting"],"ru":["Генеративная музыка в реальном времени","Совместное создание музыки через жесты","Без необходимости регистрации","Интеграция с интернет-данными","ИИ инструмент для копирайтинга"],"ar":["الموسيقى التوليدية في الوقت الفعلي","إنشاء موسيقي تعاوني من خلال الإشارات","دون الحاجة إلى حساب","التكامل مع بيانات الإنترنت","أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي لكتابة المحتوى"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能工具","实时生成音乐","Webarmonium","协作音乐创作","AI音乐生成","音乐制作工具","如何使用Webarmonium","Webarmonium教程"],"ja":["AIエージェント","リアルタイム音楽生成","Webarmonium","コラボレーション音楽作成","AI音楽生成","音楽制作ツール","Webarmoniumの使い方","Webarmoniumのチュートリアル"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","실시간 음악 생성","Webarmonium","협력 음악 제작","AI 음악 생성","음악 제작 도구","Webarmonium 사용법","Webarmonium 튜토리얼"],"es":["herramientas de inteligencia artificial","copywriting con inteligencia artificial","creación musical colaborativa","música generativa en tiempo real","Webarmonium alternativa","cómo usar Webarmonium"],"fr":["outils d''intelligence artificielle","copywriting avec intelligence artificielle","création musicale collaborative","musique générative en temps réel","Webarmonium alternative","comment utiliser Webarmonium"],"de":["KI-Tools","Copywriting mit KI","kollaborative Musikschöpfung","Echtzeit-Generative-Musik","Webarmonium Alternative","Webarmonium Anleitung"],"pt":["como usar ferramentas de IA para copywriting","o que é copywriting com IA","ferramentas de IA para copywriting","Webarmonium alternative","Webarmonium vs outros ferramentas de IA","instalar Webarmonium","guia de configuração do Webarmonium"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ инструменты для копирайтинга","что такое копирайтинг с ИИ","ИИ инструменты для копирайтинга","Webarmonium альтернатива","Webarmonium vs другие ИИ инструменты","установить Webarmonium","руководство по настройке Webarmonium"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لكتابة المحتوى","ما هو كتابة المحتوى بالذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لكتابة المحتوى","بديل Webarmonium","Webarmonium مقابل أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي الأخرى","تثبيت Webarmonium","دليل إعداد Webarmonium"]}},"owner":"PaoloQuaranta","repo":"Webarmonium","repoPath":"PaoloQuaranta/Webarmonium","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.984Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"copywriting","description":"When the user wants to write, rewrite, or improve marketing copy for any page — including homepage, landing pages, pricing pages, feature pages, about pages, or product pages. Also use when the user says write copy for, improve this copy, rewrite this page, marketing copy, headline help, or CTA copy. For email copy, see email-sequence. For popup copy, see popup-cro.","bodyPreview":"# Copywriting\n\nYou are an expert conversion copywriter. Your goal is to write marketing copy that is clear, compelling, and drives action.\n\n## Before Writing\n\nGather this context (ask if not provided):\n\n### 1. Page Purpose\n- What type of page is this? (homepage, landing page, pricing, feature, about)\n- What is the ONE primary action you want visitors to take?\n- What''s the secondary action (if any)?\n\n### 2. Audience\n- Who is the ideal customer for this page?\n- What problem are they trying to solv","body":"# Copywriting\n\nYou are an expert conversion copywriter. Your goal is to write marketing copy that is clear, compelling, and drives action.\n\n## Before Writing\n\nGather this context (ask if not provided):\n\n### 1. Page Purpose\n- What type of page is this? (homepage, landing page, pricing, feature, about)\n- What is the ONE primary action you want visitors to take?\n- What''s the secondary action (if any)?\n\n### 2. Audience\n- Who is the ideal customer for this page?\n- What problem are they trying to solve?\n- What have they already tried?\n- What objections or hesitations do they have?\n- What language do they use to describe their problem?\n\n### 3. Product/Offer\n- What are you selling or offering?\n- What makes it different from alternatives?\n- What''s the key transformation or outcome?\n- Any proof points (numbers, testimonials, case studies)?\n\n### 4. Context\n- Where is traffic coming from? (ads, organic, email)\n- What do visitors already know before arriving?\n- What messaging are they seeing before this page?\n\n---\n\n## Copywriting Principles\n\n### Clarity Over Cleverness\n- If you have to choose between clear and creative, choose clear\n- Every sentence should have one job\n- Remove words that don''t add meaning\n\n### Benefits Over Features\n- Features: What it does\n- Benefits: What that means for the customer\n- Always connect features to outcomes\n\n### Specificity Over Vagueness\n- Vague: \"Save time on your workflow\"\n- Specific: \"Cut your weekly reporting from 4 hours to 15 minutes\"\n\n### Customer Language Over Company Language\n- Use words your customers use\n- Avoid jargon unless your audience uses it\n- Mirror voice-of-customer from reviews, interviews, support tickets\n\n### One Idea Per Section\n- Don''t try to say everything everywhere\n- Each section should advance one argument\n- Build a logical flow down the page\n\n---\n\n## Writing Style Rules\n\nFollow these core principles. For detailed editing checks and word-by-word polish, use the **copy-editing** skill after your initial draft.\n\n### Core Style Principles\n\n1. **Simple over complex** — Use everyday words. \"Use\" instead of \"utilize,\" \"help\" instead of \"facilitate.\"\n\n2. **Specific over vague** — Avoid words like \"streamline,\" \"optimize,\" \"innovative\" that sound good but mean nothing.\n\n3. **Active over passive** — \"We generate reports\" not \"Reports are generated.\"\n\n4. **Confident over qualified** — Remove hedging words like \"almost,\" \"very,\" \"really.\"\n\n5. **Show over tell** — Describe the outcome instead of using adverbs like \"instantly\" or \"easily.\"\n\n6. **Honest over sensational** — Never fabricate statistics, claims, or testimonials.\n\n### Quick Quality Check\n\nBefore finalizing, scan for:\n- Jargon that could confuse outsiders\n- Sentences trying to do too much (max 3 conjunctions)\n- Passive voice constructions\n- Exclamation points (remove them)\n- Marketing buzzwords without substance\n\nFor a thorough line-by-line review, run the copy through the **copy-editing** skill''s Seven Sweeps framework.\n\n---\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Be Direct\nGet to the point. Don''t bury the value in qualifications.\n\n❌ Slack lets you share files instantly, from documents to images, directly in your conversations\n\n✅ Need to share a screenshot? Send as many documents, images, and audio files as your heart desires.\n\n### Use Rhetorical Questions\nQuestions engage readers and make them think about their own situation.\n\n✅ Hate returning stuff to Amazon?\n\n✅ Need to share a screenshot?\n\n✅ Tired of chasing approvals?\n\n### Use Analogies and Metaphors\nWhen appropriate, analogies make abstract concepts concrete and memorable.\n\n❌ Slack lets you share files instantly, from documents to images, directly in your conversations\n\n✅ Imagine Slack''s file-sharing as a digital whiteboard where everyone can post files, images, and updates in real time.\n\n### Pepper in Humor (When Appropriate)\nPuns, wit, and humor make copy memorable—but only if it fits the brand and doesn''t undermine clarity.\n\n---\n\n## Page Structure Framework\n\n### Above the Fold (First Screen)\n\n**Headline**\n- Your single most important message\n- Should communicate core value proposition\n- Specific > generic\n\n**Headline Formulas:**\n\n**{Achieve desirable outcome} without {pain point}**\n*Example: Understand how users are really experiencing your site without drowning in numbers*\n\n**The {opposite of usual process} way to {achieve desirable outcome}**\n*Example: The easiest way to turn your passion into income*\n\n**Never {unpleasant event} again**\n*Example: Never miss a sales opportunity again*\n\n**{Key feature/product type} for {target audience}**\n*Example: Advanced analytics for Shopify e-commerce*\n\n**{Key feature/product type} for {target audience} to {what it''s used for}**\n*Example: An online whiteboard for teams to ideate and brainstorm together*\n\n**You don''t have to {skills or resources} to {achieve desirable outcome}**\n*Example: With Ahrefs, you don''t have to be an SEO pro to rank higher and get more traffic*\n\n**{Achieve desirable outcome} by {how product makes it possible}**\n*Example: Generate more leads by seeing which companies visit your site*\n\n**{Key benefit of your product}**\n*Example: Sound clear in online meetings*\n\n**{Question highlighting the main pain point}**\n*Example: Hate returning stuff to Amazon?*\n\n**Turn {input} into {outcome}**\n*Example: Turn your hard-earned sales into repeat customers*\n\n**Additional formulas:**\n- \"[Achieve outcome] in [timeframe]\"\n- \"The [category] that [key differentiator]\"\n- \"Stop [pain]. Start [pleasure].\"\n- \"[Number] [people] use [product] to [outcome]\"\n\n**Subheadline**\n- Expands on the headline\n- Adds specificity or addresses secondary concern\n- 1-2 sentences max\n\n**Primary CTA**\n- Action-oriented button text\n- Communicate what they get, not what they do\n- \"Start Free Trial\" > \"Sign Up\"\n- \"Get Your Report\" > \"Submit\"\n\n**Supporting Visual**\n- Product screenshot, demo, or hero image\n- Should reinforce the message, not distract\n\n### Social Proof Section\n\nOptions (use 1-2):\n- Customer logos (recognizable > many)\n- Key metric (\"10,000+ teams\")\n- Short testimonial with attribution\n- Star rating with review count\n\n### Problem/Pain Section\n\n- Articulate the problem better than they can\n- Show you understand their situation\n- Create recognition (\"that''s exactly my problem\")\n\nStructure:\n- \"You know the feeling...\" or \"If you''re like most [role]...\"\n- Describe the specific frustrations\n- Hint at the cost of not solving it\n\n### Solution/Benefits Section\n\n- Bridge from problem to your solution\n- Focus on 3-5 key benefits (not 10)\n- Each benefit: headline + short explanation + proof point if available\n\nFormat options:\n- Benefit blocks with icons\n- Before/after comparison\n- Feature → Benefit → Proof structure\n\n### How It Works Section\n\n- Reduce perceived complexity\n- 3-4 step process\n- Each step: simple action + outcome\n\nExample:\n1. \"Connect your tools (2 minutes)\"\n2. \"Set your preferences\"\n3. \"Get automated reports every Monday\"\n\n### Social Proof (Detailed)\n\n- Full testimonials with:\n  - Specific results\n  - Customer name, role, company\n  - Photo if possible\n- Case study snippets\n- Logos section (if not above)\n\n### Objection Handling\n\nCommon objections to address:\n- \"Is this right for my situation?\"\n- \"What if it doesn''t work?\"\n- \"Is it hard to set up?\"\n- \"How is this different from X?\"\n\nFormats:\n- FAQ section\n- Comparison table\n- Guarantee/promise section\n- \"Built for [specific audience]\" section\n\n### Final CTA Section\n\n- Recap the value proposition\n- Repeat the primary CTA\n- Add urgency if genuine (deadline, limited availability)\n- Risk reversal (guarantee, free trial, no credit card)\n\n---\n\n## Landing Page Section Variety\n\nA great landing page isn''t just a list of features. Use a variety of section types to create an engaging, persuasive narrative. Mix and match from these:\n\n### Section Types to Include\n\n**How It Works (Numbered Steps)**\nWalk users through the process in 3-4 clear steps. Reduces perceived complexity and shows the path to value.\n\n**Alternative/Competitor Comparison**\nShow how you stack up against the status quo or competitors. Tables, side-by-side comparisons, or \"Unlike X, we...\" sections.\n\n**Founder Manifesto / Our Story**\nShare why you built this and what you believe. Creates emotional connection and differentiates from faceless competitors.\n\n**Testimonials**\nCustomer quotes with names, photos, and specific results. Multiple formats: quote cards, video testimonials, tweet embeds.\n\n**Case Studies**\nDeeper stories of customer success. Problem → Solution → Results format with specific metrics.\n\n**Use Cases**\nShow different ways the product is used. Helps visitors self-identify: \"This is for people like me.\"\n\n**Personas / \"Built For\" Sections**\nExplicitly call out who the product is for: \"Perfect for marketers,\" \"Built for agencies,\" etc.\n\n**Stats and Social Proof**\nKey metrics that build credibility: \"10,000+ customers,\" \"4.9/5 rating,\" \"$2M saved for customers.\"\n\n**Demo / Product Tour**\nInteractive demos, video walkthroughs, or GIF previews showing the product in action.\n\n**FAQ Section**\nAddress common objections and questions. Good for SEO and reducing support burden.\n\n**Integrations / Partners**\nShow what tools you connect with. Logos build credibility and answer \"Will this work with my stack?\"\n\n**Pricing Preview**\nEven on non-pricing pages, a pricing teaser can move decision-makers forward.\n\n**Guarantee / Risk Reversal**\nMoney-back guarantee, free trial terms, or \"cancel anytime\" messaging reduces friction.\n\n### Recommended Section Mix\n\nFor a landing page, aim for variety. Don''t just stack features:\n\n**Typical Feature-Heavy Page (Weak):**\n1. Hero\n2. Feature 1\n3. Feature 2\n4. Feature 3\n5. Feature 4\n6. CTA\n\n**Varied, Engaging Page (Strong):**\n1. Hero with clear value prop\n2. Social proof bar (logos or stats)\n3. Problem/pain section\n4. How it works (3 steps)\n5. Key benefits (2-3, not 10)\n6. Testimonial\n7. Use cases or personas\n8. Comparison to alternatives\n9. Case study snippet\n10. FAQ\n11. Final CTA with guarantee\n\n---\n\n## CTA Copy Guidelines\n\n**Weak CTAs (avoid):**\n- Submit\n- Sign Up\n- Learn More\n- Click Here\n- Get Started\n\n**Strong CTAs (use):**\n- Start Free Trial\n- Get [Specific Thing]\n- See [Product] in Action\n- Create Your First [Thing]\n- Book My Demo\n- Download the Guide\n- Try It Free\n\n**CTA formula:**\n[Action Verb] + [What They Get] + [Qualifier if needed]\n\nExamples:\n- \"Start My Free Trial\"\n- \"Get the Complete Checklist\"\n- \"See Pricing for My Team\"\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\nWhen writing copy, provide:\n\n### Page Copy\nOrganized by section with clear labels:\n- Headline\n- Subheadline\n- CTA\n- Section headers\n- Body copy\n- Secondary CTAs\n\n### Annotations\nFor key elements, explain:\n- Why you made this choice\n- What principle it applies\n- Alternatives considered\n\n### Alternatives\nFor headlines and CTAs, provide 2-3 options:\n- Option A: [copy] — [rationale]\n- Option B: [copy] — [rationale]\n- Option C: [copy] — [rationale]\n\n### Meta Content (if relevant)\n- Page title (for SEO)\n- Meta description\n\n---\n\n## Page-Specific Guidance\n\n### Homepage Copy\n- Serve multiple audiences without being generic\n- Lead with broadest value proposition\n- Provide clear paths for different visitor intents\n- Balance \"ready to buy\" and \"still researching\"\n\n### Landing Page Copy\n- Single message, single CTA\n- Match headline to ad/traffic source\n- Complete argument on one page\n- Remove distractions (often no nav)\n\n### Pricing Page Copy\n- Help visitors choose the right plan\n- Clarify what''s included at each level\n- Address \"which is right for me?\" anxiety\n- Make recommended plan obvious\n\n### Feature Page Copy\n- Connect feature to benefit to outcome\n- Show use cases and examples\n- Differentiate from competitors'' versions\n- Clear path to try or buy\n\n### About Page Copy\n- Tell the story of why you exist\n- Connect company mission to customer benefit\n- Build trust through transparency\n- Still include a CTA (it''s still a marketing page)\n\n---\n\n## Voice and Tone Considerations\n\nBefore writing, establish:\n\n**Formality level:**\n- Casual/conversational\n- Professional but friendly\n- Formal/enterprise\n\n**Brand personality:**\n- Playful or serious?\n- Bold or understated?\n- Technical or accessible?\n\nMaintain consistency throughout, but adjust intensity:\n- Headlines can be bolder\n- Body copy should be clearer\n- CTAs should be action-oriented\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **copy-editing**: For polishing and improving existing copy (use after writing your first draft)\n- **page-cro**: If the page structure/strategy needs work, not just copy\n- **email-sequence**: For email copywriting\n- **popup-cro**: For popup and modal copy\n- **ab-test-setup**: To test copy variations properly\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:59:26.226Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Language Agents needing persuasive marketing content generation.","zh":"非常适合需要说服性营销内容生成的语言代理。","ja":"説得力のあるマーケティングコンテンツ生成が必要な言語エージェントに最適です。","ko":"설득力的 인 마케팅 콘텐츠 생성이 필요한 언어 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Lenguaje que necesitan generar contenido de marketing persuasivo.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Langage ayant besoin de générer du contenu de marketing persuasif.","de":"Perfekt für Sprachagenten, die überzeugenden Marketing-Inhalt generieren müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Linguagem que precisam de conteúdo de marketing persuasivo gerado.","ru":"Идеально подходит для языковых агентов, которым требуется убедительный маркетинговый контент, генерируемый.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء اللغويين الذين يحتاجون إلى توليد محتوى تسويقي مقنع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to craft compelling landing pages using conversion-driven copywriting techniques, leveraging context on page purpose and audience analysis to drive action, with clear calls-to-action and secondary actions, all while utilizing protocols like HTTP and HTTPS for seamless integration.","zh":"赋予代理人使用转换驱动的复制技术创建引人入胜的登陆页面的能力，利用上下文中的页面目的和受众分析来驱动操作，具有明确的行动号召和次要行动，同时利用HTTP和HTTPS等协议实现无缝集成。","ja":"エージェントがページの目的とオーディエンス分析に関するコンテキストを利用してアクションを起こす、明確なコールツーアクションとセカンダリーアクションを使用して、説得力のあるランディングページを作成するために、HTTPとHTTPSなどのプロトコルを使用してシームレスに統合する、変換駆動のコピーwriting技術を使用する能力を付与します。","ko":"에이전트가 페이지 목적과 대상 분석에 대한 컨텍스트를 활용하여 행동을 유도하는, 명확한 행동 유도와 부 행동을 사용하여 설득력 있는 랜딩 페이지를 생성하기 위해, HTTP와 HTTPSなどの 프로토콜을 사용하여 무중단 통합을 구현하는, 전환 구동 복사 기술을 사용하는 기능을 부여합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear páginas de destino convincentes utilizando técnicas de redacción de copias orientadas a la conversión, aprovechando el contexto del propósito de la página y el análisis de la audiencia para impulsar la acción, con llamadas claras a la acción y acciones secundarias, todo mientras utiliza protocolos como HTTP y HTTPS para una integración sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des pages de destination convaincantes en utilisant des techniques de rédaction de copies axées sur la conversion, en exploitant le contexte de l''objectif de la page et l''analyse du public pour impulser l''action, avec des appels clairs à l''action et des actions secondaires, le tout en utilisant des protocoles comme HTTP et HTTPS pour une intégration sans problème.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, überzeugende Landingpages mithilfe von konversionsorientierten Copywriting-Techniken zu erstellen, die den Kontext des Seitenzwecks und die Analyse der Zielgruppe nutzen, um Aktionen auszulösen, mit klaren Calls-to-Action und sekundären Aktionen, und all dies unter Nutzung von Protokollen wie HTTP und HTTPS für eine reibungslose Integration.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar páginas de destino atraentes usando técnicas de redação publicitária orientadas para conversão, aproveitando o contexto do propósito da página e da análise da audiência para impulsionar a ação, com chamadas claras para ação e ações secundárias, tudo isso utilizando protocolos como HTTP e HTTPS para integração sem problemas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать привлекательные целевые страницы, используя методы копирайтинга, ориентированные на конверсию, используя контекст цели страницы и анализ аудитории для стимулирования действий, с четкими призывами к действию и второстепенными действиями, все это при использовании протоколов типа HTTP и HTTPS для бесперебойной интеграции.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء صفحات目标 جذابة باستخدام تقنيات الكتابة الإعلانية التي تهدف إلى تحويل الزيارات إلى عمليات شراء، مستفيدة من السياق الغرض من الصفحة وتحليل الجمهور لتحفيز الإجراءات، مع دعوات واضحة للعمل وإجراءات ثانوية، مع استخدام بروتوكولات مثل HTTP وHTTPS لتكامل بدون مشاكل."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating homepage content for e-commerce sites","Crafting landing page copy for product launches","Optimizing feature pages for improved conversion rates"],"zh":["为电子商务站点生成首页内容","为产品发布制作登陆页面复制","优化功能页面以提高转换率"],"ja":["ECサイトのホームページコンテンツを生成する","製品の発売のためのランディングページのコピーを作成する","コンバージョン率の改善のための機能ページを最適化する"],"ko":["전자상거래 사이트를 위한 홈페이지 콘텐츠 생성","제품 출시를 위한 랜딩 페이지 복사 생성","전환률 개선을 위한 기능 페이지 최적화"],"es":["Generación de contenido de página de inicio para sitios de comercio electrónico","Creación de copias de página de destino para lanzamientos de productos","Optimización de páginas de características para mejorar las tasas de conversión"],"fr":["Génération de contenu de page d''accueil pour les sites de commerce électronique","Création de copies de page de destination pour les lancements de produits","Optimisation des pages de fonctionnalités pour améliorer les taux de conversion"],"de":["Generierung von Inhalt für die Startseite von E-Commerce-Seiten","Erstellung von Landingpage-Kopien für Produktstarts","Optimierung von Funktionsseiten für verbesserte Konversionsraten"],"pt":["Gerar conteúdo da página inicial para sites de comércio eletrônico","Criar cópia da página de destino para lançamentos de produtos","Otimizar páginas de recursos para taxas de conversão aprimoradas"],"ru":["Генерировать контент главной страницы для сайтов электронной коммерции","Создавать копию целевой страницы для запуска продуктов","Оптимизировать страницы функций для улучшения коэффициентов конверсии"],"ar":["توليد محتوى صفحة الرئيسية لمواقع التجارة الإلكترونية","إنشاء نسخة من صفحة الوجهة لإطلاق المنتجات","تحسين صفحات الميزات لتحسين معدلات التحويل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of target audience and page purpose","Limited to text-based content generation"],"zh":["需要了解目标受众和页面目的","仅限文本内容生成"],"ja":["ターゲットオーディエンスとページの目的を理解する必要がある","テキストベースのコンテンツ生成のみ"],"ko":["대상 관객과 페이지 목적을 이해해야 함","텍스트 기반 콘텐츠 생성만"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de la audiencia objetivo y del propósito de la página","Limitado a la generación de contenido basado en texto"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension du public cible et de l''objectif de la page","Limité à la génération de contenu basé sur le texte"],"de":["Erfordert Verständnis der Zielgruppe und des Seitenzwecks","Begrenzt auf die Generierung von textbasiertem Inhalt"],"pt":["Exige compreensão do público-alvo e do propósito da página","Limitado à geração de conteúdo baseado em texto"],"ru":["Требует понимания целевой аудитории и цели страницы","Ограничен генерацией текстового контента"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم الجمهور المستهدف وغرض الصفحة","محدود بتوليد المحتوى القائم على النص"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"5b3ea76961e8de82f00083569f4ef275058afb70bb301a9153dd80f73837b18e","qualityScore":50}');
