"Ferramenta de gestão de projetos","Integração com outras ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Эффективное управление задачами","Организация дня","Повышение производительности","Инструмент управления проектами","Интеграция с другими инструментами разработки"],"ar":["إدارة المهام الفعالة","تنظيم اليوم","زيادة الإنتاجية","أداة لإدارة المشاريع","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير الأخرى"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用codex-a11y-audit","什么是AI智能工具","codex-a11y-audit替代品","codex-a11y-audit与竞争对手的比较","codex-a11y-audit安装","codex-a11y-audit设置指南","AI智能任务管理","工程师生产力优化"],"ja":["codex-a11y-auditの使い方","AIエージェントとは","codex-a11y-auditの代替","codex-a11y-auditと競合製品の比較","codex-a11y-auditのインストール","codex-a11y-auditの設定ガイド","AIエージェントのタスクマネージャー","エンジニアの生産性の最適化"],"ko":["codex-a11y-audit 사용법","AI 에이전트란","codex-a11y-audit 대체","codex-a11y-audit와 경쟁 제품 비교","codex-a11y-audit 설치","codex-a11y-audit 설정 가이드","AI 에이전트의 태스크 매니저","엔지니어의 생산성 최적화"],"es":["herramientas de AI para ingenieros","codex-a11y-audit tutorial","mejora de la productividad","accesibilidad en el desarrollo de software","alternativas a codex-a11y-audit","codex-a11y-audit vs otras herramientas de AI","instalación de codex-a11y-audit","guía de configuración de codex-a11y-audit"],"fr":["outils IA pour les ingénieurs","tutoriel codex-a11y-audit","amélioration de la productivité","accessibilité dans le développement de logiciels","alternatives à codex-a11y-audit","codex-a11y-audit vs d''autres outils IA","installation de codex-a11y-audit","guide de configuration de codex-a11y-audit"],"de":["KI-Tools für Ingenieure","codex-a11y-audit-Tutorial","Produktivitätssteigerung","Zugänglichkeit in der Softwareentwicklung","Alternativen zu codex-a11y-audit","codex-a11y-audit vs andere KI-Tools","Installation von codex-a11y-audit","Konfigurationsanleitung für codex-a11y-audit"],"pt":["como usar codex-a11y-audit","o que é codex-a11y-audit","ferramentas de ia para engenheiros","codex-a11y-audit vs trello","instalar codex-a11y-audit","guias de configuração do codex-a11y-audit","alternativas ao codex-a11y-audit","codex-a11y-audit para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["как использовать codex-a11y-audit","что такое codex-a11y-audit","инструменты ии для инженеров","codex-a11y-audit vs trello","установить codex-a11y-audit","руководства по настройке codex-a11y-audit","альтернативы codex-a11y-audit","codex-a11y-audit для разработчиков"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام codex-a11y-audit","ما هو codex-a11y-audit","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمهندسين","codex-a11y-audit vs trello","تثبيت codex-a11y-audit","دلائل إعداد codex-a11y-audit","بديلات codex-a11y-audit","codex-a11y-audit للمطورين"]}},"owner":"SwitchbackTech","repo":"compass","repoPath":"SwitchbackTech/compass","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.988Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"codex-a11y-audit","description":"Use when reviewing UI diffs, accessibility audits, or flaky UI tests to catch a11y regressions, semantic issues, keyboard/focus problems, and to recommend minimal fixes plus role-based test selectors.","version":"1.0.0","tags":"","bodyPreview":"# Accessibility Change Audit\n\nBrief purpose: review UI changes for accessibility regressions and missing improvements, then propose minimal fixes tied to the diff.\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill audits UI diffs for semantics, keyboard access, focus management, ARIA correctness, contrast, and testability. It is diff-first: only evaluate changed lines and their immediate context.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- A diff, PR, or change list that includes relevant UI files.\n- Optional: a screenshot or description of t","body":"# Accessibility Change Audit\n\nBrief purpose: review UI changes for accessibility regressions and missing improvements, then propose minimal fixes tied to the diff.\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill audits UI diffs for semantics, keyboard access, focus management, ARIA correctness, contrast, and testability. It is diff-first: only evaluate changed lines and their immediate context.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- A diff, PR, or change list that includes relevant UI files.\n- Optional: a screenshot or description of the changed UI state.\n\n## Instructions\n\n### Step 1: Scope the audit to the diff\n\nIdentify changed UI elements, interactions, and styles. Ignore unrelated files.\n\n### Step 2: Run the diff-first checklist\n\nFocus on changes that alter semantics, interaction, or visual affordances.\n\n### Step 3: Produce findings and minimal fixes\n\nTie each issue to a specific change and propose the smallest reasonable fix.\n\n### Step 4: Improve test reliability\n\nRecommend role- and name-based queries for tests instead of data or class selectors.\n\n## Audit Checklist (Diff-First)\n\nSemantics and structure\n\n- Headings follow order and are not skipped.\n- Interactive elements are buttons/links, not divs/spans.\n- Landmarks are present for new regions (main, nav, header, footer, aside).\n- Lists and tables use correct elements (ul/ol/li, th/thead/tbody).\n\nLabels and names\n\n- Inputs have labels or aria-label/aria-labelledby.\n- Icon-only controls have accessible names.\n- Helper text ties to inputs via aria-describedby.\n\nKeyboard and focus\n\n- All interactive elements are keyboard reachable and operable.\n- Focus order follows DOM order (avoid tabIndex > 0).\n- Dialogs/menus trap focus and return focus to trigger.\n\nARIA correctness\n\n- ARIA only when native semantics are insufficient.\n- aria-expanded/controls/pressed reflect actual state.\n- role is correct and not redundant.\n\nVisual and motion\n\n- Text and focus indicators meet contrast requirements.\n- Color is not the only indicator.\n- Motion respects reduced-motion preferences.\n\nMedia and imagery\n\n- Images have meaningful alt or empty alt for decorative.\n- Media controls are accessible and labeled.\n\nTesting reliability\n\n- New elements can be found by role and accessible name.\n- Interaction tests use user flows and semantic queries.\n\n## Minimal Fix Patterns\n\n1. Icon-only button\n\n- Add visible text or aria-label.\n\n2. Clickable non-button\n\n- Convert to <button> or add role=\"button\", tabIndex=0, and Enter/Space handling.\n\n3. Form label\n\n- Add <label htmlFor> or aria-labelledby and connect helper text with aria-describedby.\n\n4. Disclosure\n\n- Toggle uses aria-expanded and aria-controls; update on state change.\n\n5. Dialog\n\n- Use role=\"dialog\", aria-modal, label by heading, and return focus on close.\n\n## Output Format\n\nFindings (ordered by severity):\n\n- [severity] path:line - problem and impact\n  Fix: minimal change suggestion\n\nTests:\n\n- Recommend updates that use role/name queries and user-driven events.\n\nUX/Speed Note:\n\n- Call out any change that impacts perceived speed (layout shifts, heavy DOM, over-rendering).\n\nSeverity scale: blocker, high, medium, low.\n\n## Example Review Output\n\nFindings:\n\n- high `packages/web/src/views/Example.tsx:42` - Clickable div lacks keyboard support; keyboard users cannot activate it.\n  Fix: convert to <button type=\"button\"> or add role, tabIndex, and Enter/Space handlers.\n- medium `packages/web/src/views/Example.tsx:60` - Icon-only control has no accessible name.\n  Fix: add aria-label=\"Add event\".\n\nTests:\n\n- Add a role-based query: getByRole(\"button\", { name: /add event/i }).\n\nUX/Speed Note:\n\n- No layout shift detected; DOM complexity unchanged.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:02:19.258Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Accessibility-focused AI Agents needing automated UI change audits for semantics, keyboard access, and ARIA correctness.","zh":"Perfect for Accessibility-focused AI Agents needing automated UI change audits for semantics, keyboard access, and ARIA correctness.","ja":"Perfect for Accessibility-focused AI Agents needing automated UI change audits for semantics, keyboard access, and ARIA correctness.","ko":"Perfect for Accessibility-focused AI Agents needing automated UI change audits for semantics, keyboard access, and ARIA correctness.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA centrados en la accesibilidad que necesitan auditorías automatizadas de cambios de interfaz de usuario para semántica, acceso al teclado y corrección de ARIA.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA axés sur l''accessibilité nécessitant des audits automatisés de modifications d''interface utilisateur pour la sémantique, l''accès au clavier et la correction ARIA.","de":"Perfekt für barrierefreie KI-Agents, die automatisierte Prüfungen von Benutzeroberflächen-Änderungen für Semantik, Tastaturzugriff und ARIA-Korrektheit benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA com foco em Acessibilidade que precisam de auditorias automatizadas de alterações de UI para semântica, acesso ao teclado e correção do ARIA.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на доступность, которым необходимы автоматизированные аудиты изменений UI для семантики, доступа с клавиатуры и правильности ARIA.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يركزون على سهولة الوصول وهم بحاجة إلى تدقيق آلي للتغييرات في واجهة المستخدم للсемантиك ووصول لوحة المفاتيح وضبط ARIA."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to review UI diffs for accessibility regressions and missing improvements, proposing minimal fixes tied to the diff, utilizing protocols like PRs and change lists, and evaluating factors such as contrast and testability.","zh":"Empowers agents to review UI diffs for accessibility regressions and missing improvements, proposing minimal fixes tied to the diff, utilizing protocols like PRs and change lists, and evaluating factors such as contrast and testability.","ja":"Empowers agents to review UI diffs for accessibility regressions and missing improvements, proposing minimal fixes tied to the diff, utilizing protocols like PRs and change lists, and evaluating factors such as contrast and testability.","ko":"Empowers agents to review UI diffs for accessibility regressions and missing improvements, proposing minimal fixes tied to the diff, utilizing protocols like PRs and change lists, and evaluating factors such as contrast and testability.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a revisar las diferencias de interfaz de usuario para retrocesos de accesibilidad y mejoras perdidas, proponiendo soluciones mínimas vinculadas a la diferencia, utilizando protocolos como PR y listas de cambios, y evaluando factores como contraste y pruebas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de réviser les différences d''interface utilisateur pour les régressions et les améliorations manquantes en matière d''accessibilité, en proposant des corrections minimales liées à la différence, en utilisant des protocoles tels que PR et listes de modifications, et en évaluant des facteurs tels que le contraste et la testabilité.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, Benutzeroberflächen-Unterschiede für Barrierefreiheitsrückschritte und fehlende Verbesserungen zu überprüfen, minimale Korrekturen im Zusammenhang mit dem Unterschied vorschlagend, Protokolle wie PR und Änderungslisten verwendend und Faktoren wie Kontrast und Testbarkeit bewertend.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a revisar as diferenças de UI para regressões de acessibilidade e melhorias ausentes, propondo soluções mínimas vinculadas à diferença, utilizando protocolos como PRs e listas de alterações, e avaliando fatores como contraste e testabilidade.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью просматривать различия в UI для выявления регрессий доступности и отсутствующих улучшений, предлагая минимальные исправления, связанные с различием, используя протоколы типа PR и списки изменений, и оценивая такие факторы, как контраст и тестируемость.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من مراجعة فروق واجهة المستخدم للانحدارات في سهولة الوصول والتحسينات المفقودة، مع提出 إصلاحات محدودة مرتبطة بالفرق، واستخدام بروتوكولات مثل PRs وقوائم التغيير، وتقييم عوامل مثل التباين والقابلية للفحص."},"useCases":{"en":["Auditing UI changes for accessibility compliance","Identifying keyboard access and focus management issues in UI diffs","Proposing minimal fixes for ARIA correctness and contrast improvements"],"zh":["Auditing UI changes for accessibility compliance","Identifying keyboard access and focus management issues in UI diffs","Proposing minimal fixes for ARIA correctness and contrast improvements"],"ja":["Auditing UI changes for accessibility compliance","Identifying keyboard access and focus management issues in UI diffs","Proposing minimal fixes for ARIA correctness and contrast improvements"],"ko":["Auditing UI changes for accessibility compliance","Identifying keyboard access and focus management issues in UI diffs","Proposing minimal fixes for ARIA correctness and contrast improvements"],"es":["Auditoría de cambios de interfaz de usuario para cumplimiento de accesibilidad","Identificación de problemas de acceso al teclado y gestión del foco en las diferencias de interfaz de usuario","Propuesta de soluciones mínimas para la corrección de ARIA y mejoras de contraste"],"fr":["Audit des modifications d''interface utilisateur pour la conformité d''accessibilité","Identification des problèmes d''accès au clavier et de gestion du focus dans les différences d''interface utilisateur","Proposition de corrections minimales pour la correction ARIA et les améliorations de contraste"],"de":["Prüfung von Benutzeroberflächen-Änderungen für Barrierefreiheits-Konformität","Identifizierung von Tastaturzugriffs- und Fokushanblingsproblemen in Benutzeroberflächen-Unterschieden","Vorschlag minimaler Korrekturen für ARIA-Korrektheit und Kontrastverbesserungen"],"pt":["Auditoria de alterações de UI para conformidade de acessibilidade","Identificação de problemas de acesso ao teclado e gerenciamento de foco em diferenças de UI","Proposta de soluções mínimas para correção do ARIA e melhorias de contraste"],"ru":["Аудит изменений UI для соблюдения требований доступности","Выявление проблем доступа с клавиатуры и управления фокусом в различиях UI","Предложение минимальных исправлений для правильности ARIA и улучшения контраста"],"ar":["تدقيق التغييرات في واجهة المستخدم للامتثال لسهولة الوصول","تحديد مشاكل الوصول إلى لوحة المفاتيح وإدارة التركيز في فروق واجهة المستخدم","طرح إصلاحات محدودة لضبط ARIA وتحسين التباين"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires a diff, PR, or change list that includes relevant UI files","Optional but beneficial: a screenshot or description of the UI change"],"zh":["Requires a diff, PR, or change list that includes relevant UI files","Optional but beneficial: a screenshot or description of the UI change"],"ja":["Requires a diff, PR, or change list that includes relevant UI files","Optional but beneficial: a screenshot or description of the UI change"],"ko":["Requires a diff, PR, or change list that includes relevant UI files","Optional but beneficial: a screenshot or description of the UI change"],"es":["Requiere una diferencia, PR o lista de cambios que incluya archivos de interfaz de usuario relevantes","Opcional pero beneficioso: una captura de pantalla o descripción del cambio de interfaz de usuario"],"fr":["Nécessite une différence, une PR ou une liste de modifications qui inclut des fichiers d''interface utilisateur pertinents","Optionnel mais bénéfique : une capture d''écran ou une description du changement d''interface utilisateur"],"de":["Benötigt einen Unterschied, PR oder Änderungsliste, die relevante Benutzeroberflächen-Dateien enthält","Optional, aber nützlich: ein Screenshot oder eine Beschreibung der Benutzeroberflächen-Änderung"],"pt":["Exige uma diferença, PR ou lista de alterações que inclua arquivos de UI relevantes","Opcional, mas benéfico: uma captura de tela ou descrição da alteração de UI"],"ru":["Требует различия, PR или списка изменений, включающего соответствующие файлы UI","Необязательно, но полезно: скриншот или описание изменения UI"],"ar":["يتطلب فرقا، PR أو قائمة التغييرات التي تشمل ملفات واجهة المستخدم ذات الصلة","إختياري ولكن مفيد: لقطة شاشة أو وصف للتغيير في واجهة المستخدم"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"f471d1d3a8f3013c119671ec28b060ee361c2c1b0ef07db415802784cbae8706","qualityScore":50}');
