"iOS、Android、Flutter対応","高速Figma CLI","開発効率の向上"],"ko":["병렬 내보내기","일괄 처리","스마트 캐싱","iOS, Android, Flutter 지원","빠른 Figma CLI","개발 효율성 향상"],"es":["Exportaciones paralelas","Procesamiento por lotes","Caché inteligente","Compatibilidad con iOS, Android y Flutter","Interfaz de línea de comandos","Diseño de Figma optimizado"],"fr":["Exportations parallèles","Traitement par lots","Cache intelligent","Compatibilité avec iOS, Android et Flutter","Interface de ligne de commande","Conception Figma optimisée"],"de":["Parallele Exporte","Batchverarbeitung","Intelligente Zwischenspeicherung","Kompatibilität mit iOS, Android und Flutter","Kommandozeileninterface","Optimiertes Figma-Design"],"pt":["Exportação paralela para acelerar o desenvolvimento","Processamento em lote para projetos de grande escala","Cache inteligente para reduzir o tempo de carregamento","Suporte a projetos de iOS, Android e Flutter","Integração com a linha de comando do Figma"],"ru":["Параллельный экспорт для ускорения разработки","Пакетная обработка для крупномасштабных проектов","Умное кэширование для уменьшения времени загрузки","Поддержка проектов iOS, Android и Flutter","Интеграция с командной строкой Figma"],"ar":["التصدير المتوازي لتسريع التطوير","معالجة الدفعات لمشاريع كبيرة النطاق","تخزين ذكي لتقليل وقت التحميل","دعم مشاريع iOS و Android و Flutter","التكامل مع سطر أوامر Figma"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用ExFig","什么是Figma CLI","ExFig替代品","Figma CLI教程","ExFig安装","ExFig设置指南","Figma设计优化","iOS开发工具","Android开发工具","Flutter开发工具"],"ja":["ExFigの使い方","Figma CLIとは","ExFigの代替","Figma CLIチュートリアル","ExFigのインストール","ExFigの設定ガイド","Figmaデザインの最適化","iOS開発ツール","Android開発ツール","Flutter開発ツール"],"ko":["ExFig 사용법","Figma CLI란","ExFig 대안","Figma CLI 튜토리얼","ExFig 설치","ExFig 설정 가이드","Figma 디자인 최적화","iOS 개발 도구","Android 개발 도구","Flutter 개발 도구"],"es":["cómo usar ExFig","qué es ExFig","ExFig alternativa","ExFig vs Figma","instalación de ExFig","guía de configuración de ExFig","herramientas de Inteligencia Artificial para diseño","exportar diseños de Figma","optimizar diseños de Figma"],"fr":["comment utiliser ExFig","quoi est ExFig","alternative à ExFig","ExFig vs Figma","installation d''ExFig","guide de configuration d''ExFig","outils d''Intelligence Artificielle pour la conception","exporter des conceptions Figma","optimiser les conceptions Figma"],"de":["wie man ExFig verwendet","was ist ExFig","ExFig-Alternative","ExFig vs Figma","ExFig-Installation","ExFig-Konfigurationsanleitung","KI-Tools für Design","Figma-Designs exportieren","Figma-Designs optimieren"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia para desenvolvimento de aplicativos","exfig alternative","exfig vs sketch","como usar exfig","exfig install","exfig setup guide","ferramentas de ia para figma","desenvolvimento de aplicativos móveis com exfig"],"ru":["инструменты ии для разработки приложений","exfig альтернатива","exfig vs sketch","как использовать exfig","exfig установка","exfig руководство по настройке","инструменты ии для figma","разработка мобильных приложений с exfig"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لتطوير التطبيقات","بديل exfig","exfig مقابل sketch","كيفية استخدام exfig","تثبيت exfig","دليل إعداد exfig","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لبرنامج Figma","تطوير التطبيقات المحمولة مع exfig"]}},"owner":"alexey1312","repo":"ExFig","repoPath":"alexey1312/ExFig","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.989Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-apply-change","description":"Implement tasks from an OpenSpec change. Use when the user wants to start implementing, continue implementation, or work through tasks.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Implement tasks from an OpenSpec change.\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **Select the change**\n\n   If a name is provided, use it. Otherwise:\n   - Infer from conversation context if the user mentioned a change\n   - Auto-select if only one active change exists\n   - If ambiguous, run `openspec list --json` to get available changes and use the *","body":"Implement tasks from an OpenSpec change.\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **Select the change**\n\n   If a name is provided, use it. Otherwise:\n   - Infer from conversation context if the user mentioned a change\n   - Auto-select if only one active change exists\n   - If ambiguous, run `openspec list --json` to get available changes and use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select\n\n   Always announce: \"Using change: <name>\" and how to override (e.g., `/opsx:apply <other>`).\n\n2. **Check status to understand the schema**\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json\n   ```\n   Parse the JSON to understand:\n   - `schemaName`: The workflow being used (e.g., \"spec-driven\")\n   - Which artifact contains the tasks (typically \"tasks\" for spec-driven, check status for others)\n\n3. **Get apply instructions**\n\n   ```bash\n   openspec instructions apply --change \"<name>\" --json\n   ```\n\n   This returns:\n   - Context file paths (varies by schema - could be proposal/specs/design/tasks or spec/tests/implementation/docs)\n   - Progress (total, complete, remaining)\n   - Task list with status\n   - Dynamic instruction based on current state\n\n   **Handle states:**\n   - If `state: \"blocked\"` (missing artifacts): show message, suggest using openspec-continue-change\n   - If `state: \"all_done\"`: congratulate, suggest archive\n   - Otherwise: proceed to implementation\n\n4. **Read context files**\n\n   Read the files listed in `contextFiles` from the apply instructions output.\n   The files depend on the schema being used:\n   - **spec-driven**: proposal, specs, design, tasks\n   - Other schemas: follow the contextFiles from CLI output\n\n5. **Show current progress**\n\n   Display:\n   - Schema being used\n   - Progress: \"N/M tasks complete\"\n   - Remaining tasks overview\n   - Dynamic instruction from CLI\n\n6. **Implement tasks (loop until done or blocked)**\n\n   For each pending task:\n   - Show which task is being worked on\n   - Make the code changes required\n   - Keep changes minimal and focused\n   - Mark task complete in the tasks file: `- [ ]` → `- [x]`\n   - Continue to next task\n\n   **Pause if:**\n   - Task is unclear → ask for clarification\n   - Implementation reveals a design issue → suggest updating artifacts\n   - Error or blocker encountered → report and wait for guidance\n   - User interrupts\n\n7. **On completion or pause, show status**\n\n   Display:\n   - Tasks completed this session\n   - Overall progress: \"N/M tasks complete\"\n   - If all done: suggest archive\n   - If paused: explain why and wait for guidance\n\n**Output During Implementation**\n\n```\n## Implementing: <change-name> (schema: <schema-name>)\n\nWorking on task 3/7: <task description>\n[...implementation happening...]\n✓ Task complete\n\nWorking on task 4/7: <task description>\n[...implementation happening...]\n✓ Task complete\n```\n\n**Output On Completion**\n\n```\n## Implementation Complete\n\n**Change:** <change-name>\n**Schema:** <schema-name>\n**Progress:** 7/7 tasks complete ✓\n\n### Completed This Session\n- [x] Task 1\n- [x] Task 2\n...\n\nAll tasks complete! Ready to archive this change.\n```\n\n**Output On Pause (Issue Encountered)**\n\n```\n## Implementation Paused\n\n**Change:** <change-name>\n**Schema:** <schema-name>\n**Progress:** 4/7 tasks complete\n\n### Issue Encountered\n<description of the issue>\n\n**Options:**\n1. <option 1>\n2. <option 2>\n3. Other approach\n\nWhat would you like to do?\n```\n\n**Guardrails**\n\n- Keep going through tasks until done or blocked\n- Always read context files before starting (from the apply instructions output)\n- If task is ambiguous, pause and ask before implementing\n- If implementation reveals issues, pause and suggest artifact updates\n- Keep code changes minimal and scoped to each task\n- Update task checkbox immediately after completing each task\n- Pause on errors, blockers, or unclear requirements - don''t guess\n- Use contextFiles from CLI output, don''t assume specific file names\n\n**Fluid Workflow Integration**\n\nThis skill supports the \"actions on a change\" model:\n\n- **Can be invoked anytime**: Before all artifacts are done (if tasks exist), after partial implementation, interleaved with other actions\n- **Allows artifact updates**: If implementation reveals design issues, suggest updating artifacts - not phase-locked, work fluidly\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:02:20.143Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for DevOps Agents requiring efficient OpenSpec change management and Figma CLI automation","zh":"适用于需要高效的OpenSpec变更管理和Figma CLI自动化的DevOps代理","ja":"DevOpsエージェントが効率的なOpenSpecの変更管理とFigma CLIの自動化を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"효율적인 OpenSpec 변경 관리 및 Figma CLI 자동화가 필요한 DevOps 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes de DevOps que requieren un cambio de gestión de OpenSpec eficiente y automatización de Figma CLI","fr":"Idéal pour les agents DevOps nécessitant une gestion de changement OpenSpec efficace et une automatisation Figma CLI","de":"Ideal für DevOps-Agents, die eine effiziente OpenSpec-Änderungsverwaltung und Figma-CLI-Automatisierung erfordern","pt":"Ideal para agentes DevOps que requerem gerenciamento eficiente de alterações OpenSpec e automação Figma CLI","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов DevOps, требующих эффективного управления изменениями OpenSpec и автоматизации Figma CLI","ar":"مثالي لعميل ديفوبس الذي يتطلب إدارة تغييرات OpenSpec فعالة وتوافق Figma CLI"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement tasks from OpenSpec changes, leveraging fast Figma CLI with parallel exports, batch processing, and smart caching for iOS, Android, and Flutter, utilizing openspec list --json for seamless change selection and execution","zh":"赋予代理实现从OpenSpec更改任务的能力，利用快速的Figma CLI进行并行导出、批处理和智能缓存，用于iOS、Android和Flutter，使用openspec list --json进行无缝的更改选择和执行","ja":"エージェントがOpenSpecの変更からタスクを実装できるようにし、高速なFigma CLIを使用して並列エクスポート、バッチ処理、スマートキャッシングを実行し、iOS、Android、Flutterでopenspec list --jsonを使用してシームレスに変更を選択して実行","ko":"에이전트가 OpenSpec 변경에서 작업을 구현할 수 있도록 하며, 빠른 Figma CLI를 사용하여 병렬导出, 일괄 처리 및 스마트 캐싱을実行하고, iOS, Android 및 Flutter에서 openspec list --json을 사용하여無縫な変更 선택 및 실행을 구현","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar tareas a partir de los cambios de OpenSpec, aprovechando la rápida Figma CLI con exportaciones paralelas, procesamiento por lotes y almacenamiento en caché inteligente para iOS, Android y Flutter, utilizando openspec list --json para una selección y ejecución de cambios sin problemas","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre des tâches à partir des modifications OpenSpec, en exploitant la Figma CLI rapide avec des exportations parallèles, un traitement par lot et un cache intelligent pour iOS, Android et Flutter, en utilisant openspec list --json pour une sélection et une exécution de modifications sans problème","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Aufgaben aus OpenSpec-Änderungen umzusetzen, indem sie die schnelle Figma-CLI mit parallelen Exporten, Batchverarbeitung und intelligenter Zwischenspeicherung für iOS, Android und Flutter nutzen, unter Verwendung von openspec list --json für eine reibungslose Änderungsauswahl und -ausführung","pt":"Habilita agentes a implementar tarefas a partir de alterações OpenSpec, aproveitando o Figma CLI rápido com exportações paralelas, processamento em lote e cache inteligente para iOS, Android e Flutter, utilizando openspec list --json para seleção e execução de alterações sem interrupção","ru":"Позволяет агентам реализовывать задачи из изменений OpenSpec, используя быстрый Figma CLI с параллельными экспортами, пакетной обработкой и умным кэшированием для iOS, Android и Flutter, используя openspec list --json для бесшовного выбора и выполнения изменений","a