ompatibilité avec les flux de travail personnalisés"],"de":["Automatisierung von Workflows","Struktur zur Effizienzsteigerung","Integration mit Cursor AI","Cursor-Konfigurationssystem","Steigerung der Produktivität","Kompatibilität mit benutzerdefinierten Workflows"],"pt":["Automação estruturada para o editor de código Cursor AI","Melhoria da eficiência do desenvolvedor","Integração com o Cursor AI","Sistema de configuração flexível","Suporte a múltiplos ambientes de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Структурированная автоматизация для редактора кода Cursor AI","Повышение эффективности разработчика","Интеграция с Cursor AI","Гибкая система конфигурации","Поддержка нескольких сред разработки"],"ar":["نظام آلي متكامل لتعديل Cursor AI","تحسين كفاءة المطور","التكامل مع Cursor AI","نظام مرن للتحكم","دعم بيئات متعددة للتنمية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","pr-with-docs","Cursor AI代码编辑器","自动化系统","开发效率","代码编辑器的工作流程","如何使用pr-with-docs","pr-with-docs安装","pr-with-docs设置指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント","pr-with-docs","Cursor AIコードエディター","自動化システム","開発効率","コードエディターのワークフロー","pr-with-docsの使い方","pr-with-docsのインストール","pr-with-docsの設定ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","pr-with-docs","Cursor AI 코드 편집기","자동화 시스템","개발 효율성","코드 편집기의 워크플ロー","pr-with-docs 사용법","pr-with-docs 설치","pr-with-docs 설정 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de AI","automatización de flujos de trabajo","Cursor AI","pr-with-docs","cómo usar pr-with-docs","qué es pr-with-docs","alternativas a pr-with-docs","pr-with-docs vs otros","instalación de pr-with-docs","guía de configuración de pr-with-docs"],"fr":["outils d''IA","automatisation des flux de travail","Cursor AI","pr-with-docs","comment utiliser pr-with-docs","qu''est-ce que pr-with-docs","alternatives à pr-with-docs","pr-with-docs vs autres","installation de pr-with-docs","guide de configuration de pr-with-docs"],"de":["AI-Tools","Automatisierung von Workflows","Cursor AI","pr-with-docs","wie man pr-with-docs verwendet","was ist pr-with-docs","Alternativen zu pr-with-docs","pr-with-docs vs andere","Installation von pr-with-docs","Konfigurationsanleitung für pr-with-docs"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","pr-with-docs","cursor ai","automação de código","desenvolvedor de software","como usar pr-with-docs","o que é pr-with-docs","pr-with-docs vs cursor ai","instalar pr-with-docs"],"ru":["ии агенты","pr-with-docs","cursor ai","автоматизация кода","разработчик программного обеспечения","как использовать pr-with-docs","что такое pr-with-docs","pr-with-docs vs cursor ai","установка pr-with-docs"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","pr-with-docs","cursor ai","نظام آلي للتعديل","مطور البرمجيات","كيفية استخدام pr-with-docs","ما هو pr-with-docs","pr-with-docs مقابل cursor ai","تثبيت pr-with-docs"]}},"owner":"pmagnomuller","repo":"ai-workflow-cursor-config","repoPath":"pmagnomuller/ai-workflow-cursor-config","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.023Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pr-with-docs","description":"Creates production-ready pull requests with automatically updated AGENTS.md and project docs. Use when the user asks to create a PR, make a PR, is ready to merge, has finished a feature and wants a PR, or says theyre done for the day with changes to commit.","bodyPreview":"# PR with Docs\n\nWhen the user asks to create a pull request (e.g. \"make a PR with these changes\", \"create a PR for this\", \"ready to merge\", \"that''s all for today, I added X\"), follow this workflow to analyze changes, update AGENTS.md (and .cursor/rules if relevant), run the Git workflow, and create the PR.\n\n## 1. Change Analysis\n\n- Examine all modified, added, and deleted files in the current branch.\n- Identify scope: features, bug fixes, refactors.\n- Detect changes that require **AGENTS.md** up","body":"# PR with Docs\n\nWhen the user asks to create a pull request (e.g. \"make a PR with these changes\", \"create a PR for this\", \"ready to merge\", \"that''s all for today, I added X\"), follow this workflow to analyze changes, update AGENTS.md (and .cursor/rules if relevant), run the Git workflow, and create the PR.\n\n## 1. Change Analysis\n\n- Examine all modified, added, and deleted files in the current branch.\n- Identify scope: features, bug fixes, refactors.\n- Detect changes that require **AGENTS.md** updates:\n  - New API endpoints or routes (`apps/api/app/routes/`, `apps/web/src/app/api/`)\n  - Database schema or migrations (`apps/api/migrations/`)\n  - New environment variables or config (`apps/api/app/core/config.py`, etc.)\n  - Architecture or tech stack changes\n  - New development commands or workflows\n  - Auth flow changes\n  - New third-party integrations or dependencies\n  - New component or styling patterns\n\n## 2. AGENTS.md and Rules Updates\n\n- Read `AGENTS.md` (and relevant `.cursor/rules/*.mdc`) thoroughly.\n- Update sections based on code changes; preserve structure and tone.\n- Add new sections only for entirely new concepts.\n- Ensure code examples match current patterns; keep terminology and style consistent.\n- Do not remove information unless it is obsolete.\n- If changes affect only API or only web, consider updating `.cursor/rules/python-api.mdc` or `.cursor/rules/nextjs-web.mdc` as appropriate.\n\n## 3. Git Workflow\n\n**Branch**\n\n- Check branch: `git branch --show-current`.\n- If on `main`/`master`, create a feature branch: `<type>/<brief-description>` (e.g. `feature/add-instagram-scraping`, `fix/auth-redirect-loop`, `docs/update-schema-info`). Types: `feature`, `fix`, `docs`, `refactor`, `chore`.\n- If already on a feature branch, use it.\n\n**Stash**\n\n- Check uncommitted changes: `git status`.\n- If there are uncommitted changes: `git stash push -m \"Auto-stash before PR creation\"`.\n- Restore stash after operations if one was created.\n\n**Commit**\n\n- Stage docs first: `git add AGENTS.md` (and any `.cursor/rules/*.mdc` if changed).\n- Commit docs: `git commit -m \"docs: update AGENTS.md with [specific changes]\"`.\n- Stage rest: `git add .`\n- Commit code with conventional commits: `<type>(<scope>): <description>` (e.g. `feat(auth): add Google OAuth support`).\n\n**Publish**\n\n- Push: `git push -u origin <branch-name>`.\n- Handle push conflicts or errors.\n\n## 4. Pull Request\n\n- Use GitHub CLI: `gh pr create` (or host-appropriate CLI).\n- PR description should include:\n  - **Summary**: 2–3 sentence overview.\n  - **Changes Made**: Bulleted list.\n  - **Documentation Updates**: AGENTS.md (and rules) sections updated.\n  - **Testing**: How changes were tested (if applicable).\n  - **Breaking Changes**: Any breaking changes or migration steps.\n  - **Related Issues**: Links if mentioned.\n- Title in conventional commits style; add labels (feature, bugfix, documentation, etc.) if possible.\n\n## When to Update AGENTS.md\n\n| Change | Update |\n|--------|--------|\n| New files in `apps/api/` (routes, models, services) | Repo Layout, Conventions, Key Files |\n| New files in `apps/api/migrations/` | Repo Layout, Database/Migrations |\n| New env vars in code | Conventions / README env section |\n| New packages | Repo Layout / Tech stack |\n| New dev commands | Where to Run Commands |\n| Auth logic changes | Conventions, Auth |\n| New component/API patterns | Conventions, Key Files |\n| New third-party integrations | Conventions or new subsection |\n\n## When NOT to Update AGENTS.md\n\n- Minor bug fixes that do not change architecture.\n- Internal refactors that do not affect usage patterns.\n- Styling tweaks following existing patterns.\n- Test file additions (unless they introduce new testing patterns).\n\n## Quality Before PR\n\n1. AGENTS.md is valid Markdown with no syntax errors.\n2. Code examples in AGENTS.md use correct syntax.\n3. All Git operations completed successfully.\n4. Commits follow conventional commits format.\n5. PR description is accurate and complete.\n\n## Error Handling\n\n- If Git fails: clear error message and suggested fix.\n- If AGENTS.md updates are unclear: ask the user.\n- If PR creation fails: give the user the PR description for manual creation.\n- Always clean up: restore stash, return to original branch if needed.\n\n## Communication\n\n- Give a short status at each phase.\n- Say which AGENTS.md (and rules) sections you are updating and why.\n- Show commit messages before committing and PR description before creating.\n- Ask for confirmation if changes are ambiguous or potentially breaking.\n- Proactively mention related docs that could be updated.\n\n## Output Phases\n\n1. **Analysis**: \"Analyzing changes in current branch...\"\n2. **Documentation**: \"Updating AGENTS.md sections: [list]...\"\n3. **Git**: \"Creating branch / committing changes...\"\n4. **PR**: \"Creating pull request...\"\n5. **Summary**: PR URL and brief summary of actions.\n\nGoal: merge-ready PRs with documentation in sync with the codebase.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:12:48.784Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Git-based AI Agents requiring streamlined pull request creation with automated documentation updates","zh":"适用于基于 Git 的 AI 代理，需要简化的拉取请求创建和自动文档更新","ja":"Git ベースの AI エージェントに適しています。ストリームライン化されたプルリクエストの作成と自動ドキュメント更新を必要とします","ko":"Git 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다. 간소화된 풀 리퀘스트 생성 및 자동 문서 업데이트 필요","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA basados en Git que requieren la creación de solicitudes de extracción optimizada con actualizaciones de documentación automatizadas","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA basés sur Git nécessitant la création de demandes d''extraction rationalisée avec des mises à jour de documentation automatisées","de":"Ideal für Git-basierte KI-Agents, die eine optimierte Erstellung von Pull-Anfragen mit automatisierten Dokumentenaktualisierungen erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA baseados em Git que requerem criação de solicitações de pull simplificada com atualizações de documentação automatizadas","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, основанных на Git, требующих упрощенного создания запросов на вытягивание с автоматическими обновлениями документации","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي المبني على Git الذي يتطلب إنشاء طلبات السحب المُبسطة مع تحديثات الوثائق المُتوماتيكية"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to analyze code changes, update AGENTS.md files, and run Git workflows to create pull requests with accurate documentation, utilizing protocols like Git and file formats such as Markdown","zh":"赋予代理分析代码更改、更新 AGENTS.md 文件并运行 Git 工作流以创建具有准确文档的拉取请求的能力，利用 Git 等协议和 Markdown 等文件格式","ja":"エージェントにコードの変更を分析し、AGENTS.md ファイルを更新し、Git ワークフローを実行して正確なドキュメントを持つプルリクエストを作成する能力を付与します。Git や Markdown などのプロトコルやファイル形式を利用します","ko":"에이전트가 코드 변경을 분석하고 AGENTS.md 파일을 업데이트하며 Git 워크플ロー를 실행하여 정확한 문서가 포함된 풀 리퀘스트를 생성할 수 있는 기능을 부여합니다. Git 및 Markdown와 같은 프로토콜 및 파일 형식을 사용합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a analizar los cambios de código, actualizar archivos AGENTS.md y ejecutar flujos de trabajo de Git para crear solicitudes de extracción con documentación precisa, utilizando protocolos como Git y formatos de archivo como Markdown","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser les modifications de code, de mettre à jour les fichiers AGENTS.md et d''exécuter les flux de travail Git pour créer des demandes d''extraction avec une documentation précise, en utilisant des protocoles tels que Git et des formats de fichiers tels que Markdown","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, Codeänderungen zu analysieren, AGENTS.md-Dateien zu aktualisieren und Git-Workflows auszuführen, um Pull-Anfragen mit genauer Dokumentation zu erstellen, wobei Protokolle wie Git und Dateiformate wie Markdown verwendet werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a analisar alterações de código, atualizar arquivos AGENTS.md e executar fluxos de trabalho do Git para criar solicitações de pull com documentação precisa, utilizando protocolos como Git e formatos de arquivo como Markdown","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью анализировать изменения кода, обновлять файлы AGENTS.md и запускать рабочие процессы Git для создания запросов на вытягивание с точной документацией, используя протоколы như Git и форматы файлов, такие как Markdown","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تحليل تغييرات الكود وتحديث ملفات AGENTS.md وتشغيل سير العمل Git لإنشاء طلبات السحب مع توثيق دقيق، باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل Git وتنسيقات الملفات مثل Markdown"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating pull request creation with updated documentation","Analyzing code changes for features, bug fixes, and refactors","Updating AGENTS.md files based on detected code modifications"],"zh":["自动创建拉取请求并更新文档","分析代码更改以实现功能、错误修复和重构","根据检测到的代码修改更新 AGENTS.md 文件"],"ja":["ドキュメントを更新したプルリクエストの自動作成","機能、バグ修正、リファクタリングのためのコード変更の分析","検出されたコード変更に基づいて AGENTS.md ファイルを更新"],"ko":["문서를 업데이트한 풀 리퀘스트의 자동 생성","기능, 버그 수정, 리팩토링을 위한 코드 변경 분석","검출된 코드 수정에 따라 AGENTS.md 파일을 업데이트합니다"],"es":["Automatizar la creación de solicitudes de extracción con documentación actualizada","Analizar los cambios de código para características, correcciones de errores y refactorizaciones","Actualizar archivos AGENTS.md en función de las modificaciones de código detectadas"],"fr":["Automatiser la création de demandes d''extraction avec une documentation mise à jour","Analyser les modifications de code pour les fonctionnalités, les corrections de bogues et les refactorisations","Mettre à jour les fichiers AGENTS.md en fonction des modifications de code détectées"],"de":["Automatisieren der Erstellung von Pull-Anfragen mit aktualisierter Dokumentation","Analysieren von Codeänderungen für Funktionen, Fehlerkorrekturen und Refactorings","Aktualisieren von AGENTS.md-Dateien basierend auf detektierten Codeänderungen"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de solicitações de pull com documentação atualizada","Analizar alterações de código para recursos, correções de bugs e refatorações","Atualizar arquivos AGENTS.md com base em modificações de código detectadas"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание запросов на вытягивание с обновленной документацией","Анализировать изменения кода для функций, исправления ошибок и рефакторинга","Обновлять файлы AGENTS.md на основе обнаруженных изменений кода"],"ar":["توفير إنشاء طلبات السحب مع تحديثات الوثائق المُتوماتيكية","تحليل تغييرات الكود لميزات وإصلاحات الأخطاء وإعادة هيكلة الكود","تحديث ملفات AGENTS.md بناءً على التعديلات التي تم الكشف عنها في الكود"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git workflow access","Limited to Markdown file updates, specifically AGENTS.md"],"zh":["需要 Git 工作流访问","仅限 Markdown 文件更新，特别是 AGENTS.md"],"ja":["Git ワークフローへのアクセスが必要","Markdown ファイルの更新のみ、特に AGENTS.md"],"ko":["Git 워크플로우 액세스가 필요합니다","Markdown 파일만 업데이트할 수 있으며, 특히 AGENTS.md"],"es":["Requiere acceso al flujo de trabajo de Git","Limitado a actualizaciones de archivos Markdown, específicamente AGENTS.md"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au flux de travail Git","Limité aux mises à jour de fichiers Markdown, spécifiquement AGENTS.md"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf den Git-Workflow","Begrenzt auf Markdown-Dateiaktualisierungen, speziell AGENTS.md"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao fluxo de trabalho do Git","Limitado a atualizações de arquivos Markdown, especificamente AGENTS.md"],"ru":["Требует доступа к рабочему процессу Git","Ограничен обновлениями файлов Markdown, в частности AGENTS.md"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى سير العمل Git","محدود بتحديثات ملفات Markdown، تحديداً AGENTS.md"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"6917e6348217317e4d5469de00913533c0012e01b2a01a715d79ccc3a0443751","qualityScore":50}');
