sos verificados para seguridad y calidad"],"fr":["Méthodologie d''ingénierie inverse de binaires","Analyse de code binaire avec r2 et Ghidra","Identification rapide du type de fichier et de la fonction","Désassemblage et décompilation de code","Ressources vérifiées pour la sécurité et la qualité"],"de":["Methodik für Binär-Reversing","Analyse von Binärcode mit r2 und Ghidra","Schnelle Identifizierung von Dateityp und Funktion","Disassemblieren und Dekompilieren von Code","Verifizierte Ressourcen für Sicherheit und Qualität"],"pt":["Metodologia de engenharia reversa de binários","Análise estática com r2 e Ghidra","Fingerprinting rápido","Identificação de tipo de arquivo","Desmontagem e Decompilação"],"ru":["Методология обратной инженерии бинарных файлов","Статический анализ с помощью r2 и Ghidra","Быстрое определение типа файла","Определение типа файла","Дизассемблирование и декомпиляция"],"ar":["منهجية هندسة عكسية ثنائية","تحليل ثابت باستخدام r2 و Ghidra","تحديد سريع لنوع الملف","تحديد نوع الملف","فك التجميع وافك التشفير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["二进制逆向工程","二进制代码分析","快速指纹识别","静态分析","逆向工程","代码分析"],"ja":["バイナリリバースエンジニアリング","バイナリコード分析","高速フィンガープリント認識","静的分析","逆向エンジニアリング","コード分析"],"ko":["이진 역공학","이진 코드 분석","빠른 지문 인식","정적 분석","역공학","코드 분석"],"es":["ingeniería inversa de binarios","análisis de código binario","seguridad informática","desensamblado de código","descompilación de código","r2","Ghidra","identificación de tipo de archivo"],"fr":["ingénierie inverse de binaires","analyse de code binaire","sécurité informatique","désassemblage de code","décompilation de code","r2","Ghidra","identification du type de fichier"],"de":["Binär-Reversing","Analyse von Binärcode","IT-Sicherheit","Disassemblieren von Code","Dekompilieren von Code","r2","Ghidra","Dateityp-Erkennung"],"pt":["engenharia reversa de binários","análise estática","r2","Ghidra","fingerprinting","identificação de tipo de arquivo","desmontagem","decompilação"],"ru":["обратная инженерия бинарных файлов","статический анализ","r2","Ghidra","быстрое определение типа файла","определение типа файла","дизассемблирование","декомпиляция"],"ar":["هندسة عكسية ثنائية","تحليل ثابت","r2","Ghidra","تحديد سريع لنوع الملف","تحديد نوع الملف","فك التجميع","افك التشفير"]}},"owner":"aiskillstore","repo":"marketplace","repoPath":"aiskillstore/marketplace","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.574Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"binary-re","description":"This skill should be used when analyzing binaries, executables, or bytecode to understand what they do or how they work. Triggers on binary, executable, ELF, what does this do, reverse engineer, disassemble, decompile, pyc file, python bytecode, analyze binary, figure out, marshal. Routes to sub-skills for triage, static analysis, dynamic analysis, synthesis, or tool setup.","bodyPreview":"# Binary Reverse Engineering\n\n## Purpose\n\nComprehensive guide for binary reverse engineering. This skill provides the overall methodology, philosophy, and reference material. Related skills handle specific phases:\n\n## Related Skills\n\n| Skill | Purpose | Trigger Keywords |\n|-------|---------|------------------|\n| `binary-re:triage` | Fast fingerprinting | \"what is this binary\", \"identify\", \"file type\" |\n| `binary-re:static-analysis` | r2 + Ghidra analysis | \"disassemble\", \"decompile\", \"functions\"","body":"# Binary Reverse Engineering\n\n## Purpose\n\nComprehensive guide for binary reverse engineering. This skill provides the overall methodology, philosophy, and reference material. Related skills handle specific phases:\n\n## Related Skills\n\n| Skill | Purpose | Trigger Keywords |\n|-------|---------|------------------|\n| `binary-re:triage` | Fast fingerprinting | \"what is this binary\", \"identify\", \"file type\" |\n| `binary-re:static-analysis` | r2 + Ghidra analysis | \"disassemble\", \"decompile\", \"functions\" |\n| `binary-re:dynamic-analysis` | QEMU + GDB + Frida | \"run\", \"execute\", \"debug\", \"trace\" |\n| `binary-re:synthesis` | Report generation | \"summarize\", \"report\", \"document findings\" |\n| `binary-re:tool-setup` | Install tools | \"install\", \"setup\", \"tool not found\" |\n\n**Note:** Each skill auto-detects based on keywords. You don''t need to explicitly route - just ask what you need.\n\n## Pre-Flight Verification\n\n**Before beginning any analysis, verify tooling availability:**\n\n### Core Tools (Required)\n```bash\nrabin2 -v  # Should show version\nr2 -v      # Should show version\n```\n\n### Decompilation (Optional)\n```bash\n# Check r2ghidra availability\nr2 -qc ''pdg?'' - 2>/dev/null | grep -q Usage && echo \"r2ghidra OK\" || echo \"r2ghidra missing - install with: r2pm -ci r2ghidra\"\n```\n\n### Dynamic Analysis Platform Check\n| Host Platform | Method | Setup Required |\n|---------------|--------|----------------|\n| Linux x86_64 | Native QEMU | `apt install qemu-user` |\n| macOS (any) | Docker + binfmt | See `binary-re-tool-setup` skill |\n| Windows | WSL2 | Use Linux method inside WSL |\n\n**If dynamic tools unavailable:** Proceed with static-only analysis, note reduced confidence in synthesis phase.\n\n### Fallback Tooling (No r2/Ghidra)\n\nWhen radare2 or Ghidra aren''t available, use standard binutils/LLVM tools:\n\n```bash\n# Metadata (replaces rabin2 -I)\nreadelf -h binary              # ELF header\nreadelf -d binary              # Dynamic section (dependencies)\nfile binary                    # Quick identification\n\n# Imports/Exports (replaces rabin2 -i/-E)\nreadelf -Ws binary | grep -E \"FUNC|OBJECT\" | awk ''{print $8}''\nnm -D binary 2>/dev/null       # Dynamic symbols\n\n# Strings (replaces rabin2 -zz)\nstrings -a -n 8 binary | grep -Ei ''http|ftp|/etc|/var|error|pass|key|token|api''\n\n# Disassembly (replaces r2 pdf)\nobjdump -d -M intel binary | head -500\n# Or LLVM (better cross-arch support):\nllvm-objdump -d --no-show-raw-insn binary | head -500\n\n# Dependencies (replaces rabin2 -l)\nldd binary 2>/dev/null || readelf -d binary | grep NEEDED\n```\n\n**Limitations of fallback approach:**\n- No cross-references (axt/axf) - must trace manually\n- No decompilation - assembly only\n- No function boundary detection - raw disassembly\n- Reduced accuracy for stripped binaries\n\n---\n\n## Philosophy\n\n**The LLM drives analysis; the human provides context.**\n\nHuman provides:\n- Platform info (device type, OS, hardware)\n- Suspected purpose (what the binary might do)\n- Constraints (no network, isolated env, etc.)\n\nLLM executes:\n- Tool selection and invocation\n- Hypothesis formation from evidence\n- Experiment design\n- Knowledge synthesis\n\n## The Agentic Loop\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│           HYPOTHESIS-DRIVEN ANALYSIS            │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│                                                 │\n│  0. I/O SANITY → Compare known inputs/outputs   │\n│  1. OBSERVE → Gather facts via tools            │\n│  2. HYPOTHESIZE → Form theories from facts      │\n│  3. PLAN → Design experiments to test theories  │\n│  4. EXECUTE → Run tools (gate risky ops)        │\n│  5. RECORD → Capture observations               │\n│  6. UPDATE → Confirm/refute hypotheses          │\n│  7. LOOP → Until understanding sufficient       │\n│                                                 │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n### Step 0: Compare Known I/O First (CRITICAL)\n\n**Before diving into code analysis, always check if known inputs/outputs exist.**\n\nThis step prevents hours of wasted analysis by establishing ground truth first.\n\n⚠️ **REQUIRES HUMAN APPROVAL** - Even for I/O comparison, get explicit approval before execution.\n\n```bash\n# SAFE: Use emulation for cross-arch binaries (after human approval)\n# ARM32 example:\nqemu-arm -L /usr/arm-linux-gnueabihf -- ./binary input.txt > actual_output.txt\n\n# x86-64 native (still requires approval):\n./binary input.txt > actual_output.txt\n\n# Docker-based (macOS - safest option):\ndocker run --rm --platform linux/arm/v7 -v ~/samples:/work:ro \\\n  arm32v7/debian:bullseye-slim /work/binary /work/input.txt > actual_output.txt\n\n# Compare outputs:\ndiff expected_output.txt actual_output.txt\ncmp -l expected_output.txt actual_output.txt | head -20  # Byte-level\n\n# Document the delta:\n# - Where does output first diverge?\n# - What pattern appears in the corruption?\n# - Does file size match (logic bug) or differ (truncation)?\n```\n\n**Record as FACT:**\n```\nFACT: Output differs at byte {N}, expected \"{X}\" got \"{Y}\" (source: diff/cmp)\nFACT: File sizes match/differ by {N} bytes (source: ls -l)\n```\n\nThis single step often reveals the bug category before any disassembly.\n\n## Knowledge Model\n\nThroughout analysis, maintain structured knowledge via **episodic memory**:\n\n```\nFACTS: Verified observations with tool attribution\nHYPOTHESES: Theories with confidence and evidence\nQUESTIONS: Open unknowns blocking progress\nEXPERIMENTS: Planned tool invocations\nOBSERVATIONS: Results from experiments\nDECISIONS: Human-approved choices with rationale\n```\n\n### Episodic Memory Integration\n\nKnowledge persists across sessions via episodic memory. Use consistent tagging:\n\n```\n[BINARY-RE:{phase}] {artifact_name} (sha256: {hash})\nFACT: {observation} (source: {tool})\nHYPOTHESIS: {theory} (confidence: {0.0-1.0})\nQUESTION: {unknown}\nDECISION: {choice} (rationale: {why})\n```\n\n**Starting analysis:** Search episodic memory for artifact hash first\n**After each phase:** Findings are automatically captured in conversation\n**Resuming:** Search `[BINARY-RE] {artifact_name}` to restore context\n\n## Human-in-the-Loop Triggers\n\n**ALWAYS ask human before:**\n\n1. **Executing the binary** - Even under QEMU, confirm sandbox\n2. **Network operations** - Prevent unintended phone-home\n3. **Conflicting evidence** - Resolve contradictory findings\n4. **Privileged operations** - Device access, root actions\n5. **Major direction changes** - Significant analysis pivots\n\n## Session Management\n\n### Starting New Analysis\n\n```\n1. Compute artifact hash: sha256sum binary\n2. Search episodic memory: \"[BINARY-RE] sha256:{hash}\"\n3. If previous analysis found:\n   → \"Found previous analysis from {date}. Resume or start fresh?\"\n4. If resuming: Load facts/hypotheses, continue from last phase\n5. If fresh: Begin with triage phase\n```\n\n### Resuming Interrupted Analysis\n\n```\nUser: \"Continue analyzing that thermostat binary\"\n\nClaude:\n1. Invoke episodic-memory:search-conversations\n   Query: \"[BINARY-RE] thermostat\"\n2. Retrieve previous session findings\n3. Summarize: \"Last session identified ARM32/musl, found network\n   functions. We were about to run dynamic analysis.\"\n4. Continue from that phase\n```\n\n### Searching Past Analyses\n\n```\nUser: \"Have we analyzed any ARM binaries with hardcoded passwords?\"\n\nClaude:\n1. Search: \"[BINARY-RE] FACT: hardcoded\" or \"[BINARY-RE] ARM\"\n2. Return matching artifacts and findings\n```\n\n## Standard Analysis Flow\n\nFor typical unknown binary analysis:\n\n```\n1. Triage (binary-re-triage)\n   └─ Architecture, ABI, dependencies, capabilities\n\n2. Static Analysis (binary-re-static-analysis)\n   └─ Functions, strings, xrefs, decompilation\n\n3. Dynamic Analysis (binary-re-dynamic-analysis) - if safe\n   └─ Syscalls, network, file access\n\n4. Synthesis (binary-re-synthesis)\n   └─ Structured report with evidence\n```\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Essential Commands\n\n```bash\n# Fast triage\nrabin2 -I binary              # Metadata\nrabin2 -l binary              # Dependencies\nrabin2 -zz binary             # Strings\n\n# Static analysis\nr2 -q -c ''aa; aflj'' binary    # Functions\nr2 -q -c ''izj'' binary         # Strings\n\n# Dynamic (ARM example)\nqemu-arm -L /usr/arm-linux-gnueabihf -strace ./binary\n```\n\n### Architecture Detection\n\n| Indicator | Architecture | QEMU Binary | Ghidra Processor |\n|-----------|--------------|-------------|------------------|\n| `e_machine=EM_386 (3)` | x86 32-bit | `qemu-i386` or Docker `--platform linux/i386` | `x86:LE:32:default` |\n| `e_machine=EM_ARM (40)` | ARM 32-bit | `qemu-arm` or Docker `--platform linux/arm/v7` | `ARM:LE:32:v7` |\n| `e_machine=EM_AARCH64 (183)` | ARM 64-bit | `qemu-aarch64` or Docker `--platform linux/arm64` | `AARCH64:LE:64:v8A` |\n| `e_machine=EM_X86_64 (62)` | x86-64 | Native or Docker `--platform linux/amd64` | `x86:LE:64:default` |\n| `e_machine=EM_MIPS (8)` | MIPS 32 LE | `qemu-mipsel` | `MIPS:LE:32:default` |\n| `e_machine=EM_MIPS (8)` BE | MIPS 32 BE | `qemu-mips` | `MIPS:BE:32:default` |\n| `e_machine=EM_RISCV (243)` | RISC-V 64 | `qemu-riscv64` | `RISCV:LE:64:RV64I` |\n| `e_machine=EM_RISCV (243)` 32 | RISC-V 32 | `qemu-riscv32` | `RISCV:LE:32:RV32I` |\n\n### Libc Detection\n\n| Interpreter | Libc |\n|-------------|------|\n| `ld-linux-armhf.so.3` | glibc (ARM hard-float) |\n| `ld-musl-arm.so.1` | musl |\n| `ld-uClibc.so.0` | uClibc |\n\n## Error Recovery\n\n| Situation | Action |\n|-----------|--------|\n| Tool not found | Use `binary-re-tool-setup` skill |\n| Wrong architecture | Re-run triage, verify file output |\n| QEMU fails | Try Qiling, Unicorn, or on-device |\n| Analysis timeout | Reduce scope, use `aa` not `aaa` |\n| Conflicting evidence | Ask human, document both interpretations |\n\n## Documentation\n\nSee companion docs:\n- `docs/r2-commands.md` - Complete r2 reference for LLMs\n- `docs/ghidra-headless.md` - Ghidra scripting guide\n- `docs/arch-adapters.md` - Per-architecture quirks\n- `docs/python-bytecode-re.md` - Python .pyc/marshal obfuscation patterns\n\n## Integration\n\nWorks with other plugins:\n- **remote-system-maintenance**: Extract binaries from devices via SSH\n- **fresh-eyes-review**: Validate conclusions before documenting\n- **scenario-testing**: Create reproducible analysis environments\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T04:33:33.382Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cybersecurity Agents needing advanced binary reverse engineering capabilities with r2 and Ghidra analysis","zh":"非常适合需要使用r2和Ghidra分析进行高级二进制逆向工程的网络安全代理","ja":"サイバーセキュリティエージェントがr2およびGhidra分析を使用した高度なバイナリ逆向エンジニアリング機能を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"r2와 Ghidra 분석을 사용하여 고급 바이너리 역공학 기능이 필요한 사이버 보안 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de ciberseguridad que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de ingeniería inversa de binarios con análisis r2 y Ghidra","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de cybersécurité ayant besoin de capacités avancées d''ingénierie inverse de binaires avec analyse r2 et Ghidra","de":"Perfekt für Cybersicherheitsagenten, die erweiterte Binär-Rückingenieur-Kapazitäten mit r2- und Ghidra-Analyse benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Cibersegurança que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de engenharia reversa de binários com análise r2 e Ghidra","ru":"Идеально для агентов кибербезопасности, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности обратного инжиниринга бинарных файлов с помощью анализа r2 и Ghidra","ar":" مثالي لعميل الأمن السيبراني الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لتحليل الثنائيات العكسي باستخدام تحليل r2 و Ghidra"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform fast fingerprinting and static analysis of binaries using triggers like ''what is this binary'' and ''disassemble'', enabling comprehensive binary reverse engineering with quality-verified methodologies","zh":"赋予代理快速执行二进制指纹识别和静态分析的能力，使用诸如''这是什么二进制''和''反汇编''等触发器，实现全面二进制逆向工程，具有质量验证的方法论","ja":"エージェントが''これは何のバイナリですか''や''逆アセンブル''などのトリガーを使用して、高速なバイナリフィンガープリントと静的分析を実行できるようにし、品質保証済みの方法論を使用した包括的なバイナリ逆向エンジニアリングを可能にします","ko":"에이전트가 ''이 바이너리는 무엇인가'' 또는 ''逆조립''과 같은 트리거를 사용하여 빠른 바이너리 지문 분석 및 정적 분석을 수행할 수 있도록 하며, 품질 검증된 방법론을 사용하여 포괄적인 바이너리 역공학을 가능하게 합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar una identificación rápida y un análisis estático de binarios utilizando desencadenadores como ''¿qué es este binario'' y ''desensamblar'', lo que permite una ingeniería inversa de binarios integral con metodologías verificadas de calidad","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer une identification rapide et une analyse statique de binaires à l''aide de déclencheurs tels que ''qu''est-ce que ce binaire'' et ''désassembler'', permettant ainsi une ingénierie inverse de binaires complète avec des méthodologies vérifiées de qualité","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, eine schnelle Identifizierung und eine statische Analyse von Binärdateien mithilfe von Auslösern wie ''was ist dieser Binärdatei'' und ''disassemblieren'' durchzuführen, wodurch eine umfassende Binär-Rückingenieur-Analyse mit qualitätsgeprüften Methoden ermöglicht wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar identificação rápida e análise estática de binários usando gatilhos como ''o que é este binário'' e ''desmontar'', permitindo uma engenharia reversa de binários abrangente com metodologias verificadas por qualidade","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью быстро определять и проводить статический анализ бинарных файлов с помощью триггеров, таких как ''что это за бинарный файл'' и ''дизассемблировать'', обеспечивая комплексную обратную инженерию бинарных файлов с методологиями, проверенными на качество","ar":"تمكّن العميل من إجراء تحديد سريع وتحليل ثابت للثنائيات باستخدام الزنادات مثل ''ما هذا الملف الثنائي'' و ''فك التجميع''، مما يتيح تحليل الثنائيات العكسي الشامل باستخدام منهجيات محكّمة الجودة"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating binary identification with ''binary-re:triage''","Performing in-depth static analysis with ''binary-re:static-analysis''","Debugging binaries using Ghidra and r2"],"zh":["使用''二进制-再:分诊''自动执行二进制识别","使用''二进制-再:静态分析''执行深入的静态分析","使用Ghidra和r2调试二进制文件"],"ja":["''バイナリ-再:トリアージ''を使用してバイナリ識別を自動化する","''バイナリ-再:静的分析''を使用して詳細な静的分析を実行する","Ghidraとr2を使用してバイナリをデバッグする"],"ko":["''바이너리-재:트리아지''를 사용하여 바이너리 식별을 자동화하는 것","''바이너리-재:정적 분석''을 사용하여 심층 정적 분석을 수행하는 것","Ghidra와 r2를 사용하여 바이너리를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar la identificación de binarios con ''binary-re:triage''","Realizar un análisis estático en profundidad con ''binary-re:static-analysis''","Depurar binarios utilizando Ghidra y r2"],"fr":["Automatiser l''identification de binaires avec ''binary-re:triage''","Effectuer une analyse statique en profondeur avec ''binary-re:static-analysis''","Déboguer des binaires à l''aide de Ghidra et r2"],"de":["Automatisieren der Identifizierung von Binärdateien mit ''binary-re:triage''","Durchführen einer tiefen statischen Analyse mit ''binary-re:static-analysis''","Debuggen von Binärdateien mit Ghidra und r2"],"pt":["Automatizar a identificação de binários com ''binary-re:triage''","Realizar análise estática aprofundada com ''binary-re:static-analysis''","Depurar binários usando Ghidra e r2"],"ru":["Автоматизировать определение бинарных файлов с помощью ''binary-re:triage''","Проводить глубокий статический анализ с помощью ''binary-re:static-analysis''","Отлаживать бинарные файлы с помощью Ghidra и r2"],"ar":["تحديد الثنائيات تلقائيًا باستخدام ''binary-re:triage''","إجراء تحليل ثابت متعمق باستخدام ''binary-re:static-analysis''","تصحيح الثنائيات باستخدام Ghidra و r2"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires specific trigger keywords for skill activation","Limited to binary reverse engineering tasks"],"zh":["需要特定的触发关键字来激活技能","仅限于二进制逆向工程任务"],"ja":["スキルをアクティブにするには特定のトリガーキーワードが必要","バイナリ逆向エンジニアリングタスクのみ"],"ko":["스킬을 활성화하려면 특정 트리거 키워드가 필요","바이너리 역공학 작업만"],"es":["Requiere palabras clave de activación de habilidad específicas","Limitado a tareas de ingeniería inversa de binarios"],"fr":["Nécessite des mots clés d''activation de compétence spécifiques","Limité aux tâches d''ingénierie inverse de binaires"],"de":["Erfordert spezifische Trigger-Schlüsselwörter für die Fähigkeitsaktivierung","Begrenzt auf Binär-Rückingenieur-Aufgaben"],"pt":["Requer palavras-chave de gatilho específicas para ativação da habilidade","Limitado a tarefas de engenharia reversa de binários"],"ru":["Требует конкретных ключевых слов триггера для активации навыка","Ограничен задачами обратного инжиниринга бинарных файлов"],"ar":["يتطلب كلمات مفتاح زناد محددة لتفعيل المهارة","محدود بمهام تحليل الثنائيات العكسي"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"779a12efde05da3712fd34fa2dfcc7e6377da29ba17e2346fc24534951365a04","qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/bdg', 'community', 'majiayu000', 'claude-skill-registry', 'majiayu000/claude-skill-registry', 'bdg', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-20T04:13:19.578Z', '2026-02-20T04:57:20.782Z', '90fdf1deecdc10c40c0913a5bc389a64e304c219da904b1d1b3e1fa9974b889a', '{"id":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/bdg","name":"bdg","description":{"zh":"bdg 是一个浏览器自动化 CLI 工具，支持网页截图、会话管理等功能","ja":"bdg は Web ページの自動化を実現するブラウザ自動化 CLI 工具です","ko":"bdg는 웹 페이지 자동화를 구현하는 브라우저 자동화 CLI 도구입니다","es":"bdg es una herramienta de automatización de navegador que permite lanzar sesiones en Chrome y realizar tareas como capturas de pantalla","fr":"bdg est un outil d''automatisation de navigateur qui permet de lancer des sessions dans Chrome et de réaliser des tâches comme des captures d''écran","de":"bdg ist ein Browser-Automatisierungstool, das das Starten von Sitzungen in Chrome und das Ausführen von Aufgaben wie Screenshots ermöglicht","pt":"O bdg é uma ferramenta de automação de navegador que permite iniciar sessões, capturar telas e executar comandos via CLI.","ru":"Bdg - это инструмент для автоматизации браузера, который позволяет запускать сеансы, делать скриншоты и выполнять команды через CLI.","ar":"bdg هو أداة أتمتة متصفح تسمح ببدء جلسات وتصوير الشاشة وتنفيذ أوامر عبر واجهة سطر الأوامر.","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"bdg 浏览器自动化 CLI","ja":"bdg ブラウザ自動化 CLI","ko":"bdg 브라우저 자동화 CLI","es":"Automatización de navegador con bdg","fr":"Automatisation du navigateur avec bdg","de":"Browser-Automatisierung mit bdg","pt":"bdg: Automatize Navegadores com CLI","ru":"bdg: Автоматизация браузеров с помощью CLI","ar":"bdg: آلي للإنترنت مع واجهة سطر الأوامر","en":"bdg"},"description":{"zh":"bdg 是一个浏览器自动化 CLI 工具，支持网页截图、会话管理等功能","ja":"bdg は Web ページの自動化を実現するブラウザ自動化 CLI 工具です","ko":"bdg는 웹 페이지 자동화를 구현하는 브라우저 자동화 CLI 도구입니다","es":"bdg es una herramienta de automatización de navegador que permite lanzar sesiones en Chrome y realizar tareas como capturas de pantalla","fr":"bdg est un outil d''automatisation de navigateur qui permet de lancer des sessions dans Chrome et de réaliser des tâches comme des captures d''écran","de":"bdg ist ein Browser-Automatisierungstool, das das Starten von Sitzungen in Chrome und das Ausführen von Aufgaben wie Screenshots ermöglicht","pt":"O bdg é uma ferramenta de automação de navegador que permite iniciar sessões, capturar telas e executar comandos via CLI.","ru":"Bdg - это инструмент для автоматизации браузера, который позволяет запускать сеансы, делать скриншоты и выполнять команды через CLI.","ar":"bdg هو أداة أتمتة متصفح تسمح ببدء جلسات وتصوير الشاشة وتنفيذ أوامر عبر واجهة سطر الأوامر.","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"definition":{"en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"features":{"zh":["支持网页截图","会话管理","支持 headless 模式","支持可见浏览器窗口","支持会话状态检查"],"ja":["Web ページのスクリーンショットをサポート","セッション管理","ヘッドレスモードをサポート","可視ブラウザウィンドウをサポート","セッション状態の確認をサポート"],"ko":["웹 페이지 스크린샷 지원","세션 관리","헤드리스 모드 지원","가시 브라우저 창 지원","세션 상태 확인 지원"],"es":["Lanzar sesiones en Chrome","Realizar capturas de pantalla","Gestión de sesiones","Modo headless","Ventana de navegador visible"],"fr":["Lancer des sessions dans Chrome","Réalisser des captures d''écran","Gestion des sessions","Mode headless","Fenêtre de navigateur visible"],"de":["Sitzungen in Chrome starten","Screenshots erstellen","Sitzungsverwaltung","Headless-Modus","Sichtbare Browser-Fenster"],"pt":["Inicie sessões de navegador com facilidade","Capture telas de páginas web"," Execute comandos via CLI","Controle de sessões de navegador","Modos headless e visível"],"ru":["Запускайте сеансы браузера с легкостью","Делайте скриншоты веб-страниц","Выполняйте команды через CLI","Контроль сеансов браузера","Режимы headless и видимого окна"],"ar":["ابدأ جلسات المتصفح بسهولة","تصوير الشاشة من صفحات الويب","تنفيذ أوامر عبر واجهة سطر الأوامر","مراقبة جلسات المتصفح","الوضع الخفي والمرئي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["浏览器自动化","CLI 工具","网页截图","会话管理","headless 模式","可见浏览器窗口"],"ja":["ブラウザ自動化","CLI ツール","Web ページのスクリーンショット","セッション管理","ヘッドレスモード","可視ブラウザウィンドウ"],"ko":["브라우저 자동화","CLI 도구","웹 페이지 스크린샷","세션 관리","헤드리스 모드","가시 브라우저 창"],"es":["automatización de navegador","bdg","chrome","captura de pantalla","gestión de sesiones","modo headless"],"fr":["automatisation de navigateur","bdg","chrome","capture d''écran","gestion des sessions","mode headless"],"de":["browser-automatisierung","bdg","chrome","screenshot","sitzungsverwaltung","headless-modus"],"pt":["automação de navegador","CLI","bdg","ferramenta de automação","navegador headless","captura de tela"],"ru":["автоматизация браузера","CLI","bdg","утилита автоматизации","браузер headless","скриншот"],"ar":["أتمتة متصفح","واجهة سطر الأوامر","bdg","أداة أتمتة","متصفح خفي","تصوير الشاشة"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.578Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"bdg","description":"Use bdg CLI for browser automation via Chrome DevTools Protocol. Provides direct CDP access (60+ domains, 300+ methods) for DOM queries, navigation, screenshots, network control, and JavaScript execution. Use this skill when you need to automate browsers, scrape dynamic content, or interact with web pages programmatically.","bodyPreview":"# bdg - Browser Automation CLI\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\nbdg https://example.com          # Start session (launches Chrome)\nbdg dom screenshot /tmp/page.png # Take screenshot\nbdg stop                         # End session\n```\n\n## Session Management\n\n```bash\nbdg <url>                  # Start session (1920x1080, headless if no display)\nbdg <url> --headless       # Force headless mode\nbdg <url> --no-headless    # Force visible browser window\nbdg status                 # Check session status\nbdg pee","body":"# bdg - Browser Automation CLI\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\nbdg https://example.com          # Start session (launches Chrome)\nbdg dom screenshot /tmp/page.png # Take screenshot\nbdg stop                         # End session\n```\n\n## Session Management\n\n```bash\nbdg <url>                  # Start session (1920x1080, headless if no display)\nbdg <url> --headless       # Force headless mode\nbdg <url> --no-headless    # Force visible browser window\nbdg status                 # Check session status\nbdg peek                   # Preview data without stopping\nbdg stop                   # Stop and save output\nbdg cleanup --force        # Kill stale session\nbdg cleanup --aggressive   # Kill all Chrome processes\n```\n\n**Sessions run indefinitely by default** (no timeout). With HMR/hot-reload dev servers, keep the session running:\n\n```bash\nbdg http://localhost:5173      # Start once\n# ... make code changes, HMR updates the page ...\nbdg dom screenshot /tmp/s.png  # Check anytime\nbdg peek                       # Preview collected data\n# No need to stop/restart - Chrome stays on the page\n```\n\n## Screenshots\n\nAlways use `bdg dom screenshot` (raw CDP is blocked):\n\n```bash\nbdg dom screenshot /tmp/page.png                    # Full page\nbdg dom screenshot /tmp/viewport.png --no-full-page # Viewport only\nbdg dom screenshot /tmp/el.png --selector \"#main\"   # Element only\nbdg dom screenshot /tmp/scroll.png --scroll \"#target\" # Scroll to element first\n```\n\n## Form Interaction\n\n```bash\n# Discover forms\nbdg dom form --brief              # Quick scan: field names, types, required\n\n# Fill and interact\nbdg dom fill \"input[name=''user'']\" \"myuser\"    # Fill by selector\nbdg dom fill 0 \"value\"                         # Fill by index (from query)\nbdg dom click \"button.submit\"                  # Click element\nbdg dom submit \"form\" --wait-navigation        # Submit and wait for page load\nbdg dom pressKey \"input\" Enter                 # Press Enter key\n\n# Options\n--no-wait          # Skip network stability wait\n--wait-navigation  # Wait for page navigation (traditional forms)\n--wait-network <ms> # Wait for network idle (SPA forms)\n--index <n>        # Select nth element when multiple match\n```\n\n## DOM Inspection\n\n```bash\nbdg dom query \"selector\"     # Find elements, returns [0], [1], [2]...\nbdg dom get \"selector\"       # Get semantic a11y info (token-efficient)\nbdg dom get \"selector\" --raw # Get full HTML\nbdg dom eval \"js expression\" # Run JavaScript\n```\n\n## CDP Access\n\nDirect access to Chrome DevTools Protocol:\n\n```bash\n# Execute any CDP method\nbdg cdp Runtime.evaluate --params ''{\"expression\": \"document.title\", \"returnByValue\": true}''\nbdg cdp Page.navigate --params ''{\"url\": \"https://example.com\"}''\nbdg cdp Page.reload --params ''{\"ignoreCache\": true}''\n\n# Discovery\nbdg cdp --list                    # List all 53 domains\nbdg cdp Network --list            # List methods in domain\nbdg cdp Network.getCookies --describe  # Show method schema\nbdg cdp --search cookie           # Search methods\n```\n\n**Important**: Always use `returnByValue: true` for Runtime.evaluate to get serialized values.\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Login Flow\n```bash\nbdg https://example.com/login\nbdg dom form --brief\nbdg dom fill \"input[name=''username'']\" \"$USER\"\nbdg dom fill \"input[name=''password'']\" \"$PASS\"\nbdg dom submit \"button[type=''submit'']\" --wait-navigation\nbdg dom screenshot /tmp/result.png\nbdg stop\n```\n\n### Wait for Element\n```bash\nfor i in {1..20}; do\n  EXISTS=$(bdg cdp Runtime.evaluate --params ''{\n    \"expression\": \"document.querySelector(\\\"#target\\\") !== null\",\n    \"returnByValue\": true\n  }'' | jq -r ''.result.value'')\n  [ \"$EXISTS\" = \"true\" ] && break\n  sleep 0.5\ndone\n```\n\n### Extract Data\n```bash\nbdg cdp Runtime.evaluate --params ''{\n  \"expression\": \"Array.from(document.querySelectorAll(\\\"a\\\")).map(a => ({text: a.textContent, href: a.href}))\",\n  \"returnByValue\": true\n}'' | jq ''.result.value''\n```\n\n## Exit Codes\n\n| Code | Meaning | Action |\n|------|---------|--------|\n| 0 | Success | - |\n| 1 | Blocked command | Read error message, use suggested alternative |\n| 81 | Invalid arguments | Check command syntax |\n| 83 | Resource not found | Element/session doesn''t exist |\n| 101 | CDP connection failure | Run `bdg cleanup --aggressive` and retry |\n| 102 | CDP timeout | Increase timeout or check page load |\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n```bash\nbdg status --verbose      # Full diagnostics\nbdg cleanup --force       # Kill stale session\nbdg cleanup --aggressive  # Kill all Chrome processes\n```\n\n**Chrome won''t launch?** Run `bdg cleanup --aggressive` then retry.\n\n**Session stuck?** Run `bdg cleanup --force` to reset.\n\n### Custom Chrome Flags\n\nUse `--chrome-flags` or `BDG_CHROME_FLAGS` for self-signed certificates, CORS, etc.:\n\n```bash\n# CLI option\nbdg https://localhost:5173 --chrome-flags=\"--ignore-certificate-errors\"\n\n# Environment variable\nBDG_CHROME_FLAGS=\"--ignore-certificate-errors\" bdg https://localhost:5173\n\n# Multiple flags\nbdg https://example.com --chrome-flags=\"--ignore-certificate-errors --disable-web-security\"\n```\n\n**Common flags for development:**\n- `--ignore-certificate-errors` - Self-signed SSL certs\n- `--disable-web-security` - CORS issues in development\n- `--allow-insecure-localhost` - Insecure localhost\n- `--disable-features=IsolateOrigins,site-per-process` - Cross-origin iframes\n\n## Verification Best Practices\n\n**Prefer DOM queries over screenshots** for verification:\n\n```bash\n# GOOD: Fast, precise, scriptable\nbdg cdp Runtime.evaluate --params ''{\n  \"expression\": \"document.querySelector(\\\".error-message\\\")?.textContent\",\n  \"returnByValue\": true\n}''\n\n# GOOD: Check element exists\nbdg dom query \".submit-btn\"\n\n# GOOD: Check text content\nbdg cdp Runtime.evaluate --params ''{\n  \"expression\": \"document.body.innerText.includes(\\\"Success\\\")\",\n  \"returnByValue\": true\n}''\n\n# AVOID: Screenshots for simple verification (slow, requires visual inspection)\nbdg dom screenshot /tmp/check.png  # Only use when you need visual proof\n```\n\n**When to use screenshots:**\n- Visual regression testing\n- Capturing proof for user review\n- Debugging layout issues\n- When DOM structure is unknown\n\n**When to use DOM queries:**\n- Verifying text content appeared\n- Checking element exists/visible\n- Validating form state\n- Counting elements\n- Any programmatic assertion\n\n## When NOT to Use bdg\n\n- **Static HTML** - Use `curl` + `htmlq`/`pq`\n- **API calls** - Use `curl` + `jq`\n- **Simple HTTP** - Use `wget`/`curl`\n\nUse bdg when you need: JavaScript execution, dynamic content, browser APIs, screenshots, or network manipulation.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T04:57:20.782Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Automation Agents needing advanced browser automation capabilities via CLI.","zh":"适用于需要高级浏览器自动化功能的自动化代理，通过CLI实现浏览器自动化。","ja":"CLI経由で高度なブラウザ自動化機能を必要とする自動化エージェントに適しています。","ko":"고급 브라우저 자동화 기능을 필요로 하는 자동화 에이전트에게 적합하며, CLI를 통해 브라우저 자동화를 구현합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Automatización que necesitan capacidades de automatización de navegador avanzadas a través de la CLI.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Automatisation qui ont besoin de capacités d''automatisation de navigateur avancées via la CLI.","de":"Perfekt für Automatisierungsagenten, die erweiterte Browser-Automatisierungsfunktionen über die CLI benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Automação que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de automação de navegador via CLI.","ru":"Идеально для агентов автоматизации, которым необходимы расширенные возможности автоматизации браузера через CLI.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الآليين الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة في أتمتة المتصفح عبر CLI."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate browser interactions using Chrome, enabling features like headless mode, screenshot capture, and session management via protocols such as HTTPS, utilizing libraries and tools for browser automation.","zh":"使代理能够使用Chrome自动化浏览器交互，实现诸如无头模式、截图捕获和会话管理等功能，通过HTTPS等协议，并利用浏览器自动化的库和工具。","ja":"エージェントがChromeを使用してブラウザの相互作用を自動化できるようにし、ヘッドレスモード、スクリーンショットのキャプチャ、セッション管理などの機能を実現し、HTTPSなどのプロトコルを使用し、ブラウザ自動化のライブラリやツールを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 Chrome을 사용하여 브라우저 상호작용을 자동화할 수 있도록 하며, 헤드리스 모드, 스크린샷 캡처, 세션 관리 등의 기능을 구현하며, HTTPS 등의 프로토콜을 사용하며, 브라우저 자동화 라이브러리 및 도구를 활용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes automatizar las interacciones del navegador mediante Chrome, habilitando características como el modo sin cabeza, la captura de pantalla y la administración de sesiones a través de protocolos como HTTPS, utilizando bibliotecas y herramientas para la automatización del navegador.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les interactions de navigateur à l''aide de Chrome, activant des fonctionnalités telles que le mode sans tête, la capture d''écran et la gestion de session via des protocoles tels que HTTPS, en utilisant des bibliothèques et des outils pour l''automatisation du navigateur.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Browser-Interaktionen mithilfe von Chrome zu automatisieren, wodurch Funktionen wie den headless-Modus, die Screenshot-Erfassung und die Sitzungsverwaltung über Protokolle wie HTTPS aktiviert werden, unter Verwendung von Bibliotheken und Tools für die Browser-Automatisierung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar interações do navegador usando o Chrome, permitindo recursos como modo headless, captura de tela e gerenciamento de sessão via protocolos como HTTPS, utilizando bibliotecas e ferramentas para automação de navegador.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать взаимодействия браузера с помощью Chrome, обеспечивая функции, такие как режим headless, захват экрана и управление сессиями через протоколы, такие как HTTPS, используя библиотеки и инструменты для автоматизации браузера.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على أتمتة تفاعلات المتصفح باستخدام كروم، وتمكين الميزات مثل وضع غير متصل، وتقاطع الشاشة، وإدارة الجلسات عبر بروتوكولات مثل HTTPS، باستخدام المكتبات والأدوات لأتمتة المتصفح."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating web page interactions for data scraping","Generating screenshots of web pages for visual testing","Debugging web applications in headless browser environments"],"zh":["用于数据抓取的网页交互自动化","用于视觉测试的网页截图生成","在无头浏览器环境中调试Web应用程序"],"ja":["データスクレイピングのためのWebページの相互作用の自動化","ビジュアルテストのためのWebページのスクリーンショットの生成","ヘッドレスブラウザ環境でのWebアプリケーションのデバッグ"],"ko":["데이터 스크레이핑을 위한 웹 페이지 상호작용 자동화","시각적 테스트를 위한 웹 페이지 스크린샷 생성","헤드리스 브라우저 환경에서 웹 애플리케이션 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar las interacciones de la página web para la extracción de datos","Generar capturas de pantalla de páginas web para pruebas visuales","Depurar aplicaciones web en entornos de navegador sin cabeza"],"fr":["Automatiser les interactions de page Web pour le scraping de données","Générer des captures d''écran de pages Web pour des tests visuels","Déboguer des applications Web dans des environnements de navigateur sans tête"],"de":["Automatisieren von Webseiten-Interaktionen für das Daten-Scraping","Erzeugen von Screenshots von Webseiten für visuelle Tests","Debuggen von Webanwendungen in headless-Browser-Umgebungen"],"pt":["Automação de interações de página web para extração de dados","Geração de telas de páginas web para teste visual","Depuração de aplicações web em ambientes de navegador headless"],"ru":["Автоматизация взаимодействий веб-страниц для сбора данных","Генерация экранов веб-страниц для визуального тестирования","Отладка веб-приложений в средах браузера headless"],"ar":["أتمتة تفاعلات صفحة الويب لاستخراج البيانات","تحغيل لقطات من صفحات الويب للاختبار المرئي","تصحيح أخطاء التطبيقات الويب في بيئات المتصفح غير متصل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Chrome browser installation","Limited to HTTP and HTTPS protocols","Needs display for non-headless mode"],"zh":["需要安装Chrome浏览器","仅限HTTP和HTTPS协议","非无头模式需要显示"],"ja":["Chromeブラウザのインストールが必要","HTTPとHTTPSプロトコルのみ","ヘッドレスモード以外では表示が必要"],"ko":["Chrome 브라우저 설치가 필요함","HTTP 및 HTTPS 프로토콜만 지원","헤드리스 모드가 아닌 경우에는 표시가 필요"],"es":["Requiere la instalación del navegador Chrome","Limitado a los protocolos HTTP y HTTPS","Necesita una pantalla para el modo no sin cabeza"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation du navigateur Chrome","Limité aux protocoles HTTP et HTTPS","Nécessite un écran pour le mode non sans tête"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation des Chrome-Browsers","Begrenzt auf die Protokolle HTTP und HTTPS","Benötigt einen Bildschirm für den nicht-headless-Modus"],"pt":["Requer instalação do navegador Chrome","Limitado aos protocolos HTTP e HTTPS","Necessita de exibição para modo não headless"],"ru":["Требует установки браузера Chrome","Ограничен протоколами HTTP и HTTPS","Требует дисплея для режима не-headless"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت متصفح كروم","محدود ببروتوكولات HTTP و HTTPS","يحتاج إلى شاشة للوضع غير متصل"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"90fdf1deecdc10c40c0913a5bc389a64e304c219da904b1d1b3e1fa9974b889a","qualityScore":50}');
