"Déployer des applications sur exe.dev","de":"Bereitstellung von Anwendungen auf exe.dev","pt":"Implantação no exe.dev: Guia de Deploy","ru":"Развертывание на exe.dev: Руководство","ar":"تثبيت exe.dev: دليل الإنشاء","en":"exe"},"description":{"zh":"exe.dev 是一个 VM 主机平台，提供持久存储和默认 HTTPS。您可以轻松地将您的 Vibes 应用部署到 exe.dev","ja":"exe.dev は、永続的なストレージとデフォルトのHTTPSを備えたVMホスティングプラットフォームです。Vibes アプリをexe.devに簡単にデプロイできます","ko":"exe.dev는 영속적인 저장소와 기본 HTTPS를 갖춘 VM 호스팅 플랫폼입니다. Vibes 애플리케이션을 exe.dev에 쉽게 배포할 수 있습니다","es":"El despliegue de aplicaciones en exe.dev es un proceso sencillo que requiere una clave SSH, una cuenta en exe.dev y una aplicación Vibes generada","fr":"Le déploiement d''applications sur exe.dev est un processus simple qui nécessite une clé SSH, un compte sur exe.dev et une application Vibes générée","de":"Die Bereitstellung von Anwendungen auf exe.dev ist ein einfacher Prozess, der einen SSH-Schlüssel, ein Konto auf exe.dev und eine generierte Vibes-Anwendung ...","pt":"O exe.dev é uma plataforma de hospedagem de VM que oferece armazenamento persistente e HTTPS por padrão. Aprenda a implantar seu aplicativo Vibes com facilid...","ru":"exe.dev - это платформа для хостинга виртуальных машин, обеспечивающая постоянное хранилище и HTTPS по умолчанию. Узнайте, как развернуть свое приложение Vibes.","ar":"exe.dev هي منصة استضافة افتراضية توفر تخزينًا مستمرًا و HTTPS افتراضيًا. تعلم كيفية تثبيت تطبيق Vibes الخاص بك بسهولة.","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"definition":{"en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"features":{"zh":["持久存储","默认 HTTPS","SSH 密钥支持","exe.dev 账户集成","Vibes 应用部署"],"ja":["永続的なストレージ","デフォルトのHTTPS","SSH キーのサポート","exe.dev アカウントの統合","Vibes アプリのデプロイ"],"ko":["영속적인 저장소","기본 HTTPS","SSH 키 지원","exe.dev 계정 통합","Vibes 애플리케이션 배포"],"es":["Despliegue de aplicaciones con almacenamiento persistente","HTTPS por defecto","Cuenta en exe.dev para la gestión de aplicaciones","Uso de claves SSH para la autenticación","Soporte para aplicaciones Vibes","Proceso de despliegue sencillo"],"fr":["Déploiement d''applications avec stockage persistant","HTTPS par défaut","Compte sur exe.dev pour la gestion des applications","Utilisation de clés SSH pour l''authentification","Prise en charge des applications Vibes","Processus de déploiement simple"],"de":["Bereitstellung von Anwendungen mit persistenter Speicherung","HTTPS standardmäßig","Konto auf exe.dev für die Anwendungsverwaltung","Verwendung von SSH-Schlüsseln für die Authentifizierung","Unterstützung für Vibes-Anwendungen","Einfacher Bereitstellungsprozess"],"pt":["Armazenamento persistente","HTTPS por padrão","Implantação fácil de aplicativos Vibes","Suporte a SSH","Criação de conta e verificação de email"],"ru":["Постоянное хранилище","HTTPS по умолчанию","Простая установка приложений Vibes","Поддержка SSH","Создание учетной записи и проверка электронной почты"],"ar":["تخزين مستمر","HTTPS افتراضي","تثبيت سهل لتطبيقات Vibes","دعم SSH","إنشاء حساب وตรวจ إلكتروني"]},"keywords":{"zh":["exe.dev","Vibes 应用","VM 主机","持久存储","默认 HTTPS","SSH 密钥","部署指南"],"ja":["exe.dev","Vibes アプリ","VM ホスティング","永続的なストレージ","デフォルトのHTTPS","SSH キー","デプロイガイド"],"ko":["exe.dev","Vibes 애플리케이션","VM 호스팅","영속적인 저장소","기본 HTTPS","SSH 키","배포 가이드"],"es":["despliegue de aplicaciones","exe.dev","almacenamiento persistente","HTTPS","claves SSH","aplicaciones Vibes","plataforma de alojamiento de máquinas virtuales","desarrollo de aplicaciones","devops"],"fr":["déploiement d''applications","exe.dev","stockage persistant","HTTPS","clés SSH","applications Vibes","plate-forme d''hébergement de machines virtuelles","développement d''applications","devops"],"de":["Bereitstellung von Anwendungen","exe.dev","persistente Speicherung","HTTPS","SSH-Schlüssel","Vibes-Anwendungen","Plattform für die Bereitstellung von virtuellen Maschinen","Anwendungsentwicklung","devops"],"pt":["exe.dev","hospedagem de VM","armazenamento persistente","HTTPS","implantação de aplicativos","Vibes","SSH","desenvolvimento web"],"ru":["exe.dev","хостинг виртуальных машин","постоянное хранилище","HTTPS","развертывание приложений","Vibes","SSH","веб-разработка"],"ar":["exe.dev","استضافة افتراضية","تخزين مستمر","HTTPS","نشر التطبيقات","Vibes","SSH","تطوير ويب"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.578Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"exe","description":"Deploy a Vibes app to exe.dev VM hosting. Uses nginx on persistent VMs with SSH automation. Supports client-side multi-tenancy via subdomain-based Fireproof database isolation.","bodyPreview":"# Deploy to exe.dev\n\nDeploy your Vibes app to exe.dev, a VM hosting platform with persistent storage and HTTPS by default.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n1. **SSH key** in `~/.ssh/` (id_ed25519, id_rsa, or id_ecdsa)\n2. **exe.dev account** - run `ssh exe.dev` once to create your account and verify email\n3. **Generated Vibes app** - an `index.html` file ready to deploy\n\n## Gather Config Upfront\n\n**Use AskUserQuestion to collect deployment config before running the deploy script.**\n\nUse the AskUserQuestion too","body":"# Deploy to exe.dev\n\nDeploy your Vibes app to exe.dev, a VM hosting platform with persistent storage and HTTPS by default.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n1. **SSH key** in `~/.ssh/` (id_ed25519, id_rsa, or id_ecdsa)\n2. **exe.dev account** - run `ssh exe.dev` once to create your account and verify email\n3. **Generated Vibes app** - an `index.html` file ready to deploy\n\n## Gather Config Upfront\n\n**Use AskUserQuestion to collect deployment config before running the deploy script.**\n\nUse the AskUserQuestion tool with these questions:\n\n```\nQuestion 1: \"What VM name should we use? (becomes yourname.exe.xyz)\"\nHeader: \"VM Name\"\nOptions: Suggest based on app name from context + user enters via \"Other\"\n\nQuestion 2: \"Which file should we deploy?\"\nHeader: \"File\"\nOptions: [\"index.html (default)\", \"Other path\"]\n\nQuestion 3: \"Does this app need AI features?\"\nHeader: \"AI\"\nOptions: [\"No\", \"Yes - I have an OpenRouter key\"]\n\nQuestion 4: \"Is this a SaaS app with subdomain claiming?\"\nHeader: \"Registry\"\nOptions: [\"No - simple static deploy\", \"Yes - need Clerk keys for registry\"]\n```\n\n### After Receiving Answers\n\n1. If AI enabled, ask for the OpenRouter API key\n2. If Registry enabled, ask for Clerk PEM public key and webhook secret\n3. **Proceed immediately to deploy** - no more questions\n\n## Quick Deploy\n\n```bash\ncd \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/scripts\" && [ -d node_modules ] || npm install\nnode \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/scripts/deploy-exe.js\" --name myapp --file index.html\n```\n\n## What It Does\n\n1. **Creates VM** on exe.dev via SSH CLI\n2. **Starts nginx** (pre-installed on exeuntu image)\n3. **Uploads** your index.html to `/var/www/html/`\n4. **Generates HANDOFF.md** - context document for remote Claude\n5. **Makes VM public** via `ssh exe.dev share set-public <vmname>`\n6. **Verifies** public access at `https://myapp.exe.xyz`\n\n## AI-Enabled Apps\n\nFor apps using the `useAI` hook, deploy with the `--ai-key` flag:\n\n```bash\nnode \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/scripts/deploy-exe.js\" --name myapp --file index.html --ai-key \"sk-or-v1-...\"\n```\n\nThis sets up a **secure AI proxy**:\n1. Installs Bun runtime\n2. Creates `/home/exedev/proxy.js` - proxies `/api/ai/*` to OpenRouter\n3. Configures systemd service for the proxy\n4. Adds nginx reverse proxy from port 80/443 to Bun (port 3001)\n\n**IMPORTANT:** Do not manually set up AI proxying. Manual nginx config changes can overwrite SSL settings and miss the Bun/proxy.js service. Always use the deploy script with `--ai-key`.\n\n### Multi-Tenant AI Apps\n\nFor SaaS apps with per-tenant AI:\n\n```bash\nnode \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/scripts/deploy-exe.js\" --name myapp --file index.html --ai-key \"sk-or-v1-...\" --multi-tenant\n```\n\n## Registry Server\n\nFor SaaS apps using subdomain claiming (from `/vibes:sell`), deploy with Clerk credentials:\n\n```bash\nnode \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/scripts/deploy-exe.js\" --name myapp --file index.html \\\n  --clerk-key \"$(cat clerk-public-key.pem)\" \\\n  --clerk-webhook-secret \"whsec_xxx\" \\\n  --reserved \"admin,api,billing\"\n```\n\nThis sets up a **subdomain registry server**:\n1. Installs Bun runtime to `/usr/local/bin/bun`\n2. Creates `/var/www/registry-server.ts` with Clerk JWT verification\n3. Configures systemd service (port 3002)\n4. Adds nginx proxy for `/registry.json`, `/check/*`, `/claim`, `/webhook`\n\n### Registry Endpoints\n\n| Endpoint | Method | Auth | Description |\n|----------|--------|------|-------------|\n| `/registry.json` | GET | None | Public read of all claims |\n| `/check/{subdomain}` | GET | None | Check availability |\n| `/claim` | POST | Bearer JWT | Claim subdomain for user |\n| `/webhook` | POST | Svix sig | Clerk subscription events |\n\n### Getting the Clerk Public Key\n\nThe registry server needs Clerk''s PEM public key to verify JWTs for the `/claim` endpoint.\n\n**Option 1: From Clerk Dashboard**\n1. Go to Clerk Dashboard → API Keys\n2. Scroll to \"PEM Public Key\" or click \"Show JWT Public Key\"\n3. Copy the full key (starts with `-----BEGIN PUBLIC KEY-----`)\n\n**Option 2: From JWKS endpoint**\n```bash\n# Get your Clerk frontend API domain from dashboard\ncurl https://YOUR_CLERK_DOMAIN/.well-known/jwks.json\n```\nThen convert the JWK to PEM format using an online tool or `jose` CLI.\n\n**Passing to deploy script:**\n```bash\n# From a file\nnode deploy-exe.js --clerk-key \"$(cat clerk-public-key.pem)\" ...\n\n# Inline (escape newlines)\nnode deploy-exe.js --clerk-key \"-----BEGIN PUBLIC KEY-----\\nMIIB...\\n-----END PUBLIC KEY-----\" ...\n```\n\n**Manual configuration on server:**\n```bash\nssh myapp.exe.dev\nsudo nano /etc/registry.env\n# Add: CLERK_PEM_PUBLIC_KEY=\"-----BEGIN PUBLIC KEY-----\\n...\\n-----END PUBLIC KEY-----\"\nsudo systemctl restart vibes-registry\n```\n\n## Continue Development on the VM\n\nClaude is pre-installed on exe.dev VMs. After deployment, you can continue development remotely:\n\n```bash\nssh myapp.exe.dev -t \"cd /var/www/html && claude\"\n```\n\nThe HANDOFF.md file provides context about what was built, so Claude can continue meaningfully.\n\n### Manual Public Access\n\nIf the deploy script doesn''t make the VM public automatically, run:\n\n```bash\nssh exe.dev share set-public myapp\n```\n\n## Multi-Tenant Apps\n\nFor apps that need tenant isolation (e.g., `alice.myapp.com`, `bob.myapp.com`):\n\n### Client-Side Isolation\n\nThe same `index.html` serves all subdomains. JavaScript reads the hostname and uses the subdomain as a Fireproof database prefix:\n\n```javascript\n// In your app:\nconst hostname = window.location.hostname;\nconst subdomain = hostname.split(''.'')[0];\nconst dbName = `myapp-${subdomain}`;\n\n// Each subdomain gets its own Fireproof database\nconst { database } = useFireproof(dbName);\n```\n\n### Custom Domain Setup\n\n1. **Add `--domain` flag:**\n   ```bash\n   node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/scripts/deploy-exe.js\" --name myapp --domain myapp.com\n   ```\n\n2. **Configure wildcard DNS** at your DNS provider:\n   ```\n   *.myapp.com  CNAME  myapp.exe.xyz\n   myapp.com    ALIAS  exe.xyz\n   ```\n\n3. **Set up wildcard SSL** on the VM:\n   ```bash\n   ssh myapp.exe.dev\n   sudo apt install certbot\n   sudo certbot certonly --manual --preferred-challenges dns \\\n     -d \"myapp.com\" -d \"*.myapp.com\"\n   ```\n\n## CLI Options\n\n| Option | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `--name <vm>` | VM name (required) |\n| `--file <path>` | HTML file to deploy (default: index.html) |\n| `--domain <domain>` | Custom domain for wildcard setup |\n| `--ai-key <key>` | OpenRouter API key for AI features |\n| `--multi-tenant` | Enable subdomain-based multi-tenancy |\n| `--tenant-limit <$>` | Credit limit per tenant in dollars (default: 5) |\n| `--clerk-key <pem>` | Clerk PEM public key for JWT verification |\n| `--clerk-webhook-secret <secret>` | Clerk webhook signing secret |\n| `--reserved <list>` | Comma-separated reserved subdomain names |\n| `--preallocated <list>` | Pre-claimed subdomains (format: `sub:user_id`) |\n| `--dry-run` | Show commands without executing |\n| `--skip-verify` | Skip deployment verification |\n\n## Redeployment\n\nAfter making changes, redeploy with:\n\n```bash\nnode \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/scripts/deploy-exe.js\" --name myapp\n```\n\n## SSH Access\n\nAccess your VM directly:\n\n```bash\nssh myapp.exe.dev\n```\n\n## Architecture\n\n```\nexe.dev VM (exeuntu image)\n├── nginx (serves all subdomains via server_name _)\n├── claude (pre-installed CLI)\n├── /usr/local/bin/bun  ← Bun runtime (system-wide)\n├── /var/www/html/\n│   ├── index.html   ← Your Vibes app\n│   └── HANDOFF.md   ← Context for remote Claude\n├── (with --ai-key)\n│   ├── /opt/vibes/proxy.js  ← AI proxy service (port 3001)\n│   └── vibes-proxy.service  ← systemd unit\n└── (with --clerk-key)\n    ├── /var/www/registry-server.ts  ← Registry service (port 3002)\n    ├── /var/www/html/registry.json  ← Subdomain claims data\n    └── vibes-registry.service       ← systemd unit\n```\n\n### Port Assignments\n\n| Service | Port | Purpose |\n|---------|------|---------|\n| AI Proxy | 3001 | OpenRouter proxy for `useAI` hook |\n| Registry | 3002 | Subdomain claim/check API |\n\n- **No server-side logic** - pure static hosting (unless using AI proxy)\n- **Persistent disk** - survives restarts\n- **HTTPS by default** - exe.dev handles SSL for *.exe.xyz\n- **Claude pre-installed** - continue development on the VM\n\n## Post-Deploy Debugging\n\nAfter deployment, **always work with local files** - they are the source of truth. SSHing to read deployed files is slow and wastes tokens.\n\n| Task | Use Local | Use SSH |\n|------|-----------|---------|\n| Editing/debugging code | ✅ Always | ❌ Never |\n| Checking console errors | ✅ Local file | ❌ No need |\n| Verifying deploy | ❌ | ✅ `curl https://vm.exe.xyz` |\n| Server-specific issues | ❌ | ✅ Only if local works but remote doesn''t |\n\n**To redeploy after local fixes:**\n```bash\nnode \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/scripts/deploy-exe.js\" --name <vmname> --file index.html\n```\n\n## SSL Configuration\n\nThe deploy script preserves existing SSL by using include files for AI proxy config. When manually editing nginx:\n\n1. **Never replace the entire config** - only add/modify specific blocks\n2. **Check for SSL first:** Look for `listen 443 ssl` in the config\n3. **Use includes:** Put new configs in `/etc/nginx/conf.d/` or separate files\n4. **Test before reload:** `sudo nginx -t`\n\n### exe.dev Home Directory\n\nThe home directory on exe.dev VMs is `/home/exedev` (not `~` expansion). For manual file operations:\n\n```bash\n# Use explicit path or /tmp for staging\nscp file.html vmname.exe.xyz:/home/exedev/\n# or\nscp file.html vmname.exe.xyz:/tmp/\n```\n\n---\n\n## What''s Next?\n\nAfter successful deployment, present these options using AskUserQuestion:\n\n```\nQuestion: \"Your app is live at https://${name}.exe.xyz! What''s next?\"\nHeader: \"Next\"\nOptions:\n- Label: \"Share my URL\"\n  Description: \"Get the shareable link for your app. I''ll confirm the public URL and you can send it to anyone - they''ll see your app immediately with full functionality.\"\n\n- Label: \"Make changes and redeploy\"\n  Description: \"Continue iterating locally. Edit your files here, then run deploy again to push updates. The VM keeps running so there''s zero downtime during updates.\"\n\n- Label: \"Continue development on VM\"\n  Description: \"Work directly on the server. SSH in and use the pre-installed Claude to make changes live. Great for server-specific debugging or when you want changes to persist immediately.\"\n\n- Label: \"I''m done for now\"\n  Description: \"Wrap up this session. Your app stays live at the URL - it runs 24/7 on exe.dev''s persistent VMs. Come back anytime to make updates.\"\n```\n\n**After user responds:**\n- \"Share URL\" → Confirm \"Your app is live at https://${name}.exe.xyz - share this link!\"\n- \"Make changes\" → Acknowledge, stay ready for local edits\n- \"Continue on VM\" → Provide: `ssh ${name}.exe.dev -t \"cd /var/www/html && claude\"`\n- \"I''m done\" → Confirm app stays live, wish them well\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T04:57:32.065Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud Deployment Agents needing seamless VM hosting with persistent storage and HTTPS.","zh":"非常适合需要无缝虚拟机托管、持久存储和HTTPS的云部署代理。","ja":"クラウドデプロイエージェントがシームレスなVMホスティングと永続的なストレージ、およびHTTPSを必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"시ーム리스한 VM 호스팅 및 지속적인 저장소와 HTTPS가 필요한 클라우드 배포 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de implementación en la nube que necesitan alojamiento de máquinas virtuales sin problemas con almacenamiento persistente y HTTPS.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de déploiement cloud nécessitant une hébergement de VM sans interruption avec un stockage persistant et HTTPS.","de":"Perfekt für Cloud-Deployment-Agents, die ein reibungsloses VM-Hosting mit persistentem Speicher und HTTPS benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de implantação em nuvem que necessitam de hospedagem de VM sem interrupções com armazenamento persistente e HTTPS.","ru":"Идеально для агентов облачного развертывания, которым требуется бесшовное размещение виртуальных машин с постоянным хранилищем и HTTPS.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التثبيت السحابي الذي يحتاج إلى استضافة VM دون انقطاع مع تخزين مستمر و HTTPS."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to deploy Vibes apps to exe.dev, leveraging SSH keys, HTTPS, and persistent storage, while streamlining deployment config collection using AskUserQuestion.","zh":"赋予代理部署Vibes应用到exe.dev的能力，利用SSH密钥、HTTPS和持久存储，同时使用AskUserQuestion简化部署配置收集。","ja":"エージェントがVibesアプリをexe.devにデプロイする機能を提供し、SSHキー、HTTPS、および永続的なストレージを利用し、AskUserQuestionを使用してデプロイコンフィグの収集を簡素化します。","ko":"에이전트가 Vibes 애플리케이션을 exe.dev에 배포할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, SSH 키, HTTPS 및 지속적인 저장소를 활용하고, AskUserQuestion을 사용하여 배포 구성 수집을 간소화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para implementar aplicaciones Vibes en exe.dev, aprovechando claves SSH, HTTPS y almacenamiento persistente, mientras simplifica la recopilación de configuración de implementación mediante AskUserQuestion.","fr":"Permet aux agents de déployer des applications Vibes sur exe.dev, en exploitant les clés SSH, HTTPS et le stockage persistant, tout en simplifiant la collecte de configuration de déploiement à l''aide de AskUserQuestion.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Vibes-Apps auf exe.dev zu deployen, indem sie SSH-Schlüssel, HTTPS und persistenten Speicher nutzen und gleichzeitig die Konfigurationsabrufsammlung mithilfe von AskUserQuestion vereinfachen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implantar aplicativos Vibes no exe.dev, utilizando chaves SSH, HTTPS e armazenamento persistente, além de otimizar a coleta de configurações de implantação usando AskUserQuestion.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью развертывать приложения Vibes на exe.dev, используя ключи SSH, HTTPS и постоянное хранилище, а также оптимизировать сбор конфигураций развертывания с помощью AskUserQuestion.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على نشر تطبيقات Vibes على exe.dev، باستخدام مفتاح SSH و HTTPS وتخزين مستمر، بالإضافة إلى تحسين جمع إعدادات النشر باستخدام AskUserQuestion."},"useCases":{"en":["Deploying web applications to exe.dev","Configuring SSH keys for secure deployment","Streamlining Vibes app deployment with AskUserQuestion"],"zh":["将Web应用程序部署到exe.dev","为安全部署配置SSH密钥","使用AskUserQuestion简化Vibes应用程序部署"],"ja":["Webアプリケーションをexe.devにデプロイする","セキュアデプロイのためにSSHキーを設定する","AskUserQuestionを使用してVibesアプリのデプロイを簡素化する"],"ko":["웹 애플리케이션을 exe.dev에 배포하는 것","보안 배포를 위해 SSH 키를 구성하는 것","AskUserQuestion을 사용하여 Vibes 애플리케이션 배포를 간소화하는 것"],"es":["Implementar aplicaciones web en exe.dev","Configurar claves SSH para una implementación segura","Simplificar la implementación de aplicaciones Vibes con AskUserQuestion"],"fr":["Déployer des applications web sur exe.dev","Configurer des clés SSH pour un déploiement sécurisé","Simplifier le déploiement d''applications Vibes avec AskUserQuestion"],"de":["Webanwendungen auf exe.dev bereitstellen","SSH-Schlüssel für eine sichere Bereitstellung konfigurieren","Vibes-App-Bereitstellung mit AskUserQuestion vereinfachen"],"pt":["Implantação de aplicações web no exe.dev","Configuração de chaves SSH para implantação segura","Otimização da implantação de aplicativos Vibes com AskUserQuestion"],"ru":["Развертывание веб-приложений на exe.dev","Настройка ключей SSH для безопасного развертывания","Оптимизация развертывания приложений Vibes с помощью AskUserQuestion"],"ar":["نشر تطبيقات الويب على exe.dev","تكوين مفاتيح SSH لنشر آمن","تحسين نشر تطبيقات Vibes باستخدام AskUserQuestion"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires SSH key in ~/.ssh/","Needs exe.dev account with verified email","Limited to Vibes apps with an index.html file"],"zh":["需要在~/.ssh/中有SSH密钥","需要拥有已验证电子邮件的exe.dev帐户","仅限于具有index.html文件的Vibes应用程序"],"ja":["~/.ssh/にSSHキーが必要","検証済みの電子メールを持つexe.devアカウントが必要","index.htmlファイルを持つVibesアプリのみ"],"ko":["~/.ssh/에 SSH 키가 필요합니다.","검증된 이메일이 있는 exe.dev 계정이 필요합니다.","index.html 파일이 있는 Vibes 애플리케이션만 해당"],"es":["Requiere clave SSH en ~/.ssh/","Necesita una cuenta de exe.dev con correo electrónico verificado","Limitado a aplicaciones Vibes con un archivo index.html"],"fr":["Nécessite une clé SSH dans ~/.ssh/","Nécessite un compte exe.dev avec un e-mail vérifié","Limité aux applications Vibes avec un fichier index.html"],"de":["Benötigt SSH-Schlüssel in ~/.ssh/","Benötigt ein exe.dev-Konto mit verifizierter E-Mail","Eingeschränkt auf Vibes-Apps mit einer index.html-Datei"],"pt":["Exige chave SSH em ~/.ssh/","Necessita de conta no exe.dev com e-mail verificado","Limitado a aplicativos Vibes com um arquivo index.html"],"ru":["Требует ключа SSH в ~/.ssh/","Требует учетной записи на exe.dev с подтвержденным электронным адресом","Ограничен приложениями Vibes с файлом index.html"],"ar":["يتطلب مفتاح SSH في ~/.ssh/","يحتاج إلى حساب على exe.dev مع بريد إلكتروني محقق","محدود لتطبيقات Vibes مع ملف index.html"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"897f6df589b179f8cc723ca34a768d947f72a9b8be18f6eba142d479f848cb80","qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/opi', 'community', 'majiayu000', 'claude-skill-registry', 'majiayu000/claude-skill-registry', 'opi', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-20T04:13:19.578Z', '2026-02-20T04:58:14.937Z', 'eac42ebcb705510ef0afcef2e6fee12dcce8ea7d54ec36ead1ae13b327ce7abc', '{"id":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/opi","name":"opi","description":{"zh":"Opi 是一个自动学习提取器，帮助开发者从最近的工作中自动提取学习成果，改善未来的 Claude 会话。它提供了一系列命令来收集学习材料","ja":"Opi は、最近の作業から学習成果を自動的に抽出するツールです。開発者は、将来的に Claude セッションを改善するために、Opi を使用して学習材料を収集できます","ko":"Opi는 자동 학습 추출기로, 개발자가 최근 작업에서 학습 결과를 자동으로 추출하여 향후 Claude 세션을 개선하는 데 도움을 줍니다. 명령어를 통해 학습 자료를 수집할 수 있습니다","es":"Opi es un skill que extrae automáticamente aprendizajes de commits recientes para mejorar futuras sesiones de Claude","fr":"Opi est un skill qui extrait automatiquement les apprentissages à partir de commits récents pour améliorer les futures sessions Claude","de":"Opi ist ein Skill, der Lernerfahrungen aus aktuellen Commits automatisch extrahiert, um zukünftige Claude-Sitzungen zu verbessern","pt":"Opi é um skill que extrai aprendizados de trabalhos recentes para melhorar futuras sessões do Claude","ru":"Opi - это навык, который извлекает обучение из недавних работ для улучшения будущих сессий Claude","ar":"أوبي هو مهارة تقوم باستخراج التعلم من الأعمال الحديثة لتحسين جلسات كلود المستقبلية","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Opi - 自动学习提取器","ja":"Opi - 学習自動抽出ツール","ko":"Opi - 자동 학습 추출기","es":"Opi: Extracción Automática de Aprendizaje para Desarrolla...","fr":"Opi : Extracteur d''Apprentissage Automatique pour les Dév...","de":"Opi: Automatischer Lern-Extraktor für Entwickler","pt":"Opi: Extração Automática de Aprendizado","ru":"Opi: Автоматический Извлекатель Обучения","ar":"أوبي: مستخرج التعلم الآلي","en":"opi"},"description":{"zh":"Opi 是一个自动学习提取器，帮助开发者从最近的工作中自动提取学习成果，改善未来的 Claude 会话。它提供了一系列命令来收集学习材料","ja":"Opi は、最近の作業から学習成果を自動的に抽出するツールです。開発者は、将来的に Claude セッションを改善するために、Opi を使用して学習材料を収集できます","ko":"Opi는 자동 학습 추출기로, 개발자가 최근 작업에서 학습 결과를 자동으로 추출하여 향후 Claude 세션을 개선하는 데 도움을 줍니다. 명령어를 통해 학습 자료를 수집할 수 있습니다","es":"Opi es un skill que extrae automáticamente aprendizajes de commits recientes para mejorar futuras sesiones de Claude","fr":"Opi est un skill qui extrait automatiquement les apprentissages à partir de commits récents pour améliorer les futures sessions Claude","de":"Opi ist ein Skill, der Lernerfahrungen aus aktuellen Commits automatisch extrahiert, um zukünftige Claude-Sitzungen zu verbessern","pt":"Opi é um skill que extrai aprendizados de trabalhos recentes para melhorar futuras sessões do Claude","ru":"Opi - это навык, который извлекает обучение из недавних работ для улучшения будущих сессий Claude","ar":"أوبي هو مهارة تقوم باستخراج التعلم من الأعمال الحديثة لتحسين جلسات كلود المستقبلية","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"definition":{"en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"features":{"zh":["自动提取学习成果","收集学习材料","改善 Claude 会话","支持 Git 命令","自动分析 fixCommits"],"ja":["学習成果の自動抽出","学習材料の収集","Claude セッションの改善","Git コマンドのサポート","fixCommits の自動分析"],"ko":["학습 결과 자동 추출","학습 자료 수집","Claude 세션 개선","Git 명령어 지원","fixCommits 자동 분석"],"es":["Extracción automática de aprendizajes","Mejora de las sesiones de Claude","Análisis de commits recientes","Soporte para múltiples formatos de commits","Integración con el registro de código de Claude"],"fr":["Extraction automatique des apprentissages","Amélioration des sessions Claude","Analyse des commits récents","Prise en charge de plusieurs formats de commits","Intégration avec l''enregistrement de code de Claude"],"de":["Automatische Extraktion von Lernerfahrungen","Verbesserung von Claude-Sitzungen","Analyse aktueller Commits","Unterstützung für mehrere Commit-Formate","Integration mit dem Code-Registrier-System von Claude"],"pt":["Extração automática de aprendizado","Análise de commits recentes","Identificação de commits de fixação","Melhoria de sessões do Claude","Integração com git","Automatização de workflows"],"ru":["Автоматическое извлечение обучения","Анализ недавних коммитов","Определение коммитов исправления","Улучшение сессий Claude","Интеграция с git","Автоматизация рабочих процессов"],"ar":["استخراج التعلم الآلي","تحليل الالتزامات الحديثة","تحديد الالتزامات التصحيحية","تحسين جلسات كلود","دمج مع جيت","تأتمة سير العمل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Opi","自动学习提取器","Claude 会话","Git 命令","学习材料","fixCommits"],"ja":["Opi","学習自動抽出ツール","Claude セッション","Git コマンド","学習材料","fixCommits"],"ko":["Opi","자동 학습 추출기","Claude 세션","Git 명령어","학습 자료","fixCommits"],"es":["Opi","Claude","extracción de aprendizaje","commits","desarrollo de software","automatización","eficiencia","registro de código"],"fr":["Opi","Claude","extraction d''apprentissage","commits","développement de logiciels","automatisation","efficacité","enregistrement de code"],"de":["Opi","Claude","Lern-Extraktion","Commits","Software-Entwicklung","Automatisierung","Effizienz","Code-Registrierung"],"pt":["Opi","Extração de aprendizado","Claude","Git","Commits","Fixação","Refatoração","Desenvolvimento de software","Automatização"],"ru":["Opi","Извлечение обучения","Claude","Git","Коммиты","Исправление","Рефакторинг","Разработка программного обеспечения","Автоматизация"],"ar":["أوبي","استخراج التعلم","كلود","جيت","الالتزامات","التصحيح","إعادة هيكلة","تطوير البرمجيات","تأتمة"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.578Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"opi","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Opi - Learning Extractor\n\nAutomatically extract learnings from recent work to improve future Claude sessions.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Gather Sources\n\nRun these commands to collect learning material:\n\n```bash\n# Recent commits (last 20)\ngit log --oneline -20\n\n# Today''s commits with details\ngit log --since=\"midnight\" --format=\"%h %s\"\n\n# Commits with \"fix\", \"korjaus\", \"refactor\"\ngit log --oneline -50 | grep -iE \"(fix|korja|refactor|bugfix)\"\n```\n\n### Step 2: Analyze Fix Commits\n\nFor each fix/refa","body":"# Opi - Learning Extractor\n\nAutomatically extract learnings from recent work to improve future Claude sessions.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Gather Sources\n\nRun these commands to collect learning material:\n\n```bash\n# Recent commits (last 20)\ngit log --oneline -20\n\n# Today''s commits with details\ngit log --since=\"midnight\" --format=\"%h %s\"\n\n# Commits with \"fix\", \"korjaus\", \"refactor\"\ngit log --oneline -50 | grep -iE \"(fix|korja|refactor|bugfix)\"\n```\n\n### Step 2: Analyze Fix Commits\n\nFor each fix/refactor commit, examine what changed:\n\n```bash\ngit show <commit-hash> --stat\ngit show <commit-hash> -- \"*.tsx\" \"*.ts\"  # Code changes\n```\n\nLook for patterns:\n- **What was wrong?** (the bug/issue)\n- **What fixed it?** (the solution)\n- **Why?** (root cause)\n\n### Step 3: Check Current Conversation\n\nReview current conversation for:\n- User corrections (\"ei, tee näin...\" / \"no, do it this way...\")\n- Failed attempts that were fixed\n- Non-obvious solutions discovered\n- Repeated patterns\n\n### Step 4: Categorize Learnings\n\nDetermine where each learning belongs:\n\n| Learning Type | Destination |\n|--------------|-------------|\n| React/TypeScript pattern | `.claude/LEARNINGS.md` |\n| Supabase/DB pattern | `.claude/LEARNINGS.md` |\n| CI/CD specific | `ci-doctor/references/learnings.md` |\n| Lint specific | `lint-fixer/references/learnings.md` |\n| Test specific | `test-writer/references/learnings.md` |\n| Skill-specific | `[skill]/references/learnings.md` |\n\n### Step 5: Propose Learnings\n\nFormat each learning proposal:\n\n```markdown\n## Proposed Learning\n\n**Source:** commit abc123 / conversation\n**Category:** [Global / Skill-specific]\n**File:** [target file path]\n\n### [Issue Title]\n- **Pattern:** What triggers this\n- **Wrong:** ❌ The incorrect approach\n- **Right:** ✅ The correct approach\n- **Why:** Root cause\n```\n\n### Step 6: Get Approval & Write\n\n1. Present all proposed learnings to user\n2. User approves/rejects each\n3. Write approved learnings to appropriate files\n4. Commit changes\n\n## Learning Quality Criteria\n\nOnly propose learnings that are:\n\n- [ ] **Non-obvious** - Claude wouldn''t know this without being told\n- [ ] **Actionable** - Can be applied in future situations\n- [ ] **Specific** - Has concrete wrong/right examples\n- [ ] **Recurring** - Likely to come up again\n\nSkip:\n- Typo fixes\n- One-off configuration issues\n- Project-specific constants\n- Things Claude already knows\n\n## Example Session\n\n```\nUser: /opi\n\nClaude: Let me analyze recent commits...\n\nFound 3 potential learnings:\n\n1. **useCallback for useEffect deps** (commit a1b2c3)\n   - Source: AdminTranslationsPage infinite loop fix\n   - File: .claude/LEARNINGS.md\n   - Pattern: Functions in useEffect deps cause re-renders\n\n2. **GitHub API dismiss format** (commit d4e5f6)\n   - Source: CodeQL alert dismissal\n   - File: ci-doctor/references/learnings.md\n   - Pattern: Use \"false positive\" not \"false_positive\"\n\n3. **Controlled Tabs state** (conversation)\n   - Source: Feedback popup tab fix\n   - File: .claude/LEARNINGS.md\n   - Pattern: Radix Tabs need value+onValueChange for control\n\nAdd these learnings? [Y/n for each]\n```\n\n## Commands Reference\n\n```bash\n# Commits since specific date\ngit log --since=\"2025-01-10\" --oneline\n\n# Commits by pattern\ngit log --all --oneline | grep -i \"fix\"\n\n# Show specific commit\ngit show <hash> --name-only\n\n# Diff for a commit\ngit diff <hash>^..<hash>\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T04:58:14.937Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Claude Code Agents needing automated learning extraction and improvement of future sessions.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化学习提取和改进未来会话的 Claude Code Agents。","ja":"Claude Code Agents が自動化された学習の抽出と将来のセッションの改善が必要な場合に最適です。","ko":" 将来的 세션의 자동화된 학습 추출 및 개선이 필요한 Claude Code 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de código Claude que necesitan extracción de aprendizaje automatizada y mejora de sesiones futuras.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de code Claude qui ont besoin d''une extraction d''apprentissage automatisée et d''une amélioration des sessions futures.","de":"Perfekt für Claude-Code-Agents, die eine automatisierte Lernextraktion und Verbesserung zukünftiger Sitzungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Código Claude que necessitam de extração de aprendizado automatizado e melhoria de sessões futuras.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Claude Code, которым необходим автоматизированный вывод обучения и улучшение будущих сессий.","ar":"مثالي لعميل كلود كود الذي يحتاج إلى استخلاص تعليمات自动ي وتحسين الجلسات المستقبلية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automatically extract learnings from recent work using Git commands, such as analyzing fix commits and recent code changes, to improve future Claude sessions with enhanced workflow efficiency and accuracy through protocols like Git log and grep.","zh":"赋予代理自动从最近的工作中提取学习成果的能力，使用 Git 命令，例如分析 fix 提交和最近的代码更改，以提高未来的 Claude 会话的工作流效率和准确性，通过 Git 日志和 grep 等协议。","ja":"エージェントに、Git コマンドを使用して最近の作業から学習を自動的に抽出する能力を与え、fix コミットや最近のコード変更を分析して、Git ログや grep などのプロトコルを通じて、将来の Claude セッションのワークフロー効率と精度を向上させます。","ko":"에이전트가 Git 명령을 사용하여 최근 작업에서 학습을 자동으로 추출할 수 있도록 하여, 수정 커밋 및 최근 코드 변경을 분석하고 Git 로그 및 grep과 같은 프로토콜을 통해 향후 Claude 세션의 워크플로 효율성과 정확성을 향상시킵니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes extraer automáticamente los conocimientos de trabajos recientes utilizando comandos Git, como analizar commits de corrección y cambios de código recientes, para mejorar las sesiones futuras de Claude con una mayor eficiencia y precisión del flujo de trabajo a través de protocolos como Git log y grep.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''extraire automatiquement les apprentissages des travaux récents en utilisant des commandes Git, telles que l''analyse des commits de correction et des changements de code récents, pour améliorer les sessions futures de Claude avec une efficacité et une précision accrues du flux de travail via des protocoles tels que Git log et grep.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Lerninhalte aus aktuellen Arbeiten automatisch mithilfe von Git-Befehlen zu extrahieren, wie z.B. die Analyse von Korrektur-Commits und aktuellen Code-Änderungen, um zukünftige Claude-Sitzungen mit verbesserter Workflow-Effizienz und Genauigkeit durch Protokolle wie Git-Log und grep zu verbessern.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a extrair automaticamente conhecimentos do trabalho recente usando comandos Git, como análise de commits de correção e alterações de código recentes, para melhorar as futuras sessões do Claude com eficiência de fluxo de trabalho aprimorada e precisão por meio de protocolos como Git log e grep.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматически извлекать знания из недавней работы, используя команды Git, такие как анализ исправляющих коммитов и недавних изменений кода, для улучшения будущих сессий Claude с повышенной эффективностью рабочего процесса и точностью с помощью протоколов, таких как Git log и grep.","ar":"يتمكّن الوكلاء من استخلاص المعارف تلقائيًا من العمل الحديث باستخدام أوامر Git، مثل تحليل تعديلات الإصلاح والتعديلات الأخيرة على الشفرة، لتحسين جلسات كلود المستقبلية بفعالية وحساسية محسّنة من خلال بروتوكولات مثل سجل Git و grep."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating learning extraction from recent commits","Analyzing fix commits for improved code quality","Generating summaries of recent code changes"],"zh":["自动从最近的提交中提取学习成果","分析 fix 提交以改进代码质量","生成最近代码更改的摘要"],"ja":["最近のコミットから学習を自動的に抽出する","fix コミットを分析してコード品質を向上させる","最近のコード変更の要約を生成する"],"ko":["최근 커밋에서 학습을 자동으로 추출하는 것","수정 커밋을 분석하여 코드 품질을 개선하는 것","최근 코드 변경의 요약을 생성하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar la extracción de aprendizaje de commits recientes","Analizar commits de corrección para mejorar la calidad del código","Generar resúmenes de cambios de código recientes"],"fr":["Automatiser l''extraction d''apprentissage des commits récents","Analyser les commits de correction pour améliorer la qualité du code","Générer des résumés des changements de code récents"],"de":["Automatisierung der Lernextraktion aus aktuellen Commits","Analyse von Korrektur-Commits zur Verbesserung der Code-Qualität","Generierung von Zusammenfassungen aktueller Code-Änderungen"],"pt":["Automatizar a extração de aprendizado de commits recentes","Analisar commits de correção para melhorar a qualidade do código","Gerar resumos de alterações de código recentes"],"ru":["Автоматизировать извлечение обучения из недавних коммитов","Анализировать исправляющие коммиты для улучшения качества кода","Генерировать сводки недавних изменений кода"],"ar":["تأتميم استخلاص التعلم من التعديلات الحديثة","تحليل تعديلات الإصلاح لتحسين جودة الشفرة","إنتاج ملخصات للتعديلات الحديثة على الشفرة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git access and configuration","Limited to analyzing recent commits and fix/refactor logs"],"zh":["需要 Git 访问和配置","仅限分析最近的提交和 fix/refactor 日志"],"ja":["Git アクセスと設定が必要","最近のコミットと fix/refactor ログのみを分析可能"],"ko":["Git 접근 및 구성이 필요하다","최근 커밋 및 수정/리팩토링 로그만 분석 가능"],"es":["Requiere acceso y configuración de Git","Limitado al análisis de commits y registros de corrección/refactorización recientes"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès et une configuration Git","Limité à l''analyse des commits et des journaux de correction/refactorisation récents"],"de":["Benötigt Git-Zugriff und -Konfiguration","Begrenzt auf die Analyse von Commits und Korrektur/Refaktorisierungs-Logs"],"pt":["Requer acesso e configuração do Git","Limitado à análise de commits recentes e logs de fix/refatoração"],"ru":["Требует доступа и настройки Git","Ограничен анализом недавних коммитов и журналов исправления/рефакторинга"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى تكوين Git","محدود بتحليل التعديلات الحديثة وسجلات الإصلاح/إعادة الهيكلة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"eac42ebcb705510ef0afcef2e6fee12dcce8ea7d54ec36ead1ae13b327ce7abc","qualityScore":50}');
